window.FWN_HERO_SUMMONING_PEACE_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_HERO_SUMMONING_PEACE_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":2501,"title":"Chapter 2501: Chapter 2502: Company and Exclusive Brush 9","paragraphs":["The item Nebula conceived and Nebula created to suit this world was certainly produced using technology that existed in Trinia, but it was an extremely groundbreaking invention, one that would bring about a major revolution in the magic tool industry.","[......Originally, it was devised as something to be attached to an exclusive brush, and because of that, once we received Kaito’s permission, it only makes sense to start from there. And since Kaito seems to be quite considerate towards the Sharon County, I was thinking we could set up a budget in the form of a joint development. What do you think?]","[I agree. There’s consideration for Miyama-dono as well, but beyond that, it also aligns with Kuromu-sama’s intentions...... It is certainly a revolutionary technology, and proposals like the one Tetra-dono mentioned earlier would indeed be feasible. However, to complete it to the stage of practical use, there will still need to be trial and error and fine-tuning...... During the development process, it would also lead to improvements in the skills of the magic tool engineers on their side, and it would be a good stimulus for the personnel we dispatch from our own magic tool division as well.]","[......It’s fine if you make the scale fairly large. I’ll prepare an ample budget, and even taking that into account, enormous profits can be expected. As for explaining things to and negotiating with the Sharon County, Trois is scheduled to visit soon, so let’s leave that to him.]","[Indeed. Of course, we’ll need to hold a meeting with Kuromu-sama present and make a formal decision, but broadly speaking, that should be acceptable as the company’s general policy.]","With regard to the reform of this innovative magic tool technology, Tetra and Sechs’ opinions aligned on adopting the direction of joint development, placing importance on the exclusive brush from the Victor Trading Company that had served as the catalyst, and also as a way to show respect to Kaito and his friend Cornelia.","Naturally, this was a project that would bring enormous profits to the Sharon Trading Company as well...... but for Cornelia, who would likely be subjected to tremendous stomachache, it was hard to say whether it was a blessing or a curse.","Once the future course of action had been more or less settled, Tetra rested a hand against her chin and pondered.","[......Hmmm, but even so, the scale of the profits we can foresee is just too big. Kaito said he doesn’t need any stakes, but...... we can’t let it go like that. Even if we were to buy the stakes outright, it’s still only at the conceptual stage, so calculating a proper amount would be difficult. I’d like to move things in the direction of handing over a portion of patent fees and the like, but...... ughhh...... that kid really doesn’t want money very much......]","[Miyama-dono may be extraordinary, but he’s still an individual. He doesn’t run a trading company, nor does he have hobbies that involve spending large sums of money. Even now, it seems he’s somewhat at a loss as to what to do with the money he already has.]","[......Even if we were to give stakes to the originator or developer, just like with the Partition Formula back then, it would all end up flowing to Kaito anyway...... Maybe the realistic approach would be to have Anima sit in when we talk to Kaito, and arrange things so that Kaito holds the stakes, but any money generated goes to Anima instead?]","Anima had once been taught economics by Kuromueina, and during that time Tetra, known as the Conqueror of Gold Veins, had also participated in the instruction, so they were acquainted with one another.","They had confidence that even if it were a vast sum, Anima would manage it well, so steering the discussion in that direction felt like the best option.","After falling silent for a moment to gather her thoughts...... Tetra suddenly grabbed her own head with both hands.","[......Nngaaaaah!]","[W- What’s the matter, Tetra-dono?]","[......T- This...... making me...... me, who’s even called the Conqueror of Gold Veins, worry not about how to make money, but about how to give it away...... haaahhh...... honestly, I like that kid...... I really love him.]","It didn’t seem like she had gone mad or anything of the sort, rather, it appeared that at the same time her thoughts finally came together, her affection for Kaito also surged, and she blurted it out on impulse.","[......The only regret is that he takes my feelings almost entirely as a joke.]","[Isn’t that because of the way you phrase things, always sounding like you’re teasing him?]","[......Well, I’m aware that’s a bad habit of mine...... but with someone I especially like, I end up wanting to use teasing words and see how they react. I just exaggerate or twist my phrasing, I’m not lying. Still, I’m enjoying how things are right now, and I even think a relationship like this for about 500 years wouldn’t be bad...... How troubling.]","Watching Tetra cheerfully talk about Kaito as if she were lovestruck, Sechs wore an indulgent, wry smile.","In a large mansion located in the capital of the Archlesia Empire, one of the rooms within the Sharon Count’s estate, the eldest daughter, Cornelia Sharon, slowly opened her eyes.","[......What is this? It feels like I just had a terribly frightening dream...... this chill welling up from deep within my body...... a cold? N- No, I’ve received a Provisional Blessing, so there’s no way I could catch a cold...... am I...... just imagining things......?]","She rose from the bed, approached the window, and pulled the curtains open slightly. There wasn’t a single cloud in the dawn-lit sky, yet for some reason...... to Cornelia now, the sky seemed darker than an overcast day.","She would only learn the true cause of that uneasy feeling after finishing her preparations...... when the maid Anne entered the room, holding several letters and looking at her with eyes full of pity.","<Afterword>","Stomachache Devil : [......It begins. The carnival......]","Serious Senpai : [So, it’s time to carry out the death sentence on her stomach huh......]"]},{"number":2502,"title":"Chapter 2502: Chapter 2503: Company and Exclusive Brush 10","paragraphs":["<Author's Notes>","We’re happy to announce that a second release has been decided for Alice's Random Box, the randomly assorted can badge merch previously sold.","Sales will begin on February 20. In addition, the first volume, which sold out very quickly last time, is also scheduled to receive a reprint. For more details, please check the X accounts of Shinkigensha and Morning Star Books.","As the release date approaches, an article will also be posted in the Activity Report.","The morning preparations of the Count’s daughter Sharon Cornelia always begin with a light bath. Although she is not the heir, she is still the eldest daughter of a high-ranking noble house, and she pays great attention to her appearance.","At the very least, she makes sure not to give other nobles any opening to look down on her in such matters, and so her morning routine is carried out with great care.","After the bath, she spends a fair amount of time changing clothes, applying makeup, and arranging her hair, all with the assistance of three servants.","As for today, she has no plans to attend a tea party or an evening banquet, so her appearance is kept somewhat restrained. Even so, she believes she has devoted sufficient time to ensure her grooming is flawless.","Normally, once her preparations are complete, the next step would be to review the day’s schedule. Of course, Cornelia is aware of her own plans, but to avoid even the slightest mistake, she goes over them with her personal maid. Only after that does she proceed to breakfast, this is the usual daily flow.","However, today was different. The moment her preparations were finished, Anne arrived carrying letters. This was a very bad sign. At first glance, it might not seem strange. Anne, albeit temporarily, was currently assigned as Cornelia’s personal maid, so her coming by after Cornelia was ready did not appear unusual.","Bringing letters could also be explained optimistically, sometimes urgent correspondence needed to be checked before the schedule review...... If one wished to think positively, that interpretation was possible, but unfortunately, reality was not so kind.","While Anne had indeed been assigned to Cornelia, that assignment was primarily a countermeasure on matters related to Miyama Kaito.","Tasks such as checking schedules or delivering letters were originally the responsibility of another dedicated maid; they were not supposed to be Anne’s duties.","And yet, Anne...... that Anne who had been assigned specifically to deal with matters involving Kaito, was standing there holding letters with a look of pity on her face, which could only mean one thing......","[......I have a very, very bad feeling about this...... T- This is an important letter, isn’t it?]","[I would say \"most likely\", yes. After checking the senders, I felt it necessary to have you confirm them immediately, Lady Cornelia, so I brought them to you at once......]","[I- I see. Depending on the situation, we may need to adjust today’s schedule. So then, where are they from?]","At that moment, Cornelia felt exactly like a prisoner awaiting execution. Given that Anne was here like this, she steeled herself for the certainty that at least one of the letters concerned Kaito, and waited for Anne to speak.","[......First, a letter addressed to Lady Cornelia from the Seditch Magic Tool Trading Company.]","[Ahh, that one is no problem. It’s probably a preliminary greeting regarding the meeting, under the guise of a courtesy visit, that’s scheduled for the day after tomorrow.]","The first letter was from the Seditch Magic Tool Trading Company, and she had an idea what it was about. Trois, the Special Advisor of their Sales Department, was scheduled to visit the day after tomorrow under the pretext of a face-to-face meeting aimed at strengthening future cooperation. This was likely just a polite advance notice...... something along the lines of \"We look forward to working with you the day after tomorrow\".","[Next, a letter from Miyama Kaito-sama.]","[......That one depends entirely on its contents. In the worst case, we may need to convene an emergency meeting. Eh? Anne? Why are you making that face......? D- Don’t tell me there are even more letters from outrageous senders?]","[And following that, letters from Dragon King-sama, Sky Dragon Nidzveld-sama, and Water Dragon Eingana-sama.]","[Hyuhk...... S- So...... that means exactly what I think it does, doesn’t it......? M- Most likely, at least in part, Kaito-sama has received the exclusive brushes. His letter is probably related to that. And the fact that letters came from those three means that Kaito-sama liked it and recommended it to them as well......?]","The shock of receiving letters from one of the Six Kings and two of his Executives was overwhelming. And yet, even so, Cornelia was still able to remain somewhat calm.","[That surprised me, but it’s within our expectations. Including the trading company management studies I’ve been cramming lately, Father, Mother, Brother, and I have all been making preparations to deal with this situation that was bound to come. It will be difficult, yes, but I’m sure we’ll manage somehow......]","[And next...... we have letters addressed specifically to you, Lady Cornelia, from Amel-sama, the chieftain of the Wingeds, as well as from the Wingeds' negotiation representative.]","[......That was not within my expectations.]","Cornelia had spoken confidently, saying that inquiries from the Dragon King camp regarding the exclusive brushes were anticipated and that preparations had already been made, but at Anne’s next words, her expression froze as if she was a pigeon shot by a BB gun.","[W- Why the Wingeds? We don’t have any point of contact with them at all...... N- No, more importantly, the Wingeds hardly ever interact with anyone outside that Viscouncy bordering their settlement......]","[There’s more. Next is a letter addressed to you, Lady Cornelia, from Bacchus-sama of the War King's Five Generals.]","[......Why?]","[And this one is a letter addressed to you, Lady Cornelia, from Gluttony-sama of the Ten Demons.]","[............Whyyyyy?]","These letters were completely outside anything she had anticipated, and worse still, the senders were Executives of the Six Kings, all addressing Cornelia by name.","[....................................Whyyyyyy!?]","It was hardly surprising that Cornelia ended up clutching her head and crying out in despair.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [So you really went and did it, Stomachache Devil. After that whole thing with Tetra, you probably went and spread even more \"publicity\" that just kept expanding the damage, didn’t you......?]"]},{"number":2503,"title":"Chapter 2503: Chapter 2504: Intermission: The Events a Little While Ago","paragraphs":["If you asked what the trigger was, it was a chance encounter. After having Elise-san recommend some coffee beans to me, I figured I might as well ask Ozma-san for his recommendations too, so I went to see him.","There was nothing particularly unusual about that, I simply got some suggestions for coffee beans and recommended shops, and was thinking of stopping by one on my way home...... when I ran into Kong-san completely by coincidence.","[......Oh? Now that sounds good.]","[I find it really comfortable to use, personally. I like it a lot.]","We ended up making some idle small talk, and in the middle of that conversation, the topic of the exclusive brush came up...... It might be rude to say unexpected, but Kong-san showed far more interest than I would have imagined, asking all sorts of questions.","Well, Kong-san is a Beast-type Demon, fur all over his body, so in that sense, an exclusive brush might suit him...... but he doesn’t really seem like the type to care much about grooming or beauty...... Could it be he’s more particular about it than he looks?","[So I can buy one too, right?]","[I think so. They even have brushes for Dragons, so I’m sure there’s one suitable for your build as well, Kong-san...... Though, are you particular about the gloss of your fur too?]","[......Hmm. Personally, I don’t really care either way. But, you know, I’m one of the War King's Five Generals...... Sometimes I have to accompany the Boss to formal events and stiff gatherings. At places like that, even Ozma-aniki dresses sharp. The Boss and aniki keep telling me I need to watch myself daily so I can present myself properly when the time comes.]","[Ahh, I see. If you’re attending as a distinguished guest, then you definitely need to look presentable.]","It seemed that, just as I’d thought, Kong-san himself didn’t particularly care about grooming, but given his position, there were aspects he couldn’t afford to ignore.","[And the Boss also tells me to properly adjust my magic power permeation rate...... but I’m not great with that kind of fine magic power control. I still struggle with it a lot. But with that brush, it’d make the adjustments easier, right?]","[According to Frea-san, that seems to be the case.]","[That’s great to hear. If it shortens that annoying process, I’m all for it! So where do I go to buy one?]","[If you’re buying it, that would be through the Victor Trading Company, but it might be better to confirm in advance. They’d probably be startled if you just showed up out of nowhere, Kong-san......]","[Ahh, right...... In that case, I’ll have Bacchus send a letter or something. I just need to say I heard about it from Kaito, yeah?]","[Yes...... Ah, actually, it might go more smoothly if you send the letter to Cornelia-san of the Sharon County instead.]","The president of the Victor Trading Company and the monster scholar there probably know that I purchased exclusive brushes, but whether whoever reads the letter at the trading company would immediately understand if it was introduced as my recommendation is uncertain, so I thought it would be better to go through Cornelia-san first and told him so. Kong-san readily agreed, giving me a bold thumbs-up along with his response.","The day after that exchange with Kong-san, I found myself discussing the exclusive brush again, this time in a completely different place. My conversation partner was Gluttony-san. Since our first meeting, she has invited me for tea every few months or so, and this time was no different; I had come to the subspace where she resides.","Well...... as usual, the tea and sweets were exquisitely terrible in a very delicate way. Still, Gluttony-san looked genuinely happy that I had come, so a bit of bad flavor was hardly an issue.","Even with her peculiarities, she had helped me out several times, during the Harmonic Symphony, the ship party, and other occasions, so I was more than willing to keep her company to this extent. Besides, perhaps out of consideration for my schedule, she only invited me occasionally...... which makes her far more reasonable than Makina-san, who shows up about five times a week.","\"I see...... If it is a brush personally used by Miyama Kaito-sama, then I would very much like to acquire one as well.\"","[For your Dimension Beasts, you mean?]","\"Indeed. Many Dimension Beasts are biologically close to monsters, and some have fur or horns.\"","Since no one else was present at the moment, Gluttony-san, still in her plushie form, was speaking freely, clearly intrigued by the exclusive brush.","Certainly, one could say her Dimension Beasts were kind of her pets...... Well, more accurately, they were probably subordinates or familiars, but in any case, exclusive brushes for them might not be a bad idea.","Incidentally, during our first meeting she had kept them waiting elsewhere so they wouldn’t be in the way, but normally, this subspace was filled with Dimension Beasts, and I had seen them many times by now.","If I had to describe it, their appearance leaned toward something out of Cthulhu, many of them possessed rather overwhelming looks and designs...... To the point that Natasha-san being the only one who looked like an ordinary girl almost felt like a mutation by comparison.","This subspace, with tens of thousands of Dimension Beasts flitting about everywhere, had the atmosphere of a horror scene. I had a feeling that Hina-chan would scream and run away if she saw this place.","Thinking that, I gently patted the head of a Dimension Beast that had wandered near my seat...... a dog-like creature whose face looked as though half of it had been melted away by some powerful acid. Its texture was squishy, almost like slime, but this dog-like one did have fur.","Perhaps happy to be petted, it rubbed its squishy face against me. The gesture was perfectly dog-like and even adorable. Its face was almost pure horror, but once you got used to it, it didn’t really bother you that much.","[If you’re interested, it might be worth asking more about it.]","\"Indeed. I believe I shall first contact the Sharon County. My heartfelt gratitude for this valuable information...... By the way, what do you think? That Dimension Beast there was designed with companionship in mind rather than combat ability......\"","[......It feels nice to the touch. And its gestures are cute.]","I carefully avoided commenting on its appearance. One of its eyeballs was sticking halfway out...... Was that because its face had melted and pushed it out, or was that simply its normal shape......? Unn. Well, its gestures were cute...... its gestures, that is......","<Afterword>","[A Cthulhu-esque Dimension Beast that deals mental damage just by being seen has appeared.]","[The Cthulhu-esque Dimension Beast initiated a SAN check.]","[Kaito’s SAN did not so much as twitch.]","[Kaito, seemingly unbothered, continues patting the Cthulhu-esque Dimension Beast on the head.]","[The Cthulhu-esque Dimension Beast’s SAN has decreased.]","[The Cthulhu-esque Dimension Beast has grown attached to Kaito and begun fawning over him.]","[Kaito is idly thinking that its gestures are cute.]"]},{"number":2504,"title":"Chapter 2504: Chapter 2505: Company and Exclusive Brush 11","paragraphs":["In front of Cornelia lay several letters. If she were being honest, she didn’t want to look at them...... She wanted to pretend she had seen nothing at all, remove her makeup, crawl into bed, and sleep like a corpse sinking into mud.","But unfortunately, they were things that could not be avoided. No matter how terrifying they might be...... no matter how fiercely her stomach protested in the form of sharp pain, she had no choice but to read them.","Before that, however, there was one thing she had to say. Turning quietly toward Anne, who stood by her side, Cornelia spoke in a calm voice.","[......My stomach hurts, so cancel all of today’s appointments.]","[Understood. In any case, today was mainly scheduled for studying matters related to managing the trading company, and depending on the contents of the letters, it may be necessary to arrange a discussion with your father and mother......]","Fortunately, she had no plans to go out today and had only been scheduled to study company management, so adjusting her schedule was quickly done. Soon, her attention returned to the letters.","Perhaps, when the First Hero, who had once challenged the Demon King as a mere human, faced that battle, she had felt something like this. With that thought in mind, Cornelia picked up a letter.","[......F- First, something with a confirmed matter. The one from the Seditch Magic Tool Trading Company......]","Perhaps she needed a bit of mental preparation after all, because she chose to begin with the letter from the Seditch Magic Tool Trading Company, whose contents she could more or less predict.","As expected, it was a prior greeting regarding their visit the day after tomorrow...... and a request that Cornelia also be present at the negotiation table.","That, at least, was within expectations. Thanks to Kaito’s influence, she had become acquainted with the four Special Advisors, so this fell well within the realm of what she had anticipated.","[As for the Seditch Magic Tool Trading Company, I was planning to attend anyway, and there’s no issue with the contents. I’ll send a reply via teleport delivery saying we look forward to it as well. Now then...... next......]","[It’s Miyama Kaito-sama’s letter, isn’t it?]","[Yes...... I think so. It’s likely related to the contents of the other letters......]","Moving in a manner that could only be described as hesitant, Cornelia picked up Kaito’s letter. She closed her eyes briefly as if in prayer before opening it and reading.","The contents were, as expected, about the exclusive brushes having arrived, and how he was extremely pleased with its feel and usability.","However, what followed was a major problem.","[......Using a specialized tool to convert mana wavelengths? A significant effect in equalizing mana permeation rates? No issue when using it personally even without conversion? ......A- Ahh, in other words...... is that what this means? It wasn’t something unknown to me or the Victor Trading Company, but that brush isn’t just for grooming, it has far greater effects when used for the beauty care of Dragon or Beast-type Demons...... a- and taking that into account...... Kaito-sama has recommended it to those under the Dragon King’s command...... T- Thank goodness I hadn’t eaten breakfast yet...... I feel like I’m going to throw up.]","[......Lady Cornelia, isn’t this an emergency? This is clearly turning into something far beyond what we anticipated.]","[Y- Yes...... Indeed, we did consider the possibility that if Kaito-sama liked the brush, orders might come from the Dragon King’s camp as well. But that assumption was based on \"people willing to purchase an expensive exclusive brush purely for brushing\".]","Yes, just as Akane had predicted, Cornelia and the members of the Sharon Trading Company had anticipated that if Kaito took a liking to the exclusive brush, its promotional effect might create significant demand among those under the Dragon King.","However, even so, the exclusive brush was a custom-made luxury item. Certainly high quality, yes, but it wasn’t as though its brushing performance was overwhelmingly superior to commercially available brushes.","Those with particular tastes or ample financial means might purchase it, but it was never expected to result in massive-scale orders. And yet, that very premise had now been completely overturned.","Cornelia was aware, at least as knowledge, that the uniformity of mana permeation rates was an extremely significant factor in terms of beauty for Dragon and Beast-type Demons. She had also heard that it was a fairly advanced technique.","A brush that made such high-level magical beauty treatment comparatively easy to perform...... It was easy to imagine that many would want to obtain one, even if the price were somewhat steep.","[T- This...... there’s a possibility that orders could come in on an outrageous scale...... T- That brush is a custom-made item, and even producing a single one takes a considerable amount of time...... W- We’ll need to expand the scale of the workshop to at least three times...... no, five times what we originally projected or we won’t be able to keep up!?]","[......I shall inform the Master and Madam to gather immediately.]","[P- Please do. In the meantime, I’ll check the other letters.]","Even as she felt the blood draining from her face, somewhere in her mind she could calmly surmise that the letters from Magnawell, Nidzveld, and Eingana were likely related to this matter.","However...... as for the remaining letters from Amel, Bacchus, and Gluttony, what in the world could those be about? Cornelia had been wondering that...... when her eyes fell upon the final line written in Kaito’s letter, her face turned from pale blue to utterly white.","\"While I'm at it, if there’s anyone I know outside of the Dragon King’s subordinates who shows interest, I’ll recommend the exclusive brush to them as well.\"","I see...... so this is what it feels like to be a prisoner who has just been sentenced to death. With that distant realization, Cornelia slumped limply back against her chair.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [She’s already taken a fatal hit right from the opening move, is she gonna be okay? And this still isn’t even everything you can tell from the letters yet. There’s also going to be talk from the Seditch Magic Tool Trading Company about a revolution in magic tools, you know?]","? ? ? : [So this...... is Stomach Catastrophe huh......]"]},{"number":2505,"title":"Chapter 2505: Chapter 2506: Company and Exclusive Brush 12","paragraphs":["Though she was already brimming with the urge to escape from reality, Cornelia somehow pulled herself together and began reading the letters from Magnawell, Nidzveld, and Eingana in order.","As expected, their contents all concerned the exclusive brush. In particular, it seemed that Eingana held even greater interest in the brush than Cornelia had imagined, and the letter stated that, depending on the circumstances, a large bulk order was also being considered.","(......As I thought, this exceeds expectations. I have heard that Eingana-sama is especially particular about beauty even among the Dragons, so she must also have strong interest in magic power penetration efficiency. However, it does not seem that Eingana-sama intends to use it personally; rather, many of her subordinates desire it, so she appears to be acting as the intermediary. Nidzveld-sama and Magnawell-sama seem much the same, the content feels as though they are inquiring about procedures for when their subordinates place orders, rather than for themselves...... In any case, expanding the workshop will be absolutely necessary.)","With this turn of events, the assumption that the Sharon Trading Company would purchase nearly all management rights of the Victor Trading Company and that Cornelia herself would take the representative’s seat was practically confirmed. Though her gaze drifted into the distance, this much had still been within the realm of expectation.","The real problem lay ahead, a letter whose contents she could not predict in the slightest...... First, Cornelia picked up the one from Amel and opened it...... and her expression shifted into that of a cat flung into outer space.","(......H- Huh? The phrasing is far too complicated, I can’t grasp the meaning...... bridge? A sealed gate? A new light? C- Come to think of it, I recall hearing that Amel-sama has a tendency toward exceedingly elaborate turns of phrase. But like this, I can’t discern the actual request...... This “sworn friend” must refer to Kaito-sama, and if Kaito-sama is involved...... In that case, though it may be rude, I should confirm with Kaito-sama directly...... Ah, that reminds me, there was also a letter from the Wingeds’ negotiation representative.)","Amel’s letter was brimming with chuuni rhetoric, and Cornelia could not make heads or tails of it. However, it did state that she had heard of the matter from her sworn friend, which made it certain that Kaito was involved. Cornelia considered confirming the matter with him, but decided to first read the other letter from the Wingeds.","And as she began reading that letter...... Cornelia’s face gradually drained of all color, replaced entirely by shock.","(......What? They are considering trade with our house...... Sharon County? T- That’s absurd! The Wingeds do not conduct trade with anyone except that Viscouncy adjacent to their village. While there are rare, temporary transactions such as with the Albert Duchy, those were approved only after strong petitions through connections. And now the Wingeds themselves are proposing a somewhat continuous trade relationship with our far-distant Sharon County? This is an important matter, it should be addressed not to me, but to Father as the head of the household...... Unn? Errr...... they wish to trade for the exclusive brush...... Huh?)","The letter proposed discussions regarding trade between the Wingeds and the Sharon County. For the Wingeds, who were extremely insular and traded only with a limited few, to initiate such negotiations could only be described as an extraordinary situation.","In fact, many of the Wingeds’ specialty goods were unobtainable elsewhere and in high demand, making this potentially a major transaction. But why address such a proposal to her, someone who was not even the heir...... That answer, too, lay within the letter.","They wished to create an exclusive brush for their wings and hoped to establish relations with the Sharon County for that purpose...... In other words, this trade was effectively directed toward the Victor Trading Company, whose responsible head would likely be Cornelia herself.","Looking as though she might foam at the mouth and faint at any moment, Cornelia desperately forced her mind to keep working.","(W- Why would such a thing happen!? N- No, wait. I can guess. I can guess it all too well...... I have heard that Amel-sama, the chief of the Wingeds, is close with Kaito-sama. Which means she heard about the exclusive brush from Kaito-sama and became interested? B- But even so, to decide on trade with the Sharon County over something like that seems unthinkable...... D- Does she trust Kaito-sama that deeply? She calls him her sworn friend, so I understand that Kaito-sama is someone Amel-sama trusts implicitly, but...... N- No, still, the exclusive brush only reached Kaito-sama very recently, didn’t it? And yet, in such a short time......!?)","The words Eris had once spoken, “the flap of the great dragon’s wings”, echoed again and again in Cornelia’s stunned mind. After everything that had happened, she had believed she was already estimating Kaito’s influence quite highly.","And yet, she now keenly realized that even that assessment had been far too naive. That he possessed enough influence to make the extremely insular Wingeds open a window for relations, such a thought sent a shiver down her spine...... Then, as if struck by lightning, she snapped her gaze toward the remaining letters.","(C- Could it be......? The letter from Bacchus-sama, and the one from Gluttony-sama as well...... c- could they also be the result of Kaito-sama promoting the exclusive brush? W- Wait a moment!? B- But it’s only been a few days......)","At that point, another memory surfaced in her mind. When she had first explained the Victor Trading Company to Kaito, and when she had introduced it afterward...... she had mentioned that \"increased sales would make her happy\"......","If Kaito had taken that to heart and begun promoting the product among his acquaintances at this pace...... A freezing chill swept through her entire body. Moving in haste, Cornelia seized a sheet of writing paper and began composing a letter to Kaito.","She desperately wrote her thanks regarding the promotion, adding that they already had sufficient orders and that it would be perfectly fine to halt any further advertising for the time being. After finishing, she instructed a servant to ensure it reached Kaito as quickly as possible, no matter the expense...... giving the order with such a frantic expression that even a servant who had long served the County had never seen the like before.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Amel is probably dozens of times more fond of Kaito than Cornelia imagines, more like a puppy that’s completely attached to him, on a level where she probably thinks \"If my sworn friend says so, then there’s no doubt about it!\"]"]},{"number":2506,"title":"Chapter 2506: Chapter 2507: Intermissions: Of Course, The Cause of This One is Also......","paragraphs":["The custom brush had caught the interest of Kong-san and Gluttony-san as well, and when I went to see Frea-san, I had thought I should try recommending it to Amel-san too.","And recommending it to Amel-san was actually pretty easy...... she drops by to hang out fairly often, so I simply have plenty of chances to see her.","[Fuaaaah, this is the latest model coffee magic tool!? How nice, maybe I should buy one too...... Hah!? Ahem! As expected of my sworn friend, your breadth of vision is evident in how swiftly you seize hold of newly born light.]","[I just happened to buy it by chance. I saw one at Amel-san's place, and thought I’d like one......]","[My sworn friend!]","Amel-san’s eyes had been sparkling at the latest coffee maker, but when she heard my words, an unmistakably delighted expression spread across her face.","She was probably happy that seeing her coffee maker had led me to buy a similar magic tool. It’s like that simple joy you feel when you share something in common with a friend...... Honestly, whenever I’m with Amel-san, I feel like I can see the phantom of a Pomeranian behind her, practically bouncing with excitement.","[By the way, Amel-san, this isn’t related to that magic tool, but remember when I told you I ordered an exclusive brush?]","[Ah, the brush for your familiars, yes? I do not command any familiars, but I am aware of your dedication, my sworn friend. Was it a piece that possessed brilliance worthy of your discerning eye?]","[Yes, it felt amazing to use...... but more than that, there might be something about this exclusive brush that could benefit the Wingeds as well...... To explain in detail......]","For the moment, I explained to Amel-san what I had heard from Frea-san. I didn’t know whether magic power permeability actually affected the wings of the Wingeds, but if it did, then perhaps this brush would be good for them too, that was the gist of what I told her.","[......I see. Indeed, magic power permeability is important. The wings of us Wingeds harbor great magic power, but sadly, they are not equally wrapped in brilliance. It is difficult to channel magic power into each individual feather. Moreover, only a limited number of us can use magic.]","[Ah, right...... I tend to forget, but for Humans, magic is basically a specialized skill.]","[It is gradually improving, especially of late, with humans at the center, one can observe an increase in learning speed. Yet, regrettably, for the Wingeds who dwell in a closed land, new light does not easily reach us. To turn one’s back on those who walk with the light of innovation and instead enjoy tranquility...... I, for one, have my thoughts on the matter......]","There weren’t many who had learned magic, and even Kuro’s recent efforts to improve magical teachings for Humans were being hampered by the Wingeds’ closed-off nature...... For Amel-san, who believed the Wingeds should interact more with the outside world, it must be quite a headache.","[So, about this brush...... For now, as long as you can pour magic power into it, it works even if you can’t use magic, so the barrier to using it should be much lower than learning magic. And you once said wings are a source of pride for the Wingeds, right? If it helps make them even more beautiful, maybe they’d feel motivated to interact with the outside world. After all, since it’s an exclusive brush, you need to provide something or submit requests to have one made......]","[......!? T- That’s it!!! You’re absolutely right! If it’s a brush for wings, there must be many who would want one even if it means interacting with the outside world! The reason doesn’t matter. What’s important is that they take the initiative to engage with the outside world themselves. If that can happen...... This is incredible, my sworn friend! It might become the catalyst that changes the Wingeds!!!]","It seemed my suggestion struck Amel-san as something truly promising. Her eyes shone as she spoke to me with rising excitement.","The fact that she had completely reverted to her natural tone made it all the more obvious just how thrilled she was.","[And another big factor is that you’re using it, my sworn friend. If it’s a brush beloved by you, who has received the Blessing of the God of Creation, then everyone will surely want one! If that becomes the spark that softens everyone’s attitude toward other races even a little...... I’d be so happy...... Thank you, my sworn friend! I can see a new light!!!]","[I’m glad it made you happy. I think it’ll probably work, but it might be a good idea to confirm whether a brush for the Wingeds can be made as well. There’s someone named Cornelia-san of the Sharon County who’s a friend of mine, so it might be best to consult her first. If you’d like, I can ask about it with you......]","[If she’s my sworn friend's friend, then there can be no mistake! Cornelia-san might become a bridge between the Wingeds and other races!!! Ehehe, I’m looking forward to it~~]","[......By the way, Amel-san.]","[Unn?]","[Well, your way of speaking......]","[Hah...... awawawa, ahem! I am ever in awe of the breadth of my sworn friend’s perspective. For showing us one who may become both a new light and a bridge for the Wingeds, I offer thanks on behalf of our race. The light of dawn is visible. The time of reform draws near, and with this masterpiece that grants brilliance to our wings as the key, the sealed doors shall surely open.]","I personally didn’t mind her natural way of speaking, but perhaps out of simple embarrassment, Amel-san reverted to her usual chuuni-like way of speaking, then clenched her fist as if steeling her resolve.","Still, if this talk of becoming a bridge between the Wingeds and other races really goes somewhere, Cornelia-san will probably have a lot on her plate, so if that happens, I’ll step in to help mediate as well.","Especially considering...... whether proper communication will even be possible with Amel-san’s manner of speech.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......I knew it.]","? ? ? : [To be made the key to reforming the insular Winged Folk, and their bridge to the outside world...... Cornelia-san’s future sure is bright~~]","Serious-senpai : [It’s so bright she’s practically being burned to ashes by the light......]"]},{"number":2507,"title":"Chapter 2507: Chapter 2508: A Belated Valentine’s Day Extra -","paragraphs":["In Trinia, Valentine’s Day is, simply put, regarded as one of those Otherworld Festivals. It was passed down by the past Hero Actors, and although the detailed origins are unknown to the overwhelming majority, it is fairly well known as an otherworld custom in which one gives chocolates to someone they hold affection for.","Naturally, many people imitate the custom, and in Trinia, where Hero Summoning has been performed countless times, it can be said to be a fairly standard event.","[......................]","Friendship City Hikari. In the Founder's chamber within the Central Cathedral, Olivia gazed at the item before her with a troubled expression. She too was aware of the festival known as Valentine’s Day, and it could be called natural, in a sense, for her to consider giving chocolate to someone she held affection for...... someone she revered, Miyama Kaito.","In particular, during his date with Olivia and Kaori, Kaito had mentioned that he liked chocolates, and for Olivia, whose faith overflowed her very being, it was unthinkable to overlook an event centered on giving chocolates.","Olivia possessed an extremely earnest personality, and there was no possibility she could compromise on a gift for the one she revered and worshipped with all her heart.","Just like that time when she sculpted before, she trained to the utmost within a special space where the flow of time could be manipulated, and her chocolate-making technique had already reached the level of a top-tier pâtissier.","Of course, to Olivia this was merely a skill she had acquired out of necessity, and since she had no intention of using it for anything other than chocolate to present to Kaito, it would remain a hidden talent unknown to almost everyone......","Originally blessed with a sharp palate, she conducted repeated research and careful selection, preparing the finest ingredients obtainable through her connections. The chocolates she produced with her perfected technique had already reached a level that could be called a work of art.","Then why was Olivia now wearing such a troubled expression? The answer lay in the chocolate she had made. It was a figure of Kaito crafted with extremely intricate chocolate work, and even in Olivia’s own eyes, it could be called a perfect creation......","(......I made it on impulse, but if I were to present chocolate modeled after his own appearance, would Miyama Kaito-sama not simply be bewildered? To begin with, eating food shaped like oneself does not seem like a pleasant experience.)","Indeed, though her faith was absolute, Olivia fundamentally possessed a sensible mindset. Just as with the sculpture, she had tried making chocolate modeled after Kaito’s appearance, but when she actually considered giving it to him...... she could only conclude that it was unsuitable.","Olivia lightly raised her hand over the chocolate, rewound time back so it returned into raw ingredients, and began to think.","(If one considers that it will ultimately be eaten, placing too much emphasis on form may also be a poor choice. A shape that is easy to eat, yet conveys my reverence for Miyama Kaito-sama, would be desirable...... Might there be a hint within the reference materials?)","Thinking so, Olivia picked up the books and magazines she had prepared as references. Until now she had mainly consulted cookbooks for chocolate-making, but in order to broaden her knowledge she turned to magazines featuring Valentine’s Day specials...... and then froze as she stared at a headline: \"Convey your love to someone special with heart-shaped chocolate!\"","(......Someone special...... love...... I see...... However, this shape...... No, it would be foolish to judge without trying. For now, let me attempt it once......)","Though she felt the shape was far too blatant, she could not ignore the phrase \"for someone special\", and so she decided to try making heart-shaped chocolate.","She paid particular attention to the container as well: a heart-shaped box filled with several small, bite-sized heart chocolates.","There were various types, classic chocolate, white chocolate, strawberry chocolate, and chocolates filled with citrus jelly that Kaito favored. She shaped them all into hearts, placed them into the box, and examined the result.","......No matter how one looked at it, it was a 100% honmei-type of Valentine’s chocolate.","(T/N: Honmei/True Feelings Chocolate.)","(......T- This is far too shameless, is it not? To present something so blatantly expressive...... would that not make me a wanton woman?)","For Olivia, whose purity was such that even slight exposure of skin made her blush, chocolate so brimming with visible affection was difficult to accept.","She ought to rewind it to the raw ingredients and remake it anew...... she ought to...... and yet...... her face flushed red, her expression growing even more troubled than before.","Frankly speaking, just looking at this chocolate was too embarrassing, and she could not imagine handing it to Kaito directly. If she were to present such chocolate to him face-to-face, she was confident she would faint from embarrassment.","And yet...... having seen the finished product...... she also felt that if she wished to express her feelings toward Kaito, there was no more perfect answer.","In other words, to abandon this heart-shaped chocolate would be equivalent to compromising on the gift for Kaito, and such a choice was one Olivia could never make.","(W- Will I really give this to him? This? That would...... no, but...... i- idle thoughts...... I must calm my heart......)","After carefully wrapping the heart-shaped box, she placed it within a special space under a rigorous State Preservation Magic. Then, to dispel her distracting thoughts, Olivia began to pray.","It was an austerity beyond imagination...... and when a priest who had happened to visit Olivia on business witnessed the ordeal, one that would kill an ordinary person every second, he was utterly dumbfounded, thinking...... \"As expected, the Founder stands at heights far beyond our reach......\", though such thoughts weren't something Olivia knew about.","The day of the decisive moment arrived. If it were the actual Valentine’s Day, Kaito would surely have many engagements and be troubled, so Olivia had deliberately invited him to the cathedral the day before.","When Kaito entered the Founder’s chamber in the Central Cathedral, the first thing he saw...... was Olivia prostrating herself on the ground, pressing her forehead to the floor the instant he stepped inside.","[......U- Umm, Olivia-san?]","[Today, you have graciously accepted my request to trouble you to come here for my own convenience, an act that might well be called irreverent, and I have no words sufficient to express my gratitude. The depth of Miyama Kaito-sama’s compassion should be likened to the sun that illuminates the three realms. Even your appearance upon arrival is worthy of being called supreme beauty itself, and for one possessed of proper sensibilities, to bow their head naturally before such divinity is only inevitable......]","[F- First of all, let’s calm down. I don’t really understand what’s going on, but I can tell you’re more flustered than I’ve ever seen...... so please, stand up.]","[To be granted the honor of standing before you moves this unworthy self to trembling. For such a diminutive being as myself to stand facing you is, in itself, an affront to beauty, but I shall accept your words with gratitude......]","[......Olivia-san? Errr, seriously, let’s calm down first. Try taking a deep breath......]","Though he did not fully grasp the situation, Kaito at least understood that Olivia was more flustered than ever before, and he did his best to soothe her.","Thanks to that, after some time...... though she still retained a measure of stiffness, Olivia managed to regain her composure.","[......Errr, so you said you had some business with me today?]","[Y- Yes! To convey my feelings of reverence to Miyama Kaito-sama...... I too took inspiration from an Otherworld Festival...... a- a- and so, I have prepared t- this! I fear it may offend your eyes, b- but if you would kindly accept it......]","Her face flushed bright red, Olivia extended a heart-shaped package with trembling hands. Seeing it, Kaito blinked in surprise for a moment before quickly understanding.","[Ahh, could this be Valentine’s chocolate? Thank you, this really makes me happy.]","[Auu...... I am relieved that it did not displease you.]","[No, not at all, it genuinely makes me happy.]","[A- Auu...... if it pleases you...... t- then It also...... makes me happy.]","Watching Kaito accept the chocolate with a radiant smile, Olivia’s expression softened into a shy smile where relief and happiness blended together.","To anyone who saw her though, she looked less like a devout believer...... and far more like a maiden in love.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Wha, gahhh!? T- This can’t be, I let my guard down because there wasn’t one yesterday...... Aren’t Valentine’s extra chapters after 2/14 forbidden by the rules!? What happened to the precepts!? The precepts!!!]"]},{"number":2508,"title":"Chapter 2508: Chapter 2509: Company and Exclusive Brush 13","paragraphs":["In a room of the Sharon County, Count Sharon, the head of the family, sat together with the Countess, their eldest son and heir, and Cornelia. Anne, her husband, and several other close retainers stood by at their sides.","Every one of them wore utterly exhausted expressions, as if some great trouble had occurred...... yet all they had done was hear the contents of the letter sent by Cornelia.","Of course, even that alone involved such a drastic shift in circumstances that even Count Sharon felt like holding his head in his hands. However, as a high-ranking noble who had long exercised sharp political skill, he drew on his deep experience, let out a heavy sigh, and began to speak.","[......There are mountains of things we need to consider. But when multiple situations overlap like this, the best approach is to deal with what’s already certain, one step at a time. Cornelia.]","[Yes.]","[We had already been moving with this in mind, but our house will purchase the management rights to the Victor Trading Company, and you will be installed as its representative. For the time being, the current company president will remain in his position, but you will hold the final decision-making authority. Once things stabilize to a certain degree, we may need to appoint someone else as president. However, for now, we will keep internal changes within the Victor Trading Company to a minimum and bring it under the umbrella of the Sharon County. See to it as such.]","[Understood.]","As for this matter, it had already been decided that once they judged the current Victor Trading Company unable to handle the large number of orders coming from the Dragon King’s subordinates, they would buy out the management rights and seat Cornelia as the representative.","In fact, Cornelia herself, though it had been an intense crash course, had been studying business management in earnest, understanding that this outcome was highly likely.","[Just in case, I’ll ask your wishes...... Do you want a fiancé?]","[If I were to take a fiancé at this point, it would only become a source of conflict. And as for my own feelings...... to be honest, I don’t have the capacity right now to think about anything other than myself.]","[Indeed. At present, you are like a hen that lays golden eggs...... It would be better not to give anyone an opening to take advantage. As for the official explanation...... yes, we’ll say that since your value within the County has risen too high, it has been decided that you will not take a fiancé in order to avoid family conflict until the legitimate heir is formally named successor...... If the need arises later, we can hold a formal successor designation ceremony and announce it then.]","If a noble young lady, neither the legitimate heir nor currently engaged, were set to become the head of a company expected to generate enormous profits, it was easy to imagine engagement proposals flooding in.","Thus, in order to prevent a succession dispute, they decided that for now, she would not take a fiancé. In effect, this was almost the same as declaring “Anyone who proposes engagement under the current circumstances is practically an enemy”, making it more than sufficient as a deterrent.","In truth, Cornelia and her elder brother had a good relationship, and it was almost certain that he would inherit the family. Cornelia had never even received education as a successor, so there was no real risk of a succession dispute, but the reasoning served as a warning to outsiders.","[What we must do first is expand the workshop...... though that will also require securing more craftsmen. Increasing production quickly may be difficult...... We may have no choice but to set priorities.]","[Yes. How about prioritizing those introduced by Kaito-sama? If we frame it that way, it would be harder for others to complain......]","[That may work with nobles, but are Miyama Kaito-sama’s name and reputation recognized among the Dragon King’s subordinates and the Wingeds?]","At the eldest son’s question, Cornelia tilted her head in thought. Certainly, among nobles, Kaito’s name was well known...... but to ordinary citizens, he was not particularly famous.","Whether the vast numbers of the Dragon King’s subordinates or the Wingeds, who had little interaction with other races, would accept matters simply upon hearing Kaito’s name was uncertain.","In reality, however, even the lowest ranks of the Dragon King’s subordinates had been informed of Kaito’s existence by Magnawell, and the Wingeds practically revered him as a messenger of the Gods...... but naturally, the members of the Sharon County were not aware of that much.","[We should confirm that first. As for the Dragon King’s subordinates, we can inquire when we send our replies to the Dragon King’s letters. As for the Wingeds, we’ll confirm during negotiations...... Still, the Wingeds...... Are they truly seeking to trade with us specifically for the exclusive brushes?]","[......The Wingeds take particular pride in the beauty of their wings, so I don’t think it’s impossible. However, regarding trade with them, perhaps we should first speak with that Viscouncy that has held a monopoly until now......]","The Countess responded to Count Sharon’s words. Of course, it was the Wingeds’ freedom to choose whom they associated with, but up until now, the arrangement had effectively been a monopoly. If another trading window were to open, it would change that situation.","At the very least, they needed to be careful not to give the impression that the County was slighting their Viscouncy.","[......That Viscouncy may be part of the reformist faction, but they belong to a different political group than we do. It would be safest to have Her Majesty act as an intermediary.]","[And regarding this letter from Amel-sama...... should we confirm its meaning with Kaito-sama?]","[......We have little choice but to do so. It may be disrespectful to Amel-sama, but misunderstanding her intentions would be a far greater problem.]","As for Amel’s rather chuuni-style letter, they agreed to verify its meaning with Kaito. They could hardly reply by saying they did not understand its contents, yet they also could not afford to misinterpret it. Thus, they judged that asking Kaito, who was said to be close enough to Amel to be called her sworn ally, would be the correct course of action.","And indeed, it was the correct decision. It truly was the correct decision...... However, if they did so, there was a possibility that Kaito, being considerate, might offer “I’ll attend the negotiation meeting with Amel-san”.","And if that happened...... with Kaito, who enjoyed extraordinarily high favor among the Wingeds, acting as an intermediary, they would likely be guaranteed trade terms incomparably better than those of the Viscouncy they currently dealt with. The members of the County would once again find themselves clutching their heads in disbelief...... But at this point in time, there was no way they could possibly foresee such an outcome.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [A case of chuunibyou causing secondary damage...... Because Amel strangely holds a high position and considerable ability, things are becoming unnecessarily complicated...... The County’s suffering continues. And it looks like Chris is about to get casually dragged into this too......]"]},{"number":2509,"title":"Chapter 2509: Chapter 2510: Company and Exclusive Brush 14","paragraphs":["Inside the Adventurers’ Guild building in the royal capital of Symphonia, in a neatly prepared guest room, I was speaking with Guildmaster Shion-san, also known as Catastro-san.","The topic of conversation was that exclusive brush as I remembered hearing about Catastro-san’s original form being something else entirely, so I decided to introduce it to her just in case.","Well, in Catastro-san’s case, it didn’t really feel like she was a Beastman-type Demon......","[I see. That certainly is a splendid item. I, too, take great care with magic power permeability each day in order to refine my beauty.]","[......Errr, I heard that for ordinary Demons or humans, magic power permeability doesn’t matter that much. Does that mean you’re a Beastman-type Demon, Shion-san?]","[No, in my case, I am classified as a Magical Beast-type Demon. A classification close to that of Dragons, perhaps? There are many varieties of dragons, so they are classified in another group together as \"Dragons\", but from an ecological standpoint, it would not be incorrect to call them Magical Beast-type Demons. Anyhow, it refers to beings whose true form is separate, and who usually live in a Humanized Form...... Yes, I would rather not acknowledge that form as my true appearance, but if we must classify it, I am a Magical Beast-type Demon.]","[Ah, I see, so Demons whose original form is separate are called Magical Beast-type Demons. Are there many of them?]","Now that she mentioned it, Beastman-type Demons were literally humanoids with animal features, but Dragons, like Frea-san, could switch between their original Dragon Form and a Humanized Form.","Naturally, there must be other Demons like that as well, so it wasn’t strange that such a classification existed.","[There are quite a number under this classification. However, many Magical Beast-type Demons are rather large in their true forms, and most cities impose size restrictions, so you rarely see them within city limits.]","[......Now that you mention it, you don’t really see obviously gigantic Demons like Megiddo-san around.]","[Individual establishments may set their own rules, but most cities require one to either reduce their body to under three meters or use Humanization Magic.]","[Ah, so that’s why Megiddo-san and the others usually come into the city in human form.]","[When one’s size is too great, it can obstruct passage or lead to accidental damage. Such restrictions are necessary for the coexistence of many different races.]","That made perfect sense. If multiple Demons over 10 meters tall, like Megiddo-san, were walking down the main street, the flow of people alone would become complete chaos, and they’d probably spill into the carriage lanes as well.","Megiddo-san didn’t seem like the type to worry about such things, but she was probably being firmly told off by Kuro.","[Among those Miyama-sama knows, the Special Individual Black Wolf and the Special Individual Ogre from Underworld King-sama's place are also Magical Beast-type Demons.]","[Ah, indeed, Eva is originally a giant wolf. Acht is quite large in his true form as well...... I see. In that case, people like them might have a demand for the exclusive brush too.]","[Indeed. If you wish, Miyama-sama, I can spread word of it within the Magical Beast-type Demon community.]","[Eh? You've got a community among you?]","[Yes. As I mentioned, Magical Beast-type Demons have many matters to keep in mind, such as size restrictions, so we share information and cooperate in teaching Humanization Magic. I can contact representatives of each race immediately.]","[Ah, then since the opportunity’s here, I’d appreciate it if you could give it a bit of publicity.]","[Certainly. Leave it to me.]","Thinking that it would be best to have it advertised if there was demand beyond Dragons and Beastman-type Demons, I gave my reply, and Catastro-san bowed deeply with utmost courtesy.","After finishing my conversation with Catastro-san and returning home, Anima brought me a letter that had arrived by emergency express delivery. I accepted it, moved to my room, and then checked its contents. Emergency express is an extremely fast service in which a letter arrives almost on the very day it is sent, and accordingly, each one costs a fair amount.","Wondering who it might be from, I checked and found it was from Cornelia-san. The letter politely expressed her thanks for advertising the exclusive brush...... and stated that they had already received more than enough orders, so further promotion was no longer necessary.","Originally, I had already finished promoting it to everyone I could think of, so I had no plans to advertise it further anyway. Though it was impossible to read emotions from the letter through Sympathy Magic, it at least felt as if she was pleased by the large number of orders. If I had managed to help even a little, then that was enough for me.","Just as I was thinking that, Alice appeared in the room and silently handed me a wine glass. Tilting my head in confusion, I accepted it.","Thereupon, Alice poured wine into my glass and into the one she had prepared for herself, lightly clinking them together.","[......Cheers. Well~~ wine really is delicious.]","[U- Unn? Why wine all of a sudden?]","[Well, I happened to get my hands on some good wine, so I thought I’d share it with Kaito-san...... Ah, and I’ve got cheese for snacks too.]","[That’s pretty sudden...... Well, I don’t have any plans left for today, so I don’t mind...... Unn. This really is good wine.]","I didn’t quite understand what brought this on, but since she wanted to drink together, I went along with it. Sitting down on the sofa, I enjoyed the wine with Alice.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [This guy’s unbelievable. Even after that setup last time, he can still make the damage spread...... And since it’s a letter, there’s the fatal problem that Sympathy Magic can’t convey emotions......]","? ? ? : [As for Kaito-san’s state of mind after reading the letter though, it’s basically \"Cornelia-san seems happy, so it's great!\"]","Serious-senpai : [You don't go \"Great!\" here, oi.]"]},{"number":2510,"title":"Chapter 2510: Chapter 2511: Company and Exclusive Brush 15","paragraphs":["<Author's Notes>","Volume 15 of the Light Novel and the second series of pin badges will be released on February 20th! I’ve created a page in the Activity Report, so please check it out if you like.","You can also see images of the second series of pin badges in the Activity Report.","~Personal Note~","I’ve caught a cold, so tomorrow’s update will be skipped. Everyone, please be careful with the changing weather during this seasonal transition.","After finishing the long family meeting and returning to her room, Cornelia sat wearily, sipping little by little the tea Anne had made for her that helped with stomach pains.","[......Until just about half a year ago, I was in a position where, because my family had unnecessary influence, a political marriage would be troublesome, and yet I wasn’t involved in most of the trading company’s interests, so there was little benefit. I heard whispers that potential fiancé candidates would hesitate to step forward.]","[But now, you are the representative of a trading company whose rapid expansion is practically guaranteed, have various connections, and even a friend of Miyama Kaito-sama, a person of infinite potential. The employment slots of the Victor Trading Company that’s about to expand, the profits that will surely increase in the future, connections with notable people, and friendship with someone who could be called the World's Singularity......]","[Truly, it’s like being a hen that lays golden eggs. Well, in actually...... I’m just being blown away by the storm caused by the great dragon that is Kaito-sama...... but still, this has all happened in such a short time. Even Her Majesty Chris must be at his wit’s end.]","[......This involves power balance between factions after all.]","Anne, who had previously served in the imperial palace and now worked as a top-class maid for the Sharon County, was naturally well-versed in noble affairs.","Cornelia nodded gravely at Anne’s words, immediately understanding what she meant.","[Even among the reformist faction, there isn’t complete unity. The emergence of multiple factions is inevitable...... but recently, the power of the Hamilton Marquis faction has become overwhelmingly large. Our Sharon County is no exception, but even the Hamilton Marquisdom itself has increased its influence further. Naturally, lower-ranking nobles will consider switching to the more powerful faction.]","[Though inevitable, the high-ranking nobles who lead these factions won’t be pleased, and friction between factions may arise.]","[This is something even Lady Eris didn’t fully anticipate...... or rather, she may have underestimated Kaito-sama's influence. That said, inviting young ladies from factions other than the Hamilton Marquisdom faction to that previous tea party was quite difficult...... so this outcome was unavoidable, I suppose.]","Currently, within the Archlesia Empire, the Hamilton Marquisdom faction’s influence was explosively rising. While Chris wished the power balance among factions to remain steady, and the Hamilton Marquisdom wished to avoid unnecessary friction, Kaito’s pace of action was simply faster, leaving them constantly on the back foot.","[......Even so, being told to assume the possibility of encountering Dragon King-sama or the Four Great Demon Dragons in a city he went to just to look at exclusive brushes...... and that they might take an interest in the brushes...... is impossible to predict......]","[That city was quite large, but he just happened to encounter them at exactly the right place and time without any prior arrangement.]","[I am continually impressed by Kaito-sama’s ability to draw opportunities to him...... That said, the potential profits are truly enormous. However, expanding the workshop requires a significant upfront investment, which will be difficult for Father. Ideally, we’d want a more direct source of substantial income. The Sharon Trading Company is stable, for better or worse, and isn’t directly connected to this matter, so increasing profits is difficult. There may be secondary gains from increased fame, but reproducing with magic tools the device Kaito-sama uses to convert magical wavelengths......]","[——–is impossible. Altering magical wavelengths is an extremely advanced technique. To achieve it with magic tools would require multiple new technologies...... It’s only possible because it’s a divine work under Miyama Kaito-sama’s guidance.]","[I’m not that knowledgeable about magic tool creation myself, but if Anne says so, it seems very difficult indeed.]","Here, they had a misunderstanding. Cornelia and Anne had never actually seen the item created by Canalis; they only knew of it through Kaito’s letter. All they're aware of is that it's a special item created by an Omniscient, Omnipotent God, and they recognized it as something impossible for them to reproduce.","No one could have predicted that it was actually an item created using the technological system existing in this world, that by analyzing it, it could be reproduced as a magic tool, and that applying that technology could even revolutionize magic tools.","Then, when Kaito made a remark along the lines of \"please consider Cornelia and the Victor Trading Company\", the Seditch Magic Tool Company approached them in what was almost a joint development...... and the day Cornelia would foam at the mouth and faint was already just the day after tomorrow.","<Afterword>","Cornelia : [......It’s true that it’s a big deal, but expanding the workshop and covering the costs will be handled by Father as the head of the family. I just need to focus on learning how to manage the trading company and handling on-site decisions, like prioritizing purchases until the expansion is complete, and that should be fine.]","Stomachache Devil : [......What kind of misunderstanding are you having here?]","Cornelia : [Hyiih?]","Stomachache Devil : [My Body-Blow Phase isn’t over yet! (Revolution in Magic Tool Technology, the New Light of the Wingeds, and Orders from the Magical Beast-type Demons)]","Activity Report:","Thank you, as always.","Anyhow, thank you for your patience. The release date for the latest Volume 15 of the Light Novel is February 20th, just around the corner.","This volume covers the latter part of the Six Kings arc, leading up to just before Kaito’s birthday.","You can make reservations here......","[“I Was Caught up in a Hero Summoning, but That World Is at Peace (WN)” Volume 15 Official HP]","Also, on the same day, February 20th, the second series of pin badges, which was sold once before, will be released.","The first series, which sold out quickly last time, will also be reissued, so those who missed out previously should definitely check it out. You can purchase them through the Shinkigensha Online Store:","[Shinkigensha Online Store]","At the end, images of the LN's cover and the second series of pin badges are included."]},{"number":2511,"title":"Chapter 2511: Chapter 0.15 - Volume 15 Illustrations (may contain spoilers)","paragraphs":["Here's Volume 15. I would say \"Spoiler Alert!\" here, but there's hardly any substantial illustrations this volume.","[Sorry, Kaito-kun. Did I keep you waiting?]","\"Where did you abduct this loli now?!\" -Alice probably","Kaito and Kuro stargazing...... while Shiro is probably above that building, looking back at them.","Kuro in a short-skirt type yukata"]},{"number":2512,"title":"Chapter 2512: Company and Exclusive Brush 16","paragraphs":["<Author's Notes>","My recovery was slow, so sorry, I ended up missing two days.","The sound of small birds chirping could be heard outside the window. Though only a single pane of glass separated her from it, the morning scenery felt somehow like a different world. Narrowing her eyes against the light streaming through the window, Cornelia allowed a faint smile to form.","[I of all people...... it seems I must have dozed off a little while sitting at my desk. Perhaps I was more fatigued than I realized......]","After murmuring to herself with a light, wry smile, Cornelia resumed writing the papers before her...... \"a letter of introduction to the Victor Trading Company, intended for Kaito\", along with a separate letter addressed to the company’s president.","(What a strange dream I had. An introduction naturally means a referral letter, and once I send this to Kaito-sama and notify the company president in advance, my role is finished...... Of course, should anything occur, I would bear responsibility as the one who made the introduction...... but personally guiding Kaito-sama would be far too presumptuous of me. And to think that, at the place I guided him to, we would coincidentally encounter War King-sama and Dragon King-sama...... a child’s fantasy would be more realistic than that.)","With those thoughts in mind, Cornelia swiftly finished writing the two letters, placing each into color-coded envelopes for clarity before sealing them.","Once she handed the letters to a servant, her role would be complete. From the perspective of the County’s interests, it might be better for her to involve herself with Kaito more actively. However, considering the stature of the person in question, if any ulterior motives were suspected, it could easily become a serious matter. Maintaining an appropriate distance seemed the wisest course.","[Now then, before I go deliver the letter, I should check my appearance......]","For Cornelia, the eldest daughter of a County, personal appearance was important. Though she had properly prepared herself that morning, she always confirmed her full reflection in the standing mirror before leaving her room, just to be sure.","Standing before the mirror, just as Cornelia judged that her appearance was in order...... Suddenly, \"the Cornelia reflected in the mirror moved\".","\"......But will that truly change the outcome?\"","[......Eh? Wha......]","Before Cornelia could even step back in shock at the utterly abnormal sight of her reflection moving on its own and speaking while folding its arms, the Cornelia in the mirror pressed on with her words.","\"Certainly, that incident could be called a turning point.\"","Immediately after the Cornelia in the mirror spoke, the surface of the mirror displayed a different scene...... the tea party previously held at Hamilton Marquisdom’s separate residence.","\"At that time, had you explained that an introduction meant writing a referral letter and had not personally guided Kaito-sama, then indeed, you might not have become acquainted with Dragon King-sama, War King-sama, or the Special Advisors of the Seditch Magic Tool Company.\"","[......Eh? Ah...... y- yes. I...... have already......]","\"The process may indeed change. However, the destination...... would it not remain the same? If Kaito-sama came to like those exclusive brushes and recommended it to his acquaintances, it would have been easy to imagine a similar situation unfolding. In fact, in that case, I would have been personally named and summoned by renowned figures whom I had never even met. Considering that, would it not be preferable that, though by coincidence, introductions have already been properly exchanged once?\"","[......T- That is...... certainly...... the result...... may not have changed.]","Yes...... that's right. She remembered it all too clearly now. What the Cornelia in the mirror had spoken of had already happened...... Cornelia had guided Kaito, had become acquainted with Magnawell and Megiddo, and had even been scheduled to attend the discussion with the Seditch Magic Tool Company......","[......Arehh? Please wait a moment...... the Seditch Magic Tool Company? I feel as though I’m forgetting something important......]","[——–! ——-a! ——–ld of yourself——— open your——— Co——- lia!]","[......H- How strange? It sounds as though Father’s voice is coming from outside the window?]","At some point, the Cornelia reflected in the mirror had vanished, and even the room she had been in moments before had disappeared...... Only a window remained before her, and from beyond it came a voice.","As though guided by that voice, Cornelia gently opened the window...... and her consciousness awakened.","[———Cornelia!!!]","[Hah!? F- Father!?]","[Pull yourself together! You were foaming at the mouth...... I understand how you feel, but you must keep your composure!]","[Ah, t- that's right. I...... lost consciousness from the shock...... M- My deepest apologies, Trois-sama.]","[Oh, not at all. Please do not concern yourself. I should have explained things in a more orderly fashion. I must apologize for startling you.]","As Cornelia hurriedly apologized, Trois, seated on the sofa across from her, replied with a gentle smile that there was no problem.","Indeed, this was the reception room of the Sharon County, and just as previously arranged, it was the venue for discussions with the Seditch Magic Tool Company.","It was due to the outrageous bombshell suddenly dropped during that meeting that Cornelia, overcome by shock, had foamed at the mouth and fainted for several seconds.","[......Then, once more, I shall explain in order the details regarding the new technology that our company and the Sharon Trading Company wish to jointly research and develop moving forward.]","[......Y- Yesh......]","Though she nodded at Trois’ calm words, Cornelia was inwardly screaming \"This is not how I imagined things would go!\"...... And, needless to say, the cause was Kaito.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......Well, indeed...... Even if she hadn’t made a mistake regarding the introduction, she would have ended up in the same situation...... No, actually, in that case Kaito might have been freely recommending their brushes without properly understanding Cornelia’s circumstances...... which would have made things even worse...... She was doomed...... from the very beginning......]"]},{"number":2513,"title":"Chapter 2513: Company and Exclusive Brush 17","paragraphs":["<Author's Notes>","I'm sorry for worrying you. I've recovered so much that the Retsu Kaiou in me screams.","Though losing consciousness, even briefly, in front of a guest could be called a grave problem for a noble...... this time, Count Sharon had no intention of blaming Cornelia.","After all, although he was desperately holding himself together, Count Sharon could not completely stop his body from trembling, and beneath the desk his hands quivered faintly. The matter under discussion was just that immense.","To begin with, in Trinia, magic tools are indispensable to daily life. They are so essential that one might question whether anyone exists who does not use them at all. If such magic tools were to undergo a major reform, it could even be called a world-shaking event.","At this stage, Trois had only briefly explained the outline, and the detailed discussion was still to come. Even so, the scale of it was enough to make Cornelia, who could hardly be called a specialist in magic tools, lose consciousness from the shock.","In particular, the technology that allows a user’s own mana to be repurposed as the mana of a magic crystal was simply astonishing. Teleportation magic tools are a representative example, but when powerful effects are used, it takes a certain amount of time before the tool can be used again.","For teleportation magic tools, the difference varies by grade, but on average they require about two hours. Even licensed offensive magic tools used by knights or adventurers require a comparable cooldown before reuse.","To shorten that time by replenishing it with one’s own mana would, without exaggeration, change the very way magic tools are used.","Furthermore, by assuming the use of the wielder’s mana, it becomes possible to create magic tools that employ spells which would not activate with magic crystal mana alone, and therefore could not originally be made into magic tools at all. This too would overturn many established conventions. If it even becomes possible to perform large-scale magic formulas that previously required an impossible, or at least unrealistic, number of magic crystals, then items once abandoned due to cost, such as the virtual-space-generating magic tool Alice created for the Six Kings Festival using abundant resources, might now be feasible to produce.","Nor is that all. It may also become possible to expand the effects of existing magic tools. For example, with teleportation magic tools, due to the large mana consumption, even the highest-grade models currently can transfer only about three to four people at once. Yet by having the user supply additional mana, it might become possible to teleport everyone and everything within a certain range together.","If one assumes that the user will provide additional mana, it may even be possible to reduce the quality of the magic crystal and drastically lower the price of magic tools. The changes that could arise from this single technology alone are staggering.","(......Father also looks completely unable to keep up with his thoughts. I understand that feeling painfully well. Someone like me can hardly imagine the full extent of the impact...... but one thing is absolutely clear: this will bring unimaginable profit......)","If, regarding this revolutionary new technology, the Sharon County were able to secure sufficient rights and interests through joint development with the world’s largest merchant group, the Seditch Magic Tool Company, the amount of money flowing into their house would be dizzying to even imagine.","And at the same time, what they were forced to recognize anew was the sheer magnitude of Kaito’s influence.","......To be honest, the Seditch Magic Tool Company has no real advantage in proposing this joint development or research. Officially, the trigger is said to be the exclusive brush from the Victor Trading Company, but in fact, the brush itself contained no new technology; it was the additional product created by Canalis that was the truly revolutionary masterpiece.","With nothing more than such a tenuous connection, if the Sharon County were to assert rights based on this reasoning, they would merely be ridiculed. But if the proposal comes from the Seditch Magic Tool Company instead, the situation changes.","After all, the Seditch Magic Tool Company has more than enough resources to conduct development and research on its own. Even if the Sharon Company is considered relatively large within the Human Realm, there is no particular benefit for them to go out of their way to approach it.","At that point, both Cornelia and Count Sharon could easily imagine whose influence had created the present situation.","(Though it is only a conjecture, when the Seditch Magic Tool Company approached him about the new technology, perhaps Kaito-sama told them something like, “Since the exclusive brush was the trigger, please show consideration to the Sharon County”. Kaito-sama himself gave the impression that he truly had more money than he knew what to do with, so I cannot imagine him desiring enormous profits...... I can picture that much, but......! To casually hand something like this over, the matter is simply far, far too enormous!!)","Yes, they could imagine it. They understood that Kaito, who already had more wealth than he could spend, would have no desire to claim such rights...... and given his personality, he had probably said something lightly along the lines of, “Then as long as you show consideration to Cornelia-san’s side, that’s fine”, tossing it out with casual ease. But for those on the receiving end, the scale of the profit was so great that it went beyond mere gratitude and instead felt like their stomachs might burst from the strain.","For the time being, before proceeding to the detailed discussion, Cornelia and Count Sharon simultaneously instructed the maid waiting nearby to bring tea effective for stomachache.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [She understands that Kaito doesn’t desire any rights or profits, and even without hearing the details, she can roughly imagine how the flow of things occurred...... but still, to have such an enormous windfall just handed over like that, no wonder her stomach hurts...... How pitiful.]"]},{"number":2514,"title":"Chapter 2514: Company and Exclusive Brush 18","paragraphs":["In actuality, it was somewhat questionable whether she was even keeping up mentally, but they still had to move the discussion forward. Even so, given the current situation, which could fairly be called chaotic, she did not want to shift straight into negotiating the conditions for an actual partnership or joint development.","[......I believe it is a truly wonderful proposal, and we are deeply honored that you have brought it to our household. However, it is a matter of such great magnitude that I would first like to resolve various questions and uncertainties......]","[Yes, of course. I will answer anything within my capacity...... For now, let us set aside the matter of whether or not to conclude a contract. My hope is that, during today’s discussion, we can dispel any concerns or doubts Lady Cornelia may have, so please feel free to ask anything.]","Hearing Count Sharon express his wish to begin by asking various questions, Trois accepted readily with a gentle smile.","With his soft and kindly air and calm, composed bearing, it was clear why he headed the Sales Division of the world’s largest trading company, his very presence made him easy to approach.","[Well then, to begin with, regarding what is envisioned for this new technology......]","And just as he had declared, Trois proceeded to answer Count Sharon’s and Cornelia’s questions one by one with care. He was exceedingly courteous and sincere, responding to them with genuine earnestness.","Whenever a point of concern arose, he explained it thoroughly until that concern was resolved, and even the smallest questions were answered without evasion or ambiguity.","With clear and considerate explanations, with their anxieties addressed as though he were personally standing beside them, and even including projections of how matters would proceed should a contract actually be concluded, such as the allocation of rights between the Seditch Magic Tool Trading Company and the Sharon County, the discussion progressed steadily. The initially tense Count Sharon and Cornelia gradually found themselves speaking more freely, drawn in by Trois’ gentle manner.","Then, once the conversation had advanced to a certain point...... Cornelia felt a chill run down her spine. When she glanced to the side, Count Sharon also appeared pale, a bead of sweat trailing down his cheek.","Why? How? Questions welled up, yet no answer came. Trois remained consistently gentle and gentlemanly, and just as he had declared, he was essentially waiting for Count Sharon and Cornelia’s questions before responding.","Yes, the ones asking the questions were the Sharon County side. Trois was merely answering what they asked and providing supplementary details...... The choice of topic should have belonged to Count Sharon and Cornelia.","......And yet, at some point, they realized.","At first, this had been meant as a preliminary discussion before deciding whether to conclude any contract, and they had been asking questions with that understanding. But since when have things changed? Looking back, neither Count Sharon nor Cornelia could pinpoint the moment...... yet before they knew it, the content of their discussion had shifted into \"adjusting terms on the premise that a contract would be concluded\".","(......We were only supposed to receive an explanation this time, take the matter back, and consider it further...... And yet, before we even noticed, so naturally, as though gently led by the hand, the conversation has advanced all the way to negotiating terms!?)","Yes, thinking about it now, they could see it, but until just moments ago, they had not even realized it. The discussion had already progressed to the adjustment of terms, and they were at the stage where those terms would be finalized here, formalized later in the form of a contract document, and then concluded.","(B- But, these are extremely favorable terms...... aren’t they? So favorable that one wonders whether it is truly acceptable for us to benefit this much...... The contents are entirely agreeable...... Perhaps there would be no issue in proceeding to a contract?)","Though surprised, the conditions being negotiated were undeniably attractive. It seemed that not only Cornelia but Count Sharon as well were thinking the same.","Perhaps it was because Cornelia was a friend of Kaito that such advantageous terms had been offered, but in any case, if the Seditch Magic Tool Trading Company was proposing conditions favorable to the Sharon County, there was no reason to refuse.","In the end, the negotiation of terms continued as it was, and the discussion reached an agreement both Count Sharon and Cornelia could accept...... yet when the stage came to write down the finalized conditions on paper, the two of them turned pale once more.","The conditions that had left a strong impression on them were certainly favorable to the Sharon County. However, when everything, including the extremely detailed clauses, was written out and reviewed...... the terms were almost perfectly even.","[Well then, if there are no objections from the Sharon County, I will prepare a contract based on these conditions by our next meeting.]","At this point, they understood. Looking at the paper, it was true that every condition listed had indeed been discussed. And yet, the matters most strongly imprinted in Cornelia’s mind were only the favorable ones. As for the clauses disadvantageous to the Sharon County, she could confirm that they had certainly been discussed, but astonishingly, they had left almost no impression in her mind.","Most likely, no, without a doubt, this too was all due to Trois. Not only through his expressions and demeanor, but also by skillfully adjusting the tone of his voice, the pauses in conversation, and the order of his words, he had controlled which points would linger vividly in Cornelia’s mind and which would be buried among the rest, difficult to recall.","The questions at the beginning, the realizations in the middle, the adjustment of conditions toward the end...... Count Sharon and Cornelia should have been the ones thinking and choosing for themselves all along.","And yet, it felt as though they had stepped of their own will into an unknown, vast labyrinth, choosing each fork in the road, deciding the order of their steps, selecting among countless options as they advanced...... only to realize, in the end, that the destination they reached had been decided by Trois right from the start.","(......A monster of verbal combat.)","Now she understood. Even as a shiver ran through her, relief followed. Most likely, no, without a doubt, it was thanks to Kaito. The reason the contract terms had ended up perfectly balanced between the Seditch Magic Tool Merchant Association and the Sharon County...... was because Trois had intended from the very beginning to bring them to that exact ratio.","If Trois had truly desired so, he could have concluded the agreement with conditions overwhelmingly favorable to the Seditch Magic Tool Trading Company with ease. Precisely because they were certain of that, both Count Sharon and Cornelia felt nothing but relief that events had not unfolded in that direction.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [As expected, even a count is at a disadvantage against Trois......]","? ? ? : [Well, they’re on completely different levels of experience. At this point, even Kuro-san, who personally taught him the basics, would probably have a hard time beating Trois-san in verbal combat. Well, I...... or rather, Alice-chan has never lost to Trois-san in verbal combat.]"]},{"number":2515,"title":"Chapter 2515: Company and Exclusive Brush 19","paragraphs":["After her discussion with Trois reached a certain conclusion, Cornelia felt a wave of exhaustion wash over her. As a noble lady, she ought to swallow her fatigue and maintain an unruffled expression, but she had no such composure left, and her weariness showed plainly on her face.","Had this merely been a social gathering, Count Sharon would surely have rebuked her for revealing such vulnerability and inviting others to look down on her. Yet this time, he felt no urge to fault his daughter.","After all, even he, who had experienced countless negotiations as head of a County, felt that if he let his guard slip, his fatigue would show on his own face. It seemed only natural that Cornelia, still lacking in experience, could not fully conceal hers.","(......This doesn’t mean everything is over. There’s still much we need to prepare for...... but I don’t want to think about that right now. I want to soak in a warm bath and calm my mind...... use aroma oils and candles, and relax as much as possible......)","There had been many factors contributing to her mental exhaustion: negotiating with Trois, an opponent so far above her that she felt as though she had been dancing in the palm of his hand, and confronting a new technology that could drastically reshape the history of magical tools.","And looking ahead, there were still renowned figures such as Bacchus, Gluttony, and Amel, figures of true renown, but she had no desire to think about them at the moment.","As Cornelia was lost in such thoughts, Trois spoke.","[Now then, our discussion on behalf of the Seditch Magic Tool Company has concluded. However, on a separate matter, I have been entrusted with a message for Lady Cornelia. May I deliver it?]","[Eh? F- For me?]","[Yes. It is from Tetra, the Special Advisor to our company’s Accounting Department. Though to be precise, it is not from her in her official capacity, but from Tetra personally.]","[From Tetra-sama......? Errr, what is it about?]","Hearing Trois' words, Cornelia tilted her head in puzzlement. She had indeed met Tetra before through Kaito’s introduction and exchanged greetings, but being told she had a personal message for her, unrelated to the magic tool company, left her unable to guess her purpose.","[Before that, I would like to confirm something. According to the information we have obtained, is it correct that Lady Cornelia will soon become the representative of the Victor Trading Company? If this is not something you can discuss yet, there is no need to answer.]","[Indeed...... In the near future, we do intend to appoint Cornelia as the representative of the Victor Trading Company...... But does that relate to Tetra-sama’s message?]","It was no issue that Trois had obtained information regarding the Victor Trading Company. Although the decision had been finalized only a few days prior, preparations had long been underway with the assumption that Cornelia would become its representative. It was neither surprising that he knew, nor something that needed to be hidden.","[Yes. In that case, please confirm what Tetra has entrusted to me.]","[This magic tool is......?]","[A magic tool capable of recording and playing back voices. It was not commercialized due to excessive cost relative to its performance, but Tetra purchased a prototype for personal use. Well, with this new technology, commercialization may become feasible...... but for now, please understand that it contains the message from Tetra.]","What Trois placed on the table was a voice-recording magic tool. Though it could store only a few minutes of audio, its production cost was exorbitant and its formula structure complex, leading to the prototype being shelved. After briefly explaining, Trois touched the device, and Tetra’s recorded voice began to play.","\"Lady Cornelia, please forgive the rudeness of sending you a message so suddenly when we have scarcely exchanged more than greetings before. As this device cannot record a long message, I shall proceed directly to the point. You may have heard part of this from Trois, but it concerns the Victor Trading Company. I understand that you are to become its representative. However, given that considerable investment will be required, such as expanding facilities, would it not be difficult to proceed, since seeking investors might invite involvement from other nobles?\"","Tetra’s observation was entirely correct. Considering the expansion of workshops, the organizational shift with Cornelia as representative, and future sales development, a substantial amount of funding would undoubtedly be required.","Ordinarily, recruiting investors would be an option. However, doing so could invite nobles eager to secure vested interests, and with Cornelia herself currently akin to a goose that lays golden eggs, she was in no position to grant other nobles an opening to intrude.","At present, Cornelia lacked a strong patron, so the Sharon County had intended to invest a large sum themselves, even if it meant stretching their resources.","\"......So here is my proposal: would you consider having me as your investor? This has nothing to do with the Seditch Magic Tool Company; it would be my personal investment. In the name of I who was once called the Conqueror of Gold Veins, I promise to provide funding that will fully satisfy your needs.\"","[ ! ? ! ? ]","Tetra was an extremely renowned figure in economic circles. While the world’s wealthiest individual was Kuromueina, Tetra’s personal fortune would undoubtedly place her within the top ten in the world. Even the Sharon County, considered relatively well-funded among the nobles of the Archlesia Empire, could not hope to compare to her financial power.","\"If you are wondering why, the answer is simple. Some time ago, Kaito personally asked me to look after Lady Cornelia. I am the sort of person who cannot refuse a request from someone I deeply love. Since he asked, I intend to support you with everything I have. If necessary, I would even be willing to deter troublesome elements...... I would not mind personally becoming your patron.\"","[Awawawa......]","\"Please do consider it at least once. Well then, until we meet again.\"","With those words, the message ended, leaving Cornelia trembling faintly, as though she had been abandoned in a frozen wasteland.","(......Tetra-sama as my patron? W- What is happening!? This has grown far too large! Kaito-samaaaa!?)","Shuddering at the overwhelming extent of Kaito’s influence, Cornelia cried out in anguish within her heart.","<Afterword>","~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~","Kaito-kun : [Please look after Cornelia-san, okay?]","Tetra : [You can count on me. It is a request from the one I love. I shall support her with all my might.]","Cornelia : [Hyiihh......]","~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~","Serious-senpai : [Pretty amazing, right? This is 100% goodwill, you know? Kaito probably meant something like \"Just take a little extra care of her~\", but since Tetra is seriously in love with Kaito, she went all out because it was Kaito’s request...... and as a result, Cornelia’s stomach gets obliterated...... Huh? That’s strange. Everyone’s acting out of goodwill, so why is a tragedy being born......?]"]},{"number":2516,"title":"Chapter 2516: Company and Exclusive Brush 20","paragraphs":["<Author's Notes>","[Warning] It’s not that things have gone out of control, but a seriously dangerous person is saying seriously dangerous things in the afterword. And to repeat, nothing has actually gone out of control.","At the imperial castle of Archlesia Empire, Eris and Marquis Hamilton, who had been visiting the castle far more frequently of late, were holding a meeting together with Chris in the same room.","All three held documents in their hands, their expressions grave, making it clear that the situation was a troublesome one.","[......The developments are far too rapid, and on a much larger scale than anticipated...... Count Sharon and Lady Cornelia are scheduled to come to the castle the day after tomorrow, so we will hear the details then, but even the information already confirmed is significant.]","[The movements of the Dragon King’s subordinates have exceeded expectations, but to think even the Wingeds would make a move...... And the strengthening of cooperation between the Sharon Trading Company and the Seditch Magic Tool Trading Company is now almost certain.]","At Chris' muttered words, Marquis Hamilton, who was likewise reviewing the documents, spoke with a troubled expression. Recently, the movements of the Ritch Barony had been hectic, forcing the Hamilton Marquisdom to act extensively as well. Just as that had settled down, the Sharon County had suddenly begun moving on a much larger scale.","[The Sharon County will be extremely busy, but above all, what we must pay attention to is Lady Cornelia.]","Agreeing with the others, Eris studied the documents with a serious expression. Originally, the Sharon County had been one of the more powerful noble houses, and they had thought neither the Hamilton Marquisdom nor Chris would need to act.","However, the scale had grown beyond expectations, and multiple situations were progressing simultaneously, that was the problem.","[Indeed. If they are forming a partnership with the Seditch Magic Tool Trading Company, the Sharon County will be busy, and there is a high possibility that support from the Victor Trading Company’s side will be delayed or insufficient. The movements related to the companies are particularly dangerous.]","[Yes. No matter how capable Lady Cornelia may be, she still lacks experience, and negotiating with seasoned veterans will be extremely difficult. They had likely planned to support her by dispatching personnel from the Sharon Trading Company, but it hardly seems they have the leeway for that......]","At Chris' words, Eris spoke with concern. The one they were worried about was Cornelia, who would soon sit at the negotiating table as the representative of the Victor Trading Company.","Originally, Cornelia had not been studying company management. After the previous incident involving Kaito, she had begun learning at an accelerated pace, but her experience was still overwhelmingly insufficient. Moreover, as seen from how the original president of the Victor Trading Company had required assistance from the Sharon County due to financial difficulties, he could hardly be called especially capable.","They had likely planned to dispatch talented personnel from the Sharon Trading Company to provide support, but with the partnership with the Seditch Magic Tool Trading Company established, the Sharon Trading Company itself had become extremely busy and no longer had the capacity to reassign staff.","[To think we would be seriously considering intervention regarding the Sharon County rather than the Ritch Barony......]","[When it came to the Ritch Barony, the Lord Trading Company, one of the Five Great Companies, moved early. Perhaps because they did not wish to draw the Lord Trading Company’s ire, the major companies did not make significant moves. But this time is different. The Sharon Trading Company is certainly large and powerful, but there are several companies on equal footing or even greater. I doubt they will overlook a situation that is clearly profitable.]","Agreeing with Marquis Hamilton, Chris gazed with a weary expression at several major companies listed in the documents before him, those that had been showing active movements.","To put it plainly, the Victor Trading Company was attractive right now. Enormous profits could be expected with even slight involvement, and Cornelia, who stood as its representative, lacked experience and had no backing other than the Sharon County. Even though the Seditch Magic Tool Trading Company, the world’s largest company, was involved in this matter, it was tied to the Sharon Trading Company and would not appear in dealings with the Victor Trading Company. In other words, it was an ideal target.","[Count Sharon cannot appear at the negotiation table, can he? If he did, she would be mocked as someone who cannot negotiate without parental accompaniment. The fact that Lady Cornelia lacks a strong backer outside the Sharon County is indeed problematic. The imperial family should not intervene excessively, but depending on the situation, I may have to......]","If Cornelia had backing strong enough to prevent others from underestimating her, it would be a different matter, but such support could not be prepared overnight. Just as Chris was considering intervening as emperor if necessary, an aide hurried into the room and whispered into her ear.","[......They have withdrawn? Are you certain? It is fine to speak here. Give me the details.]","[Yes, Your Majesty! Several companies that you ordered us to monitor have almost simultaneously changed their movements. It is not yet confirmed, but they have even withdrawn the funds they had prepared...... It appears they are attempting to pull out from matters related to the Victor Trading Company.]","[They have not even begun preliminary probing before negotiations, and yet they withdraw? Has Phantasmal King-sama issued a warning...... No, would she truly intervene in a mere conflict of interests between companies...... Do we know the cause?]","Chris had already identified several companies showing preliminary movements and had ordered her aides to monitor them. What had just been reported was the astonishing news that the very companies she had been wary of were now showing signs of a full withdrawal.","Given that these were multiple large-scale companies, precisely the kind Chris had been cautious of, the decision to withdraw without even taking a seat at the negotiating table was unnatural.","As Eris and Marquis Hamilton listened with tense expressions on their faces, the aide spoke with a somewhat uncertain look.","[......It cannot be said with certainty, but we have received one unbelievable piece of information. It seems the Conqueror of Golden Veins has made her move......]","[Tetra-sama did!? T- That is...... acting personally, unrelated to the Seditch Magic Tool Trading Company?]","[Yes, that appears to be the case.]","It was no wonder Chris wore an expression that perfectly matched the word \"dumbfounded\". Tetra, Conqueror of Golden Veins, was a being of unimaginable wealth and influence. If she so wished, it would not be strange to think she could economically collapse an entire nation. That such a figure was moving was beyond unexpected.","Eris and Marquis Hamilton also wore expressions of utter shock, clearly conveying how far this situation lay outside their expectations...... yet even so, there was one thought shared by Chris, Eris, and Marquis Hamilton alike.","......The cause was absolutely Kaito...... a conviction, bordering on certainty......","<Afterword>","Makina : [Yaa, my children. Have you been well? I thought you might be starting to miss Mother’s words, so today I’d like to give you a bit of a lesson, something about a child I’ve been paying attention to lately, and about the most fundamental of fundamentals: gratitude toward my beloved child. You might think \"Why talk about something so basic now of all times?\", but fundamentals are important after all, and if you neglect them, even your heartfelt gratitude toward my beloved child may fail to reach those around you. So I’d like you to take this opportunity to reaffirm those basics. Now then, about gratitude toward my beloved child, this truly is the most basic of basics. Keeping gratitude toward my beloved child at the center of your heart is the minimum courtesy expected of any living being in this world. Calling it \"common sense\" would almost be too presumptuous, it’s that obvious. And yet, lamentably, there are many lumps of flesh these days who cannot even manage this most basic of basics. That said, I’m not claiming that every lump of flesh in Trinia is hopeless. Those with merits are properly acknowledged, and there are indeed those with promise. In particular, the one I’ve been watching closely lately is Olivia. That child is truly proper. Day after day, she offers prayers of deep gratitude to my beloved child. It may be the most fundamental of fundamentals, but seeing that foundation firmly in place is reassuring. It’s like, \"Yes, this is how it should be, this is how children should be.\" I hold her in high regard, and I remembered her name at once. So this time, while looking back on Olivia’s actions, of which I think highly, let us reaffirm gratitude toward my beloved child. To begin with, what makes Olivia admirable is that she does not focus on trivial details, but gives thanks for the very existence of my beloved child. Not because something was done for her, nor because of any particular benefit, but because she truly understands that my beloved child is precious simply by existing. That is why she can offer gratitude for the mere fact of that existence. The reason she can possess such a mindset is because she has properly established the fundamental practice of always keeping gratitude toward my beloved child in her heart. I think that is truly wonderful. And what impressed me about Olivia most was when she, my child, and my beloved child went on a date together. At that time, Olivia first offered a prayer of gratitude for the fact that my beloved child had accepted the date, and after the main event, she offered another prayer of gratitude for having been granted the date. This is it! Before and after the date, two expressions of gratitude!!! Being able to do this truly shows she is proper. Not just one or the other, but gratitude for the fact that time was set aside for her and the date was accepted for her sake, and then gratitude after actually going on the date...... she truly understands. If it’s a child like that, I wholeheartedly support a romance with my beloved child, and depending on the situation, I might even lend a hand. Next, what impressed me was the sculpture she made for the birthday celebration of my beloved child. I’ll bring up the image for a moment, what you should pay attention to is right here. The face of my beloved child’s sculpture is tilted ever so slightly by five degrees. This is truly magnificent! Those five degrees!!! By giving it that angle, the expression of my beloved child’s kindness and magnanimity is dramatically enhanced, it feels as if a soul has been placed into what would otherwise be a mere sculpture, elevating the work to an entirely new level. If I had been a judge, I would have given it full marks. And not only me, Canalis and Electrone were impressed as well. This five-degree angle is something that can only be expressed with an extraordinary understanding of my beloved child. It is not a realm beginners can reach. The very fact that she can apply such an angle shows that Olivia possesses at least an intermediate-level proficiency in the Beloved Child Examination. What is fascinating is that from such use of angles, one can discern what kind of feelings the creator holds toward my beloved child. Of course, to do so perfectly requires advanced-level observational ability in the Beloved Child Examination, but as a master of my beloved child, a mother can read it with ease. For example, in the films I create, I often choose angles that especially highlight my beloved child’s cuteness. Canalis, on the other hand, tends to favor angles that emphasize my beloved child’s coolness. It is not that one is superior to the other, both are wonderful aspects of my beloved child, merely reflecting subtle differences in personal preference. As for Olivia, judging from the sculpture, it is clear she perceives my beloved child’s kindness and magnanimity...... as a guiding light, a sun-like existence that leads her forward. That perspective is quite novel and intriguing. After all, as a mother, I naturally take the viewpoint of one who guides. Olivia, who stands in the position of being guided by my beloved child, offers a fresh and fascinating perspective, allowing me to see charms of my beloved child that differ from those I myself express, and that is simply marvelous. Of course, it would be a problem if she were merely clinging to the miraculous existence that is my beloved child, but in Olivia’s case, that isn’t so. She earnestly seeks to learn for herself from each and every action of my beloved child, and having gained much insight, she regards my beloved child as a warm sun that guides her forward. Here again, the fundamentals appear. Because she always keeps the foundational principle, gratitude toward my beloved child, at the center of her heart, she does not grow arrogant, but understands her own place and holds an absolute faith in my beloved child. It is truly rare for me to evaluate an existence outside my own world so highly, but when there is a child who is proper, I acknowledge them as such. Olivia is truly dependable and highly regarded, so as a reward, I think I will someday show her the film about my beloved child that I created. Ahhh, come to think of it, after the birthday celebration, Olivia also properly visited the Beloved Child Museum. After finishing her viewing by manipulating time, she stepped outside and offered a prayer in front of the museum. She truly understands! Though she is not my child, she is highly regarded in my eyes. She more than possesses the qualifications to be in a romantic relationship with my beloved child, so I hope she continues going on many dates and deepens her bond. As a mother, I support her, and if the opportunity arises, I will gladly assist. Well then, that is all for today. If this talk has conveyed to my children how important it is to keep gratitude toward my beloved child at the center of their hearts, Mother will be pleased. Until we meet again next time!]","Serious-senpai : [......And this is how she is without even going out of control. Yeah...... she’s seriously nuts......]"]},{"number":2517,"title":"Chapter 2517: The Calm Before the Storm of Stomachaches","paragraphs":["In the study of the Albert Duchy, Lilia, having finished her work for the time being, took a breather while sipping the tea Lunamaria had prepared for her.","[......Phew, being the head of a faction really is a lot of work. Thanks to my growing connections, the work itself has become easier, but the scale of influence each decision carries is so large that I have to be very careful.]","[It truly has become the largest faction among the nobles of the Symphonia Kingdom before anyone even noticed. As expected of Milady, such unprecedented speed in her rise. This humble Lunamaria cannot stop her tears of emotion and her mocking sneers.]","[You’re clearly laughing over there...... Well, most of it is thanks to Kaito-san’s influence though.]","[Speaking of Miyama-sama, it seems he has been running wild in Archlesia Empire lately.]","At present, Lilia held a position that could be called, both in name and reality, the most powerful noble in the Symphonia Kingdom. Naturally, compared to before, the scale of information that reached her was on an entirely different level.","Her connections to other countries had also been steadily increasing, so information about movements within Archlesia Empire arrived at an early stage. Reports concerning the Ritch Barony and matters involving the Sharon County had also reached her...... including, of course, their cause.","[He really hasn’t changed at all. I can imagine the hardships Her Majesty Chris and Lady Eris must be facing, and I sincerely sympathize with them from the bottom of my heart. Still, on the other hand, I feel a little relieved...... Recently, because so many things have been happening in Archlesia Empire, things over here have been quite peaceful, which I’m grateful for.]","[The benefits are tremendous after all. Hamilton Marquisdom, Ritch Barony, and Sharon County have all suddenly leapt into the spotlight, and their power as noble households will surely rise accordingly. Archlesia Empire as a whole is experiencing remarkable economic growth, and with multiple merchant companies in motion, commercial activity is lively and vibrant. Truly wonderful profits...... yes, if only each incident occurred one by one...... Why does that person cause major upheavals in multiple places simultaneously, like coordinated acts of terror? Or perhaps that is precisely what makes Miyama-sama who he is......]","Since it was Archlesia Empire where Kaito had been stirring up various events recently, things on Lilia’s side could be described as relatively calm and peaceful. Seeing Lilia speak as though savoring that peace, Lunamaria gave a wry smile.","In truth, the benefits brought by Kaito were astonishing. Albert Duchy, which until two years ago had even been mocked as a Duchy in name only, had now become the greatest and most powerful noble household in the Symphonia Kingdom, largely due to Kaito’s influence.","[In any case, I’m grateful that gentle days have continued recently.]","[......Is that so? Then, it must be about time......]","[......About time for what?]","[No, it’s just that whenever Milady begins savoring peace like this, Miyama-sama comes to strike at the stomach of the Milady he loves with all his might. I was merely thinking that perhaps a painful blow is due soon......]","[Would you please stop saying such terrifying things!?]","Certainly, Lilia’s recent days have been peaceful...... Well, strictly speaking, various things had happened at Kaito’s birthday party not long ago, but setting that aside, things had been comparatively calm since then.","At the very least, no sudden, stomach-wrenching incidents had occurred for several months, so it would not be wrong to say she was at ease...... or rather, off her guard.","[Milady, it seems there is a certain phrase famous in the otherworld...... \"the calm before the storm\"......]","[......That isn’t the case here, right? There’s nothing...... there shouldn’t be anything, right?]","At the very least, there were no signs of any kind. But if such things could be predicted, she would never have suffered so many bouts of stomachaches up until now.","Around the time Lilia and Lunamaria were having that exchange, in the special space located in the backyard of Kaito’s house, Nebula and Canalis were conversing.","[Ahh, so permission has been granted.]","[∇∮◆£ looked as if she finally did it...... ah, right, over here, she goes by the name Tiana, doesn’t she? In any case, Tiana was delighted. Well, she must have been waiting eagerly for this, so I understand how she feels.]","[I only hope she doesn’t get too excited. That child is generally reliable, but when her tension rises, she occasionally makes mistakes.]","[Yeah, she messes up once in a while. In a way, even that berserk mode of hers is just the result of getting overly excited...... Well, she’s basically just going to meet Kaito-sama, so there shouldn’t be any problems, right?]","[Indeed. However, please make sure she adjusts herself properly to Master’s schedule.]","[Understood. As for the date, I’ll confirm it with Kaito-sama and decide accordingly.]","Unbeknownst to Lilia...... quietly, the visit of the Bipolar God Tiana had been decided. However, that was not all.","At almost the same time, in the Demon Realm, Kuromueina and Alice stood gazing up at a large facility before them.","[It’s finished~~ The amusement park.]","[All that attention to detail really paid off. It turned out quite nicely. Now we just need to hold a grand opening event.]","[Should we invite various people from each realm? For the Human Realm, the rulers...... and Lilia-chan should be fine, right?]","[Yeah, Lilia-san seems like the obvious choice. And we can invite Hina-san, Aoi-san, and the others around Kaito-san too.]","The improvements to the amusement park powered by the mysterious energy Alice had once received from Shallow Vernal were complete. With Kuromueina’s investment and provision of land, an amusement park had been built in a corner of the Demon Realm, and they were discussing its opening event. Naturally, Lilia’s name had come up as a candidate to represent the Human Realm.","And at nearly the same time, God Realm, Sanctuary, Shallow Vernal nodded with a somewhat satisfied expression, with Makina standing beside her.","[......It’s complete.]","[It turned out even better than I expected. It really feels like an onsen town adapted to fit this world, doesn’t it?]","[Yes. This way, after going on a date with Kaito-san, there will be no problem passing it to Lilia.]","[That’s true. Even so, onsen huh...... how nice. I want to go with my beloved child too.]","Here as well, an onsen town they had painstakingly created over time had been completed. And as usual, Shallow Vernal intended to bestow it upon Lilia after using it for her date with Kaito...... Truly, it could be called the calm before the storm...... as a storm of stomachaches was about to descend upon Lilia.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Witness, that is the Ultimate Stomachache Warrior...... Amazing, isn't she? A simultaneous assault from Otherworld, the Demon Realm, and the God Realm...... She really is on a whole different level.]"]},{"number":2518,"title":"Chapter 2518: Bipolar God Tiana 1","paragraphs":["Just as I woke up, brewed coffee with the coffee maker, and was sipping it while wondering what to do today, Canalis-san came to visit.","[Good morning, Kaito-sama. May I have a moment of your time?]","[Good morning, Canalis-san. Yes, that’s fine...... Ah, would you like some coffee too, Canalis-san?]","[Oh my, being hit with such an enormous reward right upon meeting is going to wreak havoc on my emotions. Taha~~ apologies for the emotional instability! Coffee personally prepared by Kaito-sama is far too awe-inspiring, I'm feeling thankful to the MAX...... I will gratefully accept!]","[I’m just pressing a switch on a magic tool, so I don’t know if it really counts as me making it......]","Smiling wryly at Canalis-san, who, as always, spoke with rich emotion despite her expressionless face, I poured coffee into a mug and handed it to her.","[So, what brings you here?]","[It’s not much, just a confirmation of Kaito-sama’s schedule. Taha~~ saying it’s a schedule check to invite Kaito-sama on a date would be rather exaggerated and off the main point though.]","[A date? If it’s about going out with Canalis-san, then as long as I’m free that day, any time is fine......]","[Oh my, Kaito-sama. That is an extremely dangerous statement. I am a simple God, so if you say things like that, I’ll take them seriously, be unable to sleep at night, and transition into daytime naps. Taha~~ the God that I am doesn't actually require sleep though...... Ah, this isn’t related to today’s matter but...... I made a really nice ranch, so would you go with me to eat some soft-serve ice cream?]","[Y- Yes, of course...... It actually sounds quite fun, so I’d like to go.]","She mentioned before that she was improving cattle breeds, but she has reached the level of running a ranch huh...... I’ve never really been to a place like that, so I’m curious and genuinely want to go.","I wonder if the soft-serve is made from the milk of the improved dairy cows? It honestly sounds delicious, and I want to try it.","[......Oh, that won’t do. My thoughts completely sprinted off in that direction. Taha~~I’ll properly invite you about that another time. Now then, to the main topic...... A god I know...... well, frankly speaking, a God related to Nebula-san has obtained permission from Shallow Vernal and would like to come meet Kaito-sama, so I came to confirm your schedule.]","[Ahh, I see...... My schedule is fairly open, so even tomorrow would be fine...... This would be a different God from Electrone-san, right?]","[Yes, the one planning to come is called Bipolar God...... well, in short, an insanely powerful God.]","[I- Insanely powerful?]","[A God that’s a bit dangerously strong. Excluding a very small number of special cases, she's probably the strongest even among the Omnipotent and Omniscient Gods. Ahh, no, her personality is perfectly normal. I’ve been on good terms with her for quite a long time, and even if I make sudden requests, she kindly accepts. She's a kind World Creator, just extraordinarily powerful, that’s all.]","Since Canalis-san herself is an Omnipotent and Omniscient God and says this so clearly, this must be a God on a completely different level of power.","Well, to me, beings who are omnipotent and omniscient already exist on a dimension beyond imagination, so even if I’m told she's among the strongest of them, I can’t really grasp how powerful that is......","[Well, you see...... battles between beings of that level might be something unfamiliar from Kaito-sama’s perspective. If I had to describe it, it’s like rock-paper-scissors where there’s no time limit, no limit on rounds, and you can change your move as many times as you like.]","[......Unn? Wouldn’t that never end?]","[In most cases, it doesn’t. Battles between Omnipotent and Omniscient beings are really just an endless repetition of reactive rock-paper-scissors, and it’s rare for a decisive conclusion to be reached. They keep up that futile back-and-forth until one side gives in and suggests a truce, and then the one who proposed it signs an agreement under slightly unfavorable terms, and that’s the end. Well, it can take tens of billions of years before it gets to that point, so it’s truly a hassle. Taha~~ apologies for having a God’s sense of scale!]","[That’s...... quite a world.]","Now that she mentioned it, if both sides are omnipotent, it really would end up like that, with no way to settle things......","[A World Creator who can end that kind of battle in a short time is clearly strong...... you might even say she's someone who surpasses Omnipotence and Omniscience.]","[Is this Bipolar God-san that kind of being?]","[That’s about right. How should I put it...... with the rock-paper-scissors example from earlier, it’s like her rock pierces paper, her scissors cuts through rock, and her paper snaps scissors in half...... Does that convey how strong she is?]","[I definitely understand that she's unbelievably strong.]","In other words, against this Bipolar God-san, no matter what you throw out reactively, she just smashes straight through it...... She's a rather outrageous being, but since Canalis-san clearly said her personality is normal and kind, she's probably just incredibly powerful yet a good person.","If that’s the case, then there’s nothing to worry about, I’m looking forward to meeting her.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [So she has arrived...... the irrational Berserk Gorilla......]"]},{"number":2519,"title":"Chapter 2519: Bipolar God Tiana 2","paragraphs":["After discussing my schedule with Canalis-san, we settled on meeting Bipolar God-san in three days. She’s basically just coming to see me, but I should still inform Lilia-san.","She might want to greet her like Electrone-san did, and even if not, an outrageous existence like a World Creator showing up is bound to cause trouble later if I don’t give her advance notice.","Right now though, it seems Lilia-san is out, so I decided I’d tell her at dinner. Just as I was thinking that, Kuro suddenly appeared in my room.","[Kaito-kun! I’m here~~]","[Welcome...... it’s rare for you to come at this hour.]","[Unn. I came to talk to you, or rather...... to invite you.]","[Invite me? I don’t have any plans today, so that’s fine......]","It was unusual for Kuro, who usually comes to hang out at night, to visit at this time, but it seemed she hadn’t come just to play, she had come to invite me to something.","[Ah, no, not today. Errr, where should I start...... You remember when we made sukiyaki and then went to the amusement park together, right?]","[Yeah, the one Alice got from Shiro-san.]","[Right, right. I think Shalltear mentioned it in passing back then, but that amusement park was going to be improved and opened in the Demon Realm...... Well, it was just completed recently. We’re planning an opening event, well, more like inviting guests to actually go around and enjoy it, and we’d like to invite you, Lilia-chan, and everyone else.]","[Ahh, I see. That sounds fun. When are you planning it?]","[This time it’s not really a formal ceremony or anything. The rulers of each country will be invited too, but attendance isn’t mandatory, it’ll be more like free participation. We’ll open it for a full day so people can come whenever they like and try everything out...... So we’re thinking about ten days from now. Does that work for your schedule, Kaito?]","[Yeah, that’s fine. As for upcoming plans, the only thing is that Bipolar God-san is coming to see me in three days, but I’m not sure about Lilia-san’s schedule.]","If I could go to the amusement park with Lilia-san, Aoi-chan, and Hina-chan, it would be really fun. As far as I’m concerned, there’s no problem with the timing.","But unlike me, Lilia-san has all sorts of noble obligations, so I can’t say whether she’ll be free.","[I’ll give Lilia-chan the invitation tomorrow and explain everything.]","[Got it. Then...... Unn?]","[......Unn? Shiro? Why did you suddenly appear?]","Just as my conversation with Kuro was about to wrap up, a light suddenly appeared in the room, and Shiro-san emerged.","[No, I had business with Kaito-san, but it just so happened that Kuro was with him, and since my matter is similar to Kuro’s, I thought I would settle our promises together.]","[U- Unn? Shiro, are you inviting Kaito-kun somewhere too?]","[Yes. More precisely, it is something we promised long ago. It was partially fulfilled in the Hydra Kingdom, but that was separate from what we promised.]","[......The promise, partially fulfilled in the Hydra Kingdom...... Ah, the onsen trip?]","Hearing Shiro-san’s words, what came to mind was the onsen trip. We really had talked about it before, and there had been a promise.","[Yes. And after thorough preparation, the onsen town has finally been completed, so I came to invite Kaito-san. Of course, if that were my only business, I could have simply summoned Kaito-san to the God Realm and told him there, but since it also concerns Kuro......]","[Unn? Me too?]","[Yes. I have created a splendid onsen town, and I intend to have a lovey-dovey onsen date there with Kaito-san...... You’re jealous, aren’t you? You are jealous, right?]","[......Eh? Ah, u- unn. That’s right. I’m so jealous~~]","With the word Doya! practically floating behind her, Shiro-san declared this proudly, and Kuro responded that she was jealous, reading the mood a bit. That was undoubtedly the answer Shiro-san was looking for, and it felt like anything else would have led to an endless loop.","[Indeed. It is only natural that Kuro would be envious. I truly created a marvelous onsen town...... That said, I did not come merely to boast. As a special exception, I intend to permit the use of the onsen town for Kaito-san’s lovers as well, even allowing the use of the Super WIN System. Naturally though, I will be first......]","[A- Ahh, I see. So it means me and the other lovers can go on onsen dates with Kaito-kun too. Hehh, that sounds fun, nice! Isis loves onsens too, so she’ll definitely be happy!]","I see, onsen trip with my lovers...... not just with Shiro-san, but with everyone...... That really does sound quite nice. One way or another, an onsen trip sounds like it would be a lot of fun.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......Hold on a second. Isn’t this the kind of situation where not only Lilia’s stomach, but I also get beaten senseless with sweetness?]"]},{"number":2520,"title":"Chapter 2520: Bipolar God Tiana 3","paragraphs":["<Author's Notes>","I got home late because I worked overtime.","Just as she had told Kaito, the next day Kuromueina brought an invitation and spoke to Lilia about the amusement park that would be opening in the Demon Realm.","[......So, that’s the situation. I’d like to invite Kaito-kun and Lilia-chan. Well, even though I say invite, it’s not a ceremony or anything, I’m not asking you to do something special. I just want you to enjoy the amusement park like normal. Sorry for the sudden notice.]","[I understand. It is a generous offer, so I would be delighted to attend.]","Nine days from now was certainly rather sudden, but since this was simply an invitation to visit the amusement park rather than to attend as honored guests, there would be no issue even if their schedules did not permit it.","Fortunately, Lilia happened to be free, and there was no problem with going to the amusement park. Accepting the invitation, she conveyed her intention to attend.","[There are many attractions that are rare in this world, so I hope you enjoy them...... Ah, but aside from that, I have a personal favor to ask of you, Lilia-chan. Would that be alright?]","[A favor?]","[Unn. If you don’t mind, I’d like to use the fact that you visited the amusement park for promotional purposes. You’re quite well-known in the Demon Realm after all.]","[Eh? Yes, that would be no problem at all...... I myself make use of my interactions with the Six Kings in social settings, even if only indirectly......]","In response to Kuromueina’s request to use news of Lilia’s visit as publicity, Lilia readily agreed.","After all, thanks to her connections with prominent figures of the Demon Realm and the God Realm, which includes Kuromueina, Lilia often held an advantageous position in social circles. In a sense, she could be said to be benefiting from Kuromueina’s renown, so there was no reason to refuse if Kuromueina wished to make use of her name.","[Thank you! Well then, that’s settled, have fun together with Kaito-kun and the others.]","After thanking her with a smile, Kuromueina gave a light wave and departed using teleportation magic. Watching her leave, Lilia fell briefly silent...... then spoke to Lunamaria, who stood nearby.","[......Luna, am I really that famous in the Demon Realm? I never had that impression......]","[H- Hmm, I wonder? Since Underworld King-sama wishes to use you for promotion, she must believe there will be a clear effect...... Fumu, Milady’s standing...... fumu...... the circumstances up to now...... Ah, errr...... Milady, you might actually be more remarkable than you imagine.]","[......Eh?]","Lunamaria had been standing with her arms crossed, thinking over Lilia’s question, but once she reached a conclusion, she wore an oddly sympathetic expression.","[......Well, now that I think about it again, this may have been a blind spot. Milady was originally a princess with a well-known epithet, so your fame in the Human Realm was already high, which made the change hard to notice there. But when I really consider it, there’s a strong possibility that Milady’s level of recognition in the Demon Realm has become something extraordinary.]","[......................Eh?]","[In our perception, the truly extraordinary person is, of course, Miyama-sama. The majority of Milady’s remarkable connections stem from Miyama-sama...... However, regarding Miyama-sama, Alice-sama supports him with such dedication that, while his name is known among the nobility in the Human Realm, he is hardly known among ordinary people, correct?]","[Y- Yes, that’s right.]","[And that is likely the same in the Demon Realm...... Of course, those who serve the Six Kings would know of him, but as for ordinary citizens who do not belong to such groups, they probably know almost nothing of Miyama-sama, just as in the Human Realm.]","[......S- So, in other words?]","Hearing Lunamaria’s words, Lilia seemed to grasp their meaning, and with a pale expression on her face, she asked for confirmation.","[......From the perspective of ordinary citizens in the Demon Realm, Milady is a Human who is on friendly terms with the Six Kings and the Supreme Gods and is highly regarded by them. Furthermore, in a realm where meritocracy is strongly emphasized, you had reached, in just over 20 years, the domain of a Count-rank Demon, a level befitting a genius...... Though it is only a prediction, Milady’s fame in the Demon Realm may well be...... comparable to that of the Six Kings or the Supreme Gods in the Human Realm.]","[Hyiih......]","[Thinking back, there were hints suggesting this. At the Harmonic Symphony, the Fairies were crowding around Milady...... Perhaps, in the Demon Realm, the most famous and popular Human is Milady.]","[......M- My stomach hurts.]","Realizing that she had unknowingly become an astonishingly famous figure in the Demon Realm, Lilia clutched her stomach and muttered. As if on cue, there was a knock at the door. When they invited the visitor in, Kaito entered.","[Excuse me. Lilia-san, I wanted to speak with you about something...... Eh? Y- You don’t look well.]","[Milady is suffering from the usual stomachache.]","[......E- Errr...... Did I do something again?]","[H- Hmm...... If we trace things back, Kaito-san could be called the root cause, but if we start saying that, there would truly be no end to it, so you can't really say this is your fault. I’ve merely been reminded of a surprising fact...... Now then, Kaito-san, didn’t you have some business?]","Fearing he might once again have unknowingly caused Lilia distress, Kaito looked apologetic, but Lilia, with a wry smile, gently assured him it was not his fault.","Relieved, Kaito then explained why he had come.","[......Errr, the World Creator Bipolar Deity will apparently be visiting the day after tomorrow, so I thought I should inform Lilia-san in advance......]","[......I retract my previous statement. My stomach hurts because of Kaito-san after all.]","Upon hearing Kaito’s words, Lilia gazed into the distance and, as if accustomed to this, took out her stomach medicine.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Indeed, for ordinary citizens of the Demon Realm, it wouldn’t be strange at all for Lilia to be an incredibly famous figure...... Even accounting for the difference between Demons and Humans, her speed in reaching the level of a Count-rank is overwhelmingly the fastest in history......]"]},{"number":2521,"title":"Chapter 2521: Bipolar God Tiana 4","paragraphs":["At the very moment she was nursing a stomachache from being invited by Kuromueina and forced to once more recognize her own standing in the Demon Realm, Kaito delivered a beautifully timed follow-up blow. As a result, Lilia ended up taking her stomach medicine yet again, but comparatively speaking, she could still be considered fairly composed.","Yes, her stomach hurt. But by now, she had known Kaito for a long time. She had experienced more than enough, firsthand, just how harsh on the stomach Kaito could be.","[......I see. I had heard that something like this would happen eventually in connection with Canalis-san and Electrone-sama, but it has finally arrived huh.]","Incidentally, the reason she didn’t attach \"-sama\" to Canalis’ name was because Canalis had insisted that she was something like Kaito’s subordinate, and if Kaito was calling her with \"-san\", then she wanted to be addressed the same way, or even without honorifics.","[Yes, though I’ll be the one giving the greeting. As for Lilia-san...... errr......]","[Kaito-san? Why are you looking at me with such a detached gaze? This seems like a moment where you could firmly declare that I have nothing to do with it, you know?]","[Milady, please give up. Reflect on your past...... After everything you’ve experienced, can you truly puff out your chest and say that you’ll have nothing to do with this meeting, and that you won’t end up meeting that Otherworld God?]","[.................]","Yes, Bipolar God was originally coming to meet Kaito, not Lilia. Under normal circumstances, it would be entirely possible for the discussion to conclude and Bipolar God to leave without Lilia ever meeting them face-to-face.","And yet, neither Kaito, who had brought the matter up, nor Lunamaria standing quietly beside them...... nor even Lilia herself, could envision a future where Lilia would somehow avoid being dragged into it.","[......I know that...... I know it’s probably impossible...... But isn’t it fine to at least...... dream a little?]","[Unfortunately, that’s just escapism, Milady...... Let us resign ourselves and accept the truth. You are a being that possesses a special power that attracts every conceivable form of stomachache.]","[I refuse to accept that!]","Watching the indescribable exchange between Lilia and Lunamaria, Kaito awkwardly averted his gaze. He seemed fully aware that he was the primary cause of most of this, and was quietly praying that the blame wouldn’t shift in his direction.","On top of that, he still had something else he needed to bring up, and he was hesitating over how to broach the subject.","[......Well, let’s just pray this ends as peacefully as possible. By the way, Kaito-san, is there anything else you needed to discuss?]","[Ah, errr, this is also pretty soon, nine days from now, but Kuro wants to invite us to an amusement park......]","[Ahhh, I read about that just a moment ago. My schedule is clear, and if Aoi-san and Hina-san are available as well, then let’s all go together.]","[Got it. And also, Shiro-san......]","[Eh? T- There’s more? And this time, it’s Shallow Vernal-sama!?]","Just as she was about to breathe a sigh of relief, the name Shallow Vernal came up, and Lilia’s face visibly turned pale.","[Ah, errr, this one’s similar to Kuro’s invitation. Shiro-san built an onsen town, and we’re going to go out together. After I go with Shiro-san, she suggested that I go again with my other lovers.]","[A- Ahh, I see...... so that’s what this is about. That’s a relief...... In a sense, then, it takes the form of an invitation from Shallow Vernal-sama.]","[Yeah. And Kuro was there at the time too. She said that if I went with each of my lovers one by one, it’d be exhausting for me, so maybe we could split into a few small groups instead...... The plan Kuro suggested was something like...... Kuro with Dr. Vier and Isis-san, Alice with Fate-san, and Lilia-san with Sieg-san, Anima, and Illness-san......]","The grouping had been arranged so that, as much as possible, the members within each group wouldn’t have to be overly mindful of one another. Kuro was paired with her family, Vier and Isis, while Alice and Fate, who were simply close friends, were grouped together. The remaining members were consolidated so that Lilia and Sieg wouldn’t have to be overly conscious around one of the Six Kings or a Supreme God.","[Certainly, that arrangement would put me more at ease as well. I assume we’ll confirm everyone’s schedules first, but roughly when are you expecting this to take place?]","[I'm scheduled to go with Shiro-san 13 days from now, so probably right after that? I’m not sure what Shiro-san plans to do with the onsen town she created, but even if she intends to move it somewhere, I think that would be difficult to do before we actually go......]","[......Do you not know the concept of spacing things out? Ah, no, it’s not as if Kaito-san is the one deciding every date himself...... Even so, that’s quite a concentration of events.]","[Well, yeah, that’s true...... How about your schedule, Lilia-san?]","[As it happens, whether I should call it fortunate or not, my calendar is unusually open this month. Even with that schedule, there would be no problem at all.]","By some strange coincidence, Lilia truly had very little planned this month, enough that she could easily adjust to the schedule Kaito had just outlined.","And so, comparatively speaking, she felt at ease...... Yes, only because she did not yet know that, later on, that very onsen town would be bestowed upon her. For now, she could still afford to relax......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [If even she herself thinks there’s no way she can avoid the stomachache...... then yeah, it’s impossible.]"]},{"number":2522,"title":"Chapter 2522: Bipolar God Tiana 5","paragraphs":["Within a certain space stood two figures: the Bipolar God ∇∮◆£ and Vicissitude God Canalis. Facing ∇∮◆£, Canalis spoke in a voice brimming with cheer, despite her expressionless face.","[Well~~ just like that, Kaito-sama just grabs hold of my heart and refuses to let go! The way he casually says things like that? Seriously cool, right? And honestly...... tahaa~~ to think I’d get a reply that was practically a \"date OK\", does that mean I’m actually pretty well-liked by Kaito-sama......? No, no, I know I shouldn’t get carried away, but still, I feel like he trusts me at least a fair bit!]","[I- I suppose so. Maybe he really does rely on you, Canalis? In that sense, I’d say you’re definitely well-liked...... unn. That’s nice and all, but...... errr, you came to tell me the schedule, right?]","[That's right. And the place brought up for that time was the ranch I built. Isn’t it wonderful? A peaceful ranch, standing side by side with Kaito-sama while eating soft-serve ice cream, it’s the absolute peak of emotional bliss. Tahaa~~ just imagining it makes me want to grin. Well, my facial muscles are still as unresponsive as ever...... but my heart is super happy.]","[......I- I’m happy for you. Arehh? That’s strange. Are we not communicating properly? You came to tell me the date I’m going to Trinia, didn’t you? Not to boast about your love life, right?]","[Yes, that’s correct. However, speaking of Kaito-sama, aside from his coolness, his humorous side is also quite charming......]","Listening with a wry smile to Canalis, who sounded thoroughly delighted despite her blank expression, ∇∮◆£ finally realized that the conversation showed no signs of shifting to the main topic. Slightly roundabout though it was, she attempted to convey \"Let’s move on to the main topic\"...... Yet although Canalis would respond, she continued at full throttle talking about Kaito...... no, more accurately, what was practically lovestruck gushing.","[...C- Canalis? You’re not trying to make me angry, are you? I understand that you’re having a wonderful time with Kaito-sama, so maybe we could get to the main topic now, hm?]","[Ah, yes, of course. Now then, to continue about Kaito-sama......]","[Can I punch you now? I can punch you now and it’d be justified, right!? Canalis, before I clench my fist, could you please talk about the schedule?]","[Unn? Ah, ∇∮◆£'s visit to Trinia will be in two days’ time according to Trinia’s calendar. I look forward to it.]","[Unn. Got it. And since it’ll be my first time meeting Kaito-sama, is there anything I should be careful about? Or perhaps something I ought to bring as a gift?]","[Speaking of Kaito-sama, when he came to the space I created the other day......]","[...................]","Even after conveying the necessary information, Canalis immediately returned to her lovestruck chatter, and a sharp vein throbbed at ∇∮◆£'s temple. Still, ∇∮◆£ was fundamentally gentle by nature. Understanding the excitement bubbling within Canalis, she swallowed her irritation and somehow managed to form a smile upon her face.","[......Unn. I get that you want to talk a lot about Kaito-sama and Nebula-san. When something wonderful happens, you just want to tell someone you know, right? I understand that feeling, and I’ll listen to your stories...... but first, let’s finish talking about my visit to Trinia, okay?]","[Unn? If it’s ∇∮◆£, I think you won't have any problem. You and Kaito-sama are probably compatible personality-wise, and if you just act normally, I’m sure he’ll like you.]","[That’s reassuring. I know he’s a kind person, but he’s Nebula-san’s great benefactor, and since I’ll finally be meeting him, I can’t help feeling nervous. If possible, I’d appreciate some advice, like topics to bring up when talking with Kaito-sama.]","[Leave it to me! Speaking of Kaito-sama, the other day when we were thinking up a new project for Nifty together, his serious side profile was just overwhelmingly heart-throbbing.]","[......Hey, you're completely drifting into lovestruck bragging again, aren't you? I meant advice for when I’m talking with him......]","[Tahaa~ I was totally captivated, but you can’t blame me, he was that awe-inspiring. After that, I served some tea, and Kaito-sama thanked me with an unbelievably dazzling smile......]","[....................]","[......And then, would you believe it, Nebula-san joined us. It naturally turned into the three of us having tea together, and it was basically my own personal happiness space unfolding before me. Kaito-sama sitting across from me, Nebula-san on my lap, truly a flawless formation. My sight, my hearing, my sense of touch, all filled to the brim with bliss. I actually struggled to steady my racing heart. And then Nebula-san......]","[.........................................]","[......And so, saying the three of us were practically lovey-dovey might be a bit of an exaggeration, but that’s honestly how it felt to me. Tahaa~~ their fan service was just incredible. I was this close to completely melting......]","[.........................................................Hmph!]","[———-Guh!?]","With a twitch of her cheek, ∇∮◆£ finally snapped, and slammed a \"Multidimensional Quantum Universe-Piercing Punch\" straight into the endlessly rambling Canalis' face.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [You can pretty easily imagine she’s been punched like that plenty of times before, given how that exchange just went......]"]},{"number":2523,"title":"Chapter 2523: Bipolar God-san Tiana 6","paragraphs":["On a clear, sunny day, it was the day that Bipolar God-san would be coming from another world. The location was the terrace in the backyard of my house, near the otherworldly space created by Canalis-san.","Incidentally, the location was chosen based on the request of Bipolar God-san, which I had heard from Canalis-san, whose face somehow had a large circular hole for some reason, and since they preferred being outdoors if possible, I picked the terrace seats.","As I thought the appointed time was approaching, the air suddenly felt different. If I had to describe it, it was like suddenly stepping into water, though there was no real difficulty moving or any sense of pressure.","If I had to put it another way, it felt as if the air suddenly gained mass or its density increased, but it didn’t affect me at all.","Immediately after, a light appeared in my line of sight, and a figure who seemed to be Bipolar God materialized.","She wore a slightly unique outfit that seemed like a combination of a one-piece dress and pants...... somewhat resembling an áo dài, but slightly different, with an elegant, ethnically inspired design that was both beautiful and practical. Her long, pale pink hair was tied into multiple small bundles, each tipped with what sounded like tiny bells, producing a delicate, tinkling sound.","Bipolar God-san lightly opened and closed her hands, moving slightly as if checking her body, then turned to look at me. Her translucent jade-colored eyes met mine, and she let out a wry smile. Just then, the strange atmosphere I had felt moments ago returned to normal.","(T/N: ao dai)","[......Ahaha, sorry about that. If I get the size adjustment wrong, this space would be crushed by the pressure of my very existence, so I added a little protection beforehand. Didn’t mean to startle you.]","Seeing her smile like that, I somehow understood what Canalis-san had said. It was hard to describe, something about her expression or aura made it so that...... at first glance, you could immediately think \"Ah, this person is kind\". Her very presence, her expression, the atmosphere she exuded, it was already gentle.","Her aura might be similar to someone like Lilia-san or Kaori-san. In any case, she really seemed like a genuinely kind person.","[Let me properly introduce myself...... you’ve probably heard from Canalis, but I’m the World Creator called the Bipolar God. I’d be happy if you call me Tiana. I’ve always wanted to meet you...... and I’m really glad we finally can.]","[Nice to meet you. Errr, as you probably know, I’m Miyama Kaito. Pleased to meet you.]","[Pleased to meet you too...... May I shake your hand?]","[Ah, yes.]","After our introductions, Tiana-san happily took my hand for a handshake. Yes, she really gives off that \"genuinely good person\" vibe, and she seemed very approachable.","[I’ve known about you through omniscience and such, but meeting Kaito-sama in person, I can really feel how kind you are, it makes me happy.]","[Ah, errr, you don’t have to call me \"-sama\" or anything like that, okay?]","[Really? Then maybe I’ll call you Kaito-kun. And you can just call me whatever feels natural.]","[Then I’ll call you Tiana-san. Please, have a seat here if you like.]","[Thank you. I’ll take you up on that......]","When I gestured to the terrace seats, Tiana-san gave a gentle smile and sat down, and after saying a quick word, I took the seat across from her.","[Errr, would tea be all right for your drink?]","Since I was dealing with an Otherworld God here, I wasn’t sure if I could ask Illness-san to serve her, so I had tea, coffee, and such prepared in advance and placed them in my Magic Box.","Upon hearing my words, Tiana-san smiled warmly and spoke.","[That’s thoughtful of you, but if it’s all right, could I prepare it myself?]","[Eh?]","[It’s something I picked up from she who I respect. They said that a being with great power has the luxury to spare, so it should be the side with that power that takes care of details in situations like this. I really appreciate that Kaito-kun wants to host me. But if possible, I’d rather you not worry about me too much and just be natural...... I know that sounds a bit presumptuous, but I do have my own objectives. If you’re willing, I’d like to treat you to a drink from my world. Actually, I got permission in Shallow Vernal to bring it here, because I wanted you to try it.]","[A drink from Tiana-san’s world? That sounds fascinating...... and if Tiana-san is alright with that, I’d love to have some.]","It seemed she had brought a sort of souvenir, drinks from her world, and I was about to be served them.","I'm not sure if I should say it's as I thought or not...... She’s incredibly easy to talk to, or rather, she deliberately gives off this playful vibe...... pretending to be considerate while really wanting to serve the drink she brought herself, so that I wouldn’t feel awkward and could comfortably accept her offer. She really feels like a kind person, and I feel like with her, I’d be able to talk freely without worry.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [With Kaito saying she’s got an atmosphere similar to Lilia or Kaori, then his initial favorability toward her is probably pretty high...... Could this actually lead the same way as Electrone's, where she’ll be able to come here regularly from now on?]"]},{"number":2524,"title":"Chapter 2524: Bipolar God Tiana 7","paragraphs":["Tiana-san said she would prepare our drinks. When she stood up from her seat and lightly moved her hand, a somewhat oddly-shaped tool and a teacup appeared...... and along with them, a huge bouquet that looked to be over a meter tall.","[......Flowers?]","[Unn. Comparing it to this world, its taste would probably be close to black tea? It’d be good if you think of it like tea brewed from flowers instead of leaves.]","As she said that, Tiana-san held a mysterious tool, something like several transparent tubes combined together, over the bouquet. The massive bouquet was drawn into the transparent tubes as if it were being sucked in.","The tubes didn’t look anywhere near large enough to contain such a huge bouquet, but as the bouquet was absorbed, it was compressed into a small sphere and floated inside the transparent tube. She then attached that tube to a device like an extractor and tilted it, and a pale pink liquid was poured into the cup.","S- Somehow it feels very sci-fi, or rather it really gives off the atmosphere of an unknown drink. It’s not being extracted with hot water or anything like that; it feels more like the bouquet itself is being compressed and turned into a drink.","[Here you go.]","[Thank you very much. The aroma...... it does feel kind of like black tea...... It doesn’t smell much like flowers.]","[Ahh, with the technological systems of this world and the world Kaito-kun was born in, I think this is probably unfamiliar to you. If I were to say it in the language of this world, what I had earlier was something like an atomic conversion device. It changes properties through atomic conversion. To explain it roughly and simply, it’s like remaking the structure of the bouquet itself. Hearing that, it might seem like it wouldn’t change no matter what the original object was, but by incorporating special quantum laws and spacetime chemistry into it, it changes it into something else while leaving some of the properties of the original object.]","[I- I see......?]","[Fufu, well, it’s hard to understand, right? It’s fine if you just recognize it as using a mysterious power to remake flowers into tea.]","It seems that this tea was made with technology that’s completely different from the chemistry I know...... and technology that’s quite advanced at that. Even if the principles were explained in detail, I probably wouldn’t understand at all...... so just as Tiana-san said, it seems better to accept that the tea is being made with a mysterious power.","For now, thinking I’d try drinking it, I picked up the cup and looked at the tea inside. There was no sign of steam rising from it, and there was almost no smell either. The color looked like rosé wine, so just from the appearance it was hard to tell much.","When I took a sip, it was about body temperature, or rather just the right temperature, and when it entered my mouth a refreshing fragrance spread all at once. Even though there had hardly been any smell when I sniffed it while it was in the cup, the fragrance spread through my mouth so strongly that it made me wonder where it had been hiding, and it felt like it passed through my nose.","It had a slight sweetness and acidity, with a refreshing taste...... and the flavor really did feel close to black tea. If I had to compare it to something, it would be like fruit tea.","[It has a fruit tea-like taste, and it’s delicious. The way the fragrance spreads when it enters the mouth is amazing, or rather, it’s a kind of refreshingness I’ve never experienced before.]","[Since the compressed fragrance spreads all at once, it’s interesting, right? I chose something with a flavor that Kaito-kun would be relatively familiar with, so I’m glad if you liked it.]","[It really is delicious, and it feels very fresh and enjoyable.]","[If you’re happy, that makes me happy too. If you’d like, please have some sweets as well.]","[Thank you very mu——- ......sweets?]","Tiana-san held out a plate toward me. On it were multicolored spheres...... honestly, they looked like nothing more than marbles or super balls. But sweets...... candy? No, maybe jelly?","[Errr, if we’re talking about something close in taste in this world...... ahh, they're cookies.]","[Eh? C- Cookies!?]","Surprised by the unexpected word cookies, I picked one up and put it in my mouth. Judging from its glossy appearance and how it felt to the touch, it was completely like glass, but for now I believed the word cookie and carefully bit down with my teeth...... With a crisp crunch, a taste just like a cookie really spread through my mouth.","O- Ohh, amazing. The impression from its appearance and the texture and taste don’t match at all. When I held it in my hand, it clearly felt hard, yet being able to bite through it so crisply was strange. It feels like my brain might bug out. I have no idea why that appearance and texture would result in this kind of bite and flavor.","[H- How should I put it...... this is amazing. When I touched it with my hand, it felt like a glass marble or something like that, but when I bite into it, it crunches easily...... it feels mysterious.]","[This is an ingredient whose hardness changes depending on the conditions. So when you hold it in your hand, it’s hard, but when you put it in your mouth and bite it, it becomes soft.]","[It feels like I’m having a mysterious experience, a rather fresh one. Ah, and the taste really is like that of a cookie, so it’s delicious. The image from the appearance and the taste are completely different though, so it’s confusing......]","[It feels like another world, doesn’t it? The ingredients in my world include many things that are unknown to Kaito-kun, and among them there are even some that beings in worlds like this one can’t taste at all with their sense of taste. Of course, I chose these while properly considering things like flavor and safety, so don’t worry.]","Certainly, if the worlds are different, it wouldn’t be strange for there to be ingredients that my common sense can’t even imagine, and being able to experience things like this is simply fun.","Also, it’s probably because Tiana-san has a gentle atmosphere and is easy to talk to. She’s bringing out things suited to my sense of taste, and since she’s omniscient, she probably chose things beforehand that would be fine for me to eat, so in that sense as well, I could enjoy these unknown foods with peace of mind.","<Afterword>","Under King : [U- Umm, about that, could you go into a bit more detail about that part......?]","Serious-senpai : [Get back in there, Baby Castella Devil...... don’t come out just because you sensed a new possibility.]"]},{"number":2525,"title":"Chapter 2525: Bipolar God Tiana 8","paragraphs":["After that, Tiana-san continued bringing out several strange ingredients I wasn’t familiar with and let me try them. It really felt like I was experiencing otherworld culture, everything was fresh and incredibly enjoyable.","[Hmm, things from other worlds really are fresh and interesting. When I first came to Trinia, I was pretty confused by a lot of things, but this reminds me of that same feeling, like everything was new.]","Thanks in part to the past Hero Actors, Trinia already had a foundation that made it easier for otherworlders to adapt, so I was able to settle in fairly naturally. Even so, I still remember being surprised by things like magic. And when it came to food ingredients, I was definitely shocked, like the worm meat I tried on a date with Kuro, or that edible flower that can bite you.","[The ability to experience that kind of freshness might actually be a point where someone like Kaito-kun clearly surpasses people like us World Creators. At least for me, when you possess the power of omniscience, it’s hard to come across that kind of fresh surprise...... In that sense, maybe having greater power doesn’t necessarily mean you’re better.]","[I see, that way of thinking is really wonderful. I can understand why Canalis-san said you’re such a kind and good person, Tiana-san.]","[Thank you. But if I seem like a kind and good person to you, I think it’s not just because of me, it’s also because you’re a kind and good kid, Kaito-kun. After all, when someone treats you kindly, it makes you want to be kind in return, right?]","[That might be true.]","From what we’d talked about so far, my impression was that Tiana-san truly was an incredibly kind and good person. Her whole atmosphere was gentle and calm, and while she accepted my praise honestly, she would also praise me in return. Even though she possessed the outrageous power of omniscience and omnipotence, she didn’t act arrogant or flaunt her strength at all.","Canalis-san and Electrone-san were also wonderful people, but Canalis-san was always expressionless, while Electrone-san had something like a switch in her mood and could be a bit quirky. Compared to them, among the World Creators of other worlds I know, Tiana-san felt the most straightforward and easiest to talk to.","In fact, if it were Tiana-san, I felt like even if I introduced her to Lilia-san, the two of them would probably get along just fine without Lilia-san ending up with a stomachache.","[......But after seeing some of the items you showed me, it feels like the civilization in your world is much more advanced than the one I used to live in.]","[Yeah. Since the ecosystem and the structure of the world are different, it’s not something that can be compared one-to-one but...... from Kaito-kun's perspective, it might feel like a science-fiction kind of world. Well, at least the world I created is.]","[Oh right, now that you mention it, you’re also managing the world Canalis-san created, right? Isn’t it tough managing two worlds?]","I knew from Canalis-san that Tiana-san had been entrusted with managing the world she created.","Managing two worlds already sounded like a lot of work to me, so I asked about it. Tiana-san gave a wry smile and scratched her cheek, and as she moved, I heard a faint jingling sound like a bell.","[Ah, well, actually, it’s not just two. At the moment, I’m managing about 4,853 worlds.]","[......Eh? Errr, you mean not planets or universes, but entire worlds themselves......?]","[Unn. I only created one world myself though. Canalis had special circumstances, but besides that...... how should I put it? It’s not exactly something to brag about, but sometimes, World Creators get bored of managing their worlds and ask me to take over. Other times, the World Creator disappears for various reasons, leaving their world behind, or they simply abandon it. As I took those worlds in, the number gradually grew.]","Tiana-san said this with a wry smile, but the idea of managing nearly 5000 worlds alone was completely unbelievable, on a scale I couldn’t even begin to imagine.","[There are cases where a World Creator disappears because they lost a battle with another World Creator, or simply because their power wasn’t very strong and they had a lifespan. Those situations can’t really be helped...... but when they abandon a world out of boredom or just cast it aside, the creator might not care, but the people living in that world are pitiful, so I try to take those worlds in whenever I can.]","[That’s...... well...... isn’t that really difficult?]","[Hmmm, not really. I’m not managing them in such a detailed way, so it hardly takes any effort. Each world already has its own ecosystem and way of life after all, and I rarely interfere with them. But that doesn’t mean it’s fine to just leave them alone either. Worlds are actually pretty complex. Sometimes the flow of energy gets distorted and holes can open up in the dimensional walls. So I just deal with problems like that...... things the inhabitants of those worlds wouldn’t be able to handle on their own.]","Tiana-san didn’t seem burdened at all while saying this. For her, managing multiple worlds apparently was something she could do almost as a side task.","Come to think of it, Canalis-san had also done things like having her main body exist in multiple places at the same time. For someone like Tiana-san, the number of worlds probably wasn’t much of a problem.","Still, even though she spoke of it as if it were the most natural thing in the world, the way she casually extended a helping hand to worlds that had been abandoned by their creators, even though she hadn’t created them herself, made it clear that her kindness came from the heart. How should I say this...... It was a story on a truly massive scale, but somehow, it left me with a warm feeling in my chest.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [I see. So aside from being ridiculously strong, she doesn’t have any quirks in her appearance or the way she talks...... And it’s not like she’d go into some jealousy-crazed berserk gorilla mode toward Kaito himself either. From Kaito’s perspective, she’s incredibly easy to get along with...... Just like Canalis and the others said, her getting permission to visit would certainly be a breeze.]"]},{"number":2526,"title":"Chapter 2526: Bipolar God Tiana 9","paragraphs":["Around the time Kaito and Tiana were enjoying tea together, in the subspace located in the backyard of Kaito’s house, there were two figures present, Canalis and another World Creator...... Electrone.","Electrone, who had received permission from Shallow Vernal to freely visit Trinia, learned that Tiana would be meeting Kaito this time. So she was peeking in...... or rather, observing the situation from the space created by Kanaris in order to use it as a reference.","『Should I say, as to be expected of Kaito-sama. Even Bipolar God appears to be having a great deal of fun. Outputting envy...... <Having tea with Kaito-sama is so enviable. Sitting across the same table as your oshi and drinking tea together must be overwhelmingly precious, like a happiness big bang. I want to try it too~~> ......Although this unit does not normally partake in eating or drinking, it would be possible if I wished to.』","[Well, I understand the feeling. I also have tea with Kaito-sama from time to time, and the happiness level is off the charts. Still, is it really okay for us to be peeking like this? Last time, my face ended up looking like a donut......]","『That is but the natural consequence of Vicissitude God boasting too much. Next, outputting opinion...... <Just peeking probably won’t make ∇∮◆£ angry. She’s usually super kind. Though she might get mad if we try to interfere? Fumu......> ......A flash of inspiration has struck this unit.』","[......I think I’ll step back a little.]","Seeing Electrone’s expression suddenly change to one that looked like she had just thought up a prank, Canalis quietly put some distance between them. Perhaps because she normally suppresses her emotions, when Electrone does express them she tends to become slightly high-spirited. With people she’s particularly close to, she sometimes even plays pranks.","And Tiana unquestionably counts as one of those especially close companions.","Electrone smoothly raised a finger as if about to do something...... and in the next instant, the upper half of her body was blown away, only to regenerate a few seconds later.","『......I could not perceive the action. Outputting shock...... <Before I could even do anything, she struck first at a speed not just Kaito-sama but even we couldn’t see. That gorilla is ridiculous. Honestly, when she goes into berserk mode out of jealousy, it seems she was still holding back back then. That’s terrifying.> ......It seems unwise to entertain strange thoughts.』","[Well, obviously. For ∇∮◆£...... for Tiana, this meeting with Kaito-sama is something she’s been waiting for a long time. Actually, even for someone like me who’s known her for ages, I rarely see her in such a good mood. Tahaa~~ She must be happy because she can feel the positive impression coming from Kaito-sama’s side...... Arehh? Come to think of it, which fan club was Tiana in again?]","『Outputting answer...... <It’s one of the serious-love factions, but in a different branch from the one I belong to. Mine leans more toward devoted oshikatsu within the serious-love faction, but ∇∮◆£...... Tiana is more of a watching-over type. Like someone who calmly watches over the adorable Kaito-sama while being seriously in love with him.> ......There are many forms among the serious-love supporters.』","[I see. Well, I belong to a different faction from you and Tiana...... the fan club made up of World Creators whose hearts were pierced by Kaito-sama’s heroic coolness. So differences in taste are only natural. Tahaa~~ Still, there’s no hierarchy when it comes to feelings for Kaito-sama.]","『I wholeheartedly agree. Even if our priorities differ, the love we feel for Kaito-sama is the same.』","If one were to distinguish them, then Canalis admires Kaito primarily for how cool he is, Electrone for how precious he is, and Tiana for how cute he is. The preferences of the fan club Tiana belongs to are quite similar to those favored by Makina. Because of that, if Makina and Tiana ever started talking about Kaito, it would be almost guaranteed that the two would hit it off immediately.","『......Outputting a different topic...... <Come to think of it, since I came all the way here, maybe I should go say hello to Lilia-chan as well?> ......Preparations for a gift have also been made.』","[Hm~ if that’s the case, wouldn’t it be better to go later together with Tiana? Tiana will probably want to greet her too.]","『Fumu, I see...... Indeed, splitting it into multiple visits would only trouble Lilia Albert. It would be better to go together with Bipolar God.』","[Right. Lilia-san should be home today since she doesn’t have any plans to go out, so you’ll probably be able to greet her without any issue.]","『Then let us do so. Outputting request...... <Ah, Canalis. While we’re at it, could you also help me decide on the souvenirs for Kaito-sama and Lilia-chan? I did get Shallow Vernal’s permission, but which do you think would be best? This one might be a little too big, don’t you think?< ......I would like to decide beforehand to avoid any discourtesy.』","[Let’s see...... unless you’re planning to give something to be placed in the garden or something, an item over 10 meters tall is probably a bit too big for a souvenir...... Though you certainly have quite a variety here, and a lot of food too...... Oh? Don’t tell me you saw Kaito-sama happily eating the ingredients from another world that Tiana gave him and got envious?]","『......Denying that would be extremely difficult. If I said I did not wish to have that sun-like smile directed toward this as well, it would be a lie.』","[Yeah, that dazzling, heart-melting smile of his looked so brilliant it felt like it could melt anyone just watching it~~]","The two of them chatted sentimentally while happily discussing what souvenirs to bring...... And at that exact moment, Lilia, who was in her office, suddenly felt a chill run through her body, as if someone had slammed a block of ice straight into her stomach. Without realizing it, she began rubbing her abdomen.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Stomachache Devil-kun, I swear...... you really stab people from completely outside their expectations, at a level that shows you have absolutely no mercy...... Two Otherworld Gods showing up at the same time with souvenirs......]"]},{"number":2527,"title":"Chapter 2527: Bipolar God Tiana 10","paragraphs":["Around the time when the future of Lilia suffering from stomachaches had quietly become inevitable, Tiana, who was happily drinking tea with Kaito, suddenly looked as if she had remembered something and asked him a question.","[Come to think of it, Kaito-kun. When I arrived here earlier, you looked a bit puzzled...... that wasn’t because I made a movement like I was checking something, right? You already seemed suspicious even before that...... did you feel something strange?]","[Eh? Ah, errr, I’m not sure how to describe it...... It felt kind of like being in water without weight, like the air had changed a little. That’s why I thought it was strange.]","[I see. That must be because I protected the space around us, so you sensed something off. That must have been sudden and surprising.]","[I was definitely surprised, but it didn’t feel unpleasant at all, so there wasn’t really any problem.]","Hearing Kaito’s reply, Tiana nodded in understanding, took a sip of her tea, and smiled gently. After a brief pause, she spoke to him again.","[By the way, the name Tiana that I’m using now was something I came up with for this world. I suppose I should also tell you my real name. My name is ∇∮◆£. Can you hear it properly?]","[......Ah, sorry. It was the same when Canalis-san said it earlier, but...... it just sounds like a high-pitched noise to me.]","[Ahh, that can’t be helped. My name doesn’t fit within the linguistic structure of this world, and it’s not something that can even be pronounced within the vocal range of the beings from this world or from Kaito-kun's previous world either.]","[Ah, I see. When worlds are different, the languages would certainly be different too. When we were summoned to Trinia, it seems some kind of magic automatically translates languages for us, but I guess other worlds are still outside its scope?]","[No, I think speaking with ordinary residents of another world should still work just fine. But if there are words or sound ranges that don’t exist in the language you can perceive, even Translation Magic can’t do anything about that. Besides, names aren’t really the kind of thing that can be translated in the first place. If there’s no corresponding word in your world, you’ll probably just recognize it as a strange sound.]","[I see......]","Watching Kaito nod, Tiana quietly let her thoughts wander, a gentle smile resting on her lips.","(......Just as I thought...... \"he can hear it\". My name exists in an extremely high-level dimensional layer, so unless someone possesses a special ability, beings from lower dimensional layers shouldn’t even be able to hear it in the first place. But Kaito-kun can hear it, he simply can’t recognize it as a word. Even when I came to this world...... he sensed the power I used to protect the space. But Kaito-kun shouldn’t have any ability that adjusts the difference between dimensional layers......)","If it were someone like Canalis, who possessed omnipotent power, they could recognize Tiana’s name and power even across dimensional layers. And if Kaito somehow had an ability that allowed him to perceive higher-dimensional beings across such layers...... then, setting aside the fact that the gap in power would normally render such an ability ineffective, it might still be possible for him to recognize Tiana’s name and power.","(......There’s definitely something there. Inside Kaito-kun...... Even using omniscience I can’t figure it out. Canalis and Electrone haven’t noticed it either, even Nebula-san hasn’t realized it at all. The only reason I noticed was because Kaito-kun happened to look puzzled when I came to this world. And even now, standing right in front of him, when I use omniscience because I feel there’s something there...... I still can’t tell. A power that can’t be recognized by any ability, including omniscience, whose existence can’t even be sensed, and which no one can even realize is there...... there’s only one thing it could be...... Epilogue...... perhaps, a fragment of that power? If something like that exists inside Kaito-kun and is nullifying the effects of dimensional differences, that would explain everything.)","Although Tiana suspected that some kind of unfathomable power resided within Kaito, even she, who ranked among the very highest of the World Creators, could find nothing. By the process of elimination, the only possibility left was a power connected to Epilogue.","(Did Shallow Vernal place it inside him to protect Kaito-kun? Or is Epilogue itself trying to protect him? I don’t know...... but when it comes to Kaito-kun’s safety, it certainly couldn’t be more reassuring. Well, in the first place, there probably isn’t any World Creator reckless enough to meddle with Shallow Vernal’s world. And if anyone tried to harm Kaito-kun, before Epilogue even became relevant, an enormous number of World Creators, including myself, would move immediately to eliminate them. And Nebula-san is here as well, so there’s absolutely nothing to worry about.)","A fragment of the power of Epilogue existed within Kaito. If her speculation was correct, that it would activate as a counter, then even if Tiana were to try to kill Kaito at this very moment, the only thing waiting would be her end. Kaito would remain perfectly safe.","(......In that case, there’s really no problem at all.)","Her realization had been born from coincidence, and it was still nothing more than a hypothesis...... but it wasn’t something that would affect Kaito or anyone around him in any meaningful way. At most, it meant that Kaito could nullify the difference between dimensional layers, and that someone who had already been excessively well-protected had now become even more invincible.","(......Eh? Wait a minute. If that’s the case, then if he really wanted to, Kaito-kun could even come to my world in the higher dimensional layer...... which would mean that giving him the kinds of gifts I excluded this time wouldn’t be a problem after all. If that’s true, there’d be even more items meant for lovers that I could recommend to Shallow Vernal...... and I might even be able to get permission for free visits...... right?)","Following Canalis’ advice, Tiana had already introduced Shallow Vernal to various items for lovers that didn’t exist in this world when negotiating with her. However, because of the difference in dimensional layers, she had excluded anything she believed Shallow Vernal could handle but Kaito would never be able to experience.","But if Kaito could ignore those dimensional differences thanks to the fragment of Epilogue within him, then she could introduce those things as well...... and if she used that as bargaining material, there was a chance she might win the same kind of visitation permission Electrone had.","(Well, I can think about that later. For now, I’ll just enjoy this tea with Kaito-kun.)","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [So she’s actually the first one to notice the Little Epilogue that even Shiro herself hasn’t realized exists......]"]},{"number":2528,"title":"Chapter 2528: Bipolar God Tiana 11","paragraphs":["While I was drinking tea and chatting pleasantly with Tiana-san, the topic gradually shifted to the people of this world, including my lovers.","[......Kaito-kun, I think it’d be difficult to meet everyone like Electrone did, but I’d like to greet your lovers too, if possible. Would that be alright?]","[Eh? Ah, yeah, I think that should be fine...... Who would you like to meet? I could probably invite Alice, Lilia-san, Anima, or Illness-san right away, but if you have someone specific in mind, I can check with them.]","[If possible, I’d really like to meet Kuromueina-chan. She’s Kaito-kun's very first lover and someone who had a big influence on you. I won’t deny there’s a bit of a fangirl feeling there, but if possible, I’d like to meet her and say hello.]","[I see...... Alright, I’ll check with her.]","Hearing Tiana-san say she wanted to meet Kuro, I sent a hummingbird to confirm with her. In a way, Kuro might be the safest option. Tiana-san was easy to talk to and kind, but she was still an Otherworld God. Someone like Lilia-san would probably get extremely nervous. Kuro, on the other hand, was already somewhat used to dealing with people like Shiro-san and Makina-san, so she might be the most suitable person to introduce first.","Before long, Kuro replied. Her schedule was apparently open, and she said she could come right away, so I asked her to.","And when I say right away, I really mean it. Less than a minute after sending her reply via hummingbird, Kuro arrived using Teleportation Magic. The moment she saw Tiana-san, she looked surprised...... no, more like completely stunned.","[......Kuro?]","[Eh? Ahh, sorry. It’s just that this is the first time I’ve seen someone who looks this overwhelmingly strong, so I got a bit shocked.]","[Tiana-san looks that strong even from your perspective, Kuro?]","[I think she’s overwhelmingly strong. Leaving aside Shiro’s unfair ability, beings like Earth God, Canalis-san, and Electrone-san all have incredible power...... but I can still roughly grasp how amazing they are. This person, though...... I can tell she’s unbelievably strong, but I can’t even begin to tell just how incredible she is...... It feels like standing at the foot of a mountain and looking up at a peak you can’t see at all.]","Just as Canalis-san had said, Tiana-san apparently possessed such power that even Kuro, who had met multiple World Creators, was astonished.","After hearing Kuro’s words, Tiana-san smiled gently, then composed herself and spoke.","[......Once again, nice to meet you, Kuromueina-chan. I’m Tiana. I’m really happy to meet you like this. You don’t need to use formal language with me, please feel free to talk casually.]","[N- Nice to meet you. You probably already know, but I’m Kuromueina...... Being called with \"-chan\" is a first for me, so it feels kind of fresh. Well, from your perspective, Tiana-san, I probably still look like a child huh?]","[Sorry if this is something I shouldn’t ask, but...... about how old are you, Tiana-san?]","Kuro had already lived for an incredibly long time, but Tiana-san was probably far older still. Curious about it, I asked, and Tiana-san made a slightly thoughtful expression, as if considering the question.","[......Errr, if it's according to the standards of this world...... if one year equals about 8,640 hours, right? Let’s see, using the number units you’re familiar with, Kaito-kun...... I’d be...... \"7,648 nayuta, 1,023 asōgi, 733 gōgasha, 3,356 goku, 2,213 sai, 6,532 sei, 5,070 jun, 9,761 kō, 4,693 jō, 3,000 gai, 2,253 kei, 8,520 trillion, 2.3 billion, 3,728 ten-thousand, 9,510 years old\"...... I think? Roughly speaking, I'm about 7,648 nayuta years old.]","(T/N: The numbers here are from the Japanese Buddhist-derived large-number system. A nayuta is 1060 years.)","[......I- I see......]","At the very least, it was clear that her age was completely absurd. No wonder Kuro’s age would seem like that of a child in comparison......","[Well, the age of a World Creator isn’t really a meaningful reference. The laws of time differ from world to world, and there are even World Creators who were born after me but are technically older than I am. This is only what it would be if converted into the time of this world, so there’s no need to worry about it.]","[You’re a World Creator with a completely ridiculous scale, both in power and everything else.]","[But if Kuromueina-chan can sense my power to some extent, then you’re already at a very high level even among those with power comparable to the Omnipotents, so that’s more than amazing enough. Besides, having greater power doesn’t mean someone is more important or superior. I’d be happy if you’d just interact with me casually without worrying about it.]","[......Kaito-kun, until recently I thought World Creators were all some kind of outrageous, troublesome existence...... but lately I’ve started to think maybe it’s just Shiro and Earth God who are the problem children, and most World Creators are actually pretty normal.]","[H- Hmmm, maybe it’s just that those related to Nebula happen to be proper ones?]","I kind of understood what Kuro was getting at, and honestly, I felt the same way. Still, that impression was only because the ones we’d met, Canalis-san, Electrone-san, and Tiana-san, all have relatively sensible personalities. If you considered the countless World Creators out there, it felt like there were probably plenty of dangerous ones too.","Still, the people connected to Nebula were all fairly reasonable...... or at least they gave me a sense of reassurance.","<Afterword>","Makina : [I don't understand. Seriously, I don’t understand...... why am I being used as an example like I’m the poster child for dangerous people......?]","Airhead God : [......I’m not happy about being put on the same level as Earth God.]","Serious-senpai : [......Well, if we’re talking about how dangerous someone is, Makina is way above, so I have a little sympathy for Shiro being used in the same example. Shiro is just more like a natural airhead......]","Makina : [......And me?]","Serious-senpai : [You’re just crazy.]"]},{"number":2529,"title":"Chapter 2529: Bipolar God Tiana 12","paragraphs":["In the end, Kuro joined us, and the three of us ended up having tea together. However, something from the exchange with Kuro earlier had been bothering me a little, so I decided to ask about it.","[Even so, judging from what Canalis-san told me and the way Kuro reacted, Tiana-san must really be incredibly strong.]","[H- Hmmm, well, I do think I’m fairly strong, but once you’re at the Omniscient-and-Omnipotent class or above, there’s not much point in comparing strength. Beings at this level rarely even start fights in the first place. Though among people you know, Makina-chan is also extremely strong. Well, her strength is more defense-oriented, so it might not be obvious at a glance......]","[Earth God? My impression was that she was about on the same level as Canalis-san and Electrone-san. Does that mean she’s actually above them?]","[Yeah. If it’s Canalis and Electrone, I don’t think they have any winning line against Makina-chan. Though like I said earlier, Makina-chan’s strength leans toward defense, so even if she could win, it would probably take an enormous amount of time.]","According to Tiana-san, Makina-san is clearly on a higher level than Canalis-san and Electrone-san. Kuro looked surprised, but honestly, I had thought they were about the same level too.","Ah, but now that I think about it, I vaguely remember Makina-san saying something like \"There’s no better term for it, so people call it the Omniscient-and-Omnipotent class, but I’m actually above that.\", so in reality, she probably really is above that level.","Well, from my perspective, the difference in power is so absurdly large that I can’t even perceive the gap anyway......","[Makina-chan entrusted the authority over her own existence to someone else. You could say she’s handed over the right of life and death over herself...... To put it extremely, Makina-chan is absolutely powerless against that one person. The person she entrusted that authority to could erase Makina-chan as easily as plucking a flower. And in a way, I think Makina-chan would consider it her greatest wish if that person were the one to end her.]","[She entrusted the right over her life and death to someone else......]","[And that, in turn, creates an unbelievably strong defense. The only one who can erase Makina-chan is the single person who holds that authority. Everyone else, even \"Makina-chan herself\", is unable to interfere with her true existence or erase it. Explaining it in detail gets complicated, so to put it roughly...... if Makina-chan, who’s at the Omniscient-and-Omnipotent class, can’t do it, then other beings at that level can’t either. That condition establishes an incredibly powerful defense over her existence. If she had entrusted it to something like a follower, someone who’d definitely side with her, or if it had been done with calculation in mind, it wouldn’t be nearly this strong. But Makina-chan entrusted the authority over her existence the very moment she became a god, giving it to someone she truly loved and trusted from the bottom of her heart. She wished that if she ever strayed from the right path, that person would end her without hesitation, and she would gladly accept it. That absolute trust and immense love are what allowed this miracle-like defense to come into existence.]","If I had to guess, that person was probably Alice. Makina-san places absolute trust in Alice. So much so that if Alice truly judged that she should be eliminated, Makina-san would probably accept it with a smile...... And because of that absolute trust, Makina-san ended up gaining a defensive ability so strong that even Tiana-san calls it unbelievably solid. Though it was probably not something she intentionally obtained, it just happened as a result......","[That’s why Makina-chan is extremely strong. Even I’d have to get pretty serious to break through that defense.]","[......Ah, so you can break through it.]","[I think I could...... but if I unleashed an attack on that scale, it would probably drag hundreds of millions of worlds down with it. It’s not the kind of attack I can pull off while holding back or suppressing the aftereffects. So if Makina-chan and I actually fought...... I think I’d win about 80% of the time. But there’s maybe a 20% chance I’d end up losing because I couldn’t bring myself to go all out without worrying about collateral damage, and the fight would drag on until I got pushed into a disadvantage. You see, I’m a bit indecisive sometimes.]","Tiana-san said this with a wry smile. In other words, if she fought seriously she would win 100%, but because her power is so overwhelming that fighting seriously would cause horrific collateral damage, kindhearted Tiana-san might hesitate to go all out and gradually lose the advantage.","[Hmmm, hearing it like that, you really are ridiculously strong, Tiana-san.]","[Well, even so, my power is still within the scope of \"strength\". I’d lose to Shallow Vernal 100% of the time.]","[That’s because of that unfair ability, right?]","[Unn. Epilogue isn’t something that falls within the categories of strong or weak. Even with omniscience, you can’t understand it or even perceive it. What kind of power it is, how it moves, how it affects things, aside from what’s been passed down by word of mouth, nothing about it can be known. And something you can’t understand can’t be defended against, nor resisted...... well, It’s simply beyond discussion.]","Epilogue should refer to the incredible power that Shiro-san possesses. And if even Tiana-san says this much about it, then it must be a completely absurd power that stands on an entirely different dimension even compared to the Omniscient-and-Omnipotent class.","......Thinking back, that wyvern that had it fired at it almost like a mere performance piece is starting to seem really pitiful.","<Afterword>","Makina : [Epilogue is a power that lies completely outside the realm where abilities can even be compared, an utterly absurd force. Even those of us who possess omniscience, myself included, have no idea what kind of power it actually is. We only know, as a \"result\", that it’s a power capable of ending everything. We can’t detect its activation, can’t see it, and can’t understand it. That’s why even I, who possess omniscience, was surprised when Shallow Vernal revived Nebula.]","Serious-senpai : [Come to think of it, when it was used during the housewarming party, Alice and the others also said they \"couldn’t understand anything\". So it’s basically the ultimate form of a kill-by-the-unknown kind of ability......]","Makina : [The only one who understands Epilogue is Shallow Vernal...... though apparently, even Shallow Vernal doesn’t know about Little Epilogue. So maybe the only thing that truly understands Epilogue is Epilogue itself.]"]},{"number":2530,"title":"Chapter 2530: Bipolar God Tiana 13","paragraphs":["While we were having tea with Kuro, Tiana-san once again brought out the snack she had first given me earlier, that thing that looked like a marble but turned into a cookie when you ate it.","Kuro probably hadn’t tried it yet, so it was likely Tiana-san’s kindness, wanting her to experience ingredients from another world too.","[Kuromueina-chan, if you’d like, please have one.]","[......Errr...... a glass bead? No, maybe a candy?]","[I gave one to Kaito-kun earlier. It’s a food from my world, something like what you’d call a cookie in this world.]","[Hehh, so this is a cookie...... Well then, I’ll have one———!? S- So amazing! It felt hard when I held it, but when I ate it, it was all crispy and crumbly. It really tastes like a cookie!?]","After eating it, Kuro’s eyes sparkled with amazement, and seeing her reaction made Tiana-san smile.","[I got to try quite a few things too, and since they’re ingredients from another world, there were a lot of things you’d never imagine by this world’s standards. It was pretty fun.]","[I see...... ingredients from another world......]","Hmmm, I’ve been with Kuro long enough to know...... Right now, this girl...... is thinking about baby castellas.","[U- Umm, Tiana-san...... I’m really interested in ingredients from another world, so I’d love to hear more about them. And I know this is a bit of an unreasonable request, but...... i- if possible, could you maybe give me just one kind......?]","That face...... she completely looked like she discovered a brand-new possibility for baby castellas. From her expression and gestures, it’s painfully obvious she wants those otherworld ingredients.","However, when Tiana-san heard Kuro’s request, she made a troubled expression.","[H- Hmmm, letting you eat them here is fine since I already got permission from Shallow Vernal...... But if it’s giving them away, that’s not something I can decide on my own. After all, this is Shallow Vernal’s world......]","[Uuu, y- yeah, that makes sense. You have that contract with Shiro too, right? I’m the one making the unreasonable request, so it can’t be helped.]","After hearing that she couldn’t give away the ingredients without Shiro-san’s permission, Kuro slumped her shoulders. She had probably expected as much, because she backed down more easily than I thought she would.","......Or so I thought, but then she glanced at me for a moment before quickly sliding over to my side and clinging to my arm.","[......Kaito-kun. I...... I really, really want ingredients from another world...... Please, lend me your help......]","She pleaded in an incredibly sweet voice, looking up at me as if trying to charm me...... Does she want those otherworldly ingredients that badly? Yeah...... she definitely does.","And Kuro understands the situation perfectly. There’s no reason for Shiro-san to cooperate with her baby castella project, so if Kuro asked directly, it would almost certainly be rejected.","However, if I asked, there might be a chance. That’s why she’s coaxing me like this. And sadly...... It's effective. The way she’s acting spoiled like this, probably something she only does with me, her boyfriend...... I have to admit, it works incredibly well.","......Errr, Shiro-san, you probably heard that conversation, right?","(......I did hear it, but why would I need to help that baby-castella maniac over there?)","You’re absolutely right, but I still want to grant Kuro’s wish somehow...... Shiro-san is the only one I can rely on!","(......Fumu fumu...... say that again.)","......Huh?","(Please repeat what you just said.)","That just now? Errr...... ah, Shiro-san is the only one I can rely on!","(......Your beloved lover...... Yes, now then, one more time.)","......Errr...... My beloved lover Shiro-san is the only one I can rely on! Please help me!","(I suppose it can’t be helped. I was the one who previously told you to seek my help when you’re in trouble, and if you’re asking me that earnestly, then as your lover, I can hardly refuse.)","Somehow...... she seemed quite pleased. Come to think of it, when I relied on Makina-san before, she complained quite a lot about it, so maybe she’s actually happy when I rely on her.","While I was thinking that, Tiana-san suddenly reacted with a small twitch.","[......Eh? Shallow Vernal? Eh? Eehhh!? Permission for free visits? Just for transferring one kind of item? No, it’s not that I’m dissatisfied at all, in fact, with those terms I’m getting way more out of this, so I’ll put forward something I’d been planning to use for negotiations later. Unn, regarding that topic...... Though I think it’ll probably only be usable in situations where you and Kaito-kun use it together, but still. Unn. We can discuss the details later...... Right, it looks like we’ll be able to make a pretty good contract for both sides.]","It seemed Shiro-san had already taken action. Just like that, she exchanged something with Tiana-san and apparently reached some kind of agreement.","[......Errr, you may have guessed it, Kuromueina-chan. It’s definitely thanks to Kaito-kun, but Shallow Vernal has given permission, so I’ll transfer one kind of ingredient from my world to you.]","[ ! ? T- Thank you...... Kaito-kun! I love you!]","Overcome with emotion, Kuro leapt forward and hugged me tightly. I guess I really do go a bit soft when it comes to Kuro, but seeing her this happy made me feel that asking Shiro-san for help was absolutely worth it.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Peaceful. It really feels peaceful...... The light lovey-dovey flirting stings my skin a little, but basically it’s peaceful...... Just how are they going to turn this into stomachache from here?]","~ ~ ~ ~ ~ Scene from a few chapters earlier ~ ~ ~ ~ ~","Tiana’s Aura : [......I’m not like that vulgar kind of magic power that recklessly intimidates everything around it. Without applying any pressure, yet still naturally making others understand the pecking order, that one is an absolute superior being. That is the refinement of the aura of an overwhelmingly superior existence......]","Little Epilogue : [............]","Tiana’s Aura : [......That’s not it...... no, that’s really not it. I mean, that’s just the general idea, you see. Of course Kaito-sama is excluded from that. I would never pressure Kaito-sama, and I would promptly adjust myself with a respectful bow from my side......]","※ Tiana judged that the adjustments to her aura were fine after observing \"Kaito’s reaction\".","※ When Kuro first saw Tiana, she felt that Tiana was an existence of unbelievable strength.","※ When Electrone first appeared, everyone except Kaito clearly felt the aura of a superior being, and she adjusted it after seeing their reactions.","~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~ ~","Serious-senpai : [......Ah, I see. This is one of those situations where Tiana goes to visit Stomachache Duchess while still wrapped in her superior-being aura without even realizing it......]"]},{"number":2531,"title":"Chapter 2531: Bipolar God Tiana 14","paragraphs":["It seemed that Shiro-san and Tiana-san had finished settling their discussion. Tiana-san turned toward us with an extremely delighted smile on her face and lightly raised a hand. At that moment, there appeared something...... A cylindrical object, like a can of Japanese tea, appeared on the table.","Aside from the surface being covered in patterns that looked like countless stars, it really just looked like a plain cylinder......","[Well then, since Shallow Vernal has given permission, I’ll give this to Kuromueina-chan as a present. Since we’re at it, Kaito-kun, you should take one too.]","[Errr...... this is an ingredient?]","[Unn. More precisely, it’s an item that produces ingredients. If I only transferred the ingredients themselves, with the difference between the environments between my world and this world, there would be many that couldn’t be cultivated here.]","Tiana-san produced identical cylindrical objects in front of Kuro and me. As she had one prepared for herself as well, she probably intended to demonstrate how to use it while explaining.","[This is a tool that produces a seasoning called Star Powder. If you touch the large star on the lid of this cylinder, it will generate the seasoning inside after 24 hours. Any unused or leftover contents will disappear and be replaced the next time it generates, though you can transfer it to another container. If you move it to another container, the expiration date is roughly about one year. As for the generation period, sorry, but I’ve adjusted it so that it can’t be shortened with things like time manipulation. If it could be increased enough to circulate in large quantities, that would cause problems.]","[A seasoning from another world...... I- I wonder, do the stars other than the big one on the lid also have some kind of meaning?]","[Unn. That’s the important part. Try touching the stars around it...... see how their color changes when you touch them? The container has 100 stars besides the large one on the lid. Depending on how many of those you touch, and in what combinations, the flavor of the seasoning that gets produced will change.]","She said it so casually, but isn’t that incredible? It’s not just about how many of the 100 star marks change color. If the flavor also changes depending on which positions of the stars are changed, then there must be an enormous number of possible combinations.","Kuro’s eyes were already sparkling brightly. She looked completely overjoyed at the thought that this could let her pursue even more possibilities for her baby castellas.","[This Star Powder is a versatile seasoning, you can sprinkle it on food, dissolve it in liquids, or knead it into dough. I think there are all sorts of ways to use it. However, there’s one thing I want you to be careful about. Just like the name Star Powder suggests, it’s a powdery seasoning that sparkles and shines, so it can affect the appearance of your dishes quite a bit, so please keep in mind that it’s a glowing seasoning when you use it. By the way, it doesn’t require any materials to generate. It’s produced by converting the surrounding air at the atomic level, so it can be made without any cost. Try searching for your favorite combinations and flavors.]","[Ooooooh...... Thank you, Tiana-san!]","[Thank you very much, I didn’t expect to receive one as well......]","It was quite interesting, and I was definitely curious about what kind of flavors this seasoning could produce. Since the generation time couldn’t be shortened with time manipulation, it would probably take Kuro quite a while to try various combinations. If anything, we might even test different combinations separately and share our impressions with each other, which could end up becoming a good topic of conversation.","From what I overheard earlier during Shiro-san’s exchange with her, it seemed that only one type of item was allowed to be transferred. Perhaps that was why she chose Star Powder, since a single type could still produce many different flavors.","Being a powdered seasoning, it likely had many uses. Kuro was probably fully intending to use it for baby castella, but it seemed like it could be used for many other things as well.","[I’m glad you like it. On my side as well, I’m grateful that, quite unexpectedly, I received permission from Shallow Vernal for free visitation.]","[Free visitation, does that mean Tiana-san will be able to come to this world from now on?]","[Unn. I originally wanted to meet Nebula-san and Kaito-kun again anyway, and there are people I couldn’t meet today, so I was planning to negotiate with Shallow Vernal so I could come again. It's just, visiting once is one thing, getting permission to visit many times isn’t something that can be handed out casually. Simply requesting it from my side would’ve been rude too, so I thought it might be pretty difficult...... which is why I’m truly grateful that things worked out like this.]","Tiana-san was kind and easy to talk to, so I was happy that I might be able to see her again in the future. Just as I was thinking that, a thought suddenly came to mind, and I decided to try making a suggestion to Tiana-san.","[......Ah, Tiana-san. If you don’t mind, I’m thinking of inviting Shiro-san, Makina-san, and the others for something like a tea party sometime soon. If you’d like, would you want to join us too?]","[Eh? If it’s alright for me to participate, then I’d love to join.]","[Of course, it’s fine. Then once the exact date is decided, I'll ask Canalis-san to pass the message along.]","[Unn. I’m looking forward to it.]","For the tea party I’m planning, Kuro, Shiro-san, Eris-san, and Olivia-san are already confirmed to attend...... and Makina-san, who heard about it and immediately insisted that she absolutely wanted to participate as well.","It seemed like Tiana-san was acquainted with Makina-san, so with her participation, I figured the conversation would probably be lively. Also...... since Tiana-san apparently seems to be much stronger than Makina-san, I was also hoping that if Makina-san happened to go on a rampage, Tiana-san might be able to help deal with her.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......Are you trying to hold a banquet of gods? Is this a line-up for the execution of Lilia, along with Eris', who got dragged along in that tea party?]"]},{"number":2532,"title":"Chapter 2532: Bipolar God Tiana-san 15","paragraphs":["After enjoying tea together with Kuro for a while, Kuro mentioned that she had other plans. After finishing her tea, she thanked Tiana-san for the star powder and headed home, leaving just Tiana-san and me again.","That said, continuing to drink tea like this didn’t seem like much of a plan, so I told Tiana-san that if there was anyone else she wanted to meet, she should feel free to say so......","[Hmm, there are definitely plenty of people I’d like to see, but Kaito-kun has already had quite a bit of tea and sweets, right? Just continuing to drink tea would probably get boring, so if you’re up for it, how about we drop by Canalis’ place?]","[Ohh, you mean the subspace in the backyard?]","[Unn...... it seems like Electrone is there too, so I thought it might be good timing.]","[Eh? Electrone-san is here as well? Then since we’re at it, shall we head over to the backyard subspace?]","As expected, Tiana-san was a very kind person, naturally being considerate of how I was doing. It was true that I’d already had quite a lot of tea and snacks, and the thought of continuing to eat and drink more was a bit...... much, so I appreciated Tiana-san’s suggestion.","I’d also been sitting the whole time, so moving my body a little sounded nice. I was surprised to hear Electrone-san was here, but maybe she had come to see Canalis-san or Nebula.","I stood up from my seat and moved together with Tiana-san.","The terrace where we had been having tea was already in the backyard, so it was only a short walk to the entrance of Canalis-san’s subspace.","When I opened the door to the subspace and stepped inside...... it was a grassland with a building that looked like a log house. I’d never seen this space before though, so maybe she’d added another one.","When we entered, just as Tiana-san said, Canalis-san was there and...... errr, someone wearing clothes that glowed in various colors...... a person who didn’t have anything above the neck.","[Hello...... Errr, why does Electrone-san not have anything above her neck?]","『Outputting a greeting to my beloved Kaito-sama...... <Hello, Kaito-sama! I’m happy to see you again!> ......Next, outputting an answer to the question...... <My face was blown off by the Berserk Gorilla. Please wait about 5 seconds for regeneration.>』","In a headless, dullahan-like state, I had no idea where the voice was even coming from, but Electrone-san answered my question.","Berserk Gorilla? Was that the person she mentioned during the birthday?","[......Errr, did you have some sort of dispute with them?]","[No, no. Electrone-san just tried to mess with her and got counterattacked. It’s a common sight, so Kaito-sama doesn’t need to worry. Tahaa~~ what you’d call reaping what you sow.]","『Difficult to argue. This unit is indeed entirely at fault...... Since I am at fault, I would appreciate it if the silent pressure would stop. I swear I will not fool around in front of Kaito-sama. Next, outputting an apology...... <T- That was just a figure of speech, okay? I’m sorry for calling you a gorilla...... alright? Your smile is scary.> ......If you get serious, regeneration will take quite a while, so I humbly beg for mercy.』","As her face regenerated, Electrone-san spoke in a flat tone, though she sounded somewhat frightened. Following her gaze, I saw Tiana-san quietly smiling.","A- Ahh...... so the \"Berserk Gorilla\" Electrone-san mentioned was Tiana-san!? I never would’ve imagined that, but apparently Tiana-san was incredibly strong, so it made sense that Electrone-san would be afraid of her.","From the atmosphere, maybe it was something like Luna playing a prank on Lilia and getting scolded for it, one of those joking exchanges that only happen because the two of them are comfortable with each other?","[......Hahh, geez, you sure never changes. Electrone. You deliberately try to mess with me even though you know I’ll counterattack...... But well, you understand a little how I used to feel now, right?]","『Outputting affirmation...... <Unn. I really understand the feeling of not being able to suppress jealousy. I’m so jealous of you having tea with Kaito-samaaa! I wanted to have tea with my oshi too!> ......I am extremely envious.』","Ahh, so the reason Electrone-san had been messing with Tiana-san was because she was jealous that we were having tea together...... though really, if she’d just said something, I’d happily have tea with her anytime.","[If you say the word, I’ll have tea with you anytime, Electrone-san. Actually, since we’re on the topic...... I invited Tiana-san earlier as well, but would you like to come to the tea party I’m planning to hold sometime soon?]","『! ? Outputting shock, excitement, and delight...... <Hawawa, my oshi’s fan service is incredible! The reverence is overflowing and won’t stop, my heart’s been firmly captured, and the Tokimeki Dream Land within my mind won’t stop!!!> ......It is a tremendous honor. I would be delighted to participate.』","As always, she was someone whose mood switched at an incredible pace. Still, there was no doubt she was happy about it, so I felt it had been the right choice to invite her.","[Also, Canalis-san, would you like to join as well? You’re very dependable, and having you there would make me feel more at ease......]","[Kaito-sama, you really know how to make people happy like that again, don’t you? Tahaa~~ how cool can you get!? At this rate, you might even conquer...... I mean, pierce straight through the hearts of these Three Gods all together! Of course, I’d be delighted to participate as well.]","Errr, that makes the tea party participants Kuro, Shiro-san, Eris-san, Chris-san, Olivia-san, Makina-san, Tiana-san, Electrone-san, and Canalis-san, 9 people...... Since she lives next door, I was planning to invite Lilia-san too...... but I was aiming for around 10 people total, so the lineup is pretty much decided already, right? Though maybe, since they like black tea, I should also ask Jutia-san and Ein-san.","<Afterword>","~ ~ Participants of Kaito’s Tea Party ~ ~","Kuro...... the Underworld King and effectively the ruler of the Demon Realm","Shiro...... God of the world","Olivia...... Founder","Makina...... Otherworld God","Tiana...... Otherworld God","Electrone...... Otherworld God","Canalis...... Former Otherworld God","Lilia...... Strongest Stomachache Warrior","Eris...... The Hope of the Stomachache World","Chris...... An Emperor whose intake of stomach medicine has recently increased","? ? ? : [......A perfect lineup. I can practically feel the determination to grind their stomachs to nothing.]","Serious-senpai : [Kaito...... since he’s the one hosting, he probably didn’t think too deeply about it and just invited acquaintances until the numbers filled out...... but Eris, Lilia, and Chris are basically being thrown straight into a festival of gods......]"]},{"number":2533,"title":"Chapter 2533: Bipolar God Tiana 16","paragraphs":["The grassland space with a log house seems to be an area where goats are raised as part of milk production. It has a sort of Alpine-like atmosphere, which feels really nice.","[......By the way, what were you doing, Canalis-san, Electrone-san?]","『Outputting answer...... <I was asking Canalis for advice while choosing a souvenir for Lilia-chan>...... Since I believe Bipolar God would also wish to give greetings, I was thinking we might go together later.』","[It’s right next to Kaito-sama’s house, so since she's here to visit, she thought she’d at least stop by to say hello. And thinking it felt wrong to go empty-handed, she was consulting with me what kind of gift would be good.]","Electrone-san and Canalis-san answered my question. I see, a souvenir for Lilia-san...... It seems Electrone-san had already greeted Lilia-san at the birthday party, so since she came all the way to this world, she probably thought she’d visit her acquaintance Lilia-san as well.","[Ahh, yeah, I was also thinking I’d like to greet Lilia-chan later, so the timing’s perfect. Electrone knows Lilia-chan, right? Then if we go together, it’ll probably be easier for Lilia-chan to talk.]","『Affirmative. Though it is merely this unit’s impression, I previously had a reasonably friendly conversation with Lilia Albert. According to Canalis, she appears to be free today, so we plan to go together later. Continuing with a proposal...... <Tiana, do you want to bring a souvenir too? Everything around here is something I've received permission from Shallow Vernal to use.>...... Additionally, I have received permission to create any item that exists within Trinia.』","Now that I think about it, Electrone-san already knows Lilia-san...... so even if I don’t introduce them, it would work just as well for Electrone-san to introduce Lilia-san. Lilia-san did leave her schedule open today in case Tiana-san came to greet her after talking with me......","[Lilia-san also left her schedule open, considering the possibility that Tiana-san might come see her after talking with me, so I think you’ll probably be able to meet her right away.]","[Oh, really? I hope we didn’t make Lilia-chan go out of her way...... In that case, maybe I should make something to bring too. Electrone, have you decided what you’re bringing?]","『It has not been fully decided. Outputting current status...... <We already decided it should be something small since large items would be inconvenient, but we’re still wondering what would be good. From a noble’s perspective, something with monetary value might be better than food>...... The candidates are around here.』","As Electrone-san said that, a fairly large table appeared in front of us, and various items appeared on top of it. Some looked like gemstones, others like antiques, there was quite a variety, but just as Electrone-san had said, almost none of them were large; even the biggest one was only about a meter in size.","[......Ah, wouldn’t this be good? This is a machine beast, right? A lifeform fused with machinery from Electrone-san’s world?]","『Affirmative. If it remained somewhere in the corner of Kaito-sama’s memory, then it is a great honor.』","[Lilia-san likes dragons, and she seemed really happy when we saw the machine beasts together before, so I think she’d like a model of this size.]","What caught my eye was a dragon whose body was about half mechanical, the kind Lilia-san and I had seen together before. It was a model small enough to sit on a table, yet crafted with incredible detail.","Lilia-san collects dragon models, so from that perspective too, this seemed like a really good choice.","『If Kaito-sama says so, then there can be no mistake. Outputting gratitude...... <Thank you very much! Then I’ll follow Kaito-sama’s advice and make this model the souvenir!>...... Once again, my thanks for the wonderful suggestion.』","[Ah, then I’ll go with something similar too. I’ll make a model of a lifeform from one of the worlds I manage, something close to what Trinia would call a dragon. If we match it with Electrone’s gift, hopefully she’ll enjoy them together.]","[I agree as well. Rather than having you two bring something completely different, having a shared concept would probably make it easier for Lilia-san to accept.]","Since it just happened to catch my eye, I suggested it on the spot, but Electrone-san, Tiana-san, and Canalis-san all seemed to like the idea. In the end, it looked like the souvenir for Lilia-san had been decided, models.","And once it was decided, since they were all Omniscient and Omnipotent Gods, the wrapped gift was completed in an instant.","[......Hmm, actually, why don’t Electrone and I just go greet her right now? Rather than Lilia-chan waiting and wondering when we’ll show up, it’d probably be easier on her if we just get the greetings over with quickly.]","『Outputting agreement...... <Yeah, you’re right. If we ask Lunamaria-chan, she’ll probably usher us in right away, so why don’t we just drop by and say hello quickly>...... If it’s just a simple greeting, it should be over in no time.』","[Then I suppose I’ll stay here and wait with Kaito-sama. What do you think, Kaito-sama? It’s around lunchtime, so how about we have a barbecue? Luckily, this place is perfect for it.]","[......A barbecue sounds great. Then while Electrone-san and Tiana-san go greet her, how about Canalis-san and I prepare things here?]","We had already eaten a fair amount of sweets, so I wasn’t exactly starving, but it was lunchtime after all, and having a barbecue in a place like this highland meadow sounded incredibly appealing.","Ah, while we’re at it, maybe we should invite Nebula too. She’s acquainted with Electrone-san and Tiana-san as well after all......","<Afterword>","Stomachache Devil : [They’re all gods who think in a pretty reasonable way, one of them has already greeted her once before, and it seems the souvenir will be made from materials that exist in this world so...... All good!]","Serious-senpai : [......That is not all good though.]","[Machine Beast Model]","A model crafted with such precision that it reaches a level \"almost impossible for human hands\" to achieve, with every detail meticulously reproduced. All of it is made using materials that exist in Trinia...... however, the mechanical parts are lavishly finished using rare metals such as orichalcum, mithril, and hihiirokane.","[Materia Dragon Model]","A dragon model that Tiana casually made. It is a colorful dragon with a four-colored body, with fire, water, wind, and earth reproduced with astonishing realism.","All of it is made from materials that exist in Trinia...... yes, made from them...... but...... the fire and wind parts are made from real flames and real wind, and the technology to \"fuse the four great elements and materialize them\" does not exist in Trinia."]},{"number":2534,"title":"Chapter 2534: Bipolar God Tiana 17","paragraphs":["When Lunamaria, who had gone to the entrance to receive the guests, brought word that visitors had arrived, the mood Lilia felt at that time was \"So the time's finally come\".","[......Two people have arrived wishing to offer you a brief greeting, Milady, someone who appears to be the Bipolar God visiting Miyama-sama, and Electrone-sama. Miyama-sama himself is not with them.]","[Electrone-sama? That’s unexpected...... I had considered the possibility that Bipolar God-sama might come alone without bringing Kaito-san along but......]","Lilia had already known that Tiana was visiting Kaito, and she herself had thought there was a high chance the two of them would end up meeting face to face.","She had assumed the most likely scenario would be Kaito bringing Tiana along, but she had also considered the possibility that the God might appear alone, much like when Electrone came by herself during the previous birthday party.","[If Bipolar God-sama and Electrone-sama know each other, then that would make them mutual acquaintances. In that case, it wouldn’t be strange for Electrone-sama to come introduce her rather than Kaito-san. Luna, when you said \"someone who appears to be the Bipolar God\", that’s because you handled the conversation with Electrone-sama, correct? Are you certain that person really is Bipolar God-sama?]","[I believe so, almost without a doubt...... I think Milady will understand the moment you see her.]","[......I have a very bad feeling about this...... B- But in any case, refusing to meet them isn’t an option. Please show them in.]","Even as Lunamaria’s wording deepened her unease, there was no possibility of declining to meet gods from another world who had come all the way here to visit.","In fact, Lilia had already assumed a meeting with Tiana was practically inevitable, which was why she had been waiting in the reception room to begin with. Calling them in now posed no problem.","She stood up from the seat where she had been waiting to greet them, and as she awaited the arrival of Tiana and Electrone, Lunamaria returned shortly afterward.","[......I’ve brought them.]","[Please let them in.]","At Lilia’s words, Lunamaria opened the door. First entered the familiar figure of Electrone...... and then, accompanied by the faint chime of a bell, Tiana stepped into the room. At that moment, Lilia understood the meaning behind Lunamaria’s earlier choice of words.","The being known as Tiana was overwhelmingly imposing. It wasn’t that she emitted a suffocating aura like the magic power of death, nor did she create a sense of pressure that made breathing difficult.","No, this was different...... If it had to be described...... it was as though the scale of her very existence was on an entirely different level. The moment Lilia laid eyes on her, she understood. The difference in rank was overwhelming, beyond even the gap in power, it felt as if the very dimension of their existence itself was different.","Though Tiana possessed a humanoid form not so different from Lilia’s own in appearance, the presence she gave off was like that of a giant towering into the heavens. It was enough to make anyone grasp the difference in stature at a single glance, and Lilia involuntarily caught her breath.","Even so, it was merely an overwhelming presence; it did not press down on her or prevent her from speaking normally.","[Welcome. Please, take a seat here.]","『I apologize for the sudden visit. Though it had just been since Kaito-sama’s birthday party, I’m relieved to see that you are in good health.』","[It has been some time, Electrone-sama.]","[This would be our first meeting, wouldn't it? My name is Tiana, an Otherworld God which is also known as the Bipolar God. I’m happy to meet you, Lilia-chan.]","[It's a pleasure to meet you. My name is Lilia Albert.]","After exchanging brief greetings, the two gods took their seats. Once Lilia confirmed this, she said \"Excuse me\", and sat down in the seat across from them.","(A- As expected of a god, her presence is incredible, but she seems to have a very gentle atmosphere about her, which is a relief.)","Although she was astonished by the presence that could only be described as overwhelmingly superior, just as Kaito had sensed Tiana’s kindness at their first meeting, Lilia too felt a gentle warmth in the smile and air surrounding Tiana.","At the very least, it lacked the oppressive feeling Makina...... or rather, Eden had given off when they first met. And as for Electrone, Lilia had already spoken with her during the previous party and knew what kind of person she was, so she was able to feel some peace of mind.","......That said, even while seated, the sheer magnitude of Tiana’s presence made Lilia instinctively straighten her back......","However, this overwhelming presence wasn’t something Tiana was consciously projecting. The truth was that she had already greatly suppressed her power to match this world, and she had adjusted the degree of that suppression by observing Kaito’s reactions.","Yes, it was roughly the same level of adjustment Electrone had used at the birthday party. Electrone had later readjusted after seeing how the others besides Kaito reacted, but Tiana had judged, based on Kaito’s response, that there was no problem and therefore hadn’t made any further adjustments.","And since Lilia’s nervousness toward an Otherworld God was exactly the kind of reaction Tiana had expected, she didn’t realize that her own presence was still overwhelming.","If it had been Electrone, who had made the same mistake before, she might have noticed...... But honestly speaking, that level of adjustment was little more than a margin of error for beings of their level. Unless there was someone present on the level of a completely ordinary person like at the birthday party, it would have been difficult to notice from their reactions alone.","Because of that coincidence, Lilia now found herself sitting face-to-face with a god radiating the aura of an overwhelmingly superior being. Even though she sensed that Tiana herself seemed kind, Lilia’s stomach still twisted painfully.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [And since Lilia herself is pretty strong, even though she can’t tell exactly how strong, she can at least understand that standing before her was an absurdly powerful existence, so of course her stomach would start hurting.]"]},{"number":2535,"title":"Chapter 2535: Bipolar God Tiana 18","paragraphs":["Lilia felt tense under the overwhelming aura of a superior being emanating from Tiana, and her stomach ached...... yet even so, she found that this was still a relatively manageable level.","That was likely because, just like Electrone, Tiana had a calm, gentle presence and possessed a sensible way of thinking...... And since both of them had clearly stated they had only come for a brief greeting, the interaction wouldn’t last long. That alone gave Lilia a certain degree of mental leeway.","On top of that, Lilia had endured countless stomach-wrenching situations before. Compared to those, a mere sharp stomachache was practically nothing. There was no headache, no nausea, no abnormal palpitations, so at this level, she could outwardly maintain a composed smile easily.","It wasn’t something she had ever wished for, but the number of stomach-crushing ordeals she had survived was on a completely different level. At the very least, no meteor was about to come crashing down from an unexpected angle, and as a Kaito-related matter, this was practically mild.","[This time, we really just came for a simple greeting, so we won’t stay long. We’ll head back to Kaito-kun and the others soon.]","[I see. I apologize for not being able to offer much hospitality.]","[No, no. We’re the ones who came unannounced. I’m just happy you took the time to meet us like this.]","As expected, with the brief introductions out of the way, the conversation naturally shifted toward returning to Kaito’s house.","『Affirmative. When we visit Kaito-sama in the future, if Lilia Albert, his neighbor, is present, we may offer a brief greeting. However, there is no need for formality when dealing with us. You may respond in a relaxed manner.』","[Does that mean, not only Electrone-sama, Tiana-sama will also be visiting this world frequently from now on?]","[Unn. I got permission from Shallow Vernal to come and go freely, so I’ll probably drop by from time to time. And if Lilia-chan is around, I’ll come say a quick hello. But you don’t have to prioritize us or anything, if you’ve got other plans, those come first, alright?]","[Understood.]","The conversation progressed in an extremely calm manner, and Lilia inwardly breathed a sigh of relief...... but of course, there was no way things would end so peacefully.","[This visit ended up being rather sudden, so as an apology, and also as a proper greeting, Electrone and I brought some small gifts.]","[......Gifts......?]","Lilia felt the shift in the flow...... primarily in a bad direction...... If it were an ordinary person, there would be no issue. A gift would simply be taken at face value.","But the other party here were World Creators that are omniscient and omnipotent. Hearing that they had brought gifts naturally filled her with unease.","『I have also received advice from Kaito-sama. Outputting impression...... <Since this is based on Kaito-sama’s suggestion, it should be correct. And Lilia-chan said she liked it when she saw it before>...... The items we have brought are models.』","[......M- Models......?]","『Affirmative. I will present mine first. I have recreated one of the machine beasts that Lilia Albert previously expressed fondness for as a model. It would be an honor if you were to display it on a desk or similar.』","[......T- This is an incredibly exquisite model......]","The moment Lilia saw the model Electrone placed on the table, a chill ran down her spine.","(......Orichalcum, Mithril, Adamantite, Hihiirokane...... all processed with absurdly fine and precise craftsmanship...... This is something that wouldn’t look out of place displayed in the most prominent spot of a royal treasury as a national treasure......)","It was a masterpiece, lavishly crafted from rare metals, worked with such intricate precision on materials of extreme hardness that a single glance was enough to recognize it as a work of art of overwhelming quality.","[I prepared a model of a dragon called a Materia Dragon, one that exists in a world I manage. It turned out quite beautifully, so I’d be happy if you could display it and enjoy it.]","[T- T- This is another truly magnificent model...... This fire, it looks exactly like the real thing...... or rather...... it doesn’t look like anything but real fire......]","[Ah, that’s because it is real fire and water, materialized. But don’t worry, I’ve altered their properties during materialization, so they won’t burn or soak anything around them, and you won’t feel any heat if you touch them. You can think of it as only looking like real fire, nothing more.]","The model Tiana had prepared was a dragon whose body seemed to be an intricate fusion of fire, water, wind, and earth. Each element had been created by materializing real fire and water...... making it an object that simply could not exist within the technological framework of this world.","(......M- My stomach...... it hurts...... Neither of these is something an individual should be allowed to own, right!?)","The reason Kaito had advised this choice, and why Electrone and the others had ultimately decided on it, was because of a past success: Makina had once gifted Lilia a life-sized dragon model, and she had been delighted by it. However, the circumstances this time were entirely different.","Back then, Lilia had accepted Makina’s request in a sense, and the gift had been given as a token of gratitude, making it easier to accept. Moreover, it was something meant for private enjoyment, and Makina had intended it as such, a piece to be appreciated among a small circle of close acquaintances.","But this time, it wasn’t a reward. While Electrone and Tiana considered these as simple gifts, given that they were World Creators, these were closer to bestowed items. That alone made it overwhelmingly humbling, and on top of that, the fact that these models were clearly impossible to reproduce with this world’s technology made Lilia’s stomach ache even more.","But there was an even bigger problem. Neither of them had any ill intent, but both had mentioned wanting her to \"display and enjoy\" the gifts...... That meant these items were effectively tokens of goodwill bestowed by these overwhelmingly superior beings.","And since they had explicitly asked her to display them, she couldn’t simply store them away in a private space like the one Makina had given her. At the very least, they would need to be placed in the treasury...... ideally somewhere visible to a certain extent.","Displaying items of immeasurable value was terrifying enough, but the real issue was what would happen when other nobles visited her residence and saw them. If asked, she would have to explain objects created with \"technology that does not exist in this world\", depicting \"creatures that do not exist in this world\". And that would inevitably reveal that Lilia built up friendly relations with Otherworld Gods.","She already had more than enough notoriety to give her stomach constant trouble, but if it became known that she also had connections with Otherworld Gods...... just imagining the uproar it would cause was enough to make her stomach twist in agony.","<Afterword>","Stomachache Devil : [Well? Beautiful, isn't it? Stomachache isn’t something you just inflict in the moment. Burst damage matters, sure, but sustained damage is effective too...... In other words, just by keeping those models on display, Lilia’s stomach will continuously accumulate periodic damage! It’s a masterpiece that can be called a continuous stomachache generator!!]","Serious Senpai : [......S- Sustained damage...... you say......?]","Stomachache Devil : [Fuhahahahaha!]","~ ~ Next time: The natural enemy of the Stomachache Devil appears ~ ~","Stomachache Devil : [Heaah!?]"]},{"number":2536,"title":"Chapter 2536: Bipolar God Tiana 19","paragraphs":["While Tiana-san and Electrone-san had gone to greet Lilia-san, I called Nebula over, and together with Canalis-san, the three of us were preparing for a barbecue.","[This goat meat seems really good, no unpleasant odor at all. Tahaa~~ though the goat milk tasted pretty mediocre.]","[Discovering such unexpectedly good items is part of the joy of trial and error. It certainly seems mild in both smell and flavor, making it easy to eat.]","[This is my first time trying goat meat, what does it taste like?]","[It’s lean and has a light, refreshing taste. However, parts near the skin can have quite a strong odor, so it’s common to use things like ginger to remove the smell. But this goat meat hardly has any odor, so I think it’ll be delicious even as is!]","When I asked about the goat meat Canalis-san had prepared, Nebula energetically answered. Sure enough, it looked quite lean, almost similar in appearance to beef round.","At the moment, Canalis-san was preparing the meat and vegetables, I was skewering them, and Nebula was making the barbecue sauce. Chatting lively like this while getting everything ready was actually pretty fun.","As I was leisurely thinking that and continuing preparations, Tiana-san and Electrone-san returned.","[Welcome back. Did everything go smoothly with the greeting?]","[We’re back. And hello, Nebula-san...... unn, we were able to greet her without any problems.]","『Outputting impressions...... <I’m glad the gift we prepared was well received~>...... We extend our gratitude once more for Kaito-sama’s advice.』","[......A gift?]","It seemed the greeting had gone well, but Nebula tilted her head curiously at the mention of a gift by Electrone-san.","Come to think of it, Nebula hadn’t been around when we decided on the gift.","『What we brought to Lilia Albert. With Kaito-sama’s advice, we created models entirely from materials that exist in this world.』","[Since we heard Lilia-chan likes dragons, we made models of dragons from each of our worlds as gifts.]","[I see...... by the way, are those items \"something that can be reproduced using the current technological system of this world\"?]","[『......Eh?』]","At Nebula’s question, Electrone-san and Tiana-san both looked as though they had been caught off guard.","[For example, machinery from Makina-san’s world can technically be made using materials that exist in this world. However, since this world lacks the technological framework of mechanical engineering, such machines would be considered unknown items.]","『......The item I provided...... should probably be...... technically possible......』","[......Ah, this might be my mistake. The one I made was materialized by fusing the four great elements, but that kind of technique......]","[......Doesn’t exist here. Even if it did, only a very small number of top-tier individuals, like Kuromueina-san, would be capable of actually achieving it.]","[I- Is that bad?]","[Hmmm, even if someone saw it, it would be difficult to determine just by sight that it was made using fused elemental materialization...... so it should be fine.]","I hadn’t realized it either, but it seemed the model Tiana-san had made couldn’t be reproduced with this world’s current technology.","[It’s fine when giving things to someone in a special position like Milord, or for personal use, but when giving gifts to someone like Lilia-san, you need to be mindful not just of the materials, but also the technological aspects.]","[Understood.]","『My apologies. This unit had been thoughtless.』","Come to think of it, Canalis-san also makes incredible items, but only for personal use, either for me or for herself. When it comes to creating things like the ordering tablets, I recall she would first check whether they could be reproduced using this world’s technology. If I remember correctly, the tablet works by applying the technology of a magic tool that sends letters placed inside a box to its paired box.","[Should we go apologize to Lilia-chan?]","[No, an apology won’t be necessary. It would only make her feel uncomfortable...... However, I do think you should visit Lilia-san once more and let her know that the model you gave her is \"something she can enjoy privately without any issue, even if it’s not displayed publicly\". No matter how polite and proper you may be, to Lilia-san, you are still overwhelmingly superior beings. It wouldn’t be strange if she felt that a gift from such individuals must be displayed prominently, or it would be disrespectful...... So I think you should tell her it’s perfectly fine to treat it like a personal collection piece, just as one might with something received from Makina-san’s world.]","[I see...... then I’ll go and tell her.]","After nodding in agreement with Nebula’s words, Tiana-san vanished from sight. She had probably gone to convey exactly what Nebula had just said.","[......Hmm, as expected, Nebula really is thoughtful and impressive.]","[I am Absolute after all! One who stands as an absolute must be able to view things from many different perspectives!!!]","[I see, as expected of Nebula.]","As I gently patted Nebula on the head, finding her small figure puffing out her chest rather endearing, she narrowed her eyes and smiled happily in response.","<Afterword>","Absolute : [......Straighten things up.]","Stomachache Devil : [......Ah, yes.]","Serious-senpai : [She removed the Continuous Stomachache Induction Device immediately!? S- So this is the Absolute......]"]},{"number":2537,"title":"Chapter 2537: Bipolar God Tiana 20","paragraphs":["Tiana-san, who had gone to speak with Lilia-san a bit more, quickly returned, and since preparations were all in order, the barbecue began without issue.","[Well~~ Lilia-chan clearly looked relieved. Just like Nebula-san said, she seemed to think it’d be rude not to display it somewhere people could see. I’m glad we managed to tell her before it was too late.]","『Outputting reflection...... <Perhaps when we said we wanted her to display it and enjoy it, it unintentionally became pressure despite no ill intent>...... Our thinking from Lilia Albert’s perspective was insufficient.』","[When worlds differ, so do their common senses, so it can be a tricky matter. In situations like that, I recommend asking Canalis-san for advice.]","Both Tiana-san and Electrone-san were reasonable and sensible individuals, and they properly acknowledged and reflected on the fact that they had unintentionally put pressure on Lilia-san. That alone made it clear how kind-hearted the two of them were.","Honestly, my own thinking had been naïve as well. I might’ve simply assumed that anything related to dragons would make her happy.","In response to them, Nebula-san suggested seeking advice from Canalis-san. Indeed, Canalis-san didn’t seem like someone who often made mistakes in that area. Even when she first met Lilia-san, she didn’t appear to place any pressure on her, and when she went around greeting the rulers of various nations as Nifty’s representative, everything went smoothly.","[I think part of it is simply a difference in experience. I’ve traveled across many worlds to the point of being called Vicissitude God, but Tiana-san and Electrone-san haven’t really had many opportunities to visit other worlds.]","[That’s true. There are still a lot of things we have to figure out as we go. Adjusting the scale of our existence when visiting a world was actually pretty difficult.]","『Outputting agreement...... <Ah, that part was quite difficult for me as well. Shallow Vernal’s world doesn’t have outer space and is relatively small in scale>...... During my first visit, my adjustments were somewhat insufficient, so I had to readjust locally.』","At Tiana-san’s explanation with a wry smile, Electrone-san nodded in agreement. It felt like I’d heard something similar before, Makina-san had said something along those lines too, if I recall.","[Come to think of it, Makina-san also mentioned that since Trinia is small, she has to be very careful.]","[To put it in a way that’s easy for Kaito-sama to understand, imagine Tiana-san and Electrone-san’s existence scale is about the size of a soccer ball. If you try to put a soccer ball into a bathtub...... it’s easy, right? You could just toss it in, and the bathtub wouldn’t break. But if you tried to put it into a glass cup, wouldn’t that suddenly become difficult?]","[It would be difficult...... actually, it wouldn’t fit at all as it is.]","[Exactly. So Tiana-san and Electrone-san compress that \"soccer ball\" down to a size that can fit into the cup. But if they make a mistake in adjusting the size, there’s a risk of breaking the cup, so smaller worlds require a lot more care...... Well, compressing one’s existence in the first place is already a difficult method, so it’s not something I’d recommend. Even a slight error can cause major differences......]","[......From the way you put it, does that mean you use a different method, Canalis?]","After hearing Canalis-san’s explanation, Tiana-san tilted her head slightly. Indeed, from her tone, it almost sounded like she didn’t consider Tiana-san and Electrone-san’s method to be ideal.","[I partition and put away part of my existence, so my current scale is no different from that of an ordinary person in this world. I’m a very slim and energy-efficient god. Honestly, this method is the easiest. By partitioning and putting away the trivial stuff, and then drawing them out when needed, I can keep my existence scale low while still using my god power normally...... though that’s a different story if I go all out.]","[Partition...... Put away...... A- Ahhh!? So that’s it! You’re storing most of your power in another dimension, and using only the \"output\"...... the gateway where it comes out to construct your body. Then when you need it, you just draw out the necessary amount!]","『Outputting understanding...... <I- I see...... that would indeed allow the existence scale to become extremely small>...... I’m impressed.』","The scale of the discussion was far too grand for me to fully grasp, but for Tiana-san and Electrone-san, it seemed to be a revelation-level technique, they were clearly impressed.","[I’ll teach you some tips later on how to partition yourself properly. With that, I think both Tiana and Electrone will be able to do the same thing right away. Also, when you’re making something to give to someone other than Kaito-sama, it’s quickest to just do a quick check with omniscience.]","[That level of experience is truly as expected. From now on, it might be a good idea for Canalis-san to give advice beforehand to those who come to visit for the purpose of greeting our lord.]","Since she had originally traveled across various worlds, Canalis-san likely possessed all sorts of tricks and techniques for dealing with differences in world size and levels of civilization. If she were to guide them at least once, it would certainly make things much more reassuring when it comes to the Gods who would visit in the future.","<Afterword>","Absolute : [While I'm at it, I also put in some light countermeasures against the stomachaches caused by the World Creators scheduled to visit in the future.]","Stomachache Devil : [W-What a monster...... (trembling)]"]},{"number":2538,"title":"Chapter 2538: Bipolar God Tiana 21","paragraphs":["It was my first time eating goat meat, and it felt similar to lamb, but still quite different from beef. It’s a red meat, yet softer than I expected, and just as I’d been told, it had almost no odor, far less gamey than I imagined. It was simply delicious.","The aftertaste was surprisingly clean, so even with the rich flavor of barbecue sauce, it didn’t feel heavy and was easy to eat. Come to think of it, I think I heard Okinawa has goat meat dishes? I’ve never been there, so I’ve never tried them......","[This is even more tender and delicious than I expected.]","[As expected of Kaito-sama, you have a fine eye. This is goat meat with God-grade properties, and amazingly...... it is very delicious! It has absolutely no other effects whatsoever!]","[Ahaha, well, since it’s food, being delicious is what matters most. If anything, having special effects might make it harder to eat casually.]","With Canalis-san’s abilities, she could probably create goat meat with effects like the Fruit of the World Tree, but for simply enjoying a meal, such effects weren’t necessary. As long as it tasted good, that was enough.","When I shifted my gaze to the others, Tiana-san had taken portions onto a small plate and was eating elegantly instead of eating it in a skewer, while Electrone-san held a skewer...... and then the meat instantly turned into particles of light and was absorbed into her.","『Outputting impression...... <It certainly tastes good. There’s no odor at all, and it seems it was raised very well~~>...... The texture is also quite pleasing.』","[......Electrone-san, that still counts as eating, right?]","『Outputting affirmation...... <Yes! I am enjoying it. As an electronic lifeform, I convert objects into electronic information and absorb them to experience their taste>...... It is only natural that it appears different from oral consumption.』","[I- I see......]","So she was literally eating information? Since she could perceive taste and texture, it must be converted into extremely advanced data before being absorbed......","Thinking how mysterious that was, I looked toward Tiana-san and noticed a vegetable on her plate that I didn’t recognize. At a glance, it looked like a super mini-sized cabbage......","[Tiana-san, what kind of vegetable is that? Actually...... is it even a vegetable?]","[Ah, this is an ingredient from my world. In terms of this world...... hmm, it’s quicker if you just try it. Here, ahhh~~]","[Eh? Ah, thank you.]","She offered it so naturally that I ended up taking a bite without thinking. It was easy to eat in one bite, which helped, and the taste...... it was like a sweet potato. Even though it looked exactly like cabbage, both the texture and flavor were sweet and starchy. Ingredients from Tiana-san’s world really were mysterious.","『Outputting intense protest...... <Haaah!? Feeding him like that is crossing the line, you b*stard!!! Why are you so casually doing something so enviable and outrageous!!!>...... I protest that this constitutes a violation of prohibited conduct.』","[No, no...... it was simply the most efficient way. Rather than preparing a new one and grilling it, it’s faster to give him what’s already on my plate.]","[Wouldn’t it have been fine to just place it on a small plate and hand it over? I can’t stay silent about this. The very person who’s beaten us senseless out of jealousy in the past, what do you think you’re doing now?]","Uh...... t- things are starting to feel a bit strange. Electrone-san was protesting against Tiana-san, and Canalis-san seemed to be joining in.","Come to think of it, I’d brushed it off as a joke before...... but hearing things like how I apparently have a fan club, how Electrone-san talks about being a fan, and how Canalis-san says I’m liked by various world creators...... could all those actually be real?","[E- Errr......]","[Milord, there’s no need to worry. They’ll keep things within reason even if they argue, so if you leave them alone, they’ll settle down eventually.]","[I- I see......]","[More importantly, Milord, how about this?]","[Unn? Is that...... bacon?]","[Yes. It’s bacon smoked using wood chips from my World Tree. Illness-san and Canalis-san and I worked through a lot of trial and error to perfect it, it’s one of my proudest creations!]","[That sounds delicious. If it’s alright with you, Nebula, I’d love to try it.]","[Of course!]","I was a little concerned about the arguing World Creators, but if Nebula said it was fine, then it should be alright. So, leaving the three still glaring at each other alone, I decided to try the smoked bacon she had made.","A faint sweetness paired with the deep, rich flavor of the smoke. The more I chewed, the more savory juices seeped out...... this was an absolutely incredible bacon. Well, considering Nebula made it, that wasn’t surprising, but it might honestly be the best bacon I’ve ever had.","[......This is amazing. As expected of Nebula's proud creation. It’s the best bacon I’ve ever eaten.]","[It’s not my achievement alone, but I’m glad you like it, Milord!]","Seeing Nebula smile so adorably at my praise, I felt a sense of warmth. Then, when I turned my gaze back to the three who had been glaring at each other, I noticed they had somehow moved farther away. Before I knew it, it had turned into a one-versus-two standoff: Tiana-san against Electrone-san and Canalis-san.","Still, from what I’d heard, Tiana-san was absurdly strong...... whether the two of them together could win was questionable. Actually...... somehow, I had a feeling they didn’t stand a chance at all.","<Afterword>","~ ~ Stomachache Chronicles: Side Story ~ ~","<The Absolute Who Reins Stomachaches> Nebula","The one and only natural enemy of the Stomachache Devil, who runs rampant in unrestrained tyranny, the Absolute capable of effortlessly removing stomachache flags. Hearing that alone might make her seem like a savior to Lilia and the other Stomachache Warriors, but that’s not entirely the case.","The reason being that Nebula fundamentally sees herself as “a resident of Kaito’s home”, and generally ignores visitors to Lilia’s residence.","In the previous incident as well, she paid no particular attention to Electrone and Tiana visiting Lilia’s house, only reacting when she heard the word “souvenir”. So it’s not as though she cancels every stomachache indiscriminately.","Moreover, she is no longer omniscient, and her range of action is limited to the grounds of Kaito’s home. As such, she generally only cancels stomachaches related to the Otherworld World Creators.","(T/N: Read as Isekai, translated to Otherworld, but Author used 胃(i) for stomach instead of 異(i) in (異世界)isekai. So this can be translated as Stomach/Stomachache World Creators.)","That said, unlike Alice, who only steps in when things have truly reached their limit, Nebula acts much earlier and resolves the root of the issue when she does intervene, making her assistance overwhelmingly effective.","However, since Kaito is her top priority above all else, she tends to be rather lenient toward his actions, sometimes overlooking stomachache flags caused by him."]},{"number":2539,"title":"Chapter 2539: Bipolar God 22","paragraphs":["As I leisurely enjoyed a barbecue with Nebula, it seemed the fight had come to an end. There hadn’t been any shaking or shockwaves, to the point that it was hard to tell whether they had really been fighting at all...... but at the very least, I could see the outcome clearly: Tiana-san standing there as if nothing had happened, while Canalis-san and Electrone-san were on the ground, knees and hands pressed against it, their heads hanging low.","『Outputting thoughts of injustice...... <I’m so done with this, this gorilla is way too strong. So overwhelming strength means you can get away with anything? That’s just unfair, this is too much.>...... Lamenting the current state where foul play runs rampant』","[What’s really awful is that she handled both me and Electrone at the same time without even counterattacking, just brushing everything aside like she was dealing with a troublesome pair throwing a tantrum. And yet, when it comes to herself, she’ll just punch me out of jealousy without hesitation......]","[N- No, well, unn...... I get how you both feel, but I don’t think hitting back is the right answer...... though that doesn’t mean I want to get hit either, so I’ll still defend or dodge when I have to......]","It really looked like Tiana-san had effortlessly dealt with the combined assault of Canalis-san and Electrone-san and brought things to an end.","Even with two Omniscient and Omnipotent beings working together, they hadn’t stood a chance, Tiana-san was just that strong, leaving the other two looking frustrated.","Though, come to think of it, the whole thing started because I had her feed me meat......","[In that case, what if I fed all three of them? Would that help them make up......?]","『 [ [ ! ? ] ] 』","Well, since Canalis-san and Electrone-san were complaining that Tiana-san’s actions were unfair, I figured doing the same thing for everyone might solve it.","Being fed like that on purpose felt embarrassing, so I thought it’d be better if I were the one doing the feeding. It was honestly just a spur-of-the-moment idea. To keep things fair, I included Tiana-san as well, but their reaction was way more intense than I expected...... Even though I’d muttered it from a fair distance away, all three of them whipped their heads toward me at incredible speed.","[Sorry, Canalis, Electrone...... I was thoughtless with my actions.]","『Outputting remorse...... <No, it’s my fault too, I got weirdly stubborn. I'm sorry.>...... conflict creates nothing』","[I also failed to control my emotions. My apologies.]","And just like that, they reconciled in a way that was almost comically obvious, shaking hands before glancing over at me with expectant eyes. I gave a small nod in response.","[Alright then, please line up in order so as not to trouble Milord.]","『 [ [ Yes! ] ] 』","At Nebula’s call, they neatly lined up, and she handed me a small plate with three bite-sized pieces of bacon.","T- This...... turned into quite the situation. But, well...... if it resolves the fight, I guess it’s fine...... Errr, first up is Tiana-san.","[T- Then, here you go.]","[Thank you! Mmm, delish! I’m really glad I came today.]","After eating the bacon and showing a blissful expression, Tiana-san smoothly stepped aside, and Electrone-san moved in front of me next.","I wasn’t sure whether this whole \"ahhh~\" feeding thing had any meaning for someone who just turned food into electronic data to consume, but for now, I held out the bacon to her the same way.","[Here you go.]","『Outputting feelings of bliss...... <Fuaahhh, being fed Nebula-san’s bacon by Kaito-sama! My two oshi in a super precious collab! This overflowing happiness is truly...... a memory!!!>...... My utmost gratitude』","The gap in her tone was as extreme as ever, though I felt like I was starting to get used to it. At the very least, I now understood that when her excitement peaked, she turned into something like an over-the-top idol fan.","After that, Electrone-san stepped aside, and finally, I fed Canalis-san the bacon as well.","[Here you go, Canalis-san.]","[Thank you very much! Tahaa~~ putting it modestly, this is the best. Good grief, I’ve shown you quite an unsightly display, Kaito-sama, I’m still far from mature, and I must apologize! But, if it led to a result like this, overflowing with happiness, then perhaps it turned out for the best. Oh, but please don’t misunderstand, I have no intention of deliberately picking fights like that in the future, so rest assured!]","Though her expression remained as blank as ever, Canalis-san spoke with unmistakable delight as she gave her thanks. It was a bit confusing to be treated entirely like some kind of idol, but...... well, since the fight was over, I figured that was good enough.","Then, a thought suddenly came to mind. I cut the bacon into a smaller piece and turned toward Nebula.","[......Errr, Nebula, would you like some too?]","[I have no real need for it...... however, I am very happy to receive Milord’s kindness, so I shall accept.]","Nebula blinked in surprise for a moment, then broke into a bright smile as she ate the bacon I offered with her small mouth. The adorable gesture was strangely soothing, and after that, we all ended up enjoying the barbecue together in a peaceful, relaxed atmosphere.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [And then after this, the others from the fan club would probably try beating them to a pulp...... Tiana would probably turn the tables on them though......]"]},{"number":2540,"title":"Chapter 2540: Bipolar God Tiana 23","paragraphs":["After the barbecue ended, I spent most of the time chatting, talking with Tiana-san again, just the two of us, and showing her around my room since she said she wanted to see it.","Since Tiana-san had such a gentle personality and was easy to talk to, the conversation flowed naturally, and before I knew it, time had flown by.","As evening approached, she decided it was about time to head home, saying she didn’t want to overstay. Though she could probably return from anywhere if she wanted, we somehow ended up moving to the terrace in the backyard where she had first arrived, and I saw her off from there.","[Kaito-kun, thank you so much for today. I really had a great time.]","[I should be the one thanking you. I had a lot of fun too, and it was really interesting hearing all those stories about other worlds. I’ll let you know once we decide on a date for the tea party, but even aside from that, feel free to drop by anytime if you feel like it.]","[Unn. I didn’t expect to get permission for free visits like this, so I’ll definitely come by again. If possible, I’d love to invite you to my world someday too...... though bringing you to another world might cause a lot of fuss, so I guess I’ll have to sort things out first.]","[I can imagine getting permission would be a hassle...... but I’m definitely interested. I’d like to visit if I get the chance.]","From what I’d heard, Tiana-san’s world sounded more like something out of science fiction......far more advanced than the world I came from. It seemed like it would have a completely different kind of \"otherworld\" atmosphere compared to Trinia, so if the opportunity ever came, I’d definitely want to go.","Hearing my response, Tiana-san smiled gently...... then after a brief pause, she quietly spoke again.","[......Kaito-kun, thank you. Not just for today, I’ve been wanting to properly thank you ever since we met.]","[Errr, is this about Nebula?]","[No. Well, it’s definitely related, of course...... but it’s also something more fundamental than that.]","[Unn?]","When I tilted my head in confusion, Tiana-san kept her gentle expression, though there was a slightly reflective look in her eyes as she continued.","[It all started with Nebula-san, that’s true. Her revival prompted me...... no, not just me, but many World Creators to look into you. We saw how you’ve lived, what you’ve gained, and what kind of resolve you had when you faced Shallow Vernal’s trial.]","[Fumu...... well, I guess there are a lot of omniscient beings around, so it’s not surprising I’d be known.]","[Unn. But unless something like that happens, we...... how should I put it? We almost never pay attention to a single life striving to gain something. Like you said, I possess omniscience and omnipotence. I can do anything and know everything...... but maybe because of that, I hadn’t really done anything, and perhaps I didn’t truly know anything either.]","[Uh...... I’m not sure I follow?]","Was this some kind of philosophical discussion? As I tilted my head, unable to grasp the intent behind Tiana-san’s curious phrasing, she let out a genuinely cheerful laugh.","[Fufufu, that was a rather roundabout way of putting it. Just like you said, among us World Creators, there are plenty who possess omniscience, and plenty who can see the future. But perhaps because of that...... we forgot something as obvious as the fact that the future can be changed. We never struggled to change it, and we couldn’t even do something as simple as reaching out for what we desired.]","[.................]","[Maybe that’s why? Watching you, worrying, suffering, losing your way...... not advancing in the most efficient manner, but struggling as you reached out with everything you had for what you wanted...... and, pushed forward by so many feelings, finally grasping it, was unbearably dazzling. Even though I knew everything through omniscience, you made me realize that I hadn’t truly understood anything...... In your back, as you walked toward the future, I saw hope.]","It was, in a way, the highest form of praise. Because she knew everything and could do anything, she had learned something she never truly understood...... They're words of gratitude from the bottom of her heart.","[That’s why, not just me, but many World Creators adore you, Kaito-kun. Of course, that includes the fact that you became the catalyst for Nebula’s revival, and the great feat of defeating Shallow Vernal in your own way. But even without Nebula or Shallow Vernal, I can say with absolute confidence that we’re your fans...... though, I suppose I’ve made it sound more complicated than it really is. In truth, it’s very simple...... Thanks to you, I’m genuinely excited about the future ahead...... so, thank you. That’s all there is to it.]","As she said this, Tiana-san smiled warmly. Her hair swayed in the breeze, and a soft, clear chime rang out. How should I say this...... it felt a little embarrassing, but hearing those words spoken so sincerely...... honestly made me happy.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Errr, so basically, that means the Tiana arc is wrapping up for now, right? Then next is......?]","??? : [Lilia-san, Sieg-san, Anima-san, Illness-san...... an amusement park trip with four lovers plus the rest of the group.]","Serious-senpai : [......I think...... I’m gonna go lie down for a bit.]"]},{"number":2541,"title":"Chapter 2541: A Conversation about the Tea Party ~ ~ Jutia ~ ~","paragraphs":["Regarding the tea party I decided to host on a whim after being invited to Eris-san’s tea gathering, things worked out one way or another, and we managed to gather around the 10 people I had originally expected.","So I could start properly thinking about the schedule and details, but before that, there were two more people...... among the people I know, two of the biggest tea lovers, Ein-san and Jutia-san, that I figured I should at least invite.","That said, to be honest, I don’t think Ein-san would participate. She has an exceptionally strong dedication to being a maid, to the point that I simply can’t picture her attending a tea party as a guest.","She might be interested if it were in the role of serving, but as someone being invited? I can confidently say that’s practically impossible.","[Hehh, tea from another world...... amazing, amazing! I’m super interested, y’know. But, but, it looks like I won’t get a chance to drink it, what a shame!]","[The taste was kind of like fruit tea, but since it was made from a bouquet of flowers, I’m not even sure if it should really be called tea.]","[Other worlds really are fascinating.]","And so, I first came to ask Jutia-san. Despite the sudden visit, she warmly welcomed me, and we started off with some light conversation while drinking the tea she brewed.","She seemed extremely curious about the otherworld tea Tiana-san had let me try, but that had only been possible because it was just the two of us at the time. In reality, there are probably complications due to contracts with Shiro-san and such. Jutia-san seemed to understand that as well, so while clearly intrigued, she also appeared to accept that she wouldn’t be able to drink it herself.","[......Anyway, changing the subject a bit...... I’m actually thinking of hosting a tea party soon......]","[Fumu fumu.]","I moved on to the main topic and explained the tea party in detail, including the participants. That said, nothing concrete had been decided yet, I only told her that I planned to hold one and who would likely be attending.","After hearing me out, Jutia-san crossed her arms and made a troubled expression.","[Hmmmm...... a tea party hosted by Kaito, there’d probably be special blends, maybe even new ones...... I’m very, very interested, y’know. But, but, but still, no can do...... With that lineup of participants and my status, I can’t very well attend while disregarding Lillywood-sama.]","[Ahh~~ is it something like maintaining balance among the Six Kings’ subordinates?]","[With Kuromueina-sama, Shallow Vernal-sama, Otherworld, the Emperor of the Archlesia Empire, and even the Founder...... in a situation like that, for me, a mere Executive under the World King, to attend while Lillywood-sama, my actual King herself, does not...... even if there’s no issue outwardly, it just doesn’t sit right with me personally. I’m really, really, really interested in the tea that would be served, and I’m struggling so, so, so much with this, but...... I’ll have to pass this time.]","She was clearly extremely interested in both the tea party and the tea itself, but with figures who could be considered the very top of their respective worlds, like Kuro and Shiro-san, gathering there, she didn’t feel comfortable disregarding Lillywood-san.","Even if it’s not an official event, it’s probably a complicated matter from her perspective. She still seemed reluctant, as even after saying she wouldn’t attend, she looked like she was still wavering......","[One option would be to invite Lillywood-san too, but since she doesn’t eat or drink, inviting her to a tea party might actually be rude...... In that case, although the details aren’t set yet, if I end up serving new tea leaves or special blends at the party, I’ll give you some afterward, Jutia-san.]","[Really!? That would make me so, so happy but...... is that okay? Is it really okay? I always end up receiving so many things from Kaito, I feel kind of bad about it, y’know.]","With a smile that seemed to mix joy and a hint of guilt, Jutia-san really was...... well, remarkably decent. Compared to Ein-san, who, upon hearing about new tea leaves, would immediately try to barge in and end up getting scolded by Kuro, the difference in self-control was honestly impressive.","[Please don’t worry about it. You’ve always been very kind to me too, Jutia-san.]","[You think so? You really think so? If you say that, then I’ll gladly accept your offer, y’know.]","[Yes. Well, it’s not certain yet that there’ll be new blends or anything...... but if there are, I’ll make sure to set some aside for you.]","Ein-san would probably be after the same thing anyway, so it might be quicker to start by telling her that even if she doesn’t attend, I’d give her some of the tea leaves used at the party.","While I was thinking that, Jutia-san stood up from her chair and came right next to me. She made a small beckoning gesture...... or rather, a motion as if asking me to lower my posture. When I leaned down slightly...... She suddenly wrapped her arms around my head in an embrace.","A soft forest-like fragrance spread through the air, accompanied by a gentle warmth and the softness of her body. One of her hands rested on my head, stroking it tenderly.","[Thank you, truly, for everything. I really, really like how kind you are. I hope, at least a little, that my gratitude reaches you.]","They say the scent of the forest has a calming effect, and it really did feel that way...... like being in a sunlit woodland, warm and at ease. Though a bit surprised, I let myself sink into that comforting sensation for a while.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Isn’t she actually pretty proactive!? I mean, she’s got initiative, or rather, her affection for Kaito is so high that she just casually hugs him and clings to him! It really feels like things are about to get super sweet, so I’d honestly like her to tone it down......]"]},{"number":2542,"title":"Chapter 2542: A Conversation about the Tea Party ~ ~ Ein ~ ~","paragraphs":["After that, I followed up with Jutia-san and went to visit Ein-san, bringing up the idea of the tea party. Of course, I made sure to tell her beforehand that if I prepared new tea leaves, I would gift some to her as well.","[Yes...... I had already heard about it from Kuromu-sama, but just as Kaito-sama conjectured, it would be unthinkable for me, a mere maid, to attend the tea party as a guest...... much less sit at the same table as my master, Kuromu-sama.]","[Yeah, figures.]","[And I suspect that you were perhaps hoping I would participate as part of the serving staff, Kaito-sama...... however, while I may have acted as support staff during the housewarming celebration before, serving at a tea party hosted by one’s master is, for a maid, a role of pride and honor...... one could even call it a starring position. In that case, I have no intention of committing the barbaric act of taking away a stage where the maids themselves should shine, as an outsider.]","In the Maid World, was serving at a tea party really such a coveted job? I didn’t really understand, but anything related to maids usually went over my head anyway, so it was safest just to let it go.","In any case, it seemed Ein-san had no intention of participating even as part of the serving staff.","[If, hypothetically, the maid serving at your residence did not meet the standards required to serve tea to Kuromu-sama, I might have stepped in. However, with someone as capable as Illness, there would be no issue whatsoever. In fact, if her skills were insufficient, then it would be a situation where only I or Shalltear could handle.]","[I see...... well, either way, that means you won’t be attending, Ein-san.]","[Indeed. Rather, I can only be grateful for your consideration in offering me the tea leaves to be served at the party, Kaito-sama. Since it will be the first tea party you host, Nebula-sama will surely prepare tea leaves worthy of the occasion, so I find myself looking forward to it already.]","[I haven’t really thought that far ahead yet, so it’s something I’ll figure out from here......]","After wrapping up our discussion about the tea party like that, Ein-san didn’t seem to have anything urgent to attend to, so we continued chatting casually.","[By the way, Kuromu-sama had a rather curious seasoning with her.]","[Ahh, that was made using the Star Powder Generator we got from Tiana-san.]","[She seems to be quite looking forward to it. For the past few days, she’s been taking out a new seasoning at set times and happily testing it on baby castellas.]","Apparently, she had already started exploring the potential of baby castellas...... At this rate, she might show up soon with baby castellas made with star powder.","That said, the star powder really does seem capable of producing all kinds of flavors. I tried it myself and ended up with a very spicy seasoning. It felt like something that would go perfectly with curry, so I was thinking of trying it next time...... though I rarely get the chance to eat curry in the first place.","There are hardly any curry shops in the Symphonia Kingdom. It seems there are some in the Hydra Kingdom, so I’d like to visit sometime, but I doubt they’d allow outside seasonings...... Maybe it’d be better to have Alice make it instead.","[......Tea from a bouquet?]","[Well, it’s not exactly tea, but it tasted pretty similar. Apparently, it uses some kind of otherworld technique called atomic transformation, so it’d probably be hard to recreate.]","[As expected of another world, I suppose...... there truly are astonishing items. Speaking of otherworld tea, Shalltear once brewed a rather peculiar tea for me before.]","[A peculiar taste?]","[Yes, she called it something like kokucha, or pu'er tea. It was quite dark in color...... I imagine the fermentation process must be different.]","[Ah, pu'er tea...... I’ve never had it myself, but I’ve heard of it.]","Was it Chinese tea? I’d only ever really had oolong tea, but I’d heard they had all sorts of varieties, so it was probably one of those.","From Ein-san’s reaction, it didn’t seem to fall under the category of black tea, so to her, it was more like an unusual curiosity from another world rather than something she particularly wanted.","Even with that bouquet-based tea from earlier, she seemed interested but not desirous of it...... It felt like her true passion was reserved solely for black tea.","[Kaito-sama, this may be a bit of a sudden change of topic...... but if you haven’t had lunch yet, would you like to dine here?]","[Is that okay? Well then, I’ll gladly take you up on the offer.]","[Would curry be acceptable?]","[Oh, that’s exactly what I was just thinking...... Eh? How did you know?]","[Anticipating one's desires is a basic accomplishment for a maid...... fumu.]","Ein-san, who had just offered to prepare the very curry I’d been craving moments ago, seemed like she was about to launch into her usual \"maids can do anything\" philosophy, but for some reason, she trailed off mid-sentence, her expression turning thoughtful......","[......If it’s for someone you cherish, you can tell what they want just by looking at their face.]","With that, she gave a slightly mischievous smile and a light wink, before going off to prepare the curry.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......This one's also got pretty high affection for him......]"]},{"number":2543,"title":"Chapter 2543: A Conversation About the Tea Party ~ ~ The One with Stomachache 1 ~ ~","paragraphs":["Eris Dia Hamilton, the heir of the Hamilton Marquisdom of the Archlesia Empire. Known as a gifted young lady of the Hamilton house and admired in high society as a perfect noblewoman, she was currently walking through the streets of the Imperial Capital, Alexandria.","Rather than her usual refined dress, she wore practical trousers in a pants-style outfit, paired with an elegant shirt and jacket. A casquette rested on her head, and with only a single maid in plain clothes as her escort, she walked through the city on foot instead of riding in a carriage.","[It might be fair to say that strolling through the city is one of Milady’s hobbies. Though I do wonder whether it suits a noble lady......]","[There are stories that even the legendary first Emperor of the Archlesia Empire would go out among the people dressed in a way that made her look no different from a village girl. And Her Majesty Chris, the current Emperor, often visits locations in person for inspections. A truly noble aristocrat must not rely solely on written reports, they must broaden their perspective by seeing the world firsthand.]","[I see...... and your real reason?]","[......Listen carefully, when it comes to stress, realizing it already exists is far too late. By the time you become aware of it, it has already begun to affect you in various ways. Stomachaches, stomachaches, stomach pain, agonizing stomach pain...... If one wishes to properly control it, a change of pace is essential.]","[Fumu, so in other words?]","[......I’m very tired. I just want a break.]","Eris had always preferred going into the city on her own two feet, and thinking back, it was during a visit to see the Founding Festival that she had first met Kaito.","Not as the daughter of a marquis, but simply as Eris, an individual. These strolls were an enjoyable pastime for her. Especially recently, with the Marquis Hamilton Faction in such a hectic state, she had needed a chance to relax, which was why she had come out into the city like this.","Of course, she made sure to complete all necessary duties perfectly before making time for herself, another testament to her competence.","[Well, Milady walking through the city is nothing unusual...... though if you’re trying to pass as a common town girl, you might be just a bit too refined......]","[I’m not actually trying to disguise myself as a town girl, you know? If I were seriously acting the part, that would be one thing, but simply changing my clothes won’t hide the fact that I’m a noble, or at least from a wealthy family. It would be obvious from my behavior. So I choose my outfit with the mindset of a noble lady enjoying a quiet outing. I’m not even hiding the royal color, after all......]","[The royal color, you mean your deep blue hair.]","[......Well, that was apparently just something an Emperor from seven generations ago declared during a succession dispute. The first and second Emperors didn’t even have this hair color, from what I’ve heard.]","After replying with a wry smile to her maid’s remark, Eris stopped at a nearby stall, bought two sticks of sweets, handed one to the maid, and began eating with a bright smile.","[Confections that require time and effort are wonderful, but something simple like this is refreshing in its own way. Though it did take me some time to get used to eating while walking......]","[As long as Milady is enjoying herself, that’s what matters. You’ve been quite busy lately.]","[I’ll continue to be busy as well...... The Marquis Hamilton Faction’s rise has been far too rapid. It gives too strong an impression of being a sudden, undeserved windfall...... That’s the problem. Of course, high-ranking nobles who gather proper information will understand that it’s not so much our doing, but rather the overwhelming influence of Kaito-sama. However, lower-ranking nobles in the provinces will surely envy the Ritch Barony. To them, it will look like we simply hit the jackpot...... like a lottery, was it? In any case, it's as if we made a fortune through pure luck. The hardships of those involved are not easily understood.]","[It wouldn’t be surprising if they thought that switching to the Hamilton faction might bring them the same fortune......]","[For lower-ranking nobles, factions are something they’d gladly change if it benefits them. But the high-ranking nobles won’t find that amusing, and if the balance of power between factions collapses, it will disrupt many things. If it were like the Albert Duchy of the Symphonia Kingdom, so overwhelmingly dominant that others have given up trying to compete, it would be a different matter...... but we’re not at that level.]","At present, within the Marquis Hamilton Faction, the Hamilton Marquisdom, the Sharon County, and the Ritch Barony are gaining profits and valuable connections at an astonishing pace, drawing far too much attention from the nobility.","Of course, Marquis Hamilton and Eris are handling the situation well, and with Emperor Chris cooperating and coordinating alongside them, everything is being controlled to prevent any negative consequences...... however, while the benefits are truly tremendous, it’s also incredibly exhausting and a constant source of headaches, and stomachaches.","[Well, I’ll put those stomach-churning matters aside for now and focus on properly refreshing myself......]","As Eris muttered that and turned her gaze down the street, she suddenly locked eyes with someone who had just come around the corner and froze.","[......Arehh? Eris-san?]","[......T- T- T- This is quite the coincidence...... Kaito-sama.]","Yes, the one who had suddenly appeared before her was Kaito, and while Eris somehow managed to respond with a smile, she was screaming internally.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......Actually attaching that 1 there...... Do you not have a human heart?]","~ ~ Extra: Eris’ Personal Maid ~ ~","A maid who often accompanies Eris while also serving as her bodyguard. Originally, she was a highly skilled intelligence agent belonging to the covert division. Not only is she exceptional in that field, but her abilities as a maid are also outstanding, boasting a Maid Power of 96,000. She is even considered a potential candidate for the next Super Maid, though she has never participated in the Maid Olympia.","This is not because she lacks interest in the Maid World like Illness. Rather, her ideal maid is one who “provides perfect support subtly, like a shadow”. Because of that, she does not participate in attention-grabbing events like the Maid Olympia (though she does go to watch as a spectator).","Even when Eris is speaking with Kaito, she quietly steps back and waits at a distance, this too is the result of adhering to her own vision of the ideal maid.","The style she strives for is essentially the position held by Alice, who serves as Kaito’s guard. Watching how Alice supports Kaito from the shadows, she is inwardly moved, thinking “This is exactly the ideal form I should aim for.”"]},{"number":2544,"title":"Chapter 2544 - A Conversation About the Tea Party ~ ~ The One with Stomachache 2 ~ ~","paragraphs":["Alexandria, the Imperial Capital of the Archlesia Empire, was, as one would expect of a capital, an immensely vast city. Within such a sprawling place, the chances of randomly running into Kaito, whose main base of activity lay in the foreign nation of the Symphonia Kingdom, on an ordinary street, with no prior arrangement and not even in a high-end shopping district, would normally be so low as to not even merit consideration.","......And yet, it was precisely such improbabilities that seemed to bend themselves around the singularity that is Miyama Kaito.","[Hello, what a coincidence. Your attire is different from usual, Eris-san...... though come to think of it, when I first came to set up a stall at the Founding Festival, you were dressed somewhat similarly.]","[Y- Yes, well...... learning about the lives of common people is also an important form of study, and it serves as a good change of pace for me as well, so I come here like this from time to time. It was the same when I stopped by your stall, Kaito-sama. Are you out shopping for something?]","Though the encounter was nothing short of astonishingly improbable, Eris had witnessed Kaito’s tendency to defy common sense on numerous occasions. If the other party was Kaito, then even such a chance meeting felt oddly plausible.","Still, Kaito’s purpose remained unclear, and she decided to ask him about it.","(......I do have information that Kaito-sama visits Alexandria from time to time, but his destinations are usually pet-related shops...... and there aren’t any such stores around here. As far as I know, none of his acquaintances live in this area either......)","The street where Eris and Kaito had run into each other was of decent size, with a number of shops lining it...... but it wasn’t lively enough to be called a main street, and it didn’t seem like the kind of place that would have anything Kaito was looking for.","[Ahh, I was asked by someone I know to try out a shop...... well, more like a place that’s going to open soon, and give my impressions. I’m on my way there now.]","[I see, so that’s the case...... I have a general grasp of the high-end shopping districts and establishments connected to the nobility, but I wasn’t aware of any new businesses opening in this area.]","[Well, it’s less a shop and more like...... a facility...... errr......]","At Eris’ words, Kaito paused, seemingly pondering about something. After a brief silence, he spoke again, looking slightly apologetic.","[......Um, Eris-san. Sorry to ask this out of the blue, but do you happen to have some time right now?]","[Eh? Yes, I don’t have any particular plans.]","[The place I’m heading to, it’s based on something called a gym from the world I used to live in. To put it simply, it’s a place with various magic tools for exercise, where you pay a certain amount each month to go and work out.]","[I see...... While one could exercise anywhere if one wants to, properly equipping oneself with high-quality magic tools would require a considerable expense. In that sense, going to a facility where such equipment is already provided does seem quite reasonable.]","The place Kaito was heading to was a gym created by Nidzveld, an idea that originally stemmed from a casual conversation with Kaito.","As a kind of trial run, Nidzveld decided to open one gym each in the Demon Realm and the Human Realm. In the Demon Realm, she chose Battle City, where many subordinates of the War King favored such activities. In the Human Realm, given the Dragon King faction’s strong ties to the Archlesia Empire, she decided to establish it there.","And so, she asked Kaito, who had firsthand experience with other world gyms, to try it out and provide feedback on whether everything was functioning properly. Having agreed, Kaito was now on his way to the soon-to-open gym.","[Yes, so the gym in the Human Realm was made for Humans, and she’d prefer to have both a man and a woman try it out if possible. I originally thought of inviting Aoi-chan or Hina-chan, but their schedules didn’t line up because of their adventurer training, so I was on my way there alone......]","[If it’s acceptable for me, then you’d like me, as a human woman, to try it out myself. I have no objections. I’m quite interested in this gym facility, and I’m not particularly bad at exercise either.]","[Thank you. Then let’s head there together.]","Eris readily accepted Kaito’s proposal. She had gone out in the first place to take a break, and she figured that moving her body and getting some exercise would be a refreshing change of pace as well.","[Do you usually exercise a lot, Eris-san?]","[Even as a noble, a certain level of physical fitness is necessary. There are things like dancing, and I also practice basic self-defense. Of course, it’s nothing refined enough for actual combat, but it’s sufficient to protect myself in situations where my guards cannot immediately intervene.]","[......Just out of curiosity, does that mean you’ve ever actually been targeted or attacked?]","[Hardly ever. At least, I’ve never experienced such a thing myself. Long ago, when the struggle for the imperial throne was more intense, it seems assassinations were quite rampant within the empire. But nowadays, I’ve never heard of anything like that.]","Walking side by side, Kaito and Eris continued toward the gym, chatting casually along the way.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [No matter how much you exercise, you can’t train your stomach...... and that’s just kind of sad.]"]},{"number":2545,"title":"Chapter 2545 - A Conversation About the Tea Party ~ ~ The One with Stomachache 3 ~ ~","paragraphs":["<An important notice regarding stuff hereafter has been posted in the Activity Report>","※This does not mean the updates would be stopped","I’ll also write a simplified version here:","・I’m planning to change from daily updates to updating every other day soon","・I want to serialize a new work (side story), so I plan to alternate updates between the two","・The protagonist of the new work will be Eulpecula.","<Activity Report>","Thank you as always.","Currently, I’ve been updating daily, but I’m planning to change the schedule to “every other day” in the near future. It’s not because daily updates have become too difficult or anything like that, rather, I want to start serializing a new work, and doing that alongside daily updates would be tough, so I’m thinking of alternating updates between the two.","Well, calling it a “new work” might not be quite accurate...... it’s more like a side story...... I’m planning to serialize <Six☆Stars>, which I’ve already written twice as extra chapters, aiming to start sometime in April if possible.","In my current concept, the setting will be [Trinia about 100 years after the present main story], with Eulpecula as the main protagonist, alongside the Six Stars plus Isis. While the main story focuses on the Human Realm due to Kaito’s daily life, this one is planned to center on the Demon Realm.","That said, much of this is still in the planning stage, so details and the exact start date haven’t been finalized yet. I’m hoping to begin sometime in April though.","That’s about it, and I appreciate your continued support.","As she walked alongside Kaito toward the gym, Eris began asking questions about their destination. Since it was her first time visiting such a facility, she wanted to have at least a basic understanding of it beforehand.","[By the way, who was it that asked Kaito-sama to come try this out?]","[Frea-san...... errr, one of the Four Great Demon Dragons, Freabell Nidzveld.]","[I see. I have heard that Nidzveld-sama sometimes invests in innovative shops and businesses without regard for profitability, so it makes sense that she would be the one to start something like this.]","There was no real surprise at hearing Nidzveld’s name. After all, the person in question was the World’s Singularity, Kaito. Even if the name of one of the Six Kings’ Executives came up, it wouldn’t be strange when it involved him.","Moreover, Nidzveld favored those with ambition and a drive to improve, and as long as someone possessed genuine passion, she would support even challenges that seemed like mere pipe dreams.","Of course, not everything succeeded, but Eris had heard that many had achieved great success thanks to Nidzveld’s backing and encouragement. So even for someone as knowledgeable as Eris, it wasn’t particularly surprising that this gym, something she was hearing about for the first time, was being led by Nidzveld.","[Oh, but it seems Frea-san will be attending an event in a city in the Demon Realm today as Magnawell-san’s representative, so one of her subordinates will be showing us around.]","Eris nodded at Kaito’s words, but due to past experiences, a faint sense of suspicion crept into her thoughts. Given that it was Kaito, and a newly opened facility connected to one of the Six Kings’ Executives, she had been prepared for a possible encounter with Nidzveld. However, from the way Kaito spoke, it didn’t seem like they would be meeting her at the gym.","Of course, that was much kinder on Eris’ stomach, but past experience told her not to let her guard down. Just because Nidzveld wasn’t there didn’t mean they wouldn’t run into another of the Six Kings’ Executives. She steeled herself, firmly preparing for anything.","If Lilia, who knew even more about Kaito than Eris, had been present, she would surely have desperately told her “It’s exactly when you’re on full alert like this that nothing happens! It’s when you let your guard down, like after finishing at the gym and relaxing, that he strikes!!!”......","But Eris had no way of knowing that. And so, continuing their light conversation, she and Kaito headed toward their destination.","The gym they arrived at was a fairly large facility, built on an expansive plot of land.","(Quite a large scale...... but if one considers exercising inside, perhaps this size is necessary. It might resemble a knights’ training ground, or perhaps something closer to a RINGTOSS arena......)","As she imagined the interior based on the exterior, the entrance door opened, and a Leopard Beastman Demon appeared, bowing toward Kaito.","[Welcome, big bro! Thank you for taking the time to come today! Oi, you lot! The big bro is here! Stop what you’re doing and line up!!]","[Hello, Namir-san...... no, there’s really no need to line up......]","At the loud announcement of the Beastman Demon...... Namir, who had met Kaito several times before, others belonging to the Crimson Fang rushed out from inside the gym and neatly lined up in front of Kaito and Eris, bowing their heads in unison.","Though Eris was inwardly surprised, Kaito merely gave a wry smile, as if already somewhat used to this kind of reaction.","[Errr, I said I’d be coming alone, but I happened to run into an acquaintance on the way. Since she’s a Human woman, I thought it would be perfect, so I asked her to come along...... is that alright?]","[Of course! In fact, we’re grateful. We’ve prepared workout clothes for both men and women! The plan is to first have you change into the exercise clothes we’ve provided so your current outfits don’t get dirty. Then we’ll give you a brief tour of the gym with explanations, and after that, you’ll try things out yourselves. Does that sound alright?]","[Yes, that’s fine.]","[I have no objections either.]","After Kaito and Eris confirmed they had no issues with the explanation, Namir nodded once before turning to his subordinates.","[......Alright then, I’ll guide the big bro myself, so you lot guide the big bro’s “wife”!]","[Ah, n- no, I’m not Kaito-sama’s wife......]","[Oh, my apologies. You lot! Make sure you show no disrespect to the big bro’s lover! Now then, big bro, this way please!]","[......No, that’s not it either......]","Just as she thought she had cleared up the misunderstanding, it turned out she hadn’t at all. The realization made Eris freeze for a brief moment, and she missed her chance to correct it.","As for Kaito, he had already learned from dealing with people like Blossom and Lanza that it was better to calmly correct this sort of thing later. So he told Eris, “I’ll explain it to them later”, before heading off with Namir.","(......No, um...... he shouted that here...... outside the facility...... there are people around. Well...... I suppose this isn’t a high-end district, so it’s unlikely any noble acquaintances would overhear...... so it should be fine...... but still, I’m starting to feel like, in social circles, I’m genuinely being recognized as Kaito-sama’s mistress or lover......)","<Afterword>","~ ~ Beastman Demon Namir ~ ~","A Leopard Beastman Demon who has appeared from time to time when Nidzveld meets Kaito, and serves as a squad leader of the Crimson Fang. A Viscount-rank Demon, he gives off more of an “underling” vibe rather than a proper subordinate, according to Kaito, he’s somewhat similar to Blossom and Lanza. His voice is extremely loud, so the remark about “Eris being Kaito’s lover” could be heard from quite a distance.","(T/N: Namir’s gender is unknown at the moment, as they hadn’t been referred to with any gender specific pronouns, but as he’s got a masculine name according to google, he’s now a male. Feels like he’s just a side chara anyway.)"]},{"number":2546,"title":"Chapter 2546: A Conversation About the Tea Party ~ ~ The One with Stomachache 4 ~ ~","paragraphs":["Guided by a member of the Crimson Fang, Eris made her way to the changing room. After receiving a brief explanation, she selected clothes in her size from those arranged by measurement and began to change.","The personal maid who had accompanied her was someone who took pride in maintaining the proper demeanor of a maid who remains in the background, and thus would almost never participate in such activities alongside her master.","If her master, Eris, wished it, she would engage in casual conversation or friendly exchanges, but otherwise she was the type to keep an appropriate distance and remain on standby. This time as well, she politely declined invitations from Kaito and the Dragon King’s subordinates, and was currently waiting in front of the changing room.","Since the outfit was meant for going out into the city and did not require assistance to change into, Eris herself showed no particular concern and calmly used a locker in the changing room to change on her own.","(......Not something that clings tightly to the skin, but rather a design with some room to it, made from materials with excellent elasticity and breathability...... It seems suited not for short bursts of intense activity like competitions, but for lighter exercise sustained over a certain period of time. It’s also quite easy to move in, and the lack of ornamentation actually makes it more suitable for athletic use. Overall, these are very good clothes.)","The outfit that had been prepared was a tracksuit inspired by Kaito’s descriptions, making it something rather unusual from Eris’s perspective.","Even so, she found it highly suitable for exercise, and with a somewhat impressed expression, she continued changing.","(There are long pants and ones that go above the knee...... perhaps the shorter ones are more suitable for more intense exercise? Since I won’t be doing anything that serious this time, and they expose more skin, I’ll go with the longer ones. If I were to wear the shorter ones, it might be best to prepare darker tights to reduce skin exposure.)","After finishing changing into the tracksuit, she tied her semi-long hair into a short ponytail so it wouldn’t get in the way. She then stored her removed clothes in a magic box before stepping out of the changing room to meet up with Kaito.","[My apologies. Have I kept you waiting?]","[No, I just got here myself. That hairstyle suits you too, Eris-san. Actually, you have this overall elegance, like you’re even wearing a tracksuit in a refined way. It’s kind of amazing.]","[Thank you for the compliment. Kaito-sama, your attire is also quite wonderful compared to your usual style. By the way, is this that so-called \"tracksuit\"? It’s my first time wearing one, but it’s very easy to move in.]","[In my world, people often wear those when exercising. Like you said, they’re easy to move in, so people who aren’t into fashion sometimes just wear them as everyday clothes too.]","[I see. That broadens my knowledge.]","Eris, who often appeared at social gatherings, was already accustomed to both giving and receiving compliments. She accepted Kaito’s praise with a smile, returned it in kind, and naturally kept the conversation flowing.","......To Kaito, that gave her the impression of being \"easy to talk to\", and through the accumulation of such small details, it led to him wondering \"Why does she seem to like me this much?\", tilting his head in confusion even as she enjoyed the benefits...... along with quite a lot of stomachaches...... However, expecting him to realize such a thing would be asking too much.","[Well then, you two, this way, please...... I’ll begin by giving you a brief tour of the facility.]","With those words, Namir began guiding them through the facility while offering light explanations, and Kaito and Eris followed behind her as they looked around.","For Kaito, many of the facilities resembled the gyms he was familiar with, so there was little novelty. For Eris, however, it was a rather curious sight, and she wore an expression of clear interest.","(......Aside from the magic tools in my household meant for light exercise, there are also quite expensive ones here capable of applying considerable load through magic. So it’s designed not just for light exercise, but also for fairly serious training. In that case, it’s likely aimed at a fairly broad range of people. Not just ordinary citizens, but perhaps even adventurers as well?)","Eris herself was quite sharp, and since she also managed several businesses, she found herself contemplating various possibilities as she observed the facility.","[......It seems quite a wide range of exercises can be performed here.]","[Yes, that’s correct. We’ve prepared equipment not only for light exercise suited to those unaccustomed to working out, but also for high-load training that would be difficult to do individually. Of course, everything is adjusted for Humans, so for Peerage Holders, it likely wouldn’t be sufficient for real training......]","[From what Frea-san mentioned, it sounds like you’re planning to build a gym where even more intense training can be done, depending on how things go?]","[Yes, that does seem to be my big sis’ intention, but...... her usual training is insanely extreme, so when she says \"intense training\", she basically means something that would normally kill you, so adjusting that is proving quite difficult...... Ah, please keep what I said a secret from her.]","While answering Eris and Kaito’s questions, Namir continued guiding them through the facility, and after giving them a general tour, it was time to actually begin exercising.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [For even her subordinates to describe her training to be so harsh it feels downright insane...... well, I suppose that’s very much like Nidzveld......]","? ? ? : [She doesn’t force it on her subordinates and treats it as personal training...... so at least she’s kinder than that gorilla who ends up killing her people during training and just opts to revive them.]"]},{"number":2547,"title":"Chapter 2547: A Conversation About the Tea Party ~ ~ The One with Stomachache 5 ~ ~","paragraphs":["She must have really liked the concept. Ever since I told Frea-san about gyms before, she created one in an astonishingly short amount of time.","Not only that, but while asking me various things about gyms, she even went ahead and made the tracksuits I mentioned, and apparently plans to lend them out and sell them as well.","The quality of these tracksuits is quite high and they’re easy to move in, to the point that if I can buy one today, I’m seriously considering taking one home. It would be perfect for the morning jogs I do with Hina-chan.","......Though, thinking about it, Hina-chan would definitely want one too, but I don’t know her size. In this world, even if they're humanoid, some species can have large builds, so they don’t just use simple S, M, L sizing. You really have to try them on to be sure.","I have a rough idea of Hina-chan’s height, so I could probably pick something that seems about right, but...... well, not in any improper sense, just as a simple fact, Hina-chan is quite well-developed around the chest, so it might be better to go one size up. I’ll bring her along next time and buy one for her.","Speaking of tracksuits, Eris-san actually looks surprisingly good in one...... or rather, maybe it’s because her posture is so proper and dignified, but she somehow makes anything she wears look stylish.","Even through the tracksuit, you can tell that the areas that should stand out do, and the areas that should be slim are slim, she definitely has an excellent figure.","And that’s probably because she takes great care of herself on a daily basis to maintain it.","Right now, she’s loosening up her body with some light stretching before exercising, and watching her movements...... she gives off the impression of being quite used to physical activity, so she must work out regularly.","She clearly puts in a great deal of effort, yet she doesn’t flaunt it or act superior because of it, that really makes her a genuinely good person, someone I can honestly respect.","[......Is my movement strange?]","[Ah, no, sorry. It’s just that you seem really used to moving your body, like you’re accustomed to exercise, so I ended up watching.]","Noticing my gaze, Eris-san tilted her head, so I hurriedly tried to explain myself. I had no improper intentions, it was pure admiration, but staring at a woman while she’s stretching is completely harassment.","After hearing my explanation, Eris-san looked understanding, then gently smiled and spoke.","[Ahh, I see...... Well, from the usual image of a noble lady, it’s not surprising if I don’t seem like someone who’s familiar with exercise.]","[Indeed, Eris-san has this sheltered, refined lady kind of aura, so it’s hard to picture you exercising much...... But when I think about it, you dance at balls and need to maintain a good figure to wear dresses beautifully, so it wouldn’t be strange if you worked out regularly.]","[That’s right. Of course, there are noble ladies just like you imagine who are completely unaccustomed to exercise...... but in the end, even nobles rely on their bodies, so a certain level of stamina is necessary. I also try to exercise regularly. However...... if I overdo it and gain too much muscle, my build becomes too thick, so I adjust accordingly.]","[......Ahh, so too much exercise isn’t good either...... That sounds tough.]","Maintaining an ideal figure really does seem difficult.","Come to think of it, Lilia-san is incredibly strong but still slender, and from what I could see when we bathed together, she didn’t look particularly muscular, so she might be carefully managing it too. But even without any physical enhancement, Lilia-san seems quite strong...... maybe it’s something like muscle density being different.","[Thinking about it that way, Life-san’s Blessing might be the perfect effect for noble ladies.]","[That’s true. Being able to naturally maintain one’s ideal physique, revert to a chosen age, and even become ageless...... there would be many who long for such a thing. That said, it’s not something that can be obtained with money.]","[......Come to think of it, Eris-san, you’ve received a Provisional Blessing from Life-san, right?]","[Yes. Thanks to that, maintaining my physique has become much easier. Since it’s only a Provisional Blessing, it doesn’t mean I can always remain in my ideal form, but it provides various benefits to the body, so I’m very grateful for it.]","[I see......]","For example, if Life-san were to grant her a True Blessing, then Eris-san would be able to maintain her ideal figure effortlessly. Well, knowing her personality, she’d probably still keep up her daily exercise anyway......","[Still, it depends on Life-san, but if you were to receive a True Blessing someday, that would be a huge help for Eris-san.]","[......K- Kaito-sama? Um, well, I understand what you mean, and I agree, but...... how should I put it? When you say things like that, it feels like they might actually come true...... I- It looks like we’re warmed up now, shall we start exercising?]","[Eh? Ah, yes. Let’s do that......]","It felt like she unusually hurried to change the subject...... but then again, when it comes to receiving a True Blessing from a Supreme God, it’s probably something that inspires a sense of awe. And whether or not to grant such a Blessing is up to Life-san, so it’s not really something we can discuss freely here.","For a noble lady, it’s not just about maintaining her figure, she probably pays a great deal of attention to beauty as well...... and that got me thinking: the shampoo made from the Fruit of the World Tree makes Bell’s fur incredibly beautiful and glossy...... so if it were adjusted properly, maybe something for humans could be made too? I've got plenty of Fruits of Nebula's World Tree, so maybe I’ll ask Alice about it next time.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Good job realizing that receiving a True Blessing from a Supreme God is something to be in awe of! ......Or so I thought, but now this guy’s trying to develop a bomb in a completely different direction!? Thanks to Nebula, he can get as many World Tree-related materials as he wants, so this Stomachache Devil's sense of normalcy is totally broken......]","? ? ? : [His favorability toward Eris-san being so high is what’s causing this. Since he likes her so much, he probably just has a strong urge to be of help somehow...... Well then, shall we have some wine?]"]},{"number":2548,"title":"Chapter 2548: A Conversation About the Tea Party ~ ~ The One with Stomachache 6 ~ ~","paragraphs":["After finishing the stretches, Eris-san and I once again received an explanation from Namir-san about the equipment and facilities.","[Now then, let me give you a brief explanation. First, regarding the equipment in this room, please try using it without activating any Body Reinforcement Magic. Since many Humans are unable to use magic, the equipment in this room has been designed based on the physical capabilities of a body without enhancement. The equipment in the other room, on the other hand, is meant to be used while under the effects of Body Reinforcement Magic. The order will be to first try the equipment in this room, and then, after using Body Reinforcement Magic, move on to the equipment in the other room.]","It was only natural, but the presence or absence of Body Reinforcement Magic had a massive impact on physical ability. For example, if Hina-chan used Body Reinforcement Magic, she could shatter even a massive boulder with her bare hands, but if we had an arm-wrestling match without enhancement, I would probably win.","That was how significant the effect of Body Reinforcement Magic was, so it made sense that there would be equipment tailored to each condition. As expected of Frea-san, it seemed everything had been prepared with consideration for how magic is learned and used in the Human Realm.","[I’ll assist you during the trial, so if anything becomes dangerous, I’ll step in immediately. Please don’t worry. If you have no questions, we’ll start by having you lightly run on the equipment over there.]","[I’m good.]","[I have no issues either.]","[Then, this way please...... Step on top of this and activate the magic tool. The surface beneath your feet will begin to move, so please run in accordance with it. Touch the red magic crystal to accelerate, the blue one to decelerate, and if you wish to stop, touch the crystal at the front labeled \"stop\".]","The first thing we were guided to was essentially a treadmill-like magic tool. Eris-san and I exchanged a quick glance and nodded, then started it up, running at a light jogging pace.","Since I regularly jog with Hina-chan, I was fairly used to running, and at this slower speed, it was easy enough.","[How is it?]","[It feels good. The footing is stable and easy to run on, and the pace is fine...... though if possible, it might be better to add handrails on the sides, so there’s something to grab if someone is about to fall.]","[I see, I’ll take that into consideration. How about you, Eris-jou?]","[I’ve used a similar magic tool before, but this one makes speed adjustments easier. Also, the fact that it gradually slows down instead of stopping abruptly is excellent from a safety standpoint. If I had to suggest something, people will likely use this for extended periods, so having a way to check the time...... perhaps a clock on that wall over there would be helpful.]","While lightly running, we shared our impressions and any points of concern. From what Eris-san said, it seemed that treadmill-like magic tools already existed, so this was likely an improved version tailored for gym use.","In practice, it was quite well-made. I didn’t really need one since I jog with Hina-chan regularly, but having something like this at home could help with a lack of exercise. Mom and Dad had mentioned they weren’t getting enough exercise lately, so maybe I could buy one for them.","Given the size of my house, it wouldn’t be a problem at all......","After that, we continued with a light jog for about 15 minutes before stopping the magic tool and stepping off. The speed had been on the slower side, so it wasn’t overly exhausting, but after running for that long, a decent amount of sweat had formed. As I wiped my face with the towel Namir-san had brought, I took out two wooden cups and a sports drink from my Magic Box.","[Eris-san, if you’d like, please have a drink. I also have straws, so feel free to use one if needed.]","[Thank you...... What is this drink?]","[It’s called a sports drink, something that helps you efficiently replenish fluids and nutrients after exercise. Alice made this, but this is also something sold commercially. It seems to be popular among adventurers.]","[Sports drink huh, I wasn’t aware such a beverage existed, I clearly have more to learn. It has a refreshing taste and is very easy to drink.]","[It only just started being sold recently after all.]","The sports drink that Alice had created at Hina-chan’s persistent request ended up being well-received by Lilia-san and the others. Thanks to that, Alice used her own connections to begin general distribution, and it had become quite popular among adventurers.","That said, since it had only just begun circulating widely, it wasn’t surprising that Eris-san didn’t know about it yet.","[Come to think of it, Frea-san seemed to really like it too.]","[Yes, once the gym officially opens, we plan to sell sports drinks at the shop inside the facility as well. Apparently, the boss personally went to negotiate with Phantasmal King-sama and secured a contract, so we’ll be able to receive a steady supply...... We’ve been drinking it regularly during training too! I’ve also heard it’s popular among the War King's subordinates, so it’s apparently a bit scarce right now. Since our boss acted early though, we’re getting priority shipments.]","It sounded like the deal had become much larger than expected, Alice was probably thrilled. Even though back when Hina-chan begged her to make it, she acted like it was quite bothersome......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [T- That's strange...... Eris is getting along peacefully with Kaito without suffering from stomachache. T- This makes her seem just like a heroine......]","? ? ? : [Aren’t the Stomachache Warriors, led by Lilia-san, actually quite suited to being heroines? After all, they’re generally people who have a high level of affection from Kaito-san......]"]},{"number":2549,"title":"Chapter 2549: A Conversation About the Tea Party ~ ~ The One with Stomachache 7 ~ ~","paragraphs":["After warming up on the treadmill, we decided to try the bench press. I’ve never done it before, but I’ve seen it on TV, it’s the one where you lie on your back and lift a barbell.","[Alright, we’ll take turns doing the bench press here. For now, let’s check how much each of you can lift.]","[......By the way, is there like an average for this?]","[We did some research when setting up this gym, but since there are large differences between races, it’s hard to group them all together as Humans. For example, dwarves tend to be strong regardless of gender, while elves are generally weaker. As for differences between men and women, human males tend to be stronger, but in races like mermaids, females are stronger. If we limit it to humans though, the average is about 30 kg for women and 50-60 kg for men.]","[I see......]","......Can I even lift the average? My arms, how strong are they? I do jog, so my legs are somewhat trained, but my arm strength is basically nonexistent...... S- Still, even if it's just a bit of petty pride, as a guy, I at least want to be stronger than Eris-san.","[Since both big bro and Eris-jou are human, going by trends, big bro should be able to lift a heavier barbell...... so let’s have Eris-jou go first.]","[Understood. I just need to lie down here, right?]","[Yes, I’ll support you, so don’t worry. Let’s start with 20 kg, slightly below average.]","(T/N: Namir refers to herself with atashi, and with their gender not being explicitly stated, with them apparently acting some sort of underling, it should be safe to say Namir is actually female.)","It was a perfectly serious exchange, nothing strange about it at all...... and yet, I found myself unsure where to look, feeling a bit uncomfortable.","As Eris-san prepared for the bench press, she took off her tracksuit jacket and lay down in just a T-shirt. Of course, that’s easier to move in, and I’d probably take mine off too when it’s my turn.","But, well, lying on her back like that in just a T-shirt inevitably emphasized certain...... distinctly feminine features. I tried to avert my eyes, but every now and then my gaze would flick over without thinking. Turning around completely would basically be admitting I got flustered staring at her chest, so I just did my best to look away and not think about it.","Also, since I’m up next, I do want to properly watch how it’s done.","[......There’s no problem at all here.]","[Can you raise and lower it as well? ......Looks fine. Next, let’s try 30 kg, the average for human women.]","[I can definitely feel the weight more than before, but I think I’m still okay.]","[Then let’s try 40 kg...... I’ve got my hands on it, so there’s no risk of it falling. Put some strength into it and lift.]","[Yes...... fuu...... ugh......]","[That’s good. You’re lifting it properly...... though at this rate, 50 kg might be difficult. Want to try it once?]","[......Kuh...... ughh...... I- I can lift it but...... I- I’m sorry, I can’t manage to raise and lower it......]","[No, no, if you can lift 50 kg at all, that’s already well above average. Good work. Take your time and relax your hands...... Eris-jou, it looks like training at around 35 kg would suit you.]","That barbell...... I wonder if its weight is being changed with magic? Instead of swapping plates, it felt like the weight shifted whenever Namir-san held her hand over it.","But putting that aside, Eris-san can lift 50 kg huh...... I- I should at least be able to manage that too, right?","[Alright, next, let’s measure big bro as well.]","[O- Okay.]","[How about it? Want to start with the 50 kg Eris-jou lifted?]","[Yeah, let’s start at 50 kg.]","Switching places with Eris-san, it was my turn to try the bench press, and I immediately went for 50 kg. I gripped the barbell firmly...... unn? Ah, this actually feels pretty easy.","[......Yeah, this much is no problem at all.]","[You’re lifting and lowering it smoothly, and it looks like you’ve got plenty of room to spare. If that’s the case, shall we try 70 kg next?]","[Got it.]","Next was 70 kg. If I could manage reps here, I’d definitely be above average...... alright...... unn? This feels pretty light too. It’s heavier than before, sure, but nowhere near a problem.","[This is still pretty easy.]","[Ohh, big bro, you’ve got quite a bit of arm strength. Your reps are smooth too...... hmm, how about 90 kg? If you can lift that, you’d be considered fairly strong for a human male.]","Another jump of 20 kg, bringing it to 90 kg...... but yeah, this is still completely manageable. Arehh? Am I actually pretty strong? I don’t remember doing any strength training, but now that I think about it, I’ve been brushing Bell, who’s over 5 meters tall...... maybe that’s built me up more than I realized.","[Hmm, big bro...... it looks like you’ve still got plenty left in you. Sorry for this, but let’s move the barbell aside for a moment...... could you try pushing against my hands as hard as you can, like you’re lifting the bar?]","[O- Okay...... like this?]","[O- Oh...... Eh? Big bro, you’re not using any Body Strengthening Magic, right? ......That’s strange. Arehh? With this kind of strength...... you could probably handle around \"200 kg\", you know?]","[Eh? Ehh, n- no, as expected, that's too much......]","According to Namir-san’s estimate, my arm strength is enough to bench press 200 kg...... but if I really had that kind of muscle, wouldn’t I be way more jacked?","Which means...... yeah, this isn’t normal. It feels like something other than raw muscle is at play, like there's some kind of strange modifier boosting my strength.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Eh? What in the heck......?]","? ? ? : [Well, I mean, have you seen just how many blessings this guy is loaded with? Even if each one only has a small effect, when you stack them all together, they end up massively boosting his base physical abilities. And there are also blessings that apply modifiers under specific conditions. Since he’s terrible at Body Strengthening Magic and the multiplier he gets from it is ridiculously low, he’s always seemed weaker compared to others when using Body Strengthening Magic, so he never noticed until now...... Though, when it comes to the bench press, there’s probably some kind of modifier kicking in. Like, maybe when he tries to lift something heavy without using Body Strengthening Magic, a strong bonus activates, something like that seems likely...... But he’s got way too many blessings, and he himself is barely aware of them, so even I can’t grasp the full picture. It’s honestly a pain to figure out......]","Serious-senpai : [I see...... Well, I guess I’ll go make my preparations......]","? ? ? : [What’s with that tool?]","Serious-senpai : [I had Makina make it in preparation for tomorrow. Considering she's always chomping down on my body, I’d say this much is only fair.]"]},{"number":2550,"title":"Chapter 2550: Extra - : April Fool’s Day Operation ~ ~ A Failed Plan ~ ~","paragraphs":["I opened my eyes to the morning sunlight and sat up in bed...... and somehow, there was an intruder standing by the window with arms crossed, wearing a fearless expression with the light streaming in behind her.","[Answer me, Kaito. What day is April 1st!?]","[......Eh? April Fool’s Day.]","[Wrong! April 1st is World Serious Day! I just decided that a moment ago!!!]","[Then there’s no way I’d know that, right!?]","I really wish she wouldn’t throw completely unknown information at me the moment I wake up. Somehow, it feels like it’s going to ruin my morning.","Well, putting that aside, the person in front of me is Serious-senpai, who shows up out of nowhere about once a year.","She's not a bad person, but they’re full of mysteries, or rather...... my honest impression is that they’re just generally hard to understand.","[......I see. Given the timeline within the story, it’s probably not actually April 1st yet, so I understand why you’d be confused. Considering how much time has passed since the birthday chapter, maybe it’s around the end of the year here? Anyway, I completely understand your confusion.]","[......No, I’m pretty sure you’re not understanding my feelings at all......]","What I’m feeling right now is more like \"What the heck is this person even talking about?\". Sure, I might be confused and bewildered, but that’s not because of the timeline, it’s because of what Serious-senpai is saying.","What is this feeling...... I just woke up, but I already want to say \"good night\" and go back to sleep.","[But think about it, since entering Afterstory, you could say the story’s timeline has essentially entered that kind of mysterious time-space often seen in fiction. If that’s the case, then things like seasons and months are trivial issues.]","[Fuaaahhh...... what do you mean by mysterious time-space?]","[You know, that thing you see a lot, where the characters don’t advance in grade or age, but the seasons keep changing, and events like Christmas and New Year keep happening over and over.]","[Ah, yeah, you see that a lot. Doesn’t it usually have some kind of name......? I’m sleepy...... Senpai, I’m making coffee, do you want some?]","[This guy sounds completely uninterested...... ah, I’ll gladly take the coffee.]","Honestly, after meeting her this many times, I’ve gotten used to it. I think it’s just right to ignore about 70% of what Serious-senpai says. Their mood swings are extreme, and they suddenly say incomprehensible things, so even if you listen seriously, you just end up confused. It’s best to just catch the main points and call it a day.","[......So, Serious-senpai, you came again this year from that room with no exit where you can only go outside once a year...... a place that sounds almost like torture just hearing about it, right? What are you planning to do this time?]","[Heh, I’m glad you asked. Thinking about it, I’ve always been passively waiting for seriousness until now. But that’s no good! From here on, I’m going to pursue seriousness more proactively, and as the first step, I’ve made preparations in advance this time.]","[Preparations? For what?]","[Behold!]","[......What is that?]","What Serious-senpai pulled out was a palm-sized object shaped like a globe made of a crystal-like sphere. It was a rather mysterious item. It looked like a magic tool, yet somehow also had a mechanical feel to its design.","[To put it simply, it’s like a teleportation magic tool. I had that crazy god who often comes to my place make it.]","[......Ahh, the one who keeps eating you when you turn into sweets?]","[Lately, she's even started controlling how I transform beforehand before eating me. She's omniscient and omnipotent, if she's gonna go through that much trouble, she could have just created the finished product themselves. Why is she so adamant about eating me...... That's something I have no clue at all.]","[Senpai, I’ve said this before, but that person sounds seriously dangerous...... shouldn’t you avoid owing her anything?]","[No, I told you, she's someone you’re connected to...... well, it’s not really about owing her. It’s more like she's eaten me so many times that I’m just getting her to repay that debt...... Anyway! Kaito, we’re heading out right now! Are you ready to go!?]","[......No, this is the first I’m hearing of it, and I literally just woke up.]","Somehow, it suddenly turned into going out somewhere, but I just woke up and only had one cup of coffee!","[Hm, then, well...... go get ready quickly.]","[Ahh, so us going is already decided. But you said something about proactive seriousness, where are we even going? Depending on the place, what I need to prepare will change......]","[An onsen!]","[......What does an onsen have to do with seriousness?]","[No, there’s no relation between onsens and seriousness at all. What are you even talking about?]","[......Senpai, can I give you a slightly strong slap?]","[C- Calm down! This was a calculated choice. The reason I picked an onsen as the destination is because an onsen chapter is coming up!!!]","To repeat, I just woke up and I’m already having this conversation...... The fact that I didn’t pull out my piko-piko hammer means I’m being pretty kind here.","[......I don’t really get what's going on, but is this like going to an onsen ahead of the onsen episode? Kind of like scouting it out?]","[You’re close...... but not quite. By personally carrying out an onsen chapter myself, I’ll build up resistance to onsens and reduce the damage. And there’s also a reason I invited you at this specific time!]","[It’s early morning, what kind of reason is that?]","[Fufufu, by heading to the onsen town this early...... There wouldn't be enough time for an extra chapter that includes a mixed-bathing event to be written. Even if it’s extended by one or two chapters like before, we won’t reach the bathing scene! In other words, I can gain onsen resistance while avoiding any lovey-dovey events, a perfect plan!!! Fuhaha, quite unfortunate huh, Mixed Bath King! You won’t get a chance to activate your unique skill!]","[......Just to ask, who exactly are you calling the Mixed Bath King? Depending on your answer, I might get mad.]","[......Well, I mean, if you’ve had mixed baths with all your lovers and several others too, doesn’t that make you one?]","[......................]","......A completely irrefutable argument. If you’ve experienced mixed bathing with a double-digit number of women, being called that might be unavoidable. But still...... still......","[But somehow, being shut down by you with a logical argument doesn’t sit right with me...... so I’m going to hit you once with my piko-piko hammer.]","[Why!? B*stard, at some point, you started treating me like Alice and Tre, as someone you can handle roughly, didn’t you!?]","<Afterword>","Makina : [I don’t understand...... why is everyone making me build the onsen town......? Also, the title already confirms that Serious-senpai’s plan is going to fail.]"]},{"number":2551,"title":"Chapter 2551 - Extra Chapter: April Fool's Day Operation ~ ~ Senpai's Miscalculation ~ ~","paragraphs":["Suddenly...... or rather, as usual, suddenly, Serious-senpai dragged me to an onsen town early in the morning with her ridiculously overconfident plan.","The onsen town, which Serious-senpai claimed was built by some crazy god she knew, looked exactly like the kind of onsen town I had imagined, it had that distinctly Japanese feel, and the scenery was quite nice.","Despite saying she was actively pursuing seriousness, Serious-senpai didn’t seem interested in pursuing anything serious at all; we were just casually sightseeing around the town together.","We went to a specialty dried fish shop and grilled the dried fish we bought on a small charcoal grill set up beside the shop, played around at an unusually retro-style arcade, or rather, an amusement corner, and did quite a variety of things.","Serious-senpai’s mood swings were as extreme as ever. She would suddenly say something incomprehensible, and then abruptly deliver a perfectly reasonable statement, it never got boring. All in all, touring the town with her was boisterous but fun.","If I had to point out a problem, it was that all the shop staff seemed like mannequins come to life. They responded when spoken to...... but the whole thing gave off the vibe of being trapped in some strange world.","It felt like, well, the town itself was meticulously built as promised, but the staff weren’t part of the deal, so they were just haphazardly made mannequins.","Anyway, after having fun with Serious-senpai all over town, we arrived at an onsen inn. It had a retro, understated charm, not a huge ryokan, more like a middle ground between a guesthouse and a traditional inn, but that gave it a nice atmosphere.","From the room’s window, we could see the whole onsen town. The tatami mats were slightly old, adding character, and the Japanese-style room had a relaxing atmosphere.","At the inn, we had a delicious meal centered on sashimi, rested a little after eating, and finally prepared to enter the main attraction: the onsens.","[W- Whaaaaat!? A digest from the monologue......? And now you’ve finally thrown excuses and formalities aside and just went with April Fool’s Day Two!?]","[Eh? What are you talking about all of a sudden?]","[T- The time, it’s been completely blown away...... skipping all the process...... a- and we’ve arrived at the result, entering the onsens...... t- this is just absurd!]","[No, time hasn’t skipped or anything though......]","Once again, she started saying something bizarre out of nowhere.","[This is an extremely malicious situation, Kaito. My perfect plan of leisurely touring the onsen town has been ruined.]","[......But we did tour, right? From morning till evening, plenty of time......]","[Unn, we did, and it was fun...... but in terms of depiction, time has been skipped!!!]","[......Shall we go to the onsens?]","[Now you’re just trying to steer the conversation toward ignoring me!?]","Honestly, if I kept engaging with this topic, she would probably go on and on saying incomprehensible things...... so, with the mindset of ignoring seventy percent of Serious-senpai’s chatter, I decided we should just move on to the onsens.","Serious-senpai muttered complaints the whole way, but she prepared herself and followed along, so pushing the plan forward forcibly might actually work.","Following the directions, we finally reached the onsens......","“MIXED BATHING ONLY”","There it was, a big sign with those words.","[H- Here it is, the Mixed Bath King’s unique skill, Absolute Mixed Bath has been activated...... guh!]","[N- No, this sign has nothing to do with me, okay? And who is the Mixed Bath King, and what’s this unique skill...... I’ll have to bonk you again.]","[Guh, so that’s how the skill is used...... fine, I’ll admit defeat this time. Alright, let’s go!]","[......Huh? Ah, wait!?]","Muttering to herself like she’d reached some personal conclusion, Serious-senpai grabbed my hand and pulled me through the noren. No, wait, I’m still not ready for this situation!","[Please wait, senpai!]","[Unn?]","[The situation! I have no idea what’s going on, or what conclusion you’ve reached in your head......but unless I’m imagining things, aren’t we heading toward mixed bathing!?]","[Well, yeah?]","[Ehhhhh......]","Why is she giving me that look that seemed to say “What is this guy even saying?”? Is it me? Am I the crazy one? ......No, that’s not it. By all logic, the one acting crazy is Serious-senpai. I can say that with absolute certainty.","I froze, unable to speak because she affirmed it so casually, and Serious-senpai made a face like she had realized something...... though with her, she probably hadn’t realized anything at all.","[......Ah, so that’s how it is.]","[No, that’s not it.]","[I haven’t even said anything yet!? ......Hah, I get your line of thought. Even the famed Mixed Bath King would feel embarrassed when bathing with a beauty with a dynamite body like mine!]","[......Dynamite...... Errr...... y- yeah, I guess.]","[Could you stop giving me polite affirmations? That hurts more than being told I’m basically flat!!!]","Well...... whether she counts as a “beauty” or not...... Yeah, but I feel more like she’s more of a “beautiful girl”, but I suppose wording it that way is understandable. If you only judge by appearance...... she is a beautiful girl. Only by appearance...... ignoring personality...... by looks alone, she qualifies as a beautiful girl.","[......Are you seriously thinking something extremely rude right now?]","[....................]","[......Hey, at least deny it!]","The term “dynamite body” feels almost outdated, but I get the general meaning from the sound of it, so let’s put that aside......","[No, Serious-senpai, don’t you find any problem with bathing together with me?]","[Eh? Totally fine, why are you asking?]","[Ehhhhh......]","Why is it that I’m the one getting the “Why is this guy asking weird stuff like that?” look? This is just unreasonable.","<Afterword>","Makina : [To have a mixed bath with Serious-senpai, her affection level toward you needs to be at least 96. In the case of my beloved child, Serious-senpai’s affection level is 5 quadrillion, so there’s absolutely no problem.]"]},{"number":2552,"title":"Chapter 2552: Extra - : April Fool’s Day Operation ~ ~ A Mixed Bath with Senpai ~ ~","paragraphs":["<Author's Notes>","As previously announced, updates will be every other day starting tomorrow. Thank you for your understanding.","Since I’d like to have a bit of a buffer until I get used to it, I’ll be writing the story every other day from now on...... As for the start of the side story's actual serialization...... I’m thinking around April 12 or 13.","Pushed along by Serious-senpai’s momentum, I passed through the noren, and it looked like behind it was a changing room...... but there was no sign of it being separated by gender at all.","[......Senpai, it seems like there’s only one changing room here, doesn’t it?]","[Well, it’s not like it matters; it’s just you and me in this inn......]","[Wha!? Senpai! Why are you trying to start undressing all of a sudden!?]","[......Well, if we’re going into an onsen, shouldn’t we take off our clothes? As expected, only those advanced ones can handle actually entering an onsen clothed.]","Before I could finish, Serious-senpai started moving as if to take off her skirt, and I hurriedly called out to stop her, to which she tilted her head in confusion...... seemingly having left all sense of embarrassment in some torture chamber somewhere.","[No, that’s not it...... you're with someone of the opposite gender here, so maybe you should hesitate a little......]","[Eh? What’s the problem...... Hah!? I get it now!]","[No, that’s not it.]","[But I haven’t said anything yet!?]","Serious-senpai seemed to notice something from my expression, but from my past experience, she probably didn’t understand my thoughts. She would start saying something completely off-base.","[......Well, don’t worry. It’s not like I’m picky about whether someone's muscular or not, so there’s no need to be embarrassed.]","[A- Ahh, I see...... you’re interpreting it as me being the one embarrassed to undress...... errr...... hmm.]","What the heck, is it me? Am I the weird one here? Why is Serious-senpai so calm and unbothered? Does she really not have any sense of shame at all?","[......I just want to confirm...... Senpai, you don't see any problem with bathing together with me, right?]","[Problem? On the contrary, what problem are you even talking about here? A- Ahh, I see...... just as you think, the prerequisites for a bathing-together event with me are very strict! If my affection for you isn’t over 96 out of a maximum of 100, the event won’t trigger.]","[Indeed, that seems like it would be tough to raise it that high...... So, how much affection have I earned so far?]","[5 quadrillion.]","[......Excuse me?]","[Like I said, if the maximum is 100, then 5 quadrillion is about where you’re at.]","......If the maximum can be exceeded to that degree, doesn’t the concept of a limit become meaningless? The number choice seems ridiculously exaggerated...... but apparently, I’ve earned 50 trillion times the maximum affection for Serious-senpai...... so a joint bath is no problem...... In fact, her affection level is at a point where marriage wouldn’t even be surprising.","[.......................................Let's go to the onsen then.]","There were a lot of thoughts swirling in my head, and my mind hadn’t fully caught up with the situation...... but if Serious-senpai genuinely had no issue with bathing together, there was nothing more I needed to say.","Still, I just couldn't help feeling awkward, so I turned my back to avoid seeing her change, carefully undressed, and moved to the onsen together.","The onsen was outdoors, with a magnificent view of mountains and trees that I couldn’t quite place, but it was breathtaking. After lightly washing ourselves, soaking in the onsen calmed my frazzled mind and I felt a small sense of relief.","[Ahh~~ onsens really are wonderful. Kaito, isn’t this the part where you prepare some alcohol for the respected me?]","[W- Well, I can prepare the alcohol, but...... umm...... a- aren't you a bit too close?]","[Too close? Is there a problem with that?]","[Unstoppable...... this Senpai......]","Even though we were in an onsen together, her sense of personal space was off. She leaned casually against me as if sitting that close was just natural.","Her smooth skin pressed against me, and if I carelessly turned my head, the high transparency of the water would make some very dangerous things visible, so my gaze stayed fixed diagonally upward.","For now, I served the alcohol Serious-senpai requested, placing it on a tray and handing it over.","[By the way, isn’t this onsen kind of deep?]","[Eh? No, I think it’s normal......]","[Is it a height problem...... no, it’s because my legs are just long and my sitting height is low huh!!!]","[Well, I think it’s true that you’re petite......]","She’s taller than Kuro, but at around 150 cm, calling her petite isn’t wrong. While I was thinking that, Serious-senpai did something shocking.","[A little...... ah, yes. This should work.]","[Ha!? Wait, S- Senpai!?]","As my gaze stayed angled upward, I heard her voice as if she’d come up with a good idea. Immediately after, something soft pressed down on my thighs, and when I hurriedly looked, Serious-senpai was sitting on my lap.","Is she an idiot!? Doing something like this, wouldn't anyone feel some sort of hesitation at all!? Especially when it involves that extremely dangerous and delicate area, normally even lovers would take a few steps before doing something like this!","[Hmph! Complaining won’t help! For a while, you’ll serve as my chair to adjust the height!!!]","[No, that’s not the problem here!]","[Unn?]","[Don’t turn around, I'll be able to see them!!!]","[Huh? We’re in the onsen together, so I don’t think it’s a problem if you see...... I really don’t get you. Ah, Kaito, you drinking? I’ll pour it for you.]","[W- Wait, don’t move around while you’re on my lap!!!]","[......Ehhhh, you sure are bossy.]","[That reaction of yours that makes me look like the troublesome one is what's weird here!!!]","She’s way too defenseless, completely unguarded and extremely dangerous, and because Serious-senpai reacts to my reaction with utter confusion, it somehow makes it feel like I’m the one acting weird. It’s basically a bug in the system.","S- Seriously, how should I say this...... She just visits once every year, but I feel like I’m always being dragged around by Serious-senpai.","<Afterword>","? ? ? : [You complain nonstop about lovey-dovey stuff, but you’re doing it yourself too, aren’t you!?]","Serious-senpai (Affection Level: 5 quadrillion) : [No, with the kind of relationship Kaito and I have, this level of physical contact is just playing around, isn’t it?]","? ? ? : [No, no, being in contact while naked is already way beyond normal, you know!? It only didn’t turn into something crazier because Kaito-san has an orichalcum-level sense of reason, one wrong step and things could’ve gotten way more intense!]","Serious-senpai (Affection Level: 5 quadrillion): [If Kaito wants to do something, he can just do as he likes, you know? I don’t have any problem with it at all.]","? ? ? : [This senpai’s hopeless...... her affection level is so high her sense of boundaries is completely bugged......]"]},{"number":2553,"title":"Chapter 2553 - A Conversation About the Tea Party ~ ~ The One with Stomachache 8 ~ ~","paragraphs":["According to Namir-san’s estimation, it seems I possess enough power to bench press over 200 kg...... but there’s no way I’m naive enough to believe that this is truly my own strength.","If it were due to magic, that would be one thing, but achieving a 200 kg bench press purely through natural physical ability is absolutely impossible with my current muscle mass.","[......Yeah, there’s almost no doubt this isn’t my natural strength. There has to be some other cause, right? If I could really lift 200 kg, my arms should be thick like logs......]","[Even if we consider muscle mutation caused by magic power, with all due respect, your magic power capacity isn’t particularly large by Human standards. It wouldn’t cause this level of variation, so we should assume there’s another factor.]","[......Muscle mutation caused by magic power?]","That unfamiliar term made me tilt my head in confusion, and Eris-san, who was nearby, began explaining in a casual tone.","[It’s related to a theory known as the <Long-Term Evolution Theory of Latent Magic Power>. Simply put, those born with immense magic power are constantly exposed to that force, and their bodies evolve in response, improving their base physical abilities.]","[It’s mainly observed in Humans. Demons, for instance, have fundamentally different muscle structures, and some are born with fully developed physical abilities from the start. For example, among those close to big bro, Lilia-dono likely has considerably enhanced base physical abilities due to the influence of her magic power.]","[Ahh, I see...... so that kind of change exists.]","So that’s why Lilia-san is so strong even without using Body Strengthening Magic......","[That said, unless someone has overwhelmingly vast magic power like Lilia-dono, people with average or slightly above-average magic power won’t experience noticeable changes. So in your case, your bench press strength must be due to some other factor......]","[Hmmm, then could it be the Blessing after all?]","[That’s certainly possible. My own physical abilities have improved thanks to Life-sama’s Provisional Blessing......]","Yes, eventually assuming it’s due to Blessings does seem the most natural conclusion...... but even then, something still feels off.","If my physical abilities had increased that much, I should have noticed it sooner...... though, now that I think about it, brushing Bell has felt a lot easier lately...... I figured I was just getting used to it, but there’s a good chance my improved base physical abilities played a role.","......Still, if that’s the case, then it means “my physical abilities improved relatively recently”, so it might not be due to Shiro-san’s Blessing...... I don’t know.","[If it’s because of Blessings, something still feels a bit off...... Alice, do you know the cause?]","[That’s obviously because you’ve got a ridiculous number of Blessings stacked on you, you know...... Maybe they’re holding back out of consideration for Shallow Vernal-sama, so each one only has a tiny effect, but there are so many that it’s piled up into something like a mountain range.]","[......A ridiculous number of Blessings?]","[Didn’t Canalis-san tell you you’ve got a lot of fans among the World Creators? That should be where they came from......]","[A- Ahh, I see......]","So Electrone-san, Tiana-san, and others gave me small Blessings...... and those stacked up in huge numbers, clearly boosting my base physical abilities...... That’s kind of insane...... but at least it doesn’t seem to harm me, right? I can still control my strength perfectly fine...... and if that’s the case, there’s no downside to being stronger......","After thanking Alice for the explanation, she waved lightly and disappeared again, and then Namir-san spoke to me in a cheerful tone.","[......Big bro! Having high base physical ability is a great thing. The higher your base ability, the bigger the boost you get from Body Strengthening Magic! We’ll have you try a few more things before moving on to equipment that uses Body Strengthening Magic, but for reference, what’s the multiplier of your Body Strengthening Magic? On average, it’s around 5 to 10 times......]","[......1.5 times.]","[......Eh?]","[......Well, like I said...... yeah...... 1.5 times......]","When it comes to Body Strengthening Magic, I seriously seem to have zero talent. No joke, at maximum output, it’s only 1.5×. If my base is a 200 kg bench press, that makes it 300 kg...... Meanwhile, someone like Aoi-chan exceeds 10×, so even with a base of 40 kg, she’d surpass 400 kg...... The difference in multipliers is just brutal.","After hearing my answer, Namir-san looked a bit awkward, her gaze wandering for a moment before she clenched her fist and spoke up.","[......Everyone has strengths and weaknesses when it comes to magic! Your base physical ability alone is already 3-4 times the average just judging by your bench press. So even with a 1.5× enhancement, your effective strength isn’t that different from an average man using 5-10× Body Strengthening Magic!]","......Honestly, I might have misunderstood Namir-san. Her mannerisms feel very underling-like, and her voice is excessively loud, so I’d unconsciously grouped her together with people like Blossom-san and Lanza-san...... but thinking about it, her explanations have been clear from the start, and her earlier analysis showed how sharp he is.","She’s considerate enough to notice how I’m feeling and try to cheer me up too. And come to think of it, Frea-san trusts her enough to leave her in charge when she’s absent, so she must be highly capable, both strong and intelligent.","Well, Blossom-san isn’t exactly thoughtless either, she just tends to jump to conclusions. When it came to judging the UTA battle or recreating traditional Japanese dance, she showed plenty of intelligence, so it’s probably wrong to lump people into the same category in the first place.","As for Lanza-san...... errr...... unn...... she’s energetic, straightforward...... and a good guy, I think.","<Afterword>","Namir: Just has an underling-like way of speaking and acting, but both personality and ability are quite excellent.","Blossom: Tends to jump to conclusions and gives off a somewhat silly vibe, but her ability is high, and she’s not thoughtless.","Lanza: A fool overflowing with energy.","Serious-senpai : [......As expected of the only woman explicitly called a fool...... She is on another level.]"]},{"number":2554,"title":"Chapter 2554: A Conversation About the Tea Party ~ ~ The One with Stomachache 9 ~ ~","paragraphs":["After trying out the equipment to a certain extent without using any Body Strengthening Magic, they went through the high-load equipment with Body Strengthening Magic as well. After sharing a few impressions and suggestions for improvement, their gym experience came to an end, and Kaito and Eris each moved to the shower rooms inside the gym to wash up.","(......It’s an exceptionally refined facility. It covers everything from light exercise to full-scale training, and it feels as though it was carefully designed by someone with deep expertise in physical conditioning. I’ve heard that Nidzveld-sama has a strong passion for training, and this truly lives up to that reputation. Judging from what Namir-sama mentioned, it seems they even gathered data on the average physical capabilities of Humans and adjusted everything accordingly. Every piece of equipment uses multiple magic crystals, allowing for a wide range of adjustments. It must be designed so that it can be tailored to the base physical abilities of each race.)","When Eris first heard about the gym from Kaito, she found it useful in concept but thought it would be quite difficult to realize. Even if the variety was fewer than Demons, there are still multiple races among Humans, and in the capital of the Archlesia Empire, many different races and mixed-blood individuals coexist.","If everything were tailored to the most numerous humans, it wouldn’t suit other species like the dwarves, who are next in number. On the other hand, preparing separate equipment for each species would drive up costs and create space issues.","Since Kaito had been invited to experience it, she initially assumed the gym would focus solely on humans. However, after actually trying it, she found that through various innovations, it had been made compatible with multiple species.","(......Since it’s still an unfamiliar concept that hasn’t fully spread yet, it may struggle a bit before becoming established. But with its initial novelty...... and Nidzveld-sama’s reputation, it should gain momentum. It will likely take root among those who value physical training, such as adventurers. In terms of improving basic physical ability, the facilities here surpass even those of the knights'. I imagine many knights will want to come as well. At this rate, it wouldn’t be surprising if a second or third gym appears sooner than expected.)","This gym focuses purely on developing basic physical ability and isn’t suited for training in martial arts or magic. However, precisely because it narrows its purpose, it offers a far superior environment for physical conditioning compared to knight training grounds.","(I wonder how Nidzveld-sama plans to expand this? It doesn’t seem like his style to personally lead the construction of more and more gyms. Rather, once the concept gains recognition, he’d probably release the know-how and create a foundation that allows other merchant groups to enter the field, encouraging competition...... If that’s the case, preparing in advance could allow the Hamilton Marquisdom to secure a fair share of profit.)","Eris’ prediction was correct. After hearing Kaito’s explanation, Nidzveld became interested in gyms and took the initiative to establish one, hoping to create a foundation in Trinia where multiple gyms would exist, allowing motivated individuals to train themselves in a good environment.","However, she had no intention of monopolizing the knowledge or the information gathered in building the gym. As Eris anticipated, once she confirmed that it worked in practice, she planned to make the information public so that other trading companies could easily join in.","In fact, as long as things got on track and other merchants became interested and joined, she wouldn’t even mind if the gyms she built operated at a loss. Part of it was likely because the idea itself came from Kaito, whom she considered her comrade, and it went against her principles to monopolize it for profit. In any case, Eris’ reading was spot on...... if one chose to, there was certainly potential for considerable profit.","(......Still, it’s unnecessary. There’s no benefit in the Hamilton Marquisdom gaining more profit than it already has, and spreading ourselves too thin would only create blind spots. If we were to pursue something, it wouldn’t be a training-focused facility like this, but rather an exercise center aimed at beauty, targeted toward women. Considering the audience, we’d need to pay some attention to the interior design, but it should still be profitable. Of course, it’s nothing more than a novice’s armchair speculation.)","Out of sheer habit, she found herself thinking about what she would do if she were to enter the competition herself, and after letting out a small wry smile, Eris carefully dried her body with a towel. She then thoroughly dried her hair using a magic tool, applied a light, natural makeup using cosmetics taken from her magic box, and left the changing room.","(At any rate, this pleasant sense of fatigue feels nice. It was a good change of pace. I should thank Kaito-sama.)","Thinking this, she walked toward where Kaito was likely waiting, when she noticed the Dragon King's subordinates bustling about in a flurry.","(......What's going on? They seem flustered...... or rather, slightly agitated? It’s like they’re preparing to welcome someone of high status...... W- What is this? I have a bad feeling about this......)","Feeling a sharp, warning-like pain in her stomach, Eris had an indescribable expression on her face. At that moment, Namir happened to pass by.","[......Ah, Namir-sama. My apologies. It seems a bit hectic...... has something happened?]","[Ahh, Eris-dono. Sorry about that...... Well, \"His Majesty\" is expected to arrive soon, and most of the ones here right now are young, so they seem a bit unsettled. I’ll make sure to warn them not to make our guests uneasy.]","Hearing Namir’s apologetic explanation, Eris’ face drained of color.","(His Majesty? ......Not \"her\", so she's not talking about Emperor Chris, right? The one Namir-sama refers to as His Majesty...... t- that would mean...... t- the Dragon King...... wouldn’t it?)","She wanted to scream...... she wanted to shout at the top of her lungs that she hadn’t been told anything about this. But suppressing that urge with all her might, Eris quietly placed a hand over her stomach.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [I never thought Eris would make it back without any stomachache...... but instead of one of the Four Great Demon Dragons, for the Dragon King himself to show up......]"]},{"number":2555,"title":"Chapter 2555: A Conversation About the Tea Party ~ ~ The One with Stomachache 10 ~ ~","paragraphs":["Inside the gym, where a faint air of restlessness lingered, Eris moved along, visibly shaken. Before long, the one who would arrive here was the Dragon King, Magnawell...... Among the Six Kings, Magnawell had particularly strong ties with the Archlesia Empire, and for Eris, herself a noble of that empire, he was someone to whom she absolutely could not afford to show the slightest disrespect.","If it were possible, she would rather leave without ever meeting him. However, knowing that Magnawell was coming and departing without even offering greetings would be a blatant act of disrespect, an option she could never choose. On the other hand, even if she remained here, she was not in a position that allowed her to speak to him first...... let alone offer greetings of her own accord.","......Yes, if only the World's Singularity were not present here......","(If I had encountered Dragon King-sama by myself, there would be no need for words, I would simply bow, and he would pass by, and that would be the end of it. But with Kaito-sama here, the situation changes entirely...... I must assume that I’ll be greeting him. I absolutely cannot afford any rudeness...... m- my stomach......)","Clutching at the growing ache in her stomach, Eris approached the entrance of the gym, where Kaito, who had arrived earlier, noticed her and smiled.","[My apologies for keeping you waiting.]","[No, not at all. I just got here myself...... Ah, by the way, I heard from Namir-san, apparently Magnawell-san is coming here for an inspection. What should we do? We didn’t make any plans or anything...... should we head back?]","It was Kaito’s way of being considerate. He figured Eris would feel intimidated meeting Magnawell, so he suggested leaving before that could happen. It was undoubtedly spoken out of kindness and goodwill.","However, if there was one problem...... It was that the only person permitted to make the choice of casually leaving despite knowing Magnawell was coming was Kaito himself.","(That’s a privilege only you have, Kaito-sama!!! If I did that, I’d be condemned by every noble in the Archlesia Empire!)","Putting Kaito aside, Magnawell’s deep connection to the Archlesia Empire made him, much like Lillywood was to the Symphonia Kingdom, one of the most important figures among the Six Kings. That was precisely the issue.","[No, it would be disrespectful to leave knowing Dragon King-sama is coming. If Kaito-sama's schedule allows it, let us wait.]","[That’s true. Then let’s at least give Magnawell-san a quick greeting before we go.]","The moment it was confirmed that Magnawell would be coming here, Eris had already half given up, but even so, she still had some peace of mind.","After all, given the circumstances, she would merely be introduced as an acquaintance of Kaito. There would be no real point of conversation between her and Magnawell.","She had heard Cornelia’s story, but that had only been possible thanks to their exclusive brushes. Magnawell, who carried himself with the utmost kingly dignity even among the Six Kings, would never engage in a long conversation with a mere noble like Eris...... much less take a particular interest in her.","At most, she expected that, thanks to Kaito, she would be granted a brief greeting and that would be the end of it.","Before long, Magnawell arrived. Namir and the others under the Dragon King’s command bowed deeply in greeting.","[At ease. I have merely come at Nidzveld’s recommendation to observe this new type of facility. I have no intention of interfering, nor of judging the conduct here.]","After addressing his subordinates, making it clear he was only here to observe, Magnawell made his way toward Kaito.","[Good afternoon, Magnawell-san.]","[Umu. You appear well, Miyama Kaito. I heard from Nidzveld that you had come to experience this place, how was it?]","[There were parts similar to the gyms I know, but also unique innovations specific to this world. I liked it. I’ve been a bit short on exercise lately, so once it officially opens, I might start coming regularly.]","[Hahaha, that is good. Whatever one does, the body is the foundation. There is no harm in keeping it well-trained...... fumu.]","After finishing his conversation with Kaito in high spirits, Magnawell cast a brief glance toward Eris. In her expectations, this was where she would be lightly introduced by Kaito, exchange a simple greeting, and that would be the end of it...... Unfortunately, there had been a major miscalculation.","For Cornelia, that assumption would have held true. To Magnawell, she had merely been the daughter of a noble acquainted with Kaito whom he happened to meet by chance. Without Kaito’s introduction, there would have been no reason for any deeper involvement.","However, the premise between Cornelia and Eris was fundamentally different. Unlike Cornelia, Eris had attended Kaito’s birthday party. Not only that, she had stood out to a certain degree, reaching the finals in the first game tournament and achieving good results in the quiz, even if luck had played a part.","[......Your face seems familiar. If I recall, you are a noble of the Archlesia Empire who is close to Miyama Kaito......?]","[ ! ? ]","Yes, because of that, in Magnawell’s eyes, Eris was not just any noble. She was a young noblewoman he had seen at the birthday party, someone particularly close to Kaito, someone worthy of his interest.","Of course, Magnawell remembering her isn't anything strange. Kaito only began forming connections with more nobles after that birthday party, and at that time, aside from Chris, Eris had been the only noble of the Archlesia Empire close to him. Given Magnawell’s strong ties to the Archlesia Empire, it was only natural that she would catch his attention.","[......Fumu. I permit you to state your name, including your household.]","As a result, rather than being introduced by Kaito, Magnawell himself recognized Eris as a noble of interest and granted her permission to introduce herself, including her family name.","In other words, this implied not only a formal self-introduction but also the expectation of further conversation and even consideration for future relations...... Faced with such an unexpectedly high evaluation, Eris managed to keep a composed expression, but inwardly, her stomach was screaming in agony.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Ah, I see...... Come to think of it, Eris did make quite a name for herself at the birthday party. So to the people around Kaito, she’s kind of like Lilia at the ship party, someone they’d want to talk to at least once...... To think that being talented and achieving great results would end up being tied with stomachache, even my Eyes of Seriousness didn’t see that coming......]"]},{"number":2556,"title":"Chapter 2556: A Conversation About the Tea Party ~ ~ The One with Stomachache 11 ~ ~","paragraphs":["Granted permission by the Dragon King Magnawell to introduce herself including her family name, the pressure weighing down on Eris was, of course, immense. However, as the heir of the Hamilton Marquisdom, she had already endured strict lady education, successor training, and the intrigue-filled noble society. She quickly straightened her posture, ensuring that neither tension nor intimidation showed in her expression or body, and gave her self-introduction with proper decorum.","[I humbly offer my greetings to the great and noble King of all dragonkind. My name is Eris Dia Hamilton. I am the heir of the Marquis Hamilton family, nobles of the Archlesia Empire.]","[Fumu...... I am Magnawell Baskus Lardo Kurtzvald. As one who is a friend of Miyama Kaito, I permit you to address me by name. I see, so you are Hamilton Marquisdom's girl huh...... I have heard that it is quite an outstanding noble house.]","[I am deeply honored.]","Until obtaining his current special avatar, Magnawell would send his subordinates as representatives to attend events such as the Founding Festival, so it could not be said that he was very familiar with the faces of the nobility.","However, he had heard reports from those subordinates who attended in his stead, and had committed to memory the names and reputations of the major noble families.","(......Her magic power is shaking. She seems tense and somewhat intimidated, yet it is admirable that she does not let it show in her expression or attitude. She is suppressing her magic power because she is heading into the city, but if she can still weave her words properly in front of me, then her nerve is quite commendable. Of course, she does not compare to Miyama Kaito, who, while being exposed to nearly unrestrained magic power from me, can take it all in and suppress it within a single breath, but that comparison is hardly fair. She is a noble with more than enough potential......)","Eris’ greeting seemed to leave a rather favorable impression on Magnawell. After nodding in satisfaction, he turned toward Kaito and asked:","[I recall she attended your birthday party before, Miyama Kaito, are you close with Eris Dia Hamilton?]","[Yes. Well, part of it is simply that I don’t have many noble acquaintances, but aside from Chris-san, she’s the noble from the Archlesia Empire I’ve spoken with the most. I trust her too. Hmmm, how should I put it...... she gives me a similar impression to Lilia-san.]","[......Oh?]","When asked by Magnawell, Kaito spoke honestly about his impression. In other words, if he were to describe her as a fellow noble, she was someone approachable and easy to talk to, much like Lilia.","There was genuine trust toward Eris in those words, and of course, it was a high evaluation without the slightest trace of ill intent.","But sadly...... the intent one tries to convey does not always reach the other party as intended. Such misunderstandings are how discrepancies arise.","(......Comparable to Lilia Albert huh...... From what I can see, her body and magic power fall far short of Lilia Albert’s. In that case, is it her intellect, her character...... or perhaps her luck?)","Yes, Magnawell interpreted Kaito’s words \"having a similar impression to Lilia\" as meaning that she possessed talent comparable to Lilia, the unparalleled genius held in high regard even by the Six Kings.","(At the very least, they are close enough to come together to experience Nidzveld’s new facility. Even if they are not lovers...... there is no doubt they share a close and trusting relationship. Miyama Kaito’s eye for people is reliable...... she is someone worth paying attention to.)","There was no way he could have guessed that they had simply run into each other in town and come here on a whim. As a result, completely without Kaito’s intention, Eris’ evaluation skyrocketed within Magnawell’s mind.","[I see...... Eris Dia Hamilton, was it...... I shall remember that name well.]","[ ! ? ! ? ]","Eris clearly understood the implication behind those words. It wasn’t merely that Magnawell had evaluated her highly, there was also the unspoken \"considering future relations\" behind it. She was thrown into confusion, unable to comprehend how a simple greeting had earned her such a high appraisal.","(What? W- Why? I merely gave a normal greeting, and Kaito-sama didn’t overly praise me or anything. S- So why such a high evaluation......?)","From Eris’ perspective, there was nothing strange about Kaito’s words. After all, in terms of status, from his point of view, she was indeed someone close to Lilia in that she was a noble.","It was, perhaps inevitably, the result of several factors coming together: Lilia being highly regarded and respected even by the Six Kings, Magnawell interpreting Kaito’s words in a different sense, and the fact that Magnawell did not know that the two had only met by chance before coming here. Only by putting all of that together could one realize Magnawell’s misunderstanding, and naturally, there was no way for Eris to notice it.","And meanwhile, the only one present who correctly understood the misalignment and misunderstanding in the exchange between Kaito, Magnawell, and Eris, and who could have cleared it up, Alice...... was sitting on a bench in the gym, leisurely sipping wine.","<Afterword>","Kaito : [A similar impression to Lilia-san (meaning she’s easy to talk to).]","Eris : [Indeed, a position like Duchess Lilia’s (in the noble sense).]","Magnawell : [So, a being like Lilia Albert...... (in terms of talent).]","Alice-chan (thoroughly amused) : [Well, saying she’s like Lilia-san isn’t wrong (in the stomachache-kinda sense).]"]},{"number":2557,"title":"Chapter 2557: A Conversation About the Tea Party ~ ~ The One with Stomachache 12 ~ ~","paragraphs":["<Author's Notes>","Just as previously announced, starting today, the serialization of <Six☆Stars> begins.","At a later date, I plan to set up ranking tags and place links beneath the afterword, but...... I haven’t looked up how to do that yet, so for now, please check via the author’s page and such.","Originally, Eris was already among the more exceptional noble ladies, and although she felt inwardly bewildered by Magnawell’s unexpectedly high praise, she quickly regained her composure.","It would be fair to say that her past experiences played a role here. Even now, Eris still doesn’t fully understand why, but from the very beginning, Kaito had always held her in high regard. Because of that, through him, she had already experienced several occasions where people she met would evaluate her highly for reasons she couldn’t quite grasp.","Of course, her questions were endless, but she was able to accept that being highly regarded wasn’t a bad thing and stabilized the conversation afterward without issue, carrying on smoothly with Magnawell.","Well, precisely because she was competent enough to recover like this, one stomach-aching situation after another kept arising......","After finishing some light conversation, Kaito and Eris headed home, while Magnawell decided to take a look around the gym...... when he suddenly tilted his head upon noticing Alice sitting on a bench, leisurely drinking wine.","Perhaps it was a clone, as Alice remained even after Kaito and Eris had left. Magnawell approached her and spoke with a slightly exasperated expression.","[......And why are you drinking wine there?]","[Come on, cut me some slack. I just got hit with a Subject K recently, so times like this call for enjoying some good wine.]","[Unn? Did something happen?]","\"Subject K\" was a term Alice often used, a coined expression that essentially meant some kind of troublesome situation related to Kaito had occurred. Magnawell was aware of her habit of using such terms, and as he tilted his head and asked what had happened, Alice let out a sigh before speaking.","[......Honestly, I wish he wouldn’t casually receive some unknown item that can essentially generate an unknown seasoning infinitely, like it’s just some souvenir. Maybe the transfer arrangements have been settled between World Creators, but dealing with the rumors spreading and preventing confusion, preparing countermeasures in case it becomes known to the public...... who do you think handles all that, seriously...... And Kuro-san, when it comes to baby castella, her IQ drops to about 3, she not only becomes a dummy, she actually makes things worse......]","[Ahh, matters involving Otherworld Gods huh...... indeed, that does sound like quite the ordeal.]","[And on top of that, he's apparently thinking about visiting higher-dimensional worlds someday, so I’ve been busy training to adapt to higher dimensions myself.]","[......You’re planning to go along?]","[What do you think will happen if something happens to Kaito-san when I’m not around!?]","[U- Umu, I see......]","Though she complained about how troublesome things were, it seemed Alice fully intended to adapt herself to higher dimensions and accompany him as his guard. Magnawell gave a wry smile.","Regarding the unknown seasoning, she had already taken measures without being told, and rather than denying Kaito’s desire to someday visit other worlds, she chose to support him, training herself accordingly. As always, her devotion was unmistakable.","[......By the way, Shalltear. What do you think of that Eris Dia Hamilton? Is she truly the kind of prodigy Miyama Kaito claims her to be?]","[In a certain sense, she rivals Lilia-san...... when it comes to stomachache, that is......]","[Stomachache?]","[Well, there’s no doubt she’s talented. But in terms of ingenuity, Chris-san is superior. She’s not quite on Lilia-san’s level either, instead, she’s more the type who draws opportunities to herself. She gets along very well with Kaito-san personality-wise and is quite favored by him, so there’ll likely be plenty more developments involving her. She’s definitely someone worth keeping an eye on.]","From Alice’s perspective, while Eris is certainly highly capable, she isn’t exceptional to the point of standing far above others. Perhaps it’s best to describe her as a well-balanced type, her intelligence, physical ability, social skills, and managerial aptitude, all qualities required of a noble, are consistently at a high level.","There’s no doubt she’s outstanding enough to be called a talented lady, but she isn’t someone with overwhelmingly extraordinary gifts. However, her compatibility with Kaito is extremely high.","It’s not just that her personality happens to align well with his preferences, she’s also skilled in conversation, and though unintentional, she firmly hits upon areas that easily raise Kaito’s favorability, such as topics related to Nebula and pets...... In a sense, it could be called a trick of fate, but her talent for increasing Kaito’s affection might be exceptional.","[It’s all unintentional and coincidental, and Eris-san herself probably tilts her head wondering why she’s so liked by Kaito-san...... but somehow, she just perfectly hits all of Kaito-san’s sweet spots. Even her choice of topics, she’s incredibly good at raising his opinion of her.]","[By that...... you don't mean she’s not deliberately manipulating people’s hearts or aiming for it, right?]","[No, that’s not it. I mean, judging from how she carries herself in high society, she definitely has conversational skills and a wide range of topics. She’s a good talker, no doubt, but I wouldn’t say she’s extraordinary. However, when it comes to conversations with Kaito-san, she somehow keeps landing on exactly the right answers...... It’s like, only during those conversations, she becomes the kind of person who draws in the right opportunities, like Lilia-san...... Well, she’s definitely going to have a lot more hardships ahead. Well~~ this wine is delicious!]","Based on Alice’s assessment, Eris is already quite favored by Kaito, and since she consistently hits right where it matters in their everyday conversations, her favorability will only continue to rise, bringing with it one stomachache after another. And so, savoring that prediction with a sense of amusement, Alice leisurely sipped her wine.","<Afterword>","[Serious-senpai, banned from the side story]","Serious-senpai : [Wha!? Why!? Banned? Why am I banned!? Whyyyy!?]","? ? ? : [Isn’t it because Kaito-san doesn’t appear much in the side story?]","Serious-senpai : [......Wh? Am I actually some kind of spirit attached to Kaito, and I just haven’t realized it?]"]},{"number":2558,"title":"Chapter 2558: A Conversation About the Tea Party ~ ~ The One with Stomachache 13 ~ ~","paragraphs":["After leaving the gym, Kaito and Eris walked side by side down the street for the time being. As for their current situation, it had originally been Kaito who invited Eris, whom he happened to run into by chance, and now that their intended gym experience was over, there hadn’t been any prior arrangement about what to do afterward.","As such, it wouldn’t have been strange for them to simply part ways here, but Kaito found that option a little unsatisfying in its own way. At the same time, he hesitated, wondering whether it was right to keep Eris, who had originally come into town for her own reasons, along with him any longer for his own convenience.","However, since there was no clear plan for where to go next, his thoughts were gradually leaning toward simply calling it a day...... though whether it was a good thing or not, Eris, who had ample experience dealing with people through high society, picked up on Kaito’s feelings to some extent and offered a suggestion to help him out.","[......Kaito-sama, do you have any plans after this?]","[Ah, no, I really just came to try out the gym, so I hadn’t thought about anything afterward at all.]","[Then how about this? We did a fair amount of exercise, and although it’s a bit late, it is around lunchtime...... if you don’t mind, would you like to go get something to eat?]","[Oh, that sounds great. Each activity was fairly light on its own, but altogether we did quite a bit, and I’m getting hungry.]","[As for the restaurant, there’s a place I had planned to visit, would that be alright? As you can see from how I’m dressed, it’s not a high-end establishment, just an ordinary dining place......]","[Honestly, that sounds better to me, I can relax more that way.]","Eris had certainly been dragged around by Kaito on a regular basis, enduring quite a number of stomach-aching situations because of it...... but at her core, she found Kaito’s character likable.","Moreover, she was the type who could properly switch her mindset, and fundamentally, she was kind and gentle. When she first ran into Kaito, she had been surprised, and yes, it had caused her no small amount of stress...... but setting that aside, now that they had met and were spending time together, she wanted both to make sure Kaito enjoyed himself and for she herself to have some fun as well.","That was why she made gestures like this, sensing Kaito’s feelings and taking the initiative to invite him to a meal, and also why she considered his preferences, deciding that a casual restaurant suited him better than a high-end one she might otherwise choose.","Of course, she would very much prefer to avoid unexpectedly running into outrageous individuals like Magnawell again...... but aside from that, she genuinely found the time spent with Kaito to be enjoyable rather than burdensome.","Well, combined with her thoughtfulness and gentle nature, Kaito’s opinion of her was steadily rising, leaving her somewhat puzzled by the outcome.","In any case, having agreed to go for a meal together, the two of them began heading toward the restaurant under Eris’s guidance.","[......Come to think of it, Eris-san, do you often...... how should I put it...... go out into the streets like that?]","[Not frequently, but I do visit from time to time like this. It’s not that I feel stifled by life as a noble. If I had to say, I simply believe that nobles should step into the city more and experience things firsthand. I think it’s foolish to cling to the rigid notion that nobles are above and commoners below, but even so, there are many things you cannot understand from only one perspective, whether that be the noble side or the commoner side. Rather than merely knowing something as knowledge, I believe that by actually experiencing it, one can broaden their horizons. As is the case with the Hydra Kingdom, the power of the people grows with the times...... and we nobles, too, must change. This is part of that.]","[That’s...... how should I put it, an incredibly admirable way of thinking.]","[......Well, that’s the official explanation.]","[Unn?]","Despite being younger than Kaito, Eris wore a composed, mature expression befitting a noble...... her words carrying a sense of responsibility and pride akin to noblesse oblige. As Kaito looked at her with admiration, Eris relaxed her expression and let out a wry smile.","[In truth, it’s just personal preference and a way to unwind. It’s not that I feel suffocated by noble life, but sometimes I want a change of pace, a different environment. So I come out like this on occasions like that.]","[Ahh, yeah, that makes sense. Being a noble seems like it’d be mentally exhausting in a lot of ways.]","[Yes. To put it bluntly, it’s a way to relax and a hobby. But for nobles, appearances are important in everything. So, to answer your question...... as a noble, the answer is that it’s an inspection carried out as part of my duties. Responding as Kaito-sama's friend...... this is simply just a hobby. I enjoy seeing and experiencing new things.]","Eris smiled as she said that, clearly enjoying herself, and Kaito couldn’t help but smile along with her.","(......Anyhow, if Kaito-sama takes the lead, I have a feeling we’ll end up running into another outrageous individual, so perhaps it’s better if I’m the one deciding where we go......)","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [That’s exactly why Kaito’s affection for her keeps going up.]","? ? ? : [When Eris talks with Kaito, she basically switches from being a noble to acting like a friend. She probably understands that Kaito prefers it that way. Compared to someone like Cornelia, the casualness she shows, like using a joking way of phrasing her words like she did this time, is likely a big reason why Kaito finds her so likable.]"]},{"number":2559,"title":"Chapter 2559 - A Conversation About the Tea Party ~ ~ The One with Stomachache 14 ~ ~","paragraphs":["With Eris-san’s suggestion, we decided to have lunch together and were now heading toward the restaurant she had originally planned to visit.","To be honest, I’d been a bit lost about where to go, so it was genuinely helpful that she made the suggestion. Or rather, if I were being honest with myself, I had also been thinking about inviting Eris-san to lunch, but I wasn’t sure if it was right to keep imposing on her time like that.","We hadn’t originally made any plans to meet up. It had been a chance encounter in the city, and I ended up asking her to accompany me to try out the gym.","At the time, she said she’d been planning to go for a walk anyway, so it wasn’t a problem. But even so, she must have had places she originally intended to visit, and thinking about that made me feel guilty about continuing to drag her around for my convenience.","Eris-san was kind, so she probably would have agreed if I had invited her. But precisely because of that, I hesitated, since there was a good chance she would go along with my suggestion even if it inconvenienced her.","And so, her initiative in bringing it up herself was truly a relief. Eris-san was really good at conversation, she had a wide range of topics she could draw from, and talking with her was genuinely enjoyable. I had also been hoping to talk with her a bit more, so it felt like perfect timing.","[......Hehh, I see. I heard that the Archlesia Empire has strong noble influence, so I assumed they’d produce a lot of wines that nobles would particularly like.]","[As for agricultural products in the region, the Symphonia Kingdom is superior. Nobles tend to be fond of showing off, so some of them take pride in importing expensive, high-quality wines from other countries as a kind of status symbol. Also, there are many dwarves in the Archlesia Empire, so demand for stronger alcoholic drinks is higher than for wine. That may be another factor.]","[Ah, that makes sense. Dwarves are naturally alcohol-tolerant and prefer stronger drinks.]","[Yes. A representative example would be dwarven fire liquor. As the name suggests, it’s so strong that it can ignite if a flame is brought near it. It’s extremely potent...... but it has high demand, especially among Demons with high alcohol tolerance, and it sells in large quantities by the barrel.]","[Come to think of it, Megiddo-san bought a lot of those too.]","[War King-sama is well known for being a heavy drinker after all.]","Eris-san herself was extremely knowledgeable, but more than that, she was skilled at explaining things in a way I could easily understand. She often used examples I was already familiar with, which made everything much clearer.","Probably, since I had set up a stall near a dwarven shop during the Archlesia Empire’s Founding Festival before, she chose fire liquor as a relatable example this time.","The fact that she did things like that so naturally really showed how good she was at conversation.","[I tried some of the products sold in dwarves’ stalls too. It really was strong liquor.]","[You drank it? That’s impressive...... I only tried a little before, but even a few sips gave me a headache.]","[I have Shiro-san’s Blessing, so I can nullify intoxication. I’m not sure about Provisional Blessing, but I feel like Life-san’s Blessing might be able to do something similar. It’s probably related to a Supreme God’s effect of completely nullifying abnormal conditions......]","[......I see. So you treat drunkenness as an abnormal status and alcohol as a toxin, and block it that way. Yes, in that case, it might be possible depending on one’s interpretation. That’s useful information. I’ll try it next time.]","[Are you not good with alcohol, Eris-san?]","[It’s not that I dislike the taste...... perhaps it’s more accurate to say I dislike being drunk. I don’t like the sensation of my thinking becoming dull, so I don’t drink much. When I think about the possibility of making poor decisions while impaired...... it makes me uneasy. I suppose I may be a bit overly cautious......]","[No, I think it’s kind of cool, you’re really disciplined.]","[Fufu, thank you. It’s truly wonderful how you naturally consider my feelings like that, Kaito-sama.]","It wasn’t just politeness, I could tell she meant it sincerely. That only made her personality shine through even more...... and honestly, talking with her really was fun.","Just like that, Eris-san and I continued chatting casually while making our way toward the restaurant.","While Kaito and Eris-san were enjoying their conversation on the way to a restaurant, a certain presence had arrived at the gym that Magnawell was inspecting.","[Ou, Magnawell! I’m here!]","[......Unn? What, you were invited too?]","[Yeah. A gym got built in my city by Nidzveld too, so I came to check out the Human Realm’s one as well. Well, as expected from something that guy came up with, it’s a pretty good facility. It’s not really built for someone of my strength, but it’s great for training my subordinates.]","[I see, I’m glad it’s been well received...... though, coming here at this time is a shame. Miyama Kaito was here just a moment ago......]","[What!? Kaito was here? Tch, that’s bad timing...... I can’t track Kaito’s magic power with Wide Area Detection, so I can’t find him...... what a pity.]","Hearing Magnawell’s words, Megiddo lamented missing Kaito. At that moment, Namir, who was nearby, spoke up.","[Big Bro went out with his girlfriend, so if you can track her magic power, you might be able to pick them up.]","[Ahh, so he’s on a date. Then it’d be bad to interrupt...... I’ll see Kaito next time.]","[Unn? Eris Dia Hamilton is Miyama Kaito’s girlfriend?]","[Ah, no, Big Bro said they aren’t like that...... but they came to try the gym together, so...... hmmm.]","In principle, Kaito had properly told Namir that Eris was not his girlfriend, but a close friend. However, from Namir’s perspective, the two seemed quite close, and going as far as training together made it feel like a fairly intimate relationship, leaving him uncertain.","[Well, whatever...... Magnawell, before we go tour the gym, how about grabbing a quick meal?]","[Unn? Ah, that works. Where to?]","[Let’s see...... oh, right. Let’s go to Kaori’s place!]","[That’s the otherworlder’s restaurant you mentioned before? I was planning to have Kaito introduce me to it though......]","[I know Kaori too, so I can introduce you just fine. You can just have Kaito take you there another time.]","[Fumu, I suppose that works...... Let’s go then.]","Megiddo, being the type who doesn’t worry about details, casually decided to head to Kaori’s restaurant. Magnawell agreed, thinking an introduction via Megiddo was fine. And so, a situation that could only be described as unfortunate for Kaori was set in motion...... and Alice’s clone, who had been watching from a bench while sipping wine, paused mid-sip and made a face that seemed to say “Wait, it’s headed that way?”.","<Afterword>","Stomachache Devil : [Unforgivable...... you put “stomachache” in the title and then made it a wholesome development...... I’m going to give you stomachache.]","Lilia : [This is bad, Eris-san!]","Eris : [......Kuh!]","Kaori : [Being a noble sure is tough......]","Stomachache Devil : [I’m definitely making you have this stomachache...... Mizuhara Kaori!]","Kaori : [Fwa!?!?]"]},{"number":2560,"title":"Chapter 2560 - A Conversation About the Tea Party ~ ~ The One with Stomachache 15 ~ ~","paragraphs":["The place Eris-san guided me to could be summed up in a single phrase: a casual dining restaurant. Still, the entire place was clean and well-kept, and it even carried a slightly upscale atmosphere.","If I had to compare it, it felt a step above a typical chain restaurant, yet not quite at the level of a high-end establishment, just the right balance.","It seemed a reservation had already been made beforehand, and as soon as we entered, a staff member led us to our seats.","[By the way, what kind of cuisine does this place serve?]","[You could say it’s a restaurant with a fairly wide variety of menu options...... though they’re particular about using ingredients produced in the Archlesia Empire.]","[I see......]","Restaurants that emphasize locally sourced ingredients weren’t exactly uncommon. Looking over the menu, it wasn’t structured around full course meals, but rather a selection of set combinations built around certain concepts...... if anything, it felt closer to a set-meal diner.","The burger steak caught my attention, so I ordered that. After Eris-san finished placing her order as well, we passed the time chatting while waiting for the food to arrive.","[I’m not sure if you know this, Eris-san, but Kaori-san’s shop actually has a similar vibe to this place. Though the atmosphere is more like something from our original world......]","[Oh, is that so? If I recall, Kaori-san runs her shop in Friendship City, correct? If the opportunity arises, I would love to visit. Surprisingly, I don’t get many chances to go to the Friendship City......]","[Ah, yeah, that makes sense. It’s quite far from the capital of the Archlesia Empire.]","[Indeed. That said, with Teleportation Magic, it’s easy enough to get there. If I make a conscious effort, visiting isn’t really difficult. In fact, Friendship City Hikari has a rather unique political system, one centered around Godism, so you could even call it a theocratic city. Its atmosphere is quite different from places like the Archlesia Empire, which makes it refreshing and enjoyable to visit.]","She had a point. Friendship City Hikari was quite far from the imperial capital, so far, in fact, that it could be considered the westernmost edge of the Human Realm. From an accessibility standpoint, it did seem a bit inconvenient.","If I remembered correctly, it was the place Dr. Vier had first invaded, the land where the Demon King’s castle had been built...... Then Neun-san defeated Dr. Vier, bringing the battle to an end, and 9 years later, the Treaty of Friendship was signed there......","Even so, it apparently attracts an incredible number of tourists each year. The name recognition of the First Hero, combined with the fact that it’s the only true religious headquarters in a world where faith runs deep, must be a major factor.","Kaori-san did mention her shop was doing very well too...... Though since it was already past lunchtime, things had probably calmed down by now, and she was likely taking a moment to catch her breath.","Around the time Kaito was enjoying his meal with Eris, over in the Friendship City that had come up in their conversation, ...... the door of a certain diner, Suiren, swung open, and Megiddo and Magnawell stepped inside.","[Ou, sorry for barging in. I’m back again, Kaori.]","[......Huh? ......Eh? Ah, uh...... w- welcome.]","The moment Megiddo strode in with that loud declaration, Kaori’s eyes widened to their absolute limit. She rubbed them vigorously, then looked at Megiddo again, glanced around restlessly, and after confirming that Kaito wasn’t anywhere in sight, her cheek twitched.","(War King-sama!? Why all of a sudden!? Kaito-kun, where’s Kaito-kun!?)","If Kaito had come along with him, it would’ve still been somewhat better. Well, her stomach would still hurt, of course, but at least there’d be some sense of reassurance. But Megiddo showing up alone was nothing short of terrifying, she couldn’t shake the feeling that if she made even the slightest mistake, she might get killed.","In reality, Kaori, who ranked among the strongest within the otherworlders in history, was actually someone Megiddo quite liked, so there was no problem at all...... but she had no way of knowing that.","[......E- Errr, War King-sama. Is Kaito-kun not with you today?]","[Ah, yeah. Kaito ain’t here today. Not exactly a replacement, but I brought someone else along. Let me introduce him...... this is Magnawell.]","[......? ? ?]","[Now, now, Megiddo, if you rush things like that, you’ll only confuse her...... You may have seen me during the party, but I am Magnawell Baskus Lardo Kurtzvald. A pleasure.]","[......Y- Yeshhh, m- my name is Mizuhara Kaori. P- Please, both of you...... errr, t- there are open seats, so sit wherever you like......]","The moment she heard the name Magnawell, Kaori nearly felt her consciousness slip into the void. Still, perhaps out of pride as the owner of a diner, she forced herself to act, she couldn’t just leave customers standing at the entrance, so she guided the two to their seats.","Magnawell looked impressed at her quick composure and professionalism, but internally, Kaori was in no state to realize that.","Just when the lunch rush had finally died down and she’d been thinking about wrapping up for the afternoon and taking a breather, two of the Six Kings had suddenly descended upon her shop.","(What is even happening!? Kaito-kun! Help! Heeelp meeee!?)","No matter how much she screamed in her heart, unfortunately, her voice didn’t reach him. Clutching her aching stomach, Kaori went over to take Megiddo and Magnawell’s order.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Ahh, I see...... from Kaori’s perspective, it’s practically a disaster but...... since she’s strong, I guess she falls into the category of people Megiddo likes. That’s why she ended up thinking “I’ll invite Magnawell and head over to her place” huh...... how pitiful.]"]},{"number":2561,"title":"Chapter 2561 - A Conversation About the Tea Party ~ ~ The One with Stomachache 16 ~ ~","paragraphs":["With the arrival of two of the Six Kings, War King Megiddo and Dragon King Magnawell, Kaori’s stomach was already on the verge of defeat from the very beginning. Still, perhaps out of professional pride, she took their orders and began preparing the food.","Neither Megiddo nor Magnawell were the type to gorge themselves; they preferred to eat lightly and focus on drinking. So she served some dishes as appetizers along with the hot sake she had once given Megiddo before.","Incidentally, the other customers in the shop had quickly finished their meals and left. Since it was already past peak hours to begin with, the shop was now left with only Kaori and the two of the Six Kings, a situation extremely harsh on her stomach.","[......Hoh, this is not bad at all. This sake is exceptionally delicious.]","[Yeah, so this is the kind of drink you like, Magnawell...... I think it was something Neun made and handled. The way you drink it is kind of like wine, right? Not something you chug, but something you sip little by little.]","[Umu. For me, meals and drinking are matters of taste. There is no need to consume large quantities. It is best to enjoy it like this, slowly, savoring the aroma in a small cup. Mizuhara Kaori, you’ve done an excellent job.]","[T- Thank you very much.]","Magnawell seemed to have taken a liking to the hot sake, tilting his small cup with a satisfied expression. That part was fine, there was no issue with that...... But what Kaori truly wished was for him to stop talking to her.","After all, Kaito, who could be called a breakwater, was not here right now. Just thinking about making some kind of mistake made her feel like she wouldn’t even be able to respond properly.","More than that, being in such close proximity to two of the Six Kings was overwhelming. The pressure from their magic power was immense, and her stomach felt as though it were being tightly constricted, to the point that she was even starting to feel dizzy.","(S- Someone, help meee......!)","More than anything, she wanted peace of mind. She desperately wished to escape this situation that felt like a dead end if she made even a single wrong move, and as if responding to that earnest prayer...... A savior appeared.","[......I see, so that’s what’s going on.]","[O- Olivia-samaaa......]","Hearing the sound of the door opening, Kaori turned her gaze, and there stood Olivia, who should have already come earlier at noon, finished her meal, and left. She had no idea why Olivia, who had already visited once, had returned again, but to Kaori, her arrival was truly a blessing.","[Ahh? Isn’t that Olivia?]","[What a coincidence.]","[Indeed. However, you need not concern yourselves with me. Please continue your meal as you were.]","After responding to Megiddo and Magnawell with words that clearly meant “she had no intention of engaging in further conversation”, Olivia took a seat at the counter.","[For now, I’ll stay here until those two leave.]","[T- Thank you so much. I’m really glad you came, Olivia-sama.]","Kaori murmured with genuine relief...... and truly, Olivia’s presence here was significant. She was someone who could speak her mind even to Megiddo and Magnawell, and at the same time, despite being powerful herself, she was one of the few individuals Megiddo would absolutely never pick a fight with.","The reason was simple. Olivia held a unique position as a neutral party among the three realms, a delicate standing. If she were to clash with one of the Six Kings, it would become a major incident. Because of that, Megiddo had been strictly warned by Kuromueina to never, ever pick a fight with Olivia. If she did, what awaited her would be a very real and serious scolding, so she never did.","Magnawell, on the other hand, was not originally quick to anger. While conflict would be a problem, becoming too close to Olivia would also be an issue, so he didn’t actively try to engage with her either. As a result, Olivia sitting between the two of them and Kaori functioned perfectly as a solid wall protecting Kaori.","For Kaori, it truly felt like seeing a Buddha in hell, but even so, one question remained: why had Olivia come here at this exact moment? Though grateful, she couldn’t help but tilt her head in confusion.","Rewinding time a little, back to when the two of the Six Kings had just arrived and Kaori was screaming internally, the deepest chamber of the Central Cathedral in the Friendship City Hikari...... within the Founder’s room, Olivia, who had been offering her prayers, suddenly twitched her expression, stood up, and turned toward the entrance.","At that moment, the scenery distorted as if noise ran through space itself, and Alice appeared.","[......Phantasmal King No Face...... no, in that form, was it Alice? What brings you here?]","[Well, I figured it’d be too cruel to just drop that on her out of nowhere, so I thought I’d lend a hand...... Anyway, Olivia-san, you should head to Suiren right away.]","[To Mizuhara Kaori’s shop? Why?]","[You’ll understand once you get there.]","Olivia tilted her head at Alice’s sudden words, but as if to say she had already conveyed everything necessary, Alice disappeared.","After seeing her off, Olivia directed her awareness toward Suiren. If she so wished, it was easy for her to grasp what was happening within the friendly city.","[......That is...... War King Megiddo and Dragon King Magnawell at Mizuhara Kaori’s shop? ......I don’t sense Miyama Kaito-sama’s presence. Does that mean those two are troubling Mizuhara Kaori? ......I suppose I’ll understand once I go.]","After murmuring that, Olivia informed the priests that she would be heading out and made her way to Suiren. Upon seeing Kaori inside the shop, shrinking back and pale-faced, she immediately grasped the situation, and chose to act as a breakwater.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Oh, you’re going to help her......?]","? ? ? : [Well, if Kaito-san were there, he’d handle things no matter what happened, so I’d just sit back and enjoy my wine. But without Kaito-san around, things are dangerous with that gorilla there. Kaori-san is liked by them, so she’s probably fine, but there’s still a chance trouble might occur with other customers.]"]},{"number":2562,"title":"Chapter 2562 - A Conversation About the Tea Party ~ ~ The One with Stomachache 17 ~ ~","paragraphs":["Several days had passed since the gym trial, and at the Hamilton Marquisdom, a so-called “family meeting”, which was increasingly becoming a Kaito countermeasure meeting, was being held once again.","That said, for this particular session, there was no urgent matter that required immediate discussion; it was simply scheduled on a day when the Marquis couple and Eris were all available.","[......And so, together with Kaito-sama, I was given the opportunity to experience the facility, this “gym” that Nidzveld-sama plans to develop moving forward. During that time, I was also able to greet the Dragon King Magnawell-sama, and he even remembered my name.]","[I see...... I had heard a brief report beforehand, but...... meeting one of the Six Kings is not something that would normally happen so easily. And yet, when Miyama Kaito-sama is involved, I find myself starting to accept it as natural...... which is rather terrifying in its own way.]","[You’re not the only one. When I heard Eris’ report, I was relieved that this time there didn’t seem to be any immediate impact...... but thinking about it more carefully, simply becoming acquainted with the Dragon King is already an extraordinary matter.]","Upon hearing that she had met Magnawell, they were, of course, surprised, and it was something they would need to keep in mind moving forward. Magnawell held immense influence over the Archlesia Empire, making him an extremely important connection.","Even so...... even so...... Perhaps they had become somewhat numb to the kinds of incidents Kaito tended to cause. At the very least, since this wasn’t a situation that would immediately cause stomachache, they had begun to feel it was relatively mild.","Of course, Eris, who had met Magnawell in person, had suffered quite a bit of stomachache from the experience. Still, it wasn’t as though any immediate dealings or exchanges had begun; it was simply that Magnawell, considering future relations, had remembered her name.","There was a possibility that this connection might lead to a significant impact down the line, but compared to the storm-like reports they had endured before, this was far gentler on the stomach.","......Of course...... the moment they let their guard down like that, something would strike from another direction.","Just as a somewhat calm atmosphere had begun to settle over the meeting, a knock sounded, and Eris’ personal maid entered the room.","[......Pardon the interruption. Eris-sama, a letter has arrived for you, from Miyama Kaito-sama.]","Naturally, anything related to Kaito took top priority, so entering during a meeting posed no issue at all. In fact, standing orders had already been given that in matters concerning Kaito, there was no need to wait for permission to enter.","[......From Kaito-sama...... I’ll take a look.]","As Eris spoke, the Marquis couple nodded quietly. She opened the seal and, somewhat hesitantly, began reading the letter, but soon, her expression shifted as if she had realized something.","[......Ahh, I see. This letter is about the tea party Kaito-sama mentioned before, the one he will be hosting. It seems the exact date hasn’t been finalized yet, but the participants have been confirmed, and this is to inform us of that.]","[So, it’s that tea party Eris was invited to...... It’s quite considerate of him to inform us of the participants in advance. That way, we can prepare accordingly, both in strategy and in mindset.]","[Indeed. With Kuromueina-sama and Shallow Vernal-sama already confirmed, my stomach already aches terribly...... but even so, knowing in advance does offer some peace of mind...... some peace......]","Thinking about the tea party made her stomach ache, but even so, Eris had been reading the letter with a wry smile, grateful that she could learn the list of participants in advance. However, partway through, that smile vanished...... The color drained from her face in an instant, paling past blue into a deathly white, and her body began to tremble so violently that even the chair she sat on rattled audibly.","Such a display was utterly unbecoming of a noble lady, who was expected to maintain composure at all times. It was the kind of behavior that would not be surprising for her parents to harshly reprimand.","And yet, neither Marquis Hamilton nor his wife had the slightest intention of reproaching Eris. Because they understood. This was not Eris overreacting out of immaturity...... it meant that even their capable and admirable daughter could not suppress her shock at what was written in that letter......","[M- M- My deepest apologies. F- For showing such disgrace......]","[N- No, it’s fine...... I- Is the lineup really that overwhelming?]","Still trembling, Eris spoke, and the Marquis reassured her while urging her to continue. His expression carried both resolve and fear, as though bracing himself to witness the depths of hell.","[......F- First, among the human participants, there are three in total including myself, me, Duchess Lilia, and Her Majesty Chris.]","[A- And the rest?]","[In addition to the previously confirmed Underworld King Kuromueina-sama and the God of Creation Shallow Vernal-sama...... there is also Eden-sama, bearing her identity as Makina-sama.]","[T- That much, we had already expected......]","[And then...... the Founder, Olivia-sama.]","[ [ ! ? ] ]","[......An Otherworld God, Electrone-sama.]","[ [ ! ? ! ? ] ]","[......Also another Otherworld God, Tiana-sama.]","[ [ ! ? ! ? ! ? ] ]","[......As well as Canalis-sama, a former Otherworld God who now serves Kaito-sama...... t- that is all.]","[ [ ........................ ] ]","The Marquis and his wife wore expressions that perfectly embodied the word speechless, staring in utter shock.","An unbearably heavy silence settled over the three of them...... before the Marquis muttered quietly......","[......That gathering of gods...... is it really something an ordinary human is allowed to attend?]","[......If anything...... I wish someone would tell me I’m not allowed...... truly...... from the bottom of my heart......]","In response, Eris, her face steeped in despair and her eyes devoid of light, stared vacantly into space as she spoke.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......Yeah. It does have “tea party” in the title...... It makes you think the stomachache is being diverted to another target, only for Alice to quickly step in and save that side...... then, once you’ve let your guard down from the feint, it comes back and grinds your stomach to dust. Truly a devil......]"]},{"number":2563,"title":"Chapter 2563 - Housemate 1","paragraphs":["My house is almost the same size and exterior as Lilia-san’s...... A Duchy’s mansion, and it has quite a large number of rooms. In Lilia-san’s case, there are many live-in workers, so having a lot of rooms makes sense, but in my house, the rooms are honestly more than enough.","As for those rooms, I rent out some of them at cheap rates to people I’m close with. Right now, there are three people living in my house: one of the cooks from Lilia-san’s mansion, one member of the security team, and one maid. No matter how spacious it is, we’re still under the same roof, so naturally, we run into each other inside the house from time to time.","Today, I happened to run into one of them in the hallway. She was holding a paper bag, looking like she had just come back from shopping, and when she noticed me, she casually raised a hand in greeting.","[......Hm? Ya, Kaito-kun.]","[Vanessa-san...... Eh? Did you really go shopping dressed like that?]","Looking at Vanessa-san, a woman around 160 cm tall with a slightly listless vibe, wearing an oversized, baggy T-shirt and hot pants, her messy black hair loosely tied into a single bundle, I couldn’t help but ask.","I mean, her outfit was way too relaxed...... more like something you’d wear lounging around your room. And since Vanessa-san has a rather large chest, I could kind of tell...... she probably wasn’t even wearing a bra.","[Ah, no, I did go shopping in proper clothes. I just make my clothes with magic, you know. I changed after I got back...... I mean, if I went out dressed like this and got spotted by someone like Illness-san, I’d get a seriously harsh lecture......]","[I’m glad to hear that. Did you buy ingredients or something?]","[I’ve got a day off tomorrow, so I figured I’d have a few drinks tonight. Picked up some snacks to go with it. I mean, the underground bar is nice and all, but bars are, you know, stylish. Don’t you think there’s a kind of work fatigue that can only be soothed by chugging cheap alcohol? Oh, and I wanted to stop by the casino too......]","[That sounds like the main reason, doesn’t it? ......So, how’d it go?]","[I got completely wrecked...... Man, that’s weird~~ I really felt like I was going to win today~~]","This Vanessa-san...... she loves alcohol, cigarettes, and gambling...... how should I put it, she’s very much a hopeless adult woman. But when she’s working, her demeanor is completely different, serious and sharp. In her private life though, she’s basically always slacking off...... Still, she’s an easygoing and kind person. When I was first summoned to this world and came to Lilia-san’s mansion, she was one of the first to casually talk to me without any prejudice. We got along well as we talked more, and now she’s renting a room here.","[I mean, I work hard every day, so you’d think they’d at least let me win a little at gambling~~]","[Is your job really that tough?]","[Well, I think all labor is basically crap. If I could, I’d rather live without working. I’ve got the money, so technically I could...... but, you know, I’m the kind of trash who can objectively look at herself. If I quit my job, I’d probably end up living like total garbage. So I figure having a job gives my life some structure.]","[You’re saying some pretty extreme things......]","[I mean, if you took my job away, I’d just spend all my time drinking, smoking, and gambling. I’d become the perfect example of a useless slob.]","Vanessa-san pulled a cigarette from her pocket and held it between her lips without lighting it, giving a wry smile...... Well, just like she says, her private life leans pretty heavily toward the hopeless side, but she’s straightforward and easygoing. Even now, she laughs cheerfully, her carefree attitude making her someone very easy to talk to.","[......Oh, right, Kaito-kun, are you free?]","[Eh? Yeah, I don’t have any particular plans......]","[Oh, nice. Then come drink some cheap booze with this Onee-san~~]","[......Didn’t you say this was for the evening? It’s still the middle of the day......]","[......Well, you know, if we keep drinking until night, it counts as an evening drink. So yeah, let’s drink in my room!]","[I mean, I don’t mind......]","I do end up drinking with Vanessa-san fairly often. It’s just, it’s usually in the dining hall or at Iris-san’s bar, so this might be the first time drinking in Vanessa-san’s room.","I’ve gone over to her room a few times before to hang out, like when we played video games together. And despite how openly sloppy she is, her room is actually pretty clean.","[Honestly, your vibe when you’re working and when you’re off-duty are completely different, Vanessa-san.]","[I’m the type who keeps work and private life strictly separate. I do take my job seriously, you know. I’ve got a fair amount of sense of responsibility, after all~~]","[Well, I mean...... you are the “Head Maid”, right?]","[Ugh, I really think Illness-sensei should be the Head Maid. I mean, doesn’t it totally not suit me? Man, if Luna-chan wasn’t assigned to Lilia-chan, I’d totally hand the position over to her~~]","Muttering in a somewhat low-energy tone, Vanessa-san really gives off that laid-back, listless Onee-san vibe. When she’s working, she’s incredibly sharp and speaks politely, so the gap between that and her private self is honestly huge.","And so, we started heading toward Vanessa-san’s room, but...... errr...... every time she takes a step, her chest sways a lot, and I really don’t know where to look.","[......Um...... Vanessa-san...... I, uh...... don’t know where I’m supposed to look......]","[Unn? Ah, my chest? Well, yeah, it sways a lot when I walk, and sometimes it rubs and hurts unexpectedly. But bras are tight and uncomfortable...... Maybe it’s just because they’re unnecessarily big?]","[No, I wouldn’t know...... but it’s really awkward for me......]","[It’s fine, don’t worry about it. If it bothers you, just look, look. I don’t mind. I mean, I look pretty good, right? Even if I’m a mess on the inside, my appearance’s decent enough. Not like you need it, but you can use me as material if you want~~]","Because she keeps that low-energy tone the whole time, it really does feel like she genuinely doesn’t care...... but even so...... there’s no way I could just go “Alright, sure, I’ll take a good look”......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [So he’s renting out the extra rooms...... I remember that coming up before. Putting that aside, is she an unexpectedly rare downer-type personality you don’t usually see?]"]},{"number":2564,"title":"Chapter 2564 - Housemate 2","paragraphs":["I ended up coming to Vanessa-san’s room after being invited to have drinks in the middle of the day. It’s not like this is my first time here, so it’s not particularly new to me, but as always, the room is neatly organized and spotless. Seeing Vanessa-san like this in her private space, I can’t help but feel a bit surprised.","[I’ve always thought of this, but your room is really clean, Vanessa-san.]","[Mm ~ well, I just don’t like living in a messy or dirty room. And given my line of work, I’m pretty good at cleaning. Ah, Kaito-kun, just sit anywhere around there.]","It’s easy to forget because of how laid-back she is in private, but Vanessa-san is the Head Maid of a Duchy. Naturally, her skills as a maid are top-notch.","Also, she doesn’t go on about strange things like “Maid Power” or “Maid Spirit”, so personally, I think she’s a properly competent maid.","Well, in this world, the “proper” type of maid is actually the kind that does talk about Maid Power and all that......","As I was thinking about that, Vanessa-san gestured for me to sit on the sofa and then walked over to a box-shaped magic tool in the room...... something like a refrigerator.","[Beer’s fine, right?]","[Yeah, that’s fine——– huh? Wait, V- Vanessa-san!? What are you doing!?]","[Eh? No, I’m getting the beer ready......]","[Not that, your bottom!? Why did you take off your hot pants and end up in your underwear!?]","It happened so suddenly that I was completely caught off guard. I turned my gaze toward Vanessa-san as she opened the fridge to grab some beer, thinking to myself that it seemed to contain nothing but alcohol, only for my eyes to immediately catch sight of her hot pants disappearing, revealing black underwear and the clearly defined, well-shaped curve of her hips.","[......Well, hot pants feel too tight for drinking, and this is usually what I wear when I’m relaxing in my room.]","[No, no, I’m here too, you know!?]","[I don’t really mind if it’s you...... Ah, well, if it bothers you, I can make the shirt bigger...... there, like this.]","Right after saying that in her usual low-energy tone, the hem of the T-shirt she was wearing extended down to about her knees...... Though honestly, that look was indecent in its own way, b- but well, it’s better than before...... probably.","Then Vanessa-san grabbed several bottles of beer, along with a magic tool that controls airflow for smoking, and sat down on the sofa across from me, placing the bottles on the table.","[For snacks, I bought some earlier......]","[Oh, dried squids huh...... quite a variety here.]","[It’s simple, but it goes best with alcohol. And it’s easy since there’s no cooking involved.]","There were whole dried squids, shredded squid, and probably some octopus too, plus fish, something that looked like stingray fin. In any case, there was quite a variety and a generous amount. It seemed like she was planning to drink quite seriously.","Even now, she casually brought four bottles of beer, and the fact that she placed all four on the table right from the start suggested she intended to drink at a pretty fast pace.","[Here, Kaito-kun, your glass.]","[Ah, thanks.]","[Sorry if I spill~~]","Vanessa-san handed me a glass, then casually popped open the beer bottle cap with her thumb and poured it for me. The fact that she removed the cap so naturally without using an opener just goes to show that, in the end, she’s one of the superhumans known as maids.","[Alright then, cheers~~]","[Cheers.]","[......Gulp...... Puhaahh! Cold beer really is the best. Ahh, Kaito-kun, feel free to snack on whatever you like.]","After lightly clinking our glasses, she immediately downed the beer in one go, a blissful smile spreading across her face as she picked up some dried squid and bit into it...... Is this really the Head Maid of a Duchy? She looks exactly like some middle-aged guy enjoying his weekend......","[......This beer goes down pretty smoothly.]","[It tastes good, right? I like this one too. I forgot where I bought it though......]","[Ehhh......]","[Well, whenever I see something, I just buy it and toss it into the cooling magic tool, so I don’t really remember where I got what. Anyway, as long as cheap booze tastes good, that’s all that matters.]","As she said that, Vanessa-san naturally lit up a cigarette as if it were second nature. Thanks to the magic tool, no smoke drifted my way, but even though it was still daytime, this was completely the vibe of someone having drinks before a day off.","Well, that’s fine, but I wish she wouldn’t casually throw her legs up on the sofa like that. She should at least be aware that her current outfit is pretty risky...... No, with her, she’s definitely aware, she just doesn’t care......","[You really like beer, don’t you, Vanessa-san?]","[I like it cold. Lager over ale. I prefer something with a bit of bitterness.]","[If we’re talking beer, I prefer lager too.]","[Looks like we get along~~. And cheap booze is nice since you don’t have to worry about it. You know what I mean? Fancy wine is good and all, but it feels like you’re expected to drink it with a certain level of elegance or something. You can’t just chug it freely.]","[Right, wine definitely has that refined image. I do feel like I have to sit up a bit straighter when drinking it.]","[Yep, yep. That’s why I like drinks you can just casually down~~. We really do get along, Kaito-kun. Want me to give you a kiss?]","[Are you already drunk?]","[I want to get drunk quickly, but not quite there yet~~.]","Laughing lightly, Vanessa-san still carried that languid air about her, yet she looked like she was genuinely enjoying herself. Somehow, she really is easy to talk to.","Though the label “hopeless” definitely applies to her, she still gives off that strong vibe of an easygoing older woman you can relax around.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [......That’s it, right? She’s covering it up with that easygoing attitude, but her affection toward Kaito is actually pretty high...... Yeah, I know her type, I’m very well informed about them already!]"]},{"number":2565,"title":"Chapter 2565 - Housemate 3","paragraphs":["Drinking in the room with Vanessa-san, she sat across from me in a rather daring outfit, no bra, just underwear and a T-shirt. With her downer-type beauty, it felt like the kind of situation that would normally make anyone flustered, but for now, the way she drank beer and smoked so casually gave off such a strong middle-aged man vibe that it somehow barely balanced out...... actually, is it even balanced? It feels more like it just turned things into chaos......","[So, by the way, Vanessa-san, what game did you play at the casino today?]","[Today I played Seven Card Poker.]","[Ah, that’s the one where you pick five cards out of seven to make a hand, right?]","[Yeah, yeah. The one I played wasn’t just about winning or losing, it changed the multiplier depending on how strong your hand was when you won. If you manage to win with a strong hand, the return gets bigger.]","The Seven Card Poker Vanessa-san played was a game I had seen before at the casino I once went to with Alice.","Normally poker uses five cards, but this version gives you seven, making it easier to form hands. However, that also means the dealer tends to get stronger hands too, so something like two pair almost never wins. It feels like a more flat version of poker.","[Man, it was so close. If I’d gotten a heart on the final change, it would’ve been a flush. If I’d gotten a 3, it would’ve been a straight. And if it was the 3 of hearts, it would’ve been a straight flush, a really exciting hand. I was totally convinced the flow was with me, so I bet big...... and then, unbelievably, after changing three cards, I didn’t get a single heart or a 3, and ended with just one pair.]","[That’s really unfortunate. Setting aside the 3, statistically getting a heart for a flush sounded pretty likely. But still, if you didn’t have a made hand yet at the time of the change, maybe you shouldn’t have bet big......]","[That’s easy to say afterward. When you’re in the moment, you just end up betting...... Kaito-kun, you seem like you’d be good at casinos.]","[I’m banned from the casino near the North District of the royal capital.]","[Ahaha, I doubt you’d cheat, so you must’ve won too much and got banned huh? What did you play?]","When I told her about going there with Alice and ending up getting tearfully begged by the casino manager, on his knees, not to ever come back, Vanessa-san laughed and slapped her knee in amusement.","[I tried a bunch of things, but for poker...... I played a version with jokers.]","[Ah, the one where Five of a Kind becomes the strongest hand. So, how ridiculous was your winning streak?]","[I played three times. The moment I was dealt my cards, it was Five of a Kind, Royal Straight Flush, and then Five of a Kind.]","[Bwahahaha! That’s completely unfair! With the Blessing you have, Kaito-kun’s luck is insane. Though...... I guess always winning might get boring. It’s not like you’re after money anyway.]","Back then, that was true, but now I probably have even more Blessings than before, so I feel like all three rounds would just end up being Five of a Kind from the start.","If that happened, it really wouldn’t be fun like Vanessa-san said, so even if I weren’t banned, I doubt I’d go to a casino.","[Ahh, but in things like monster races, if I think and choose for myself, the Blessing doesn’t affect it. If I just pick randomly because I don’t understand what’s going on though, then luck kicks in and I win......]","[I see, so if it’s something you think through yourself, it’s fine. I like monster races too, but there’s no racetrack in the royal capital. Maybe because it would compete with the casinos......]","[When I tried it, it was in the Archlesia Empire.]","[Come to think of it, in your world, you bet money on horse races, right?]","[Yeah, horse racing. I haven’t seen anything like that in this world though......]","My impression had been that monster races occupied the same position as what we’d call horse racing, but was that actually the case? Do horse races themselves even exist here?","[There are horse races, but it’s more like nobles having their own horses compete against each other. There’s almost no betting...... or rather, they’re not really open to the public. It’s more like one of those events hosted by nobles. Lilia-chan sometimes enters her own horses too. Though it’s more of a social obligation among nobles, Lilia-chan herself doesn’t seem all that interested.]","[I see, so horse races do exist. Then it shouldn’t be strange for betting on them to exist too buy...... is it because there are monster races instead?]","[That’s probably part of it, but more simply, it’s hard to tell the difference between horse-type monsters and normal horses. A lot of them look almost identical...... but even if they look the same, monsters with magic power are overwhelmingly faster.]","[But if you can see magic power, you should be able to tell...... ah, right.]","[Exactly. There aren’t many humans who can use magic after all. If people started making a fuss about horse-type monsters being mixed in whenever they lost, it’d be a huge hassle. So as a form of gambling, it probably comes with too many complications.]","[I see......]","The difference between monsters and normal animals comes down to whether they possess magic power, so anyone who can use magic can tell at a glance, but since few humans can use magic, if they can’t distinguish them by appearance, it would inevitably lead to trouble.","If monsters were allowed to participate, then it might as well just be a monster race, there wouldn’t be much point in doing it as horse racing......","[As expected of Vanessa-san...... you really know your stuff when it comes to gambling.]","[Leave it to me. I’ve got plenty of knowledge that’s completely useless in life...... Apparently when you eat chocolate, your brain gets about four times more excited than when you kiss...... want to try it?]","[Doesn’t chocolate not really go with beer?]","[That’s true...... maybe we should try it when we’re drinking wine or whiskey~~]","I figured she was only half joking as she teased me...... but somehow, if I had just gone along with it, it felt like Vanessa-san might actually have gone through with it, so I decided to steer the conversation elsewhere.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [If I remember right, it was originally something like, the lingering pleasure of letting dark chocolate melt on your tongue lasts about four times longer than a deep kiss......]"]},{"number":2566,"title":"Chapter 2566 - Housemate 4","paragraphs":["Vanessa-san and I had already been having our home-drinking...... room-drinking? Well, since this is my house, calling it “home-drinking” isn’t exactly wrong. Anyhow, we had already been drinking for a while, and now there were about four empty beer bottles lined up beside her. She drinks fast...... at this rate, I wouldn’t be surprised if she started chugging straight from the bottle before long.","That said, I’ve had drinks with Vanessa-san a few times before, but I still haven’t seen her get drunk at all...... for her, this amount isn’t even a warm-up. At this stage, she’s still in the “I wanna get drunk already~~” phase, and after a bit more, she’ll go “I guess I’m a little tipsy now~”...... and then she’ll stay like that all the way to the end.","[Now that I think about it, Vanessa-san, you’re pretty strong when it comes to alcohol, aren’t you? It’s not like you’re nullifying it with a Blessing like me or sobering up with magic, right?]","[Unn. Well, I guess it’s just my constitution. I’ve got about a quarter dwarven blood in me...... though it’s not like I can’t use magic to get rid of the effects of alcohol. If I drink too much the day before work, I’ll use magic to deal with it and get rid of the smell too. I can’t exactly show up to work reeking of alcohol.]","As usual, her tone sounded a bit low-energy, but there was a slight liveliness to her voice, she was clearly in a good mood. Right now, Vanessa-san gave off such a strong “middle-aged guy drinking in a tatami living room” vibe that it felt out of place in this Western-style room. But when she’s working, she’s perfectly sharp and composed, giving off the aura of a capable woman with no openings...... well, this is what she’s like in private.","[By the way, Vanessa-san, you weren’t originally from the knight order like the others, you’ve been a maid since your time in the royal castle, right?]","[Unn. When Lilia-chan received her title and started her household, she got permission from His Majesty and put out a call for volunteers...... you know, for maids and servants and the like. I volunteered and came over. Technically it’s a bit different, but in terms of how I’m treated, it’s pretty much the same as Illness-sensei.]","Apparently, in Illness-san’s case, Lilia-san personally asked her to come along, but outwardly, it’s presented as her having volunteered and been hired as a maid by a newly established Duchy.","[Do a lot of people usually volunteer for something like that?]","[Hmm, Lilia-chan’s case was pretty special. New noble houses do recruit servants and maids, but those are usually filled through introductions or organizations like the World Maid Association. It’s pretty rare for recruitment to happen at the royal castle itself. Lilia-chan is royalty, after all, and His Majesty was probably worried about her starting a new household, so he opened it up to volunteers.]","[Ahh, that does sound like something Ryze-san would do.]","If I had to guess, the timing was probably around when there was all that paranoia due to the knight order’s information tampering. From Ryze-san’s perspective, he likely wanted to select trustworthy personnel from within the royal castle, people whose backgrounds could be easily verified, to serve at Lilia-san’s residence.","Still, taking care of everything personally would come with its own complications due to his position, so considering all that, he probably settled on a volunteer-based system.","[Were there a lot of applicants?]","[Nope, hardly any. Even if it’s for a Duchy, it’s still newly established, and in terms of salary and stability, working at the royal castle is better. Well, since it’s new and short on staff, there’s a chance to be highly valued if you prove yourself capable, but in reality, the only ones who applied were a small group who were already quite close to Lilia-chan. That’s also why quite a few people switched from being knights to becoming servants or maids.]","I’ve heard that many of the servants in Lilia-san’s household are former members of the knight order. Apparently, Illness-san personally trained a considerable number of them, including the maids, so you could say that nearly all the servants and maids in the mansion are her students. That’s precisely why there are so many voices supporting her as the Head Maid, and Lilia-san herself would like that too.","The only issue is that Illness-san has absolutely no intention of taking the position.","[......I see. So, Vanessa-san, you were close with Lilia-san back when she was still a princess, and that’s why you volunteered?]","[Nope, not at all. We had some level of interaction because of our positions, but we hardly ever talked~~]","[Ehhhh...... T- Then why did you volunteer?]","[I thought I’d have it easier here, you know~~ Even if things were hectic since it’s a new household, Illness-sensei would be there, so I figured the work might be fairly relaxed...... plus, if Illness-sensei left, I had a feeling I’d get reassigned under Bea-senpai......]","[Bea-senpai?]","[Beatrice-senpai. She’s a good person, but she’s the strict type, both with herself and with others.]","[Ahh, I see.]","Yeah, considering Vanessa-san often says that work is a pain, her work style probably doesn’t mesh well with Beatrice-san, who’s practically called the ultimate super maid at heart.","Still, she calls her “Bea-senpai”, and refers to Illness-san in a similar way, so it doesn’t seem like they’re on bad terms.","[It was a miscalculation, though~~ Seriously. I never expected that most of the maids would be inexperienced..... well, more like they were just freshly trained under Illness-sensei, and that in terms of both experience and ability, I’d end up second only to her...... and then get placed in the Head Maid position that she turned down......]","[But you’re doing a solid job as Head Maid, aren’t you?]","[Well, you see, I might consider myself a bit of a scumbag, but I’m the kind who doesn’t cause trouble for others. Well, maybe except when I get drunk and mess with Kaito-kun......]","[Hey, doesn’t that count as causing trouble?]","[C’mon, look at our relationship~~ Let’s get all intimate~~]","After casually replying like that, Vanessa-san stood up, walked over to the sofa where I was sitting, and plopped down beside me, deliberately throwing an arm around my shoulders.","Wait, she’s only wearing a T-shirt! Or does she realize that and just not care......? Either way, with her doing something like this, I can’t help but feel how soft she is, and even though I try to stay composed, my heart is pounding like crazy.","[Vanessa-san, are you drunk already?]","[I wanna get drunk already~~ but not quite yet, I guess.]","It seemed like, for Vanessa-san, it was just a light joke, more like casual physical affection. She quickly pulled her arm away, gave a wry smile, and went back to drinking.","......Eh? Arehh? ......Is she just going to keep drinking right next to me like this?","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Aren’t they already flirting!? These two are totally all over each other!!!]"]},{"number":2567,"title":"Chapter 2567 - Housemate 5","paragraphs":["Vanessa-san, who had moved beside me, pulled back the arm she had around my shoulder, but stayed where she was and continued drinking. It didn’t seem like she had any intention of returning to her seat across from me.","[But seriously, Kaito-kun, letting me rent this room really made things easier.]","[Arehh? But weren’t you already living at Lilia-san’s mansion? In that case, isn’t it not that different?]","Vanessa-san...... well, more accurately, the servants and private soldiers at Lilia-san’s mansion could be given a room if they wished. The servants had their own rooms within the mansion; they were smaller than the guest rooms, about the size of a one-room apartment, but the rent was cheap since it was deducted from their salary, and meals were included.","As for the private soldiers, many of them lived in something like a dormitory with a training ground a short distance behind the mansion. However, a few individuals, like the captain of the guards, Sieg-san, had rooms inside the mansion and stayed there.","Of course, there were also commuters like Luna-san, but the mansion itself was located in the central district where nobles kept their estates, essentially a high-end residential area, so it was difficult to rent a place nearby, and even if you could, the monthly rent would be quite high.","If you rented somewhere cheaper, it would be a fair distance from Lilia-san’s mansion, making the daily commute difficult, which is why there weren’t many commuters.","In Luna-san’s case, her abilities were exceptional, and since she could arrive in mere seconds during early morning hours when there were few people around, running at high speed, she was a special case.","Vanessa-san had also been given a room at Lilia-san’s mansion. Given her position as the Head Maid, she had a larger room compared to other servants, so even after moving to my house, it didn’t feel like things would be that different.","[Well, you know, living at your workplace...... it’s like there’s this last-line stopper deep in your heart, holding you back. Even if it’s supposed to be your private time and you’re trying to relax, it still feels like there are limits. Like, you can’t just wander around half-naked after a bath or anything......]","[No, please don’t do that at my house either. But yeah, I think I kind of get what you’re saying. Even if it’s practically next door, does it feel different mentally?]","[Even if the difference is just a single connecting corridor, there’s a big difference between it being your workplace or not. Also, your rooms are huge but the rent is ridiculously cheap...... well, I understand that this bargain rent exists thanks to the bond of the love between me and you, Kaito-kun.]","[I’m only taking it as a formality anyway. Ah, could you pass me the bottle?]","[I’ll pour it for you~~]","The rent I charged people renting rooms, including Vanessa-san, was 100R per month...... about 10,000 yen in Japanese currency. Honestly, I didn’t really need rent in the first place. I already had more money than I could spend, so it’s not like I wanted extra income from rent. I only rented the rooms out because people I was close to wanted them.","That said, making it completely free would probably make them feel awkward, so I set it up as a formal rental arrangement and charged 100R. People said it was far too cheap, but since I was just renting out rooms that weren’t being used anyway, it was basically pure profit for me, if anything, I was the one benefiting.","[We can use the bath as much as we want too. I’m really living well thanks to you.]","[Ahaha, honestly, my place was way too big for me to handle alone, so having people I’m close with living here and making it lively actually makes me happy. Even so, there are still plenty of rooms left over.]","[It’s the same size as Lilia-chan’s mansion, so of course there’d be extras. Well, I assume the unused rooms got State Preservation Magic, so it’s not like managing them is much trouble.]","[Yeah. That said, I don’t feel like renting them out to just anyone.]","[Well, this is your home after all. You wouldn’t want just anyone unless you really trust them~~ Hmm? Could that have been an indirect approach just now? I like you too, Kaito-kun~~]","[Are you drunk?]","[I feel like I’m just about getting nicely tipsy~~]","In reality, just as Vanessa-san said, the only people I rented rooms to were those I genuinely got along with and trusted...... or in other words, people I liked.","Aside from family like my parents and Anima, there were five others, Aoi-chan, Hina-chan, and including Vanessa-san...... and then there was Canalis-san? No, Canalis-san could be counted as family like Anima and the others.","In that sense, what Vanessa-san said wasn’t wrong. When it came to whether I liked her or not, I could answer without hesitation that I do.","[......Oh, this dried shellfish is pretty good.]","[Good eye. That’s...... errr, where did I buy that again?]","[Didn’t you just buy it today?]","[Hmm, I did the shopping first, put everything into the Magic Box, and then went to the casino, so my head’s full of casino stuff and I don’t really remember. I think it was on a street in the north district~~]","[Isn’t there also a place around there that has really good cheese?]","[Ah, yeah, there is. That shop with the slightly unusual sign, right? Their stuff is rich and delicious. It’s more suited for enjoying with wine than as a beer snack, though......]","[For beer, maybe something like smoked cheese?]","[That’s nice. Smoked stuff goes perfectly with it.]","Even just chatting about trivial things like this while drinking, the conversation never really stalled, and it was fun. It made me feel that we definitely had good chemistry.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [These two are getting pretty flirty...... well, that aside, there’s probably a God somewhere out there that got hit by a stray bullet and is writhing in agony.]"]},{"number":2568,"title":"Chapter 2568 - Housemate 6","paragraphs":["Originally, Vanessa-san had bought these snacks intending to enjoy a quiet drink alone, so with the two of us eating together, the pace at which they were being consumed was fairly fast.","Well, to begin with, Vanessa-san was drinking at a rapid pace, so that naturally sped up how quickly the snacks disappeared...... though there was still plenty left. Still, I was starting to get a bit tired of dried foods, so I decided to take out something suitable from the Magic Box.","[......Wait a second, Kaito-kun. These eggs...... aren’t they ridiculously delicious?]","[They were smoked by Nebula and Illness-san using chips from the World Tree. Not just meat and fish, there were fruits too. I received quite a variety.]","What Vanessa-san was praising so highly were smoked eggs about the size of quail eggs. You could eat them in a single bite, and they had a rich flavor with an excellent smoky aroma. Combined with how easy they were to eat, they felt perfectly suited as snacks to go with alcohol.","[If you’re going to serve something this delicious, it would be rude of me not to bring out my own hidden stash. No helping it, I’ll show you my finest.]","[Your finest? That sounds exciti...... Vanessa-san? Wait, w- what are you doing!?]","[Well, it should be hidden here......]","[Do you realize what you’re wearing right now!? Please don’t go rummaging under the bed dressed like that!]","After declaring she’d bring out her special stash, Vanessa-san dropped to all fours in front of the bed and reached underneath, trying to retrieve something.","However, she was currently dressed in nothing but underwear and an oversized T-shirt. To make matters worse, the bed was directly in front of where I was sitting.","Which meant that, from my perspective, the way she looked in that position...... was far too stimulating. The motion of reaching under the bed ended up emphasizing her hips even more.","I noticed immediately and quickly looked away, but even turning my face aside, I could still catch glimpses of it at the edge of my vision. Or rather, my awareness kept drifting that way...... it was a rather complicated state of mind.","[Oh, got it, got it. It was farther back than I thought.]","[......Vanessa-san, did you get it? Is it safe for me to look again now?]","[If you wanted to look, you could’ve just looked...... you’re quite the gentleman.]","[Even if this is your own room, your guard is way too low, you’re basically completely unguarded...... There’s a member of the opposite sex here, you know?]","Pulling out what looked like a tightly sealed box from under the bed, Vanessa-san returned to sit beside me in high spirits, showing absolutely no sign of concern.","At this point, I was convinced that even if I had been staring the whole time, she wouldn’t have minded in the slightest.","[Hmm, I guess that depends on the person. You’ve got plenty of options, so there’s no need for you to be desperate, and it’s not really in your nature anyway...... As for me, even if you suddenly pushed me down right here, I’d probably just accept it with the thought “Want a little exercise between drinks?” That’s about how much I like you, Kaito-kun~~. Arehh? Where’s the knot...... maybe on the back?]","[You really just say things like that so casually......]","The troubling part was that Vanessa-san wasn’t joking, she genuinely meant it...... If I were to lose to temptation and make a move here, she’d probably accept it in that same relaxed manner.","As she spoke, Vanessa-san turned the box around in her hands, trying to undo the tightly wound string wrapped around it.","[Well, it’s not like I want something as over-the-top as a boyfriend or husband, that just sounds like a pain so I’ll pass on that, but I do have a normal sex drive, and if it’s someone I like, I don’t mind being held at all~~. And if you ever feel like a change of pace, just let me know, okay~~? Oh, it opened. Wanna have a taste?]","[......Taste of what?]","[For now, the secret snack, I guess...... so, what do you think?]","[Black meat? Is it something marinated?]","Being lightly dressed and mentally completely unguarded, Vanessa-san’s teasing was especially tough to deal with while I had alcohol in me. So I tried not to dwell on what she’d just said and instead focused on the secret snack.","At a glance, it looked like blackened meat, and it was clear it had been marinated in something. That was probably why she’d stored it under the bed instead of in the Magic Box. Time doesn’t pass inside the Magic Box, so it’s not suitable for marinating.","[This is actually fish. By cutting it into chunks and applying a special State Preservation Magic, you can let the sauce soak in without it going bad. It’s pretty advanced magic, and it also slows down the aging process a lot, so it takes time to finish, but the taste is incredible.]","[Hehh. Well then, since we have it, I’ll try one...... oh, wow. The flavor is incredibly rich, but it still clearly tastes like fish...... it goes really well with beer.]","[Right? Eating this while drinking...... ahh, that’s the best!]","Vanessa-san’s secret snack tasted somewhat like marinated tuna, but far more complex. The more you chewed, the more umami spread through your mouth. Despite clearly being well-aged, it still carried a freshness reminiscent of just-caught sashimi. As expected of something she called her secret stash, it was exceptionally delicious.","Unn, it really is delicious. Delicious is good, but...... Vanessa-san? You’ve moved so close you’re practically pressed up against me. Is that intentional, or not......? I can’t quite tell, and with how loose her neckline is in this outfit, I’m not sure where I’m supposed to look when glancing downward......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Oi, cut the cr*p. You two are already basically lovers...... that distance is totally like a couple drinking together at home, isn’t it!? You’re flirting like crazy!!! Where the hell is the seriousness!?]","? ? ? : [If it’s not there, then it’s just not there.]"]},{"number":2569,"title":"Chapter 2569 - Intermission: An Emotion Whose Name I Do Not Know","paragraphs":["My personal creed is that moderation is best in all things in life. Human beings aren’t made to constantly give 100% at all times. If you keep pushing yourself at full power nonstop, eventually something is bound to break.","That’s why I think using around 70% of your strength in everyday life is enough. Of course, if you live long enough, there will probably be a few moments where you truly have to stake everything and give it your all. In those situations, you can give 100%, even 120% if necessary. But that’s only for extraordinary circumstances.","I don’t want to exhaust myself trying my hardest through ordinary daily life, and I’d rather avoid effort whenever possible.","It’s not like I look down on people who work hard with everything they’ve got. I do think effort is important, and I think people who can genuinely give their all are amazing...... it’s just that I personally don’t want to work that hard, and I’d rather avoid effort whenever I can.","It’s not that I lack desires. I want money, and I want to eat delicious food too...... but it’s not like I dream of owning more wealth than I could ever spend and living extravagantly, nor do I want to taste every delicacy in the world. As long as I can live comfortably without hardship, that’s enough for me.","Maybe you could call me detached. Maybe even dried up. But honestly, I’m not dissatisfied with my life, and somehow or another, I enjoy living it well enough.","I think labor is universally awful, and I hate the structure of society where you can’t survive without working. Still, if I were to spend my days doing absolutely nothing and living in complete laziness, that probably wouldn’t be very enjoyable either...... when I think about how much more satisfying holidays feel because of the daily grind, maybe work, despite being awful, is necessary for a fulfilling life.","I like alcohol, cigarettes, and gambling, I hate troublesome things, and I don’t really have any strong beliefs or pride to speak of...... I’m fully aware that makes me kind of a worthless person, but as long as I’m not causing trouble for anyone else...... I think living leisurely and happily is best, so I don’t really worry about it.","I may think work is awful and admit that I’m a bit of a scumbag, but that doesn’t mean I do my job carelessly or slack off.","I take my work seriously...... I just don’t give it absolutely everything I have.","It’s not like some dramatic event in my past changed my outlook on life, or that I had some defining trigger that made me think this way. I’ve simply always been like this.","And for someone like me, the three people who arrived here from another world because of a summoning accident...... well, to be honest, I didn’t particularly care.","After the summoning accident actually happened and it was decided that Kaito-kun, Aoi-chan, and Hina-chan would be staying at the mansion, they became a frequent topic of conversation among the servants and maids for quite some time.","Especially Kaito-kun, who, for various reasons, was the first man to visit Lilia-chan’s mansion in ages, people had plenty of both sympathetic and critical opinions about him.","The sympathy, well, I thought that was fine. He’d essentially been thrown into a completely unfamiliar world without warning, so of course, he was probably anxious about a lot of things. Wanting to look after him or help him seemed perfectly natural to me.","The negative opinions, on the other hand...... honestly, I just thought, Are these people idiots? Before being a man or an otherworlder, he was a guest personally welcomed by Lilia-chan, the lord of the mansion. I genuinely couldn’t understand the mindset of servants deciding how to treat him based on their personal likes or dislikes.","Whether someone is a woman or a man, a native or an otherworlder, if Lilia-chan acknowledges them as a guest, then they are a guest, and you treat them appropriately...... that seemed obvious to me, but maybe some of the former knights among the staff were just a little too hot-blooded.","Well, Illness-sensei was openly on Kaito-kun’s side, and plenty of people couldn’t stand up to her, so eventually the negative opinions naturally faded away......","As for my own thoughts on the matter, I truly couldn’t have cared less. Both sympathy and criticism take energy in their own way. I figured I’d just properly carry out the duties assigned to me as a maid of Lilia-chan’s mansion and interact with them normally. That was all there was to it.","......You really never know, huh? Somehow, before I realized it, I’d gotten surprisingly close with Kaito-kun. Hmm...... maybe that was it? Being pitied probably makes the person on the receiving end feel awkward too, so maybe having someone like me around, who treated him normally without overthinking things, felt comfortable for him.","I don’t really know though...... we simply got along well. Outside of work, I’m incredibly laid-back and pretty careless about most things...... and Kaito-kun’s also the type who relaxes a lot in private. Well, unlike me, he’s the kind of person who can properly pull himself together when it matters, so saying we’re alike might be rude, but...... we clicked in that easygoing sort of way, became close, and...... hmm, before I noticed it, I think I’d come to like him quite a lot.","It’s not like there was some dramatic event or a romance novel-style development. We just talked normally, got along, became friends, and as we spent more time together, my feelings naturally grew stronger...... it was probably something like that.","If I had to point to one thing, maybe it’s this? Being around Kaito-kun lets me relax and let my guard down, so maybe that’s why it feels comfortable. Hmm...... I don’t really know.","[......Vanessa-san? You suddenly look deep in thought. What’s wrong?]","[Hmm. I was just wondering what makes someone fall in love with another person...... but the more you think about it, the more troublesome it gets. I’m done thinking about it.]","[Ehhhh......]","[It doesn’t really matter what the trigger or reason was. As long as you understand your own feelings, that’s enough, right? So anyway, Kaito-kun, I really like you~~. Which is why...... give me that last egg~~.]","Human emotions really are complicated. It doesn’t feel pure enough to call it love in the romantic sense, yet at the same time, it’s not deep enough to call it devotion either.","I...... don’t know the proper words to describe the feelings I have for you.","So, well, it’s fine. As long as I know that I like you, that I’m happy spending time like this right now, and that I hope these kinds of days continue from now on too...... then that’s probably enough.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Like she herself said, I think the reason Kaito’s affection for her grew was because she treated him naturally from the very beginning, without pitying him or being hostile toward him. There were moments where he got flustered by her sexier side too, and it felt like Kaito was consciously seeing her as a woman...... d*mn it, she seriously has heroine-level potential...... the kind that could make for some really sweet romance scenes...... what a troublesome one......]"]},{"number":2570,"title":"Chapter 2570 - Demon Realm Amusement Park 1","paragraphs":["As I watched the scenery of the Demon Realm flow past outside, I turned toward Aoi-chan and Hina-chan, who both looked like they were having the time of their lives.","[So you two haven’t really been to the Demon Realm much, right?]","[Hardly at all. Just that party on the ship before, and the Harmonic Symphony.]","[Our adventurer work is mostly centered around the Human Realm after all. Though I’ve heard that top-ranked adventurers sometimes get jobs in the Demon Realm and end up helping the Six Kings’ subordinates......]","Right now, we were on our way to the pre-opening of the amusement park Kuro and Alice had built in the Demon Realm. Lilia-san and the others were coming too, but the transport carriage...... well, I guess calling it a carriage was technically correct? Since fitting everyone into a single carriage would’ve been difficult, we split up into groups.","We could’ve just used teleportation magic to get there instantly, but this time the trip itself was part of the pre-opening experience. We were traveling from Kuromu Lake to the amusement park by carriage.","The ten of us were divided up like this: me, Aoi-chan, and Hina-chan in one carriage; Lilia-san, Luna-san, and Sieg-san in another; and Anima, Caraway, Eta, and Theta in the last.","We had invited Illness-san too, but she apparently had other business this time and couldn’t come. She did say she’d join the small trip later on to the hot spring town Shiro-san was building.","[But this carriage is really comfortable. It barely shakes at all...... though the thing pulling it looks less like a horse and more like some gigantic monster......]","[Maybe it’s because the Demon Realm has so many monsters compared to the Human Realm? Normal horses would probably get scared by the monsters’ presence.]","As I listened to Aoi-chan answer Hina-chan’s comment, I looked toward the creature pulling the carriage. It was some kind of dinosaur-like monster.","It was hard to describe exactly, but it looked like a tyrannosaurus with enlarged forelegs walking on all fours...... the kind of thing that looked obviously powerful at first glance.","[I wonder what kind of monster it is?]","[......I think it’s probably a monster called a Grapfoot. They don’t live in the Human Realm, only in the Demon Realm. They really look carnivorous, but if I remember right, they’re actually herbivores.]","[Ooh, as expected of Aoi-senpai, you really know your stuff. Arehh? Somehow, dinosaur-like monsters in the Demon Realm...... isn’t this different from the one we learned about in training?]","Aoi-chan, who probably studied all sorts of things daily as an adventurer, answered my question immediately. Hina-chan, meanwhile, didn’t seem as familiar with the topic and muttered while trying to jog her memory.","[The one from training was the Agisaurus, right? The super dangerous and violent one they warned us not to approach its habitat......]","[......Ah, Bell’s snack......]","I knew the Agisaurus pretty well too, or rather, it was the monster used to make Bell’s favorite beef jerky. Since Bell always looked so happy eating it, it was easy to forget, but apparently it was an extremely dangerous monster whose hide and flesh were both harder than steel.","[But this is exciting! An amusement park, an amusement park! I never thought I’d get to go to one in this world!]","[Hina-chan really does seem like the type who’d love this kind of thing. What about you, Aoi-chan?]","[I do have knowledge about them, but I’ve actually never been to one before.]","The conversation shifted to the amusement park we were heading toward, and Hina-chan’s excitement was exactly what I’d imagined. Her enthusiasm was obvious even from the outside.","On the other hand, I’d never really pictured Aoi-chan as someone who went to amusement parks much, but when I actually asked her, it turned out she’d never been to one at all.","[Ehh!? Aoi-senpai, you’ve never been to an amusement park before? Not even as a kid with your family or something?]","[Go out with the people from that household? ......Just imagining it makes me sick.]","[......You really do casually reveal some pretty dark stuff whenever the topic of your family comes up, Aoi-senpai.]","It wasn’t some rebellious phase or anything like that. Seeing the expression on Aoi-chan’s face, one filled with nothing but pure, visceral disgust, made even Hina-chan respond with an awkward look.","Aoi-chan’s hatred toward her family was completely genuine. Honestly, it felt like she even hated calling them “family” in the first place...... She almost never referred to them that way, usually just saying “my parents’ house”. She truly seemed to despise them from the bottom of her heart.","[W- Well, if it’s your first time, then it’ll probably feel really fresh and exciting, right? I mean, you can probably imagine what the attractions are like, but...... they’ve adapted everything to fit this world, so I bet a lot of things are different.]","[......That’s true. I am looking forward to it when all’s said and done. Kaito-san, you’ve gone before, right?]","[I have, but back then, it was basically still in the stage where Shiro-san had just made it and they were still improving it afterward. I mean, one of Shiro-san’s roller coasters moved at ten times the speed of sound for over 10 minutes...... and the initial version was designed based on Lilia-san’s physical abilities......]","[Ehhhhhh...... A- Are you sure the place we’re going to now is safe!? If it’s designed around Lilia-san’s standards, won’t we get turned into chunks of meat!?]","[W- Well, Kuro and Alice adjusted everything, so it should be fine.]","That was Lilia-san’s standard for you. Well, to be fair, attractions built around Lilia-san’s physical capabilities really would turn ordinary people into minced meat machines......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [This may seem like the moment where I braced myself for the date chapter to happen...... but maybe the real deal is at the hot springs? No, wait, they could also be lulling me into a false sense of security before striking......]"]},{"number":2571,"title":"Chapter 2571 - Demon Realm Amusement Park 2","paragraphs":["After traveling in an incredibly comfortable carriage that barely shook at all, we arrived at the amusement park. Meeting up in front of the entrance...... we all stared at the park with lightly stunned expressions.","[......I- It’s way more authentic than I expected...... this is incredible.]","[Eh? Just from looking at it, doesn’t it seem ridiculously huge?]","I could understand Aoi-chan and Hina-chan’s surprise. Honestly, I was shocked too. Back when Shiro-san had first created it, and when I went around it with Kuro and Alice...... it had still been about the size of an ordinary amusement park.","But what stood before us now was something reminiscent of those famous theme parks in Chiba or Osaka...... no, the entrance alone was already overwhelmingly massive.","[This is truly an absurdly large facility.]","[Indeed. We can’t even grasp its full scale from here...... but if the entrance alone is this enormous, the inside must be on another level entirely.]","[......So Kaito-san’s world has multiple facilities this enormous......]","Naturally, it was Lilia-san, Luna-san, and Sieg-san’s first time seeing an amusement park, and they wore expressions full of curiosity and amazement.","Nearby, Anima and the others were also talking amongst themselves with great interest.","[Cara, this thing’s seriously enormous......]","[We can’t tell the whole scale from the entrance alone, but judging from the area of land owned by Kuromueina-sama around here, the size of the entrance, and the rough estimate from simple magic detection...... this place might exceed a one-kilometer radius from the center.]","[......Theta, how large was the central coliseum in Battle City again?]","[If I remember correctly, its radius was around 500 meters. So if this is even bigger than that...... it might be the largest commercial facility ever built in the Demon Realm.]","The coliseum in Battle City ruled over by Megiddo-san was absolutely enormous. Considering it had been built so the over-ten-meter-tall Megiddo-san could fight at full force, that was only natural.","But according to Anima, Caraway, Eta, and Theta, this amusement park was even larger than that...... which meant it might actually dwarf that certain famous theme park in Chiba.","[But still, this is so exciting! At this size, there’s no way we could see everything in one day, but that just means there must be some amazing attractions here! And look, they even have cute mascots, it really feels like a proper theme park!]","Prompted by Hina-chan’s excited words, I looked around near the entrance and spotted a cat mascot holding a sign that read “Entrance This Way”.","......Unn, how should I put this...... it barely retained its original form anymore. Judging from the fact that it was a cat, it was probably originally based on the cat costume Alice used to wear, but it had been heavily redesigned into something genuinely cute, completely different from the vaguely creepy design it used to have.","Kuro definitely supervised this extensively...... Last time I came here with Kuro and Alice, there had been merchandise based on that mascot suit, but once Kuro became a co-manager, she must’ve mercilessly rejected all the bad designs.","[This is our first time experiencing something like an amusement park at all, so we’ll have to rely on you all to teach us various things, Kaito-san.]","[Even for us, an amusement park of this scale is completely new territory...... but well, we at least have a rough idea of what kinds of facilities and attractions there’ll be, so I think we’ll manage.]","As Lilia-san said, among everyone here, the only ones who truly understood what an amusement park was like were me, Aoi-chan, and Hina-chan. Aoi-chan had apparently never been to one before, but she still probably knew a lot about them in theory.","Then I glanced over at Lilia-san’s group and Anima’s group, and every single one of them was looking at me. When I turned toward Aoi-chan and Hina-chan, they were looking at me too...... Ah, wait...... am I supposed to be the one leading everyone around?","[......For now, let’s go take care of the admission process. If possible, I’d like to get a map of the park or maybe a brochure......]","It was pretty unusual for me to be the one taking charge in a group outing like this instead of Lilia-san, but considering the location was an amusement park, it couldn’t really be helped.","That said, compared to when I came here with Shiro-san, Kuro, and Alice, both the layout and scale were so completely different that I definitely wanted some kind of map before deciding how to go around the place.","[......Ah, wait, never mind. The person who made this place is right here......]","[Eh? Ahh, so I’m supposed to handle that? Here you go, brochures.]","Come to think of it, the one who had built this amusement park together with Kuro was standing right beside us, so if we wanted to know about maps and things like that, asking Alice was obviously the fastest option.","The moment I called out to her, Alice, apparently having expected this already, immediately pulled out enough brochures for everyone and handed them over.","[Thanks...... though there’s one thing I want to ask. What’s with that absurd-looking facility I just saw called “Baby Castella Castle”?]","[That was built because a certain baby-castella idiot forcefully pushed the idea through. We discussed and designed most of the facilities and attractions together, but we agreed to each make one personal project completely free from the other’s interference. That thing’s what Kuro-san created.]","[......I see. Got it.]","Well, naturally, it was the handiwork of that Baby Castella Devil. Honestly, if it hadn’t been, I’d have been more worried. Arehh? That means Alice also made some attraction or facility entirely based on her own personal tastes, didn’t she? Hmm, considering Alice’s personality and preferences...... I have a bad feeling she’d made some ridiculously over-the-top romance-themed attraction.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [She calls herself a sh*tty noob at romance, but Alice really does love romantic stuff and super cliché love events......]","? ? ? : [Careful with your choice of words there, Fake Serious...... or I’ll cook you up and feed you to Makina, you know?]","Serious-senpai : [I haven’t even made fun of anything yet! I’m just talking about the information we’ve gotten so far!!! It’s not like I’m insulting you, okay!?]"]},{"number":2572,"title":"Chapter 2572 - Demon Realm Amusement Park 3","paragraphs":["Since today’s amusement park is in its pre-opening phase, admission is limited to invited guests only, there’s no need to worry about crowds. Alice had thoughtfully given us pamphlets before entry, so we decided to take a look through them together first.","The pamphlet was the fold-out kind. Once unfolded, it displayed a full map of the park along with the names of the major facilities, while the back listed the locations of restaurants, rest areas, and other non-attraction facilities.","[......I expected as much, but this place is enormous.]","[This really feels like a theme park, doesn’t it? The areas are divided up, and each one seems to have its own concept......]","For now, everyone had their own copy of the pamphlet, but there was no point in all of us spreading them out individually, so the group that had been chatting earlier gathered together to look at a single one.","Aoi-chan and Hina-chan leaned in over the pamphlet I had opened, each voicing their impressions. Just as Hina-chan said, it definitely gave off a strong theme park atmosphere.","[There are seven color-coded areas...... The castle in the center must be the Baby Castella Castle Alice mentioned, right? Though on the pamphlet it just looks like an ordinary castle......]","[It feels like the six surrounding areas are encircling the castle area in the middle.]","On the map, there was indeed an illustration of a castle at the center, with six other areas forming a ring around it.","Looking closer, each area had a name....... The central area was called the “Otherworld Area”, while the others were...... the Flame Area, featuring attractions themed around fire and volcanoes; the Ice Area, with a fantastical atmosphere of snow and ice; the Forest Area, themed around nature and woodlands; the Dark Area, with gloomy colors and what looked like haunted house attractions; the Aqua Area, seemingly packed with water-related rides; and the Magic Area, which carried a magical fantasy vibe. Seven areas in total.","[......Could it be that, aside from the Otherworld Area, the other six are themed after the Six Kings?]","[The fire and ice ones definitely fit, and the forest one too, but...... what about the other three?]","It was just a hunch, but it felt like each area had been designed with one of the Six Kings in mind. Fire matched Megiddo-san, ice was clearly Isis-san, and the forest was obviously Lillywood-san. Up to that point, it was easy enough to figure out, but just as Hina-chan tilted her head in confusion, the remaining three were harder to connect with any clear image.","[I think the Dark Area is probably Alice. The Phantasmal King camp and their Executives all have this dark sort of image. Then the Aqua Area might be Magnawell-san’s. Magnawell-san himself gives more of a rocky mountain impression, but apparently the seas of the Demon Realm fall under his jurisdiction. And the magical fantasy-themed area is probably Kuro, since she’s the creator of magic tools...... Though honestly, maybe none of it’s related at all.]","[But now that you mention it, Kaito-san’s explanation really does make sense. In that case, I wonder if the central area is themed after another world, just like its name suggests?]","[Hmm...... Maybe the amusement park I visited before is actually inside that central area? Like, they placed an amusement park from the other world inside the Otherworld Area, and then made the other six sections original attractions based on the Six Kings of this world.]","[I see! Well, no matter what, it looks like it’s going to be fun!!!]","Since they’d gone out of their way to name it the Otherworld Area, there had to be something related to the other world there. The explanation that made the most sense was the one I’d just mentioned, that the amusement park I once visited with Shiro-san, Kuro, and Alice had been placed in the central area, with the other sections added around it afterward.","That would also explain the absurd size of the place. It was basically the original amusement park plus six more parks built around it. Of course it would end up gigantic.","......Though if that wasn’t the case, then hearing “Otherworld Area” immediately brought to mind the First Hero and related things...... And depending on how it was handled, that could easily result in yet another location dedicated to embarrassing Neun-san. Kuro would definitely never allow that.","Though I still had no idea why they’d decided to add some bizarre facility called Baby Castella Castle to the Otherworld Area......","[Hmmm.]","[What’s wrong, Aoi-senpai?]","[......No, it’s just...... the shape of this Otherworld Area...... doesn’t it kind of resemble Kaito-san’s necklace?]","[Really? Now that you mention it, I can sort of see it...... or maybe not...... Aren’t you overthinking it?]","[Maybe so.]","It resembles my necklace? Now that she mentioned it, I couldn’t deny it looked somewhat similar...... But no, that couldn’t be it...... right? There’s no way, right? I mean, I wasn’t involved in building this amusement park at all. Surely they didn’t create an entire area based on me or something that ridiculous, right?","[......Alice, the motif for this central area is the other world, right?]","[.................]","[Why are you smiling silently? What I’m thinking right now is just me imagining things, right?]","[.................]","Without saying a single word, Alice simply gave me a smile so refreshing it was almost dazzling before she vanished from sight.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [I see...... so, what’s the truth?]","? ? ? : [It’s an area created with Kaito-san in mind. Well, it’s only based on an image of him, there’s nothing there that directly identifies a specific person or any merchandise like that. At most, people who know him well might look at it and think “Hmm, maybe this is related to Kaito-san?”]","Serious-senpai : [......What about the Baby Castella Castle though?]","??? : [That was Kuro-san forcing it through with “When you think of Kaito-kun, you think of his identity as the Baby Castella Lovers Association Vice President!” ......Well, as a result, it actually drifted further away from Kaito-san’s image, so fewer people might notice the motif now.]"]},{"number":2573,"title":"Chapter 2573 - Demon Realm Amusement Park 4","paragraphs":["After quickly checking the brochure to get a general grasp of the whole place, it was safe to say we were finally ready to head inside.","[Alright, then let’s get going and......]","[Wait a second!]","[......Hina-chan?]","Just as we were about to enter, Hina-chan stopped us with an unusually serious expression. There was an intensity about her unlike anything before.","[We still haven’t decided the order we’re going around in!]","[......Can’t we just figure it out as we go......?]","[That’s naïve, Aoi-senpai! As naïve as a clueless baby!!!]","[S- Seriously?]","Seeing Aoi-chan get overwhelmed by Hina-chan was honestly pretty rare. Hina-chan’s sheer determination was so intense that even Lilia-san and I couldn’t casually cut in.","At the very least, Hina-chan was probably the most knowledgeable about amusement parks among us, and definitely the one looking forward to this the most. If she was insisting this strongly, then deciding the route beforehand might really be important.","[Listen carefully, okay? This is a theme park on this scale. There’s absolutely no way to ride every attraction in a single day. Honestly, if we go in without a plan, we probably won’t even manage to visit all the areas! We may have to give up on conquering every attraction because of time constraints, but we should at least make sure we visit all seven areas! And for that, planning ahead is essential!]","[I- I see...... You certainly have a point, Hina-san. Considering we’ll be giving our impressions afterward, it would be best if we at least visited every area.]","What Hina-chan said made sense. We weren’t just here as ordinary guests enjoying ourselves, especially in Lilia-san’s case, since Kuro had personally asked to use her impressions for promotional purposes. Even if seeing every attraction was impossible, we still wanted to at least tour every area once.","Still, this amusement park was absurdly huge. Honestly, each individual area looked like it could rival the size of a normal amusement park on its own, and the number of attractions listed in the brochure was staggering.","This place is probably, no, unquestionably been built with the concept of “the largest entertainment facility in the Demon Realm” in mind. Trying to wander around without a plan would make it nearly impossible to see every area.","Lilia-san seemed convinced by Hina-chan’s reasoning as well, nodding in agreement as we once again gathered around the brochure to discuss the order we’d go in.","[......Since this is our first time at an amusement park to begin with, I would like Yuzuki-sama to take the lead in advising us here. To put it simply, how many attractions per area do you think would be ideal?]","[Let’s see...... I think we should keep it to about two or three each. Since we’re invited guests this time, I doubt it’ll be so crowded that we’ll end up waiting an hour or anything like that, but I’m sure other invited guests came in family groups or parties too. Given the scale of the place, there’ll probably still be a decent number of people here, so we should expect at least some waiting time. With that in mind, it’s better to keep our pre-planned attractions limited so we can still spontaneously check out anything that catches our interest along the way.]","Hina-chan was giving off the most intellectual atmosphere she ever had in her life, but in the end, what it really boiled down to was that she wanted to enjoy the amusement park to the absolute fullest. Well, that made sense. Hina-chan loved doing things in large groups, and a place like this was probably exactly her dream environment. The sheer passion in her voice made it obvious how serious she was.","[......In Kaito-san’s world, do people really wait an hour for a single attraction?]","[That depends on the season. During crowded periods, especially for popular attractions, people can end up waiting several hours...... but this is still the pre-opening phase, and nobody even knows which attractions are the popular ones yet, so I doubt the waits will get that bad.]","Sieg-san, who was experiencing an amusement park for the very first time, asked with a surprised expression, so I gave a simple explanation. Once this place officially opened and gained popularity, long wait times would probably become normal here too...... and with Alice involved, they might even start selling something like Fast Passes eventually. Still, at least for today, there probably wouldn’t be lines that extreme.","More than anything, the park was simply far too massive, with way too many attractions. Since most of them were completely unknown to the guests, people would probably think, “Rather than standing in line, let’s just go somewhere else”.","[And another important thing is deciding in advance where we’re going to eat. Ideally, we should have lunch after finishing around two areas, then move on to the remaining ones afterward. The central area seems to be the main attraction of the whole park, so I think we should save that for last. Which means we need to decide whether we’re going clockwise or counterclockwise......]","[......At this point, maybe Hina-chan should just decide everything......]","Watching Hina-chan mutter to herself while staring intensely at the brochure, Aoi-chan quietly whispered that under her breath. Honestly, that really did feel like the correct answer. Hina-chan’s enthusiasm was obviously on a completely different level from the rest of us, so it probably would be best to just let her handle everything...... though Hina-chan herself probably preferred the idea of everyone discussing things together and deciding as a group, which made it a bit complicated.","[This is the south entrance, so if we head right, we’ll reach the Dark Area, and if we go left, it’ll be the Aqua Area...... Hina-chan, which do you think is better?]","[Definitely the Aqua Area!]","When I casually asked which area she wanted to visit first, Hina-chan answered immediately without hesitation.","[Any particular reason why?]","[......Because...... the Dark Area definitely has...... haunted houses and scary stuff, right......]","After all the intensity she’d shown earlier, I thought she had some carefully thought-out strategy behind her instant answer...... but it turned out she was just bad with horror attractions. The unexpectedly adorable reason made me inadvertently let out a wry smile.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Since Alice is one of the main people behind this place, there’s definitely going to be something like a haunted house...... or rather, a horror house attraction. That said, I agree with avoiding it. Haunted house-type attractions have an extremely high lovey-dovey threat level...... easily above ★7. They’re very dangerous.]","? ? ? : [There you go again with those weird personal standards......]"]},{"number":2574,"title":"Chapter 2574 - Demon Realm Amusement Park 5","paragraphs":["Since we’d decided the first place to head after entering would be the Aqua Area, we figured we should decide what to ride there before going in.","From what I could tell, the Aqua Area was probably themed after Magnawell-san...... and apparently, my guess was right, because a lot of the attractions had “Dragon” in their names.","[There are quite a lot of attractions just in the Aqua Area. Hina-san...... is there anything we should prioritize?]","[Since the name alone makes it sound like there are a lot of water attractions, I definitely want to ride something like a splash coaster!]","[Spla...... errr......]","[It’s an attraction where a group of people ride together in a vehicle, traveling across fast-moving water with lots of splashing effects and things like that. In amusement parks from our world, they’re pretty standard. Not every single park has one, but they’re really popular.]","Since Sieg-san tilted her head at the unfamiliar term after hearing Hina-chan’s suggestion, I gave a quick explanation. Splash coasters really were the first thing that came to mind when hearing Aqua Area, and with a place this big, there were definitely at least one or two of them somewhere.","[I see. Since many of us are beginners, I think starting with a classic attraction is an excellent idea...... but Yuzuki-dono, which one is this splash coaster?]","[......That’s the problem. Since the pamphlet is designed to be compact and easy to carry, it only shows a rough map and the attraction names. We can’t actually tell what kind of attractions they are, so we have to imagine them based on the names.]","That was pretty common for amusement parks, honestly. It was difficult to include detailed explanations for every attraction in a pamphlet, so usually they only listed the locations and names. You’d look at the map and the titles, imagine what the attraction might be like, head over there...... and sometimes discover it was completely different from what you expected.","Of course, this world didn’t have internet searches or anything like tha...... ah, wait, I could just ask Alice, couldn’t I? But still, trying things out based only on the pamphlet and your imagination was part of the charm of amusement parks too...... so asking Alice, who could give the answer to anything, didn’t necessarily feel like the right choice.","Especially since this trip wasn’t about efficiently clearing every attraction. The main point was for everyone to enjoy the amusement park together. If we got too fixated on covering all the major attractions and ended up not having fun because of it, that would defeat the purpose.","[......Hina-chan, what about this Dragon Adventure? The starting point looks like a rocky mountain, and judging by the layout...... maybe that lake is the goal?]","[That’s true! A steep drop from a high place straight into a lake is classic! Just like Kaito-senpai said, this Dragon Adventure definitely seems suspicious. Ah, but do you think the usual amusement park tropes from our world apply here too?]","[Alice supervised the whole thing, so I’m sure it’s designed to feel very similar to amusement parks and theme parks from our world.]","[Then let’s try Dragon Adventure first! Is everyone okay with that?]","At Hina-chan’s words, the others nodded as well, and the first attraction we’d head to was decided: Dragon Adventure. Maybe it was just my imagination, but Lilia-san seemed slightly restless...... or rather, she was definitely getting excited just hearing the word “dragon”.","In that sense, even if it didn’t turn out to be a splash coaster, it was still probably a good choice if dragon-loving Lilia-san would enjoy it.","[After that, maybe we should move toward the next area...... and stop by the attraction in this large...... sea-like place here?]","[Yes. Considering the route toward the next area too, I think Aoi-senpai’s suggestion is the best. Let’s deliberately avoid deciding exactly what to ride there for now, and instead just head to that sea-like area and pick something that looks fun based on the atmosphere.]","With that, we had a rough plan for which attractions to visit in the Aqua Area. The real issue would probably be how crowded each attraction got.","I doubted we’d have to wait an entire hour, but for the large-scale attractions, we’d probably need to be prepared for at least some lines, so we’d have to keep an eye on the time......","Thinking that, we headed for the entrance gate. Each of us showed the invitation card Kuro had given us and passed through, but...... for some reason, the staff treated me differently.","[Please wait a moment.]","[Eh? Ah, okay.]","Everyone else had gotten through after a quick check, so I wondered why only I was stopped...... then the receptionist presented me with an ornate card decorated with luxurious trim.","[This is an all-attraction highest-priority pass exclusively for Miyama Kaito-sama. If you present this to staff members at crowded attractions, both you and your companions will be guided with top priority.]","[......Ah, yes. Thank you very much.]","[......VIP. Kaito-senpai is still an ultra VIP as always.]","[Well, considering two of the owners are Kaito-san’s lovers, it’s only natural...... though I’m grateful that this means we won’t have to worry about waiting times.]","I definitely hadn’t expected such special treatment to be prepared for me, but Hina-chan, Aoi-chan...... everyone all reacted more like “Well, that’s obviously gonna happen”, without showing any particular surprise.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Of course, you’d be a VIP.]"]},{"number":2575,"title":"Chapter 2575 - Demon Realm Amusement Park 6","paragraphs":["As soon as we entered the Aqua Area, everyone was left overwhelmed. It was supposedly only one of the seven areas, yet it was absurdly vast. Half of it consisted of a rocky region filled with craggy mountains, while the other half was made up of the sea and several islands. The sheer scale of it all was staggering.","[......Is all of this really an amusement facility? Amusement parks are incredible.]","[No, even in our world, there aren’t amusement parks on this scale. One area alone might exist somewhere, but seven of them? I doubt there’s anything comparable......]","I replied to Lilia-san, who murmured in amazement. In truth, the Aqua Area by itself might have rivals among large-scale theme parks, perhaps even places that surpassed it. But when you considered that this was only one-seventh of the entire park, there was probably nothing in existence that could compare.","At that size, the maintenance costs alone would surely be astronomical, not to mention the operational expenses. According to Alice, the amusement park Shiro-san created ran on some kind of “mysterious infinite power source”, meaning there were supposedly no operating costs whatsoever. I wondered if that system was also applied to places like the Aqua Area.","If they really could supply energy from Shiro-san’s amusement park through some special method, then the operating costs could probably be kept remarkably low, making a theme park of this scale feasible.","[Anima, this place feels like the visuals were carefully calculated too, right?]","[Yeah. The taller attractions are spaced far apart so the view remains open from the entrance. It’s designed so that the vastness of the area can be understood at a single glance.]","Caraway and Anima discussed the design philosophy, and they were right. The fact that the sheer scale overwhelmed you the instant you stepped inside meant the layout had been intentionally constructed so that much of the park’s enormity could be seen right from the entrance.","Well, considering it had been created through the cooperation of Kuro, the world’s wealthiest magnate who owned numerous major trading companies, and Alice, who was deeply knowledgeable about amusement parks and other cultural concepts from another world, it made perfect sense.","[......Errr, Dragon Adventure is probably over by those rocky mountains, right?]","[It looks like the course starts from the front, goes through the mountains, then exits into the lake at the back, maybe? If that’s the case, it really does seem like some kind of splash coaster! Let’s go already!]","Urged on by Hina-chan, whose eyes were sparkling with excitement as if her enthusiasm had already hit maximum levels, we all headed toward the attraction we had decided on first: Dragon Adventure.","The entrance had apparently been built at a higher elevation to make it easier to see the entire area, so the path sloped gently downward through the rocky region.","Still, the road itself was extremely wide, and just as Anima had said, the visibility was excellent. Even while walking, we could easily take in the attractions and shops scattered along the way.","[U- Uuuu, everything looks so fun. I wonder what that excavation game is about?]","[It’s in the rocky mountains, so I imagine you dig for ores or fossils or something. Though since it’s an attraction, it’s probably adjusted to make it easy and enjoyable......]","[That sounds amazing...... ngh, there’s just not enough time. There’s nowhere near enough time......]","Even as Hina-chan struggled to resist being drawn in by the attractions we passed along the way...... it was obvious she wanted nothing more than to jump into every single one that caught her eye, but the place was simply too enormous to fully explore in a single day. If we started wandering into attractions outside the plan, conquering all seven areas would become impossible, so she clenched her fists and forcefully held back her desires.","[......It does seem all but certain that the Dragon Kings were used as the motif. There are remarkably detailed dragon models placed all over the area......]","[Indeed. So far we’ve seen models of Blue Dragon, Funnytail, Grap Dragon, and Red Wing, and every one of them was built at the same size as the real creature. The craftsmanship was extraordinarily precise as well. Red Wing’s wings in particular are often mistakenly imagined as red because of the name, but in reality they’re much closer to orange, and even that detail was reproduced perfectly. I must say, it was truly impressive. It makes me even more excited for Dragon Adventure. Since it bears the name “Dragon”, it’s bound to be an attraction related to dragonkind, so we should be able to see multiple species of dragons there. I would be delighted if they even had rare dragon species that are seldom seen, and honestly, I can hardly wait.]","[I- Is that so...... As expected of Milady, your passion for dragons is incredible...... What do you think, Sieg?]","[......I wonder if there’s a section where you can interact with cute monsters......]","[From the sound of it, amusement park attractions probably don’t have that sort of thing......]","Seeing Lilia-san’s excitement soar from the exquisitely crafted dragon models and Sieg-san, who seemed more interested in interacting with real creatures than the replicas, Luna-san let out a small sigh.","Well, this area probably wasn’t really to Luna-san’s tastes...... She loved cute things after all. If we eventually reached a more fancy and adorable-themed zone, I had a feeling her excitement would rise too.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [It’s so peaceful...... Where is it coming from, when’s it going to happen? Is it still a little too early...... Where’s the lovey-dovey atmosphere going to strike from......]","? ? ? : [You’re being absurdly cautious about this.]"]},{"number":2576,"title":"Chapter 2576 - Demon Realm Amusement Park 7","paragraphs":["We were heading through the Aqua Area toward Dragon Adventure, but...... somehow, this area felt far more massive than I’d imagined.","The entrance had been built on slightly elevated ground, giving a wide-open view, though even then it wasn’t possible to grasp the entire area. Still, I could spot the rocky mountain that was presumably where Dragon Adventure was located, and I could also clearly see the defining features of the Aqua Area: rocky terrain on one side and the sea on the other.","So I figured all we had to do was head toward the rocky mountain in the center of the area that served as our landmark, but after walking down the gentle slope for a while and entering the rocky region, I noticed something strange.","......It was huge. The rocks were so enormous they practically qualified as cliffs. The paths were broad and designed to keep the view open, and there were guide signs placed everywhere, so it didn’t feel cramped or oppressive...... but still, with towering rock walls rising on both sides of the road, the sheer scale was overwhelming.","Those rock walls weren’t just empty cliffs either. Some sections housed souvenir and goods shops, others had snack stands, so the space was being put to good use...... but that wasn’t the issue.","The issue was that, from the entrance, these rocky pathways had looked much smaller. The elevated entrance had probably been designed to provide a long-distance view, which slightly distorted the sense of perspective, but I hadn’t expected the difference in impression to be this extreme once we actually got here.","[......Aoi-chan, Hina-chan. Unless I’m imagining things...... isn’t that rocky mountain way bigger than we expected?]","[It’s probably unbelievably huge. It already looks massive even from this distance, but we’ve been walking for quite a while and it doesn’t feel like we’ve gotten any closer at all.]","[I think we may have had preconceived notions going in. Since we know amusement parks, we unconsciously imagined something like the rocky mountain used for a typical splash coaster, but honestly, this feels about five times bigger than what we had in mind.]","Just as Aoi-chan said, we’d definitely been walking for a while, yet the distance to the mountain didn’t feel any shorter, and as Hina-chan said, it honestly felt several times larger than what we’d originally imagined.","[At this point, well, I already had a rough idea from seeing how wide the place was, but moving around here is going to take a lot of time......]","[Yes. That’s exactly why you should use the Fast Road over there.]","[Alice? Fast Road...... you mean that path with the railings?]","Right when I was once again realizing just how absurdly enormous the amusement park was and thinking travel alone would take forever, I heard Alice’s voice behind me.","Following her prompting, I turned my gaze and saw a pathway separated by railings, completely different from the ordinary walkways, with gates, or something like entrances, placed at intervals.","[To put it in very simple terms, it uses the same system as the hallway in Kaito-san’s house. You can move just by lightly shifting your weight, and if you enter the attraction number from the pamphlet at the entrance, it’ll automatically take you there.]","[......Eh? That’s amazing......]","So the Fast Road was basically the same kind of automatic movement magic formula as the hallway in my house. Apparently, you could travel to your desired attraction without even needing to walk.","That would drastically reduce the fatigue from moving around, and there was no risk of getting lost either, making it incredibly convenient.","[H- High-tech...... I underestimated this place. Since I know amusement parks from my original world, I just kind of assumed the parks back there would naturally have superior technology, but they can even do automated transportation here......]","[......So basically, the entire amusement park has something like a fast travel system...... that’s insane.]","[Aoi-senpai, what’s fast travel?]","[Eh? Wait...... is that maybe not a commonly used term?]","Fast travel was more of a gaming term. Since Aoi-chan liked games, she used it completely naturally, but Hina-chan, who probably didn’t play the kind of games where fast travel systems appeared, tilted her head in confusion.","Well, with this, the transportation problem was basically solved, but something still bothered me, so I decided to ask Alice about it.","[......But still, installing an automated transportation system across the entire park and building dedicated pathways for it must’ve cost an absurd amount......]","[Ahh, it’s fine. I had Makina help out, so we managed to make it pretty low-cost.]","[......You made Makina-san do all the work again, didn’t you......]","[That’s not true. I just asked a little favor, and she happily agreed to fully cooperate. Besides, the amusement park itself is already packed with technology that doesn’t exist in this world yet, so it made sense to have an advisor who properly understands the contract with Shallow Vernal-sama involved. It was a rational decision to avoid future conflicts over interdimensional technology issues.]","She probably talked her into helping again like always. Makina-san was ridiculously gullible when it came to Alice. If Alice put on a serious face and called her “best friend” or something, she’d probably melt instantly and start spoiling her, so I was pretty sure Alice had worked her extremely hard.","......Which was probably why the amusement park had ended up several times larger than originally planned......","<Afterword>","~ ~ Conversation Between the Hero and the Gullible God ~ ~","Makina : [No, seriously. If you want to build something on too large a scale, you have to get Shallow Vernal’s approval first. And if anything conflicts with the contracts already in place, those need to be adjusted too, so it’s a huge hassle.]","Alice : [For me, amusement parks are places filled with memories of my dear best friend Makina...... so I don’t really want to compromise. I mean, if we’re going to build one, I want it to be something incredible.]","Makina : [I- It can’t be helped then! It’s true that amusement parks are a place full of memories for me and Alice too, and I understand wanting to be particular about it! If you put it that way, then as your best friend, there’s no way I can refuse to help...... Leave it to me! I’ll help as much as you need!!]","Serious-senpai : [YOU’RE WAY TOO EASY!]"]},{"number":2577,"title":"Chapter 2577 - Demon Realm Amusement Park 8","paragraphs":["Thanks to the Fast Road we used right away, we quickly arrived in front of the Dragon Adventure attraction we were aiming for, but the rocky mountain really was absurdly huge.","And in front of that rocky mountain stood a building, which apparently served as the starting point. Since this was a pre-opening event, there were quite a lot of invited guests due to the sheer scale of the amusement park.","That was because anyone who received an invitation could bring along as many companions as they wanted, so long as they declared them beforehand. That was why nearly all of us had come together, and along the way here, I’d also seen groups like families and coworkers visiting together, so there were definitely a fair number of people around.","Still, unlike us, who had prior knowledge about amusement parks and, thanks to Hina-chan’s advice, had narrowed down the attractions we wanted to visit with the intent of covering the entire park, most people weren’t making a beeline for Dragon Adventure, which was located relatively near the center of the Aqua Area.","They were probably stopping by the attractions between the entrance and here first.","At the very least, there didn’t seem to be any line, making it feel like we were the first visitors for this attraction.","[Are we the first ones here? Let’s go in already!]","[......Does this mean that rocky mountain over there actually has nothing to do with it?]","[No, I think the attraction probably takes us inside that mountain. This building’s just the reception area, I guess.]","[Ahh, I see......]","Watching the visibly excited Hina-chan, I gave a brief explanation after Sieg-san muttered his confusion. From our perspective, it was easy enough to guess that some kind of coaster would take us into the mountain, but for someone unfamiliar with amusement parks, it probably looked like we were heading toward a completely separate building from the rocky mountain itself.","Once we stepped inside, the first thing that caught my eye was a sign labeled Entry Restrictions, which read: “Reduction to under 3 meters mandatory”. It should refer to large species adjusting their size through Humanization or Body Shrinking Magic. It was actually a fairly common size restriction even in cities...... apparently, “under three meters” was treated as a general standard.","Further ahead...... was an area that somewhat resembled an Adventurers’ Guild reception desk, where we checked in for entry. There didn’t seem to be any other waiting guests, so we were immediately guided onward as we followed the attendant.","Waiting for us there was a 10-person coaster, and thankfully, it matched our group size perfectly, so it looked like all of us could ride together in one go.","[Aoi-senpai, let’s ride in the very front! The very front!]","[Eh? N- No, the front seat is a bit...... my hairstyle will get ruined......]","[Then Kaito-senpai! Let’s ride in the front together!!!]","[Ahaha, sure.]","Watching the unusually high-energy Hina-chan with a smile, I sat in the front seat beside her as requested. I’d thought we’d be secured with some kind of solid safety bar, but when the attendant operated the coaster, a ring-like band made of magic wrapped itself around my waist.","I guess it was basically the equivalent of a seatbelt? Since it didn’t secure our shoulders or anything, either the ride wasn’t the type that reached extreme speeds, or the coaster itself was protected by some kind of anti-fall magic formula.","Before long, the coaster started moving. At the same moment, part of the scenery ahead blurred, and a humanoid bird figure appeared, wearing a survival jacket and goggles, giving off a cool adventurer vibe.","“Yo, so you’re the adventurers who accepted the investigation request alongside me huh? Name’s Falcon. I may not look it, but I’m a fairly well-known adventurer. Well, since we’re doing this joint investigation together, let’s get along.”","Apparently, the setting was that we had accepted an investigation request regarding that rocky mountain as adventurers, and this Bird Beastman named Falcon, who would be conducting the investigation with us, served as the guide for the attraction.","[Eh? That’s amazing. Is this some kind of hologram?]","[They probably used Illusion Magic or something like that.]","[Whoa~~]","As Hina-chan let out an impressed voice beside me, the coaster continued moving forward at a slow pace while Falcon kept speaking as the guide.","“So apparently, all sorts of dragons have been gathering around that rocky mountain. Normally, dragons tend to be highly territorial, so it’s rare for multiple species to gather in the same place...... but maybe there’s something in that mountain attracting dragonkind...... hm!?”","Falcon’s expression suddenly turned serious mid-explanation, and he started glancing around warily.","“This is bad. A Red Dragon and a Wing Dragon are fighting nearby. Getting caught up in that would be trouble. We’re heading into the mountain immediately!”","The moment he said that, a roar like that of dragons echoed out, and ahead of us, a red dragon and a green dragon could be seen engaged in aerial combat.","They obviously weren’t real, just another Illusion Magic performance, but the sense of presence was overwhelming, and as we got closer, the Red Dragon suddenly breathed flames straight toward us.","“Tsk, we’re pushing through!”","The coaster accelerated toward the approaching flames, and we plunged directly into the inferno. I instinctively braced myself, but...... as expected, it was only an Illusion Magic effect, and there was no heat at all.","Even so, the quality of it all was incredible...... This attraction really looked like it was going to be amazing.","[Red Dragons and Wing Dragons...... indeed, ecologically speaking, they’re two species unlikely to share the same habitat. However, there have been a few recorded cases where both were sighted simultaneously......]","Also, there was apparently an actual enthusiast sitting behind us...... it was just Lilia-san though......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [That bird adventurer, could it be modeled after Alice’s bird costume?]","? ? ? : [I...... Alice-chan said we should just stick with the original bird costume as-is, but Kuro-san kept saying “Hmm, denied”, and wouldn’t budge, so only the “bird” part remained and it turned into a completely different character.]"]},{"number":2578,"title":"Chapter 2578 - Demon Realm Amusement Park 9","paragraphs":["The coaster picked up speed as it entered deeper into the rocky mountain, though it wasn’t excessively fast. True to the word “adventure”, it seemed to be the kind of ride where you progressed while enjoying the scenery around you.","It felt similar to those immersive coasters at theme parks where the vehicle shakes in sync with the visuals.","“......The inside is far more spacious than I expected. Large dragons could probably pass through here without issue...... Mm, the ones over there are......”","Just as Falcon said, the interior gave the impression of a vast, brightly lit cavern. Even from the coaster, it was obvious the ceiling was extremely high and the pathways unusually wide.","......But if they’d built it with this much space, didn’t that mean some enormous dragon was bound to appear somewhere?","Thinking that, I looked toward where Falcon was facing and saw a dragon covered in glittering crystal ores that resembled an armadillo, along with an iron dragon whose tail was shaped like a gigantic axe.","[A mutant subspecies of Crystal Dragon and a Special Individual Axe Tail......]","“Impressive. That glowing dragon is a Crystal Dragon...... and it appears to be a mutant that consumed large quantities of Light Crystals. I see now. The reason the entire cavern is so bright must be because this place contains an abundance of Light Crystals...... But that’s not all. The other one is an Axe Tail, yet its tail is single-edged. That makes it a Special Individual. Both are exceedingly rare dragons.”","Just as I heard Lilia-san murmur from behind me, Falcon began explaining the dragons ahead, and it matched exactly what Lilia-san had said.","She identified them instantly from that distance......? She’s seriously the real deal...... Come to think of it, she’d previously mentioned how Special Individual White Dragons have differently shaped wings, so she clearly knew a great deal even about rare variants.","“......Still, this is strange. Despite their appearances, both are docile species, but they almost never share the same habitat. There really must be something hidden within this rocky mountain...... For now, let’s continue onward.”","I was starting to understand the attraction’s storyline. They had come to investigate the mountain at someone’s request, only to discover the bizarre phenomenon of species that should never coexist living together, and now they were searching for the cause.","The coaster continued onward while passing several more dragons, until eventually something resembling an underground lake came into view.","“An underground lake. It’s enormous, and there’s even a current flowing through it...... Now that I think about it, there was a massive lake near this mountain. Perhaps the water flows there fro———!? Something’s coming from beneath the surface! Watch out!!”","As if responding to Falcon’s warning, the waters of the underground lake churned violently, and a gigantic figure burst forth. What emerged was a dragon with a squat, frog-like body. It was roughly five meters long, covered in deep blue scales...... probably some kind of water dragon?","[A Vodavise? But that species should inhabit the sea......]","“Impossible!? That creature is a Vodavise...... a violent dragon that lives in the ocean! There’s no way it should be in an underground lake...... No, we can think about that later. We’re getting out of here! This way!”","Lilia-san knew far too much about dragons. She identified it at a glance before Falcon did, and even pointed out that it was a dragon that lived in the sea.","Well, putting that aside, this was a coaster attraction, so there was no way it would suddenly turn into a battle. The moment Falcon shouted, the coaster rapidly accelerated, and the scenery began rushing past us.","A roar that was likely from that Vodavise echoed from behind, and the tension instantly shot upward. The coaster sped through the cavern far faster than before, while heavy thudding footsteps rang out behind us, making it obvious the creature was pursuing us.","Still, I can’t exactly judge it based on appearance, but it didn’t look particularly fast, and the footsteps gradually seemed to grow more distant. At this rate, we might actually esc———","“GROOOOOOOO!!”","The moment I thought that, a tremendous roar echoed out, far beyond anything compared to the earlier roar of the Vodavise. It shook the air itself with a violent tremor, causing the coaster to rattle.","Then immediately afterward, the coaster rotated a full 180 degrees to face backward. So it even had a feature like this? The production quality was incredible.","The first thing visible behind us was the pursuing Vodavise, though perhaps because it truly was slow-footed, there was still a fair amount of distance between us, but in the very next instant, a gigantic maw burst out from a side passage and sank its fangs into the Vodavise’s neck, effortlessly slamming the massive creature to the ground.","What appeared was clearly something dangerous-looking...... a savage bipedal dragon resembling a T-rex. The Vodavise seemed to have died instantly from that single strike, showing no sign of movement as it lay collapsed on the ground.","[A Miragaia? That’s rare! Even I’m seeing one moving around for the first time!]","Judging from how excited Lilia-san sounded, it must have been an extremely rare dragon. Its name, apparently, was Miragaia.","“M- Miragaia......!? Why would a monster possessing one of the highest combat capabilities among dragons be in a place like this......? This is bad. If it attacks us, we won’t stand a chance......”","Of course, this was only part of the attraction’s setting. Still, the reason it didn’t really feel that dangerous was probably because of the absurd combat strength of the people riding this coaster.","Even if that Miragaia were real and actually attacked us, the only ones who could truly be considered in danger would probably be me, Aoi-chan, and Hina-chan...... As for everyone else, they’d probably be able to dispose of it without much effort.","And honestly, judging from its appearance, aura, and the way it moved earlier...... it was probably genuinely considered powerful by monster standards, but in terms of actual strength, it still felt like the kind of thing Bell could kill with a single playful cat swipe.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Well, in fact, Lilia’s probably just enjoying getting to see rare dragons moving around, and from the perspective of those on the level of Peerage Holders, it probably feels about as threatening as watching kittens play-fight. But hypothetically speaking, if it actually attacked...... the one Miragaia absolutely shouldn’t target is the weakest one there, Kaito. That’s the unreasonable part......]","? ? ? : [......That Wyvern Ultimate Overkill Incident back then had been truly tragic.]","Serious-senpai : [No, rather than an incident, that’s more of a deliberate murder...... Though yeah, there’s no denying the wyvern was the real victim there......]"]},{"number":2579,"title":"Chapter 2579 - Demon Realm Amusement Park 10","paragraphs":["The dragon lover Lilia-san said it was rare, that it had an overwhelmingly imposing appearance, and Falcon, our guide, had hinted at something like “Could it be......?”. Given that it was a large species, this Miragaia was probably the main attraction monster of this ride.","When the Miragaia turned toward the coaster and let out a tremendous roar, the coaster shook in response, then spun around another 180 degrees to face forward once more.","“Anyway, we’re running at full speed!”","At Falcon’s words, the coaster started moving faster than ever before, and together with the heavy footsteps thundering behind us, I saw a gigantic fireball streak past beside the coaster.","“D*mn it, it’s even breathing fireballs now!? And Miragaia’s incredibly fast, at this rate, it’s going to catch us......!”","[K- Kinda getting tense now. Kyaa!? The sounds and lights are amazing, this feels so intense!]","[Yeah. It’s not as fast as a real roller coaster, so we can still talk, but it’s still pretty quick, and with all these sharp turns it really feels like we’re hitting the climax.]","I nodded in agreement with Hina-chan, who spoke excitedly. As she said, this had incredible intensity and tension. Since it felt like we were being chased from behind, we couldn’t actually see the Miragaia itself, but various dragons kept appearing ahead of us as we fled while avoiding them. Fireballs blasted other dragons away, explosions erupted when they struck the cave walls, rocks came crashing down, it was all spectacularly overwhelming.","At times, the Miragaia would even catch up to us, and we’d slip beneath its legs before escaping again, making it all feel incredibly nerve-racking.","“......!? W- What is this chamber......? And that jewel......”","After fleeing from Miragaia for a while, we arrived in an unusually vast space. Countless dragons could be seen there, and at the center floated a jewel emitting an eerie purple glow.","It was as though the jewel itself was drawing the dragons toward it, and in fact, even when we entered the chamber, none of the dragons paid us any attention.","Before long, the coaster changed direction again, allowing us to see the Miragaia entering the chamber in pursuit of us...... but the very next moment, the Miragaia shifted its attention away from us and towards the jewel instead, moving directly toward it.","“Could it be, that’s the legendary treasure said to lure dragons...... the Dragon Orb!? I see now, that’s why this rocky mountain is home to so many different dragons......”","If I remembered correctly, those treasures were something like OOPArts. Apparently, most of them had been experimental creations Shiro-san made long ago and scattered throughout the world. Maybe that Dragon Orb was one too? No, the Dragon Orb here was probably just a prop for the attraction, but honestly, it wouldn’t surprise me if an item like that really existed.","(That’s rather rude. I have never created an item that attracts dragons.)","Ahh, so you didn’t make one. So this Dragon Orb was simply an original treasure made up for the attraction’s setting. Sorry, I jumped to conclusions there...... hm? You said you never made an item that attracts dragons “specifically”? So things like treasures that attract monsters in general, including those that aren’t dragons......","(............Wouldn’t it be better to focus on the attraction?)","That reaction definitely means you’ve made something like that before, doesn’t it......!? Well, I guess Shiro-san’s right. Even if I worried about it now, there wasn’t much I could do about it...... better focus on the attraction.","“Did we...... survive? Still, this is far beyond what a mere adventurer can handle. We’ll need the guild to organize a large-scale recovery force...... For now, let’s bring this information back. Fortunately, the dragons are completely absorbed in the Dragon Orb and aren’t paying attention to us...... no, wait. If I remember right, the legends say the Dragon Orb attracts dragons at fixed intervals......”","As the coaster gradually slowed down and Falcon’s explanations became the main focus again, right after Falcon muttered something ominous, the eerie glow emitted by the Dragon Orb vanished, almost as if following a classic setup.","From the explanation, it seemed the Dragon Orb was a treasure that repeated a cycle of activation and dormancy, and now, it had entered its dormant phase, causing its power to attract dragons to disappear.","And the very next instant...... the countless dragons in the chamber all turned their gazes toward us at once...... the sheer pressure was unbelievable......","“R- RUUUUUUN!”","The coaster spun back to face forward and suddenly shot off at a speed comparable to a real roller coaster. A moment later, layered roars shook the air itself, accompanied by footsteps rumbling like an earthquake.","From there on, it was absolute chaos. Dragons of every kind kept catching up to us one after another, only to be blown away by other dragons in the frenzy, while fireballs, lightning, and all sorts of attacks came flying nonstop. It truly felt like the climax of the attraction.","As we continued fleeing through the chaos, a faint light finally appeared far ahead in our line of sight.","“The exit!? Hurry, get outside at full speed!!”","The coaster charged toward the light at tremendous speed, but...... this was a splash-type coaster, wasn’t it? And there had been that huge lake near the rocky mountain, plus all those hints about the relationship between the mountain and the lake...... which meant the punchline of this attraction was probably......","“Alright, we’re outsi———– huh?”","Bursting out into blinding light, we emerged exactly where I expected, high up along the rocky mountain, with a gigantic lake spread out beneath us...... and from there, the result was obvious.","“Ah, we’re fal...... uwaaaahhh!?”","That’s right, we plunged straight down toward the lake. From a tremendous height, the coaster dove in one swift drop, sending up an enormous splash. The coaster itself seemed protected by magic, so we didn’t actually end up soaked, but even so, it had been an incredibly intense attraction. With a faint lingering sense of weightlessness still clinging to my body, that was all I could think.","<Afterword>","~ ~ Treasure Encyclopedia ~ ~","<Jewel of Vaulted Heaven>","A jewel that indiscriminately attracts monsters within a radius of several kilometers. If abused, it could even artificially trigger a Stampede, making it a dangerous treasure designated for sealing.","As usual, it was one of the artifacts Shiro created and scattered around during one of her treasure-making sprees.","While it can be switched on and off, it has absolutely no usage restrictions, meaning even a child fiddling with it could accidentally activate it, making it extremely dangerous. Several tens of thousands of years ago, Kuromueina retrieved it with an exasperated expression and sealed it away.","Even now, it remains in the possession of the Underworld King Kuromueina, sealed and stored within the subspace inside her coat.","<Jewel of Regulated Heaven>","It is believed to be one of the secret treasures, but at present, its effects are completely unknown, and nobody understands what it is used for. As such, it is displayed in the treasure museum of the Hydra Kingdom as a “treasure of unknown purpose”.","Its true ability is to “freely control the monsters attracted by the Jewel of Vaulted Heaven”. However, since it only works on monsters under the influence of the Jewel of Vaulted Heaven, and Kuromueina has already sealed that treasure away, the activation conditions can no longer be fulfilled. As a result, it is, quite literally, nothing more than an ordinary jewel now."]},{"number":2580,"title":"Chapter 2580 - Demon Realm Amusement Park 11","paragraphs":["The very first Dragon Adventure honestly exceeded my expectations by a huge margin. Despite its simplicity, it still felt like it had a proper story, and there were all sorts of fun gimmicks too, like the coaster flipping around so you could suddenly see what was behind you. It was incredibly enjoyable.","[That was amazing! I never expected an attraction with this level of quality!!!]","[It really was incredibly intense. The way the footsteps and roars made it feel like something was actually chasing us felt so realistic, and the part with the Dragon Orb, where it makes you think you’re safe for a moment before suddenly taking a sharp turn, was really well done too. Though, if I had to say one thing, the speed still felt a bit slow.]","[Ahh, well, that part can’t really be helped, can it? I felt the same way too. Even if speed wasn’t the main focus of the attraction, magic still has a pretty big influence on things.]","Personally, it felt pretty fast to me, but apparently for Aoi-chan and Hina-chan it wasn’t much at all. Well, Hina-chan could run far faster than any roller coaster, and Aoi-chan could probably reach the speed of sound without much trouble, so from their perspective it made sense that the speed felt lacking.","Compared to the roller coasters I’d ridden with Shiro-san before though, even I had to admit it felt slower. Even to me, it only registered as “pretty fast”, so just like Hina-chan said, this wasn’t really an attraction built around speed.","[It truly was a wonderful attraction! Not only were there many rare dragons that are normally difficult to see, but by introducing the fictional treasure known as the Dragon Orb, they were able to create combinations of dragons that should never naturally exist...... Being able to witness pairings unique to this attraction alone was absolutely marvelous. Though the speed of the ride certainly surprised me......]","[I was actually most surprised by that part. It was an unbelievably fast vehicle.]","[It felt similar to the cars that appear in those games Kaito-san has, but transporting this many people at that speed is truly astonishing. It would probably be difficult, but if something like this were developed as an actual means of transportation, it could completely change the world’s common sense.]","I already knew Lilia-san would get excited over anything dragon-related, but what surprised me was that Luna-san and Sieg-san also thought the coaster was unbelievably fast.","Still, after listening to them, I could understand why. From our perspective, it felt slow compared to modern roller coasters, but for them, this was a vehicle carrying a large number of people while moving vastly faster than a self-driving carriage. Naturally, that would feel fresh and astonishing.","Come to think of it, this world didn’t have railways or anything like that. Travel mainly relied on horse-drawn carriages, flying dragon services, ships, and Teleportation Magic.","Purely in terms of speed, flying dragon services might actually be faster, but because it travels through the air, it’s harder to really feel that speed.","Compared to that, a coaster racing along close to the ground probably felt far more impactful.","[So in Master’s world, vehicles this fast are treated as amusement rides. Truly impressive.]","[Ahh, but honestly, I don’t think it was actually that fast for a coaster. Like Hina-chan mentioned earlier, it wasn’t really an attraction focused on speed......]","[......Hmm, if we’re talking about an attraction centered around speed...... perhaps something like that over there?]","As I answered Anima’s question, Caraway pointed toward a spot a short distance away, and everyone, including me, turned to look.","There stood a fairly large signboard with the words “THE NEXT GENERATION OF ULTRA-HIGH-SPEED ATTRACTIONS! SONIC COASTER!” written boldly across it.","[Sonic Coaster...... Could it be an attraction themed after the Sonic Dragon, one of the dragons capable of extraordinarily high-speed flight?]","[As expected of Milady, you immediately recognized the motif.]","[ [ [ .................. ] ] ]","As we listened to the conversation between Lilia-san and Luna-san, Aoi-chan, Hina-chan, and I all stared at the sign with conflicted expressions.","I understood exactly how the other two felt. More than likely, they were thinking the exact same thing I was.","[......You three? You all look rather puzzled. Is there something strange about it from the perspective of people familiar with amusement parks?]","[Ah, no...... I think it’s probably a type of roller coaster. You could even call it a classic attraction.]","[Just like Hina-chan said, it’s such a famous and standard attraction that even I, who’d never been to an amusement park before, knew about it, but......]","In response to Luna-san’s question, Hina-chan and Aoi-chan answered hesitantly. It was like they both felt something was off, but couldn’t quite put it into words.","[......How should I put this? Like Caraway said, that definitely looks like an attraction focused on speed, but...... honestly, I can’t tell what standard they used to design it. From the perspective of people who can use Body Strengthening magic, roller coasters from our world would probably seem slow. But if it’s balanced around the assumption that people are using Body Strengthening Magic, then for people who can’t use magic, it’d be dangerous enough to kill them...... It just makes me wonder whether roller coasters can even function in a world where there’s such a huge gap in individual physical abilities.]","Exactly. Even among just our group, if the ride were adjusted based on my standards, everyone else would probably think it was less “speed-focused” and more just plain slow, but if it were adjusted to Lilia-san’s level instead, it would basically become a machine designed to turn people into chunks of meat.","Still, they’d put up such a huge sign and were boldly advertising it as “ultra-high-speed”...... so maybe there was some kind of special mechanism involved?","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Well, Alice obviously has experience with roller coasters, and Kuro’s ridden one before too, so I doubt they overlooked the issue of differences in physical abilities...... But just how are they planning to solve that problem......?]"]},{"number":2581,"title":"Chapter 2581 - Demon Realm Amusement Park 12","paragraphs":["Unable to resist our curiosity after all, we decided to stop by and check out the Sonic Coaster.","From the outside, it looked like an ordinary roller coaster, but there was a distinctive large sign at the reception area, and the attendant began explaining its contents to us.","[This attraction uses a specialized Illusion Magic to adjust the rider’s perceived speed. The sign contains details about the magic’s effects, potential side effects, and any pre-existing conditions that would make someone ineligible to use it, so please read through that first. Beside that sign, you’ll also find the magic formula used to adjust perceived speed. If, after reviewing both, you agree to the terms, please each take one of the bracelets provided and put it on yourselves.]","I see. I was wondering how they could make speed the attraction’s selling point when there were such vast differences in ability between visitors, but changing each rider’s perception of speed...... that certainly solved the problem. If that’s how it worked, then anyone could experience incredible speed regardless of their individual capabilities.","As I was thinking that, Lilia-san murmured with genuine admiration on her face.","[......I see, to think they would use a method like this...... It’s quite similar to the VR games you own, Kaito-san.]","[In what way?]","[The cases of myself, Anima-san, and Caraway-san are particularly obvious, but we possess extremely high resistance to Illusion Magic. Under normal circumstances, magic of the level that can be stored inside a magic tool...... engraved in a magic crystal would never be capable of affecting our five senses. Of course, if someone possessed overwhelming skill like Alice-sama, and used an extraordinarily complex and precise magic formula, they could bypass those resistances and affect us...... but it’s impossible to engrave something that complex onto a magic crystal. Alice-sama uses it so casually, but even her Recognition Inhibition Magic alone would require a magic circle hundreds of meters in radius if it were actually written out.]","Now that she mentioned it, that was true. People like Lilia-san possessed extremely high resistance to status ailments, so debuffs of that nature normally shouldn’t work on them at all.","Unless the caster had absurd skill like Alice, or was overwhelmingly more powerful than Lilia-san and the others, a magic formula simple enough to be made into a magic tool shouldn’t be capable of affecting them.","[This works because they first provide a detailed explanation of the magic and its effects, then have us personally put on the magic tool ourselves. By following those steps, a magical contract is established, allowing us to willingly accept the magic’s effects.]","[Ahh, I get it. VR games also require you to physically enter the costume yourself, right?]","Just like entering a costume in a VR game, willingly accepting and consenting to the magic’s effects established a magical contract, allowing the magic to affect even those with powerful resistances.","I had to admit, it was brilliantly thought out...... It felt like they had properly utilized the new technologies tested during the Six Kings Festival. Impressive as always.","[......Excuse me. Miyama Kaito-sama, it seems Phantasmal King-sama has a message specifically for you. Please confirm that before proceeding.]","[Eh? Errr...... Alice?]","I had been about to put on the bracelet after being satisfied with the explanation, but at that moment, the receptionist informed me that Alice had left a message for me. Turning around, I called out to Alice behind me.","[To put it simply, Kaito-san, please don’t wear the bracelet. It might break......]","[......Why?]","[I honestly don’t know. With the VR games, you were using them before everyone else, so it feels like they were adjusted in advance so they wouldn’t affect you. But those bracelets were made afterward, so if you put one on, there’s a pretty high chance it’ll just get nullified...... You’ve got way too many Divine Blessings, and I have no idea which one might interfere. Adjusting it individually for each Blessing would be way too much trouble, so I gave up. Seriously, how many Blessings do you even have!?]","[......I’d like to know that myself.]","Ah, I see...... Since this was essentially a type of debuff that affected the target through Illusion Magic, there was a chance it would be negated by the countless Blessings from Otherworld Gods that I had apparently received. That’s why I wasn’t supposed to wear the bracelet......","[Well, it’ll be fine. Kaito-san isn’t the one who needs to be adjusted to match everyone else, you’re the one everyone else is being adjusted to match. Even without the bracelet, it’ll feel plenty fast to you, so there’s no problem at all.]","......In other words, she was saying that I was by far the weakest member of this group, and that I was such a complete weakling that I didn’t need any adjustment to perceive the speed of a roller coaster...... A perfectly accurate and entirely fair assessment.","Honestly, there was no way I needed the bracelet. Its purpose was to adjust things for people who couldn’t perceive an ordinary roller coaster as fast. I’d already thought the Dragon Adventure ride felt plenty fast, so it was completely unnecessary for me.","[I can completely understand the logic...... but somehow I still can’t quite accept it......]","[Well, you’ll just have to give up on that. Anyway, that’s the entire message.]","Seeing the indescribable expression on my face, Alice let out a wry smile before vanishing from sight.","<Afterword>","[A serious development is underway in a gaiden where Serious-senpai Is banned from appearing]","Serious-senpai : [......Explain it...... Explain it to me in detail. I am currently...... on the verge of losing my composure.]"]},{"number":2582,"title":"Chapter 2582 - Demon Realm Amusement Park 13","paragraphs":["Now then, just how impressive was the Sonic Coaster, which prided itself on speed......? It was insanely fast. This was the default speed setting, right? It was seriously incredible. Hina-chan and the others were letting out excited screams as well, so they were probably experiencing the same tremendous speed I was.","How should I put it? If I had to describe it, it was terrifying because it felt realistically fast...... For example, in terms of pure speed, being carried by Amel-san was much faster, but in that case, it was so fast that I couldn’t even see the scenery, and she would use protective magic to block things like wind pressure, so it was surprisingly difficult to truly feel the speed.","The Sonic Coaster, on the other hand, was fast, the wind was intense, and the G-forces during the turns were incredible. It genuinely felt like I was being tossed around by tremendous speed, making it much easier to experience just how fast it really was.","[W- Wow, that was amazing...... I wondered what it would feel like to alter your perceived speed, but it really was unbelievably fast and scary.]","[It really was a strange sensation. Thinking about it calmly, that level of speed should be something we can achieve with Body Strengthening Magic, yet it felt unbelievably fast. The wind pressure felt incredible too. So that’s what changing perceived speed feels like......]","Listening to Hina-chan and Aoi-chan talk, I roughly understood what was happening. The actual speed they experienced was the same as what I experienced, but thanks to the alteration of their perceived speed, something that normally wouldn’t feel particularly fast to them instead felt overwhelmingly fast.","Hearing that, it really did sound like a type of debuff magic.","[How was it for you, Lilia-san?]","[It was wonderful. It feels like it’s been a long time since I truly experienced such speed. Perhaps you could say it made me feel like a child again, reminding me of how I felt the first time I rode in a carriage. It’s been so long since a vehicle felt faster than my own feet.]","When I asked Lilia-san, she looked slightly surprised, yet somehow happy. Indeed, for Lilia-san, almost everything was slower than running herself, so the sensation of riding something that actually felt fast must have been quite refreshing.","The others seemed to feel similarly. While they were confused and surprised by sensations they rarely experienced, they all found the experience fresh and enjoyable.","The fact that even people with naturally extraordinary physical abilities could enjoy it showed just how thoughtfully designed this amusement park was. At this rate, I was sure we’d continue having a great time.","[So, what should we do next? We ended up riding it out of curiosity, but we originally planned our schedule with plenty of spare time. Shall we head to the ocean-themed area as planned?]","[I think that’s fine, but what about you, Hina-chan?]","[Let’s go! Even though we already rode the Splash Coaster, it’d be a waste not to visit that huge waterfront area they prepared!]","The Sonic Coaster hadn’t originally been part of the plan. After Dragon Adventure, we had intended to try something in the waterfront area, so Caraway asked to confirm our next move.","In fact, we’d only planned about two attractions per area because we’d intentionally left room for spur-of-the-moment rides if something else caught our interest. Time wasn’t an issue at all.","It also helped that we hadn’t needed to wait in line for either Dragon Adventure or the Sonic Coaster. That said, Hina-chan was effectively the one directing our group’s course right now, so after checking with her, we decided to head to the waterfront area as originally planned.","Using the Fast Road, we made our way there, and...... At first glance, it looked almost exactly like the ocean.","Of course, it was an artificial environment created inside the theme park, but there was a sandy beach, rolling waves...... And for some reason, you could even see the horizon.","[......Isn’t it a bit strange, size-wise, that we can actually see the horizon?]","[I imagine it’s simply an illusion projected onto the walls to make it appear that way, but seeing it like this, it really does look exactly like the sea.]","At my murmur, Sieg-san nodded with an impressed expression on her face. It really did seem to be an incredibly well-crafted theme park, and they had clearly paid close attention to the atmosphere as well.","Still, with this area looking this perfectly like the ocean, it was hard to imagine what kinds of attractions they had just from a glance. If anything, it almost felt like putting on a swimsuit and swimming at the beach would fit the setting better.","[So, Hina-chan, what do you want to do?]","[......Judging by the atmosphere, I bet they have attractions where you ride boats or ships. There might also be something like an underwater tunnel, but if possible, I’d like to try one that’s out on the water.]","[I see...... According to the brochure, the nearest one is...... something called Kraken Cruise...... Could it be a horror attraction?]","[No, wouldn’t it be more like a panic attraction? Like one of those shark-themed rides where a ship gets attacked by a kraken while trying to escape.]","[Ah, I see. Yeah, that’s definitely a classic setup......]","When it came to boat attractions, the image of a panic ride involving a shark attack was something commonly associated with theme parks. The idea of being attacked by sharks was heavily influenced by movies, but in this world, perhaps krakens filled the role of the classic sea monster that attacked ships instead.","After discussing it with everyone else, we ultimately decided to head to the Kraken Cruise, and once again, we used the Fast Road to travel there. Being able to set an attraction as the destination and move there directly once we’d decided where to go was incredibly convenient.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [What are the chances that this Kraken Cruise turns into an incredibly serious development!?]","? ? ? : [About the same as the chances of Serious-senpai appearing in the main story outside of an April Fools Extra Chapters.]","Serious-senpai : [......In other words, it’s not zero?]"]},{"number":2583,"title":"Chapter 2583 - Demon Realm Amusement Park 14","paragraphs":["The starting point of the Kraken Cruise was, for lack of a better description, a sailing ship that looked like something a pirate would use. I had expected a small boat, but it was actually quite large.","Well, it had been made somewhat compact for an attraction, so it felt more like a small-to-medium-sized sailing vessel, but even then it was much bigger than I had imagined.","At the reception area, we were given instructions regarding the attraction. The Kraken Cruise used Illusion Magic, and no real kraken was involved. Because of the performance, there would be scenes where the kraken attacked the ship, but any counterattacks were to be carried out according to the guide’s instructions. Guests were not to use their own weapons or magic to attack.","[......So it’s really going to be a full-on battle with a kraken?]","[They mentioned following a guide’s instructions, so maybe it’ll be like Falcon from Dragon Adventure. A character like that appears and tells us what to do while we fight? There are cannons on the deck too, so maybe we’ll use those?]","Most of the attraction seemed to take place on the ship’s deck, and guests were apparently free to stand wherever they liked. The deck was equipped with cannons, ballista-like bows, and various other tools. Rather than the panic-inducing ride I had imagined, it felt more like an attraction where you physically fought against a kraken.","“Oh, so you’re the lot that wants aboard my ship huh!? I’m the captain of this vessel...... well, just call me Captain! While you’re on this ship, every one of you is my crew. Out at sea, you’ll follow my orders, so keep that in mind...... Alright then, we’re setting sail! Raise the sails!]","A man who looked every bit the pirate captain appeared, and the Kraken Cruise attraction began...... The ship started moving.","Oh, wow. The sailing ship was actually heading out onto the sea...... This was far more authentic than I had expected.","Captain looked like a pirate, but since the setting wasn’t actually that of a pirate ship, he probably represented a rough-and-tumble man of the sea instead.","“They say a kraken lives around these waters. No harm in staying alert, but no ship’s been attacked by one in years, so there’s no need to worry too much.”","Captain delivered what sounded like an obvious death flag, and as the ship continued forward, the sky gradually became overcast...... Eh? How are they doing this? The rocky area over there was still completely sunny, yet only the space above this ship had become cloudy. Was this Illusion Magic too?","“The weather’s turning ugly. The wind doesn’t feel right either...... We might have a storm coming. Alright, you lot, get below deck before the rain starts...... whoa!?”","Before Captain could finish, the ship lurched violently with a tremendous impact. The rocking should have been severe, but strangely enough, we weren’t being thrown around by inertia at all. The ship was clearly shaking, yet we could stand normally without feeling much of it. Some kind of protective magic was probably at work.","“What was that impact!?”","“Captain, l- look over there......”","One of the crew pointed toward the sea, where a gigantic squid tentacle emerged from the water. That was way bigger than I had expected...... If a single tentacle was this large, then the kraken itself would probably be well over thirty meters long. The sheer presence of it was overwhelming.","“A kraken’s tentacle...... It’s appeared!? Just the tentacle...... the main body must still be underwater! Oi, you b*stards, fire on that thing! Don’t let it wreck the ship!”","At Captain’s command, the crew opened fire with cannons and ballistae. The kraken’s tentacle recoiled and trembled as if in pain...... but in the very next moment, four more tentacles erupted from the sea.","“D*mn it, there are too many of them...... Oi, passengers! Give us a hand! Stand in front of a cannon or ballista and touch the magic crystal. A targeting circle will appear in front of you. Get the tentacle inside the circle, touch the crystal again, and fire!”","Alright, there’s our cue from the Captain. We moved to the nearest unoccupied cannons and ballistae. Following Captain’s instructions, I touched the magic crystal, and a targeting reticle appeared...... By adjusting the angle of the cannon or ballista, I could move the reticle around.","The cannons and ballistae were clearly attraction props. They were lightweight and could be moved effortlessly without requiring any real strength, making it easy to line up a shot.","When the cannonballs and bolts we fired struck the kraken’s tentacles, Captain shouted words of praise.","“Alright! Nice shooting! Keep blasting those tentacles! Stay alert though, they might come at us from directions other than the front! If we keep attacking the tentacles, the main body will eventually lose patience and show itself!”","I see. I think I’ve got the general flow now. We attack the kraken’s tentacles as they appear from the front, back, left, and right using the cannons and ballistae. Once we’ve dealt enough damage, the main body emerges, and the final battle begins.","The sheer presence of the kraken’s tentacles was impressive enough on its own, and even though it was just an attraction, it genuinely felt like we were fighting a gigantic monster. Honestly, this was pretty great...... I wasn’t expecting this kind of attraction at all, but it’s incredibly fun in its own way. Since I have basically no combat ability, I never get opportunities to fight monsters like this, so the experience feels surprisingly fresh.","<Afterword>","Kaito-kun : [......Unn? What’s this? There seems to be a button underneath the magic crystal......]","・Use a Special Attack (Eden)...... The kraken dies.","・Use a Special Attack (Makina)...... The kraken dies.","・Summon an Otherworld God...... The kraken dies.","・Call for reinforcements using baby castella as bait...... The kraken dies.","・Add Pet No. 3 (Tentative), who is standing behind you, to the battle...... The kraken dies.","・Help me, Shiro-san...... “Epilogue”","・Kraken: “Please, stop! I’m begging you! Someone help me! Fight me normally!!!”","Kaito-kun : [......Right, let’s just do our best and defeat the kraken with the cannons.]"]},{"number":2584,"title":"Chapter 2584 - Demon Realm Amusement Park 15","paragraphs":["Although the Kraken Cruise turned out to be a different kind of attraction than I had expected, the battle against the kraken was surprisingly exciting...... Heck, to be honest, it was a lot of fun.","There were cannons and ballistae. The cannons packed more power but had a slower rate of fire, while the ballistae were weaker but could fire more rapidly. I mainly used the cannons, and the whole thing was thrilling and exciting.","In the first phase, you attack the kraken’s tentacles as they emerged around the ship. After taking a certain amount of damage, a tentacle would recoil as if stunned, and after taking even more damage, it would retreat beneath the sea. The tentacles would appear some distance away and gradually approach the ship, so the objective was to intercept them before they got too close.","This time, we managed to drive them all back, but I suspect the game probably has a mechanic where it’s game over if the tentacles get close to the ship too many times.","The tentacles didn’t just appear from the front, they could emerge from any direction. However, the cannons and ballistae could only adjust their aim by about ninety degrees, so if a tentacle appeared somewhere outside that range, you’d have to move to a different cannon or ballista that could cover that area. It wasn’t the sort of attraction where you could just stand in one place and keep firing forever.","Fortunately, there were quite a few of us, and since we all knew each other, coordination was easy. We were able to decide who would cover which direction and fight efficiently. I imagine it would be much harder for a group of complete strangers who just happened to be riding the attraction together.","Then, after intercepting enough tentacles, the kraken itself finally appeared, and it was incredibly impressive.","Combined with its roughly 20-meter size, it really felt like some kind of sea kaiju. It had all the excitement of a climactic final battle.","When the kraken appeared, only two of its tentacles were sticking out above the water. I wonder if the number of tentacles present during the final battle changes depending on how many tentacles you successfully intercepted during the previous phase? My guess is that at least two will always appear, but if you fail to stop enough of them earlier, more tentacles are added, making the fight against the kraken much tougher.","That said, when the kraken appeared...... maybe it was just my imagination, but it seemed to be looking at us with round eyes as cute as a chihuahua’s, as though it was trying to tell us something...... but it was probably just my imagination. It was only a three-dimensional projection created through Illusion Magic after all. It wasn’t as if it had a will of its own......","In any case, once the final battle with the kraken began, the basic gameplay remained the same. We continued attacking it with cannons and ballistae, but the difference was that the kraken could attack as well.","That said, it was still just an attraction, so its attacks didn’t actually harm us or shake the ship. Instead, whenever the kraken launched an attack, any cannons or ballistae within the affected area would become temporarily unusable. To keep attacking, you either had to move to another undamaged weapon or wait for the disabled one to recover.","Every time the kraken attacked, the captain would say things like “We’re still alright!” or “The sails have taken damage!?”. Because of that, I think there was some sort of turn limit, in other words, you had to defeat the kraken before it managed to attack a certain number of times.","The attack areas didn’t seem to follow any pattern and appeared to be random. Whether you could keep attacking the kraken continuously depended partly on luck...... unn, luck played a role.","Maybe because of that...... the cannon I was using never once got disabled by the kraken. The kraken also had a tendency to dive underwater and reappear elsewhere after taking several hits, but that seemed random too. Yet somehow it kept reappearing within the firing angle of my cannon until the very end, allowing me to attack continuously from start to finish.","“Alright! We did it! We defeated the kraken!!!”","And with that, we successfully defeated the kraken and cleared the attraction. After the battle ended, the captain walked over to me and gave me a big thumbs-up.","“You dealt the most damage to the kraken. Impressive! We only managed to defeat it thanks to you, lad!”","With a bright smile, he showered me with praise...... It seemed there was some kind of MVP system based on the amount of damage dealt to the kraken, and apparently I had been chosen for it.","Well, it was only an attraction, so being selected as MVP didn’t earn me any special reward. All I got was praise from the captain...... but honestly, it still felt pretty nice.","Then, once the attraction was over, we received a reward for defeating the kraken at the exit: a kraken plush small enough to fit in the palm of your hand.","It was surprisingly cute, and I could see Luna-san’s eyes sparkling when she spotted it. As someone who loved stuffed animals, she seemed especially taken with it.","And so, although the Kraken Cruise had turned out quite differently from what I had expected, it ended up being an immensely satisfying experience. Following our original plan, we then set off toward the next area.","<Afterword>","Kraken Illusion : [......(Please! Just fight me normally! I’m an enemy that’s perfectly beatable through normal means! Stop using special attacks!!!)]","Kaito : [......Those are some sad eyes.]","Kraken Illusion : [......(Ahhh, the attacks are random, you know! Where I attack is completely random! It’s entirely possible for a safe zone where no attacks land to just happen by chance! My appearance locations are random too, so it’s perfectly possible for me to keep showing up in easy-to-hit spots! The fact that that guy is almost guaranteed to be MVP is just bad luck on my part because of the randomization!!!)]","Kaito : [......Somehow, no attacks are coming my way at all, and it keeps appearing in easy-to-target positions.]","Serious-senpai : [......T- This illusion is pulling every possible punch for him.]","Makina : [Even Mother would be all smiles about this...... Ah!? This kraken...... it’s quite the suck-up.]","Serious-senpai : [Can you not!?]"]},{"number":2585,"title":"Chapter 2585 - Demon Realm Amusement Park 16","paragraphs":["Having ridden three attractions, one more than originally planned, we finished the Aqua Area and began heading toward the next zone.","As expected, Hina-chan looked like she was having an incredible time, and it was genuinely heartwarming to see.","[That was amazing! Every single one of them was so well-made. I never imagined they’d be that incredible!]","[I think magic plays a huge part in it. The realism of the Illusion Magic is amazing and makes everything feel so intense. But at the same time, they don’t just rely on flashy magic, they still understand the classic flow and presentation that make amusement park attractions fun. I was really impressed.]","[Exactly! As expected of Alice-sama. She perfectly captures what makes amusement park attractions feel like amusement park attractions while also adding magical elements unique to this world. It’s so much fun! Honestly, I wanted to try a lot more rides in the Aqua Area, but if we do that, we won’t have time to visit all the other zones...... Gununu, what a dilemma!]","Indeed, every attraction we’d ridden in the Aqua Area had been enjoyable, and I definitely wanted to try the others as well.","But as Hina-chan said, seeing all seven zones would be difficult. Each area was so vast and packed with attractions that even spending an entire day in just one zone might not be enough to experience everything. In that sense, it couldn’t really be helped.","Well, that desire to come back and try the attractions you missed is exactly what creates repeat visitors. Having too many attractions to finish in a single day is actually an effective strategy if the goal is to encourage people to return.","[But, Kaito-senpai, I was thinking...... this amusement park must have cost an absurd amount of money, right? It’s incredible, and there’s no doubt it’s fun, but...... can they actually make a profit from this?]","[Ahh...... about that. If I remember correctly, they apparently exploited Gods as a labor force, so the whole thing is operating under some pretty outrageous circumstances. To begin with, the amusement park Shiro-san originally created, the one that’s probably equivalent to the central Otherworld Area, runs on an infinite power source, and the attractions maintain themselves automatically. Apparently, it costs practically nothing to operate......]","[I- I see...... That’s completely insane. Making Gods work as laborers...... Is that really alright?]","[......As for that, I’m not really in a position to say anything. Even if it was based on her own wishes, I’ve got Canalis-san handling Nifty for me after all......]","[Now that you mention it, Kaito-senpai is actually the most outrageous one here. Compared to you, this amusement park almost seems tame, which is kind of amazing.]","My remarkably growing kouhai had a knack for hitting painfully accurate points. She was absolutely right. When it came to outrageous behavior, I had no standing whatsoever to criticize anyone. If anything, the people around me were far more absurd than this amusement park.","Even so, throughout the conversation Hina-chan wore a bright smile, clearly enjoying herself immensely. There’s something charming about her innocent, carefree nature. Maybe it’s because so many of the people around me are older, but as one of the few younger people in my life, she has that adorable little-sister-like appeal.","She has the kind of charm that makes you want to look after her, spoil her, and take care of her. And seeing Hina-chan having so much fun naturally made me feel happy as well.","[In a way, it feels like you’re having the most fun out of everyone, Hina-chan.]","[Amusement parks are fun! I’m happy that I get to come here with Kaito-senpai and Aoi-senpai too, and...... how should I put it? I just love the lively atmosphere of a place like this!]","As she spoke, expressing her excitement with her entire body as though she were throwing her hands up in celebration, Hina-chan looked even younger than her actual age. More than anything, it was obvious just how much she loved amusement parks, the attractions, the atmosphere, all of it.","For someone like Hina-chan, who enjoyed spending time and having fun with groups of people, simply being here with everyone and exploring the park together was probably an absolute delight.","Of course, she wasn’t being reckless. Even while excited, she wasn’t letting her enthusiasm completely control her actions. Still, she looked so energetic that it wouldn’t have been surprising if she suddenly broke into a run at any moment.","That said, I felt like she probably shouldn’t be bouncing around quite so much. Despite the youthful aura she gave off, she possessed a rather impressive figure that didn’t match that image at all. Watching her hop around right in front of me made it difficult not to let my eyes drift in that area, which left me feeling somewhat unsettled.","W- Well, as long as she was having fun, that was what mattered.","[......Errr, are we about to see the next area?]","[Yeah. It’s probably over there...... Ah, isn’t that it? Though...... wow, that’s incredible.]","[This is...... on a whole different scale.]","The next area coming into view was the Forest Area...... and even from a distance, I could see towering trees lining the landscape. It possessed the authentic atmosphere of a vast, ancient forest, so convincing that I couldn’t help but be overwhelmed by the sight.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [At the moment, there aren’t really any romantic events or a lovey-dovey atmosphere...... but there is a hint of something bittersweet to it. Hina is obviously the type who loves Kaito without realizing it herself, and I think she definitely has romantic feelings for him. However, she’s also the type who wants to be pampered by a kind older person, so right now the feeling is much more like a little sister innocently acting spoiled around her gentle older brother...... but there’s a real danger that once she becomes aware of her feelings, she’ll fall head over heels all at once.]"]},{"number":2586,"title":"Chapter 2586 - Demon Realm Amusement Park 17","paragraphs":["The Forest Area truly felt like being inside a gigantic forest, but as expected, or perhaps as one would expect from a place like this, you could see all sorts of clever design choices that made it suitable as a theme park.","First of all, every tree was enormous and towering. Even though there were many of them, the leaves and branches were located so high overhead that there was none of the cramped feeling that dense forests often create.","Furthermore, something I’d already noticed in the previous Aqua Area was present here as well: visibility had been carefully considered. The spaces between the trees were wide enough that your line of sight wasn’t obstructed when looking around, creating an open and spacious environment while still maintaining the atmosphere of being deep within a forest.","If I had to describe it, it felt like a forest of giant trees. Every tree was so massive that, from the perspective of humans our size, there was plenty of room to move around comfortably.","[This feels different from both Rigforesia and Yggfresis. It isn’t dark or anything, but you can’t see the sky.]","[According to the brochure, there seem to be Elevation Magic Tools installed throughout the area. Much like the rocky shores and ocean sections in the Aqua Area, perhaps this area is divided into two levels: the forest floor among the trees and the treetops above?]","In response to Lilia-san’s observation, Luna-san looked through the brochure and offered her thoughts. Sure enough, when I checked more carefully, I found mentions of the Elevation Magic Tools. Even the attractions had labels such as “Upper” and “Lower” next to their names, so it seemed Luna-san was right, this area was divided into upper and lower sections.","[In that case, maybe it would be best to ride one attraction in the lower area and one in the upper area?]","[I agree with Master’s assessment. If we’re planning to choose only two or three attractions per area, that would be the most balanced approach. The problem is deciding which ones to ride...... In the world you all come from, what kinds of attractions are considered standard in places like this?]","At Anima’s question, Hina-chan, Aoi-chan, and I all fell into thought.","[......I wonder. There’d probably be something like a coaster......]","[It’s hard to imagine. I mean, a few ideas come to mind, but none of them really feel unique to a forest-themed area. They’re just attractions you’d expect to find in any theme park.]","[When it comes to plants, I tend to think more of scenery and sightseeing than attractions......]","That was exactly the issue. When I heard “an area full of trees”, no particular attraction immediately came to mind. Sure, things like roller coasters or teacup rides seemed plausible enough, but whether those felt especially fitting for a Forest Area was another matter entirely.","Even looking through the brochure, it was difficult to guess what kind of attractions these actually were. It’s easier to imagine what the Aqua Area contained because of its lakes, rocky coastlines, and ocean theme, but this......","[......You know what? Let’s just cheat.]","[Kaito-senpai? What do you mean by cheat?]","No matter how much we thought about it, we weren’t likely to come up with some brilliant answer. If we had more time, I could’ve suggested trying a variety of attractions, but since we were limiting ourselves to only a few rides in each area, I wanted to make sure we experienced the main highlights.","With that in mind, I muttered quietly before turning the brochure toward the people behind us.","[......So, Alice. Which rides would you recommend?]","[If you’re only picking two, I’d recommend Forest Castle and Sky Tree.]","[You seriously named it Sky Tree......?]","[It’s a tree towering up toward the sky, so it’s a great name, isn’t it?]","[No, you absolutely knew what you were doing when you named that......]","Since we didn’t know which attractions to choose, we decided to ask the creator herself. Alice’s answer was Forest Castle and Sky Tree.","Forest Castle was one thing. While it was hard to imagine exactly what a “castle in the forest” entailed, the name at least conveyed a sense of grandeur.","The problem was Sky Tree. There was no way this was a coincidence. Alice knew far too much about our world for that. I was certain she’d named it as one of those little references that would make visitors from another world go “Huh?”.","Of course, Kuro had no way of knowing what Sky Tree referred to and simply accepted it as a perfectly normal attraction name.","[Well, setting aside the questionable naming choice...... Sky Tree is closer to where we are right now.]","[Arehh? But Aoi-senpai, look at this...... Both Sky Tree and Forest Castle are marked as “Lower”. Does that mean neither of them is in the upper area?]","[Looks that way. But considering it’s Alice-sama we’re talking about, I’m sure she has something in mind. I think it’d be best to follow her recommendation.]","Partly because they regularly shopped at her weapon store and often received advice from her as fellow adventurers, Aoi-chan and Hina-chan placed a great deal of trust in Alice.","Well, I do feel the same way. Even if both attractions were located in the lower area, there was probably some reason Alice had chosen them. Lilia-san and the others didn’t seem to have any objections either, so we decided that our first destination would be Sky Tree.","<Afterword>","? ? ? : [Man, Alice-chan really is trusted by everyone. This is totally the result of her everyday conduct. You can really see the purity of Alice-chan’s heart shining through here.]","Serious-senpai : [......No, I think it’s more because you’re ridiculously devoted whenever it comes to Kaito. In a situation like this, where Kaito is specifically asking for your advice, nobody expects you to slip in a prank or mess around......]"]},{"number":2587,"title":"Chapter 2587 - Demon Realm Amusement Park 18","paragraphs":["As we headed toward the Sky Tree, I found myself wondering what kind of attraction it actually was. In the Forest Area, which was divided into upper and lower sections, the attractions Alice had recommended were the Sky Tree and the Forest Castle.","At the very least, judging from the name, Forest Castle probably had nothing to do with the upper section. If so, then the Sky Tree was likely the attraction connected to it somehow.","The image of the Sky Tree from my original world kept coming to mind, but even if it turned out to be something like an observation deck...... that wouldn’t be bad either.","If it offered a view of the upper section, it would be enjoyable just for the atmosphere alone. The Forest Area was lush with greenery, so it would probably be nice simply in terms of scenery as well.","While thinking about that, we eventually arrived at the Sky Tree attraction and headed to the reception area. The attraction allowed a maximum of four riders per group, so after discussing it, we split up into groups: me, Aoi-chan, and Hina-chan; Lilia-san, Luna-san, and Sieg-san; and Anima, Caraway, Eta, and Theta.","The limit wasn’t for the attraction itself, but for the gondola-like vehicle used in it, so there was no need to wait for one group to finish before the next could ride.","[Hmm...... What exactly is this, I wonder? From the outside it just looked like a giant tree......]","[It’s called the Sky Tree, so I imagine it goes upward somehow, doesn’t it?]","Aoi-chan, Hina-chan, and I were the first to ride, and we climbed into the gondola. It was circular in shape, with no windows, just railings...... Maybe the best comparison would be a large coffee cup ride with a roof attached. In any case, we got inside and took our seats.","[A fall-prevention spell has been applied, so there is no risk of falling. However, for your safety, please refrain from leaning out.]","After the attendant gave the warning and closed the gate we’d entered through, bands of light emerged from our seats and secured our shoulders and waists.","[......Arehh? If they’re fastening us down this securely......]","[Kaito-senpai, Aoi-senpai...... Could this be one of those rides that launches you upward?]","[What a coincidence. I was thinking the exact same thing.]","Hina-chan and Aoi-chan reacted to my muttering. Just securing our waists would have been one thing...... but fastening our shoulders this firmly too? That probably meant this ride shot upward at tremendous speed.","Maybe it was some kind of free-fall attraction? But if so, the scenery wasn’t very good, considering we seemed to be inside the tree’s trunk...... If anything, it felt more like we were about to launch from a secret base.","The moment that thought crossed my mind, glowing numbers formed from magical energy appeared before us. As the countdown reached zero, the gondola shot upward at an incredible speed, just as I’d expected.","We raced through the dark interior of the trunk, climbing at a breathtaking pace...... Then, in the next instant, a dazzling brightness hit my eyes and the view suddenly opened up. If I had to describe it, it was as though the tree trunk had been turned into the barrel of a cannon and our gondola had been fired out of it. The blue sky burst into view all at once, and just as the gondola’s ascent came to a stop, the ceiling above us unfolded like flower petals and began to rotate.","At the same time, the magical energy restraining our bodies vanished, allowing us to move freely again.","[Wow......]","[Amazing......]","Hearing the awestruck voices of Hina-chan and Aoi-chan, I found myself holding my breath as well. The sight before us was truly worthy of being called breathtaking.","Launched high into the sky, we sat within the gondola as the petal-like ceiling spun like a propeller, keeping us suspended in the air. From there, the entirety of the Forest Area stretched out below us.","It looked like a vast carpet of leaves, and beyond it we could see all sorts of buildings that were presumably attractions in the upper area.","Before long, the gondola began moving slowly, taking a route that circled around the outer edge of the Forest Area.","[I- I see, so this is that kind of attraction...... We circle around the entire Forest Area while getting a full view of the upper section......]","[Looks that way. If you look closely, there are bands of magic power stretching out ahead, and it seems to be following those routes...... It’s kind of like a gondola lift, I guess.]","[The atmosphere up there is completely different from the lower area. Is it designed so people can walk on top of the leaves?]","Now I understood why Alice had recommended this attraction. Riding it allowed you to get a thorough look at the upper section of the Forest Area, and the buildings themselves were fun to observe from above. Many were shaped like flowers or constructed from wood with vivid decorative designs, making the scenery all the more enjoyable.","[......Looking closely, it seems they’re not actually leaves. It looks more like solid ground underfoot.]","[They’ve just created the impression of walking on leaves. It’s more like a huge bridge or walkway.]","[Ah, Kaito-senpai, Aoi-senpai, look over there! That thing is enormous! What kind of attraction do you think it is?]","The initial ascent had been incredibly fast, but now we were moving along at a comfortable pace. Relaxing in the gondola, the three of us leisurely enjoyed the scenery spread out before us.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [I see, so even though the departure point is in the lower area, it’s essentially an attraction that lets you tour the upper area...... The Forest Castle is probably firmly located in the lower area, so between the two, you get to enjoy both the upper and lower sections......]"]},{"number":2588,"title":"Chapter 2588 - Demon Realm Amusement Park 19","paragraphs":["The attraction at the Sky Tree was really good. The initial high-speed ascent gave it a thrilling amusement-ride feel, and after that, it let you leisurely take in the entire Forest Area from above.","That sudden climb at the beginning got my adrenaline going and lifted my spirits a bit. Thanks to that, I felt like I ended up enjoying the sightseeing much more enthusiastically than I expected.","The gondola that had completed its circuit around the Forest Area returned to the tree it had departed from, and we stepped out as the attendant opened the gate.","Lilia-san’s group should have departed a little later than us, but I had spotted their gondola some distance behind ours while we were touring the Upper Area, so they would probably be back before long.","[That was fun! We’d been riding all those intense attractions in the Aqua Area, so it was nice to have something more relaxing for a change.]","[The sudden climb at the start was pretty impressive too...... But yeah, it really was a good attraction.]","[Next, we just wait for Lilia-san’s group and then head to Forest Castle.]","I responded to Hina-chan’s cheerful smile, then nodded at Aoi-chan’s confirmation of our schedule. To avoid getting in the way of other guests, we moved outside to wait...... and before long, we heard a lively commotion approaching.","Looks like another group had arrived. Well, it wouldn’t be strange to start running into other invited guests around this time.","[......President, why this attraction specifically?]","[Come on, with a name this hilarious, how could we not try it? ......Though I guess it’s an Otherworld reference, so you guys wouldn’t get it......]","[Isn’t it just that your explanation is terrible, President?]","[Oi, who was that just now? I’m docking your pay.]","A fairly large group came walking toward us, and the person at the front looked familiar...... no, she was definitely someone I knew. Akane-san was accompanied not only by Frau-san but also several people who appeared to be employees of her trading company. When she noticed us, her eyes widened in surprise.","[Nuohh!? Kaito, Aoi, and Hina...... Well, I guess Kaito being invited isn’t surprising, but running into you here sure is a coincidence.]","[Ah, it’s Akane-san! Hello~~]","[Hello.]","[Hello, Akane-san. Were you invited by Kuro too?]","[My company has done business with Kuromu-sama’s trading company for a long time. That’s how we got invited. She said I could bring as many people as I wanted, so I just brought every employee who looked like they had nothing better to do.]","We exchanged greetings with Akane-san as she approached us. As expected, she had been invited as well.","Come to think of it, she’d mentioned that Kuro had helped her when she first established her company, and she’d also been invited to the Six Kings Festival. They must have quite a close relationship.","[Ah, right, Kaito. Thanks for introducing me to Dr. Vier. Thanks to her, the idiot from my company got completely healed.]","[Ahhh, the person you told me about when we first met. That’s great to hear.]","[Hey, you. Make sure you thank him properly too.]","This was about the employee who had lost all four limbs. When I first met Akane-san, she’d asked for help treating him. She’d refused the Fruit of the World Tree, so instead I’d introduced her to Dr. Vier.","I hadn’t heard what happened afterward, but it seemed everything had worked out. One of the trading company’s employees stepped forward at Akane-san’s prompting and bowed deeply as he expressed his gratitude.","[......You guys riding this attraction too, Kaito?]","[We already finished riding it. Right now we’re just waiting for Lilia-san’s group, who came with us...... Ah, actually, Lilia-san’s group has just returned, so now we’re only waiting for Anima and the others.]","As I answered Akane-san, I looked over and saw that Lilia-san’s group had indeed returned. Once Anima and the others came back, everyone would be together again.","[I see. Well then, it’d be rude to keep you any longer. If fate’s got anything to say about it, we’ll probably run into each other somewhere again. When that happens, take care of us, alright?]","[Of course. I hope you all enjoy yourselves too, Akane-san.]","[President~~ Don’t you want to chat with him a little more? This is probably a precious encounter with a member of the opposite sex that you’ll almost certainly never get again.]","[That’s right, that’s right. There aren’t many men who can keep up with the President’s weird energy, so you’d better not let him get away. Though I guess being a late bloomer is already a lost cause at this point.]","[Exactly! Someone who not only isn’t put off by our weird President but can actually keep her on her toes is a rare find! Seduction tactics are probably impossible for you, but you should at least leave an impression!]","[Late-bloomer President~~ Give us a raise~~]","Just as I’d thought when I visited their headquarters before, the people of the Mikumo Trading Company really seemed to enjoy this sort of banter. They all teased Akane-san relentlessly, and a prominent vein bulged on her forehead.","Then, with her cheeks twitching, she somehow managed to keep a smile on her face as she spoke to us.","[W- Well then, Kaito, you all enjoy yourselves too...... OI, YOU LOT! You’ve really been saying whatever the hell you want, haven’t you!? And that last one was definitely Frau, wasn’t it!? What’s with the fake voice!? Did you seriously think I wouldn’t recognize you!?]","After calling out to us with a smile, she then turned toward the trading company employees with an expression that could rival even a hannya.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Ah, if people connected to Kuro or Alice are being invited...... then maybe Chris is here too? Ah, no, wait a second...... If we’re talking about people related to her trading companies...... then Eris and Cornelia might be possibilities as well......]"]},{"number":2589,"title":"Chapter 2589 - Demon Realm Amusement Park 20","paragraphs":["This pre-opening event at the Demon Realm amusement park had invited an enormous number of guests, fitting for a park of such immense scale. It would be no exaggeration to say that anyone with a reasonably close connection to Kuromueina or Alice had received an invitation.","Not only Demons, but Humans and even a small number of Gods were attending the event, and looking across the park as a whole, there were quite a few world-famous figures among the guests.","That said, the amusement park was so vast and packed with attractions that the chances of randomly running into any specific person were quite low.","And yet, in one corner of that very park, two individuals wore troubled expressions. One was Eris, invited through her personal connection with Kuromueina...... or rather, as thanks for attending her tea party. The other was Cornelia, invited through her ties to the Seditch Magic Tool Company...... Both were noble daughters belonging to the Hamilton Marquisdom faction.","[......Eris-sama, Kaito-sama was definitely invited, wasn’t he?]","[Considering this facility was jointly developed by Kuromueina-sama and the Phantasmal King...... Alice-sama, there’s no way Kaito-sama wasn’t invited...... He’s definitely here.]","[......Under normal circumstances, the chances of encountering a specific person in a place this ridiculously huge are low, right?]","[Indeed. Especially since this park is structured with multiple attractions spread throughout the grounds. Even if we were to meet by chance, it would only happen during limited moments, such as while moving between locations. Realistically speaking, the odds are close to zero.]","Cornelia spoke with a grave expression, and Eris nodded with equal solemnity. Incidentally, Marie of Ritch Barony, had also received an invitation. However, she had declined due to being overwhelmingly busy with ripples and the development of her territory.","To be completely honest, both Eris and Cornelia would have preferred to decline as well...... for the sake of their stomachs. Both were caught up in situations related to Kaito, but unlike Ritch Barony, their respective noble households wielded considerable influence, so they were not being worked into the ground.","Still, despite having the leisure to attend, refusing the invitation was not an option. Not only would it be discourteous, but other noble factions might accuse them of “disrespecting the Six Kings” and cause unnecessary trouble.","[Eris-sama...... um...... what do you think?]","[......If we somehow manage not to run into him, then perhaps all this time we’ve spent suffering stomachaches has been for nothing......]","[So it really can’t be avoided......]","[To my knowledge, it never has been.]","The odds of encountering a specific individual somewhere within this enormous amusement park were extraordinarily low...... extraordinarily low...... but when that individual was Kaito, both of them felt that even a 1% chance somehow became 100%.","In other words, neither of them believed it was possible to avoid running into him somewhere in the park. Their stomachs already hurt just thinking about it, but they still clung to a faint glimmer of hope.","[......However, Cornelia-sama. Assuming Kaito-sama accepted the invitation and is attending today, wouldn’t his companions most likely be the residents of his mansion or members of Albert Duchy? It’s difficult to imagine someone like one of the Six Kings accompanying him. If that’s the case, even if we do run into him, it shouldn’t become a particularly troublesome situation for us.]","[Y- You’re right. If it’s just meeting Kaito-sama and exchanging greetings, there’s absolutely no problem.]","Exactly, Kaito himself was not the issue. Both Eris and Cornelia held a favorable impression of the kind-hearted young man and genuinely considered him a friend.","The problem was that he had a habit of simultaneously bringing along individuals who possessed terrifying levels of authority on a global scale. If not for that, even if they happened to meet him in the amusement park, they would simply exchange greetings, chat pleasantly for a moment, and part ways peacefully.","Though neither of them knew it, Akane had already run into Kaito earlier and parted ways after nothing more than a brief exchange of greetings. It was exactly the sort of ideal situation Eris and Cornelia were hoping for.","Seeing even the slightest glimmer of hope, Cornelia’s expression brightened a little. As if trying to reassure herself as much as Eris, she spoke up.","[To begin with, there must be a great many people here who know Kaito-sama. If he stopped to greet every acquaintance he met, he wouldn’t have any time left to enjoy the park himself. Looking at it that way, isn’t it entirely possible that we won’t run into him at all?]","[That is true. Knowing Kaito-sama, he’ll undoubtedly run into acquaintances by chance while moving around the park, but that doesn’t necessarily mean we’ll be among them. Perhaps we’re letting our imaginations run too wild and frightening ourselves over situations that haven’t even happened. It might be better to approach this with a more relaxed mindset.]","As Cornelia had said, Kaito’s ability to form connections with people was extraordinary, so he would almost certainly run into acquaintances somewhere in the amusement park. However, there was no guarantee that those acquaintances would be them.","Looking at it from that perspective, a path to salvation suddenly seemed possible after all, and some warmth returned to the expressions of both Eris and Cornelia.","[You’re right, Eris-sama. Being overly cautious isn’t helping. For now, let’s stop worrying about it and simply enjoy this amusement park.]","[Yes, let’s do that. Then, as we discussed earlier...... shall we head to the attraction called “Forest Castle” next?]","And yet...... Reality can be merciless.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Why is it that the Stomachache Warriors always charge headfirst to their death......]","? ? ? : [Maybe it’s because the strongest Stomachache Warrior is there, so they’re getting pulled in......]"]},{"number":2590,"title":"Chapter 2590 - Demon Realm Amusement Park 21","paragraphs":["After finishing the Sky Tree attraction, we headed for Forest Castle as planned. The timing had worked out surprisingly well, and if we continued through the Forest Area at this pace, it would be around lunchtime by the time we moved on to the next area. We could simply decide where to eat while making our way there.","[I wonder what kind of attraction is Forest Castle?]","[Since Sky Tree was in the upper area, this is definitely an attraction in the lower area, but judging from the name, it doesn’t sound like a coaster-type ride.]","[But don’t theme parks often have coaster-like attractions with names like that?]","[......Now that you mention it, that’s true.]","I found myself nodding at Hina-chan’s words. Normally, a ride tagged “Castle” didn’t sound like a coaster, but in a theme park, it wouldn’t be strange to have a roller coaster that ran through a castle-themed attraction.","After all, attractions like Sky Tree and Kraken Cruise had turned out to be completely different from what we’d expected.","Chatting like that as we walked, we were just about to reach the point where Forest Castle would come into view when something caught our attention.","[......There sure are a lot of people over there huh? But the atmosphere feels a little......]","[They seem more like security guards than people visiting an amusement park.]","Just as Hina-chan and Aoi-chan muttered, there was quite a crowd ahead of us. That itself wasn’t unusual. A fair amount of time had passed since the event began, and even the Trinians, who had no prior knowledge of amusement parks, had probably gotten used to things and learned how to move efficiently between attractions.","Still, something felt different. Many of them were dressed similarly, almost like uniforms. If I had to describe it...... it was exactly as Aoi-chan said: they looked like security personnel or bodyguards.","[Ah, there is probably a noble present. When it comes to high-ranking nobles, having that many guards and attendants is quite common. There wasn’t any limit on party size this time, after all.]","[Well, the reason all of you aren’t used to seeing that is because of Milady. Despite being a high-ranking noble herself, Milady is stronger than an entire order of knights lined up together, so she doesn’t need guards. She only brings along the minimum support staff, like me and Sieg.]","After hearing Sieg-san and Luna-san’s explanation, we all nodded in understanding. Now that they mentioned it, it made perfect sense. We often went out with Lilia-san, and we’d grown accustomed to her having practically no guards at all. But that was only because Lilia-san was overwhelmingly powerful.","For an ordinary noble, it wouldn’t be strange to bring a large escort when traveling to the Demon Realm instead of the Human Realm, like on this occasion.","Among the high-ranking nobles I knew, Eris-san and Cornelia-san came to mind. Both of them would bring the strongest maids from their respective households as bodyguards whenever they went out. I also remembered hearing that when Cornelia-san had gone shopping for a special brush, her guards had been stationed some distance away.","Eris-san might be the same. Perhaps she simply made sure they stayed out of sight in everyday situations, while quite a few guards were actually protecting her from a distance.","And since this wasn’t a city but an amusement park, it would be difficult to stay hidden. So they were probably standing openly around the area like that......","[Hehh, so if there are that many people, it’s probably a pretty high-ranking noble?]","[Indeed. At the very least, a Count or higher......]","[I see...... Unn?]","Lilia-san answered my comment, and as I nodded and turned my gaze toward the group that supposedly contained a high-ranking noble, the guards suddenly stepped aside as if opening a path...... A familiar pair came into view.","In fact, they were the very people I’d just been thinking about, Eris-san and Cornelia-san. It seemed they had noticed us as well, because both of them wore expressions of utter shock...... Was it just my imagination? They looked kind of pale to me.","[It’s Eris-san and Cornelia-san! To think we’d run into them here of all places......]","[Right now, I feel both pity and terror from those two...... Kaito-san, who exactly are you planning to summon this time?]","[Eh? No, it’s not like I’m summoning any......]","I was feeling a little happy at unexpectedly running into acquaintances again after meeting Akane-san, but for some reason, Lilia-san was wearing an expression that looked both sympathetic...... and fearful of what was to come.","Errr, was this that thing again? Was she worried that someone like one of the Six Kings might suddenly show up here by coincidence? Hmm...... Well, I suppose it wouldn’t be strange if the other Six Kings had also been invited, but it was already unusual enough to run into Eris-san and the others. Could someone else really show up on top of that?","As I pondered that, Eris-san and Cornelia-san began walking toward us. They were probably coming over to greet us. At any rate, I should greet them too and......","[Kai-chaaaaaan!]","[Huh? Fate-sa——— Guh!?]","......Something came flying in. For some reason, my solar plexus must have offended her, because Fate-san suddenly appeared out of nowhere and, as usual, launched herself at me while driving a headbutt straight into it.","<Afterword>","? ? ? : [And the one chosen was...... Fate-san!]","Serious-senpai: [She might actually be the most unexpected possibility. It did mention that a small number of Gods had been invited, but while I could imagine Fate coming if she were accompanying Kaito, I never would have expected her to attend a pre-opening event on her own volition. I’d completely ruled her out as a possibility...... And just imagine what Eris and Cornelia must have felt. They approached intending to greet Kaito, only for the God of Fate to suddenly appear right in front of them...... I swear I can practically hear the sound of their stomachs tightening from stress.]"]},{"number":2591,"title":"Chapter 2591 - Demon Realm Amusement Park 22","paragraphs":["At present, Eris and Cornelia’s thoughts had completely come to a halt. And that was hardly surprising. They had headed toward one of the attractions in Forest Castle, where they had unexpectedly run into Kaito’s group.","That alone was shocking enough, and both of them had undoubtedly found themselves staring into the distance for a moment...... but it was still within the realm of what they had anticipated.","Certainly, before heading to Forest Castle, the two of them had spoken optimistically, but neither had truly believed those words. They had merely voiced a faint hope. Given that Kaito was in this amusement park, they had fully expected that a chance encounter was entirely possible.","The fact that it had happened so quickly was surprising, but since they had already steeled themselves for the possibility of meeting Kaito, they recovered fairly quickly.","As they had expected, the people accompanying Kaito were Lilia and the others. At the very least, there were no beings of extraordinarily high standing such as the Six Kings or the Supreme Gods with him.","In that case, meeting him now was actually fortunate. If they simply exchanged greetings here, they could get the encounter with Kaito over with for the time being. Since both sides were moving around in reasonably large groups, there was a good chance they would not end up traveling together. As long as the greetings were finished, even if some absurdly important figure appeared afterward, they could excuse themselves by saying they did not wish to interrupt Kaito’s conversation and make their escape.","However, fate mocked their thoughts. Just as they approached Kaito and were only a few steps away from calling out to him, Fate suddenly appeared between them and Kaito and threw herself at him.","It truly could not have been worse timing. Naturally, they could not interrupt a conversation between Fate and Kaito, but having come this close, they also could not simply turn around and leave without even offering a greeting. As a result, the two of them froze on the spot, standing before Kaito and Fate.","Their stomachs were already twisting painfully.","[......Gehokk...... Fate-san? H- How should I say this...... I’m a little surprised you’re here.]","After Fate’s headbutt had slammed into his solar plexus, Kaito coughed lightly before speaking to her. To be honest, seeing Fate here was unexpected.","Certainly, compared to before, Fate had developed an interest in far more things, and there were now many situations where she would choose to act even if it was troublesome.","However, that generally only applied to things involving Kaito. Outside of that, she still displayed the same extreme laziness she always had. For someone like Fate to show up at the amusement park’s pre-opening event was genuinely surprising.","[Well, you see, Shall-tan said...... since they’re going to use me for advertising, she wanted me to at least try one attraction. She said I could go home afterward, so she begged me to come...... And Shall-tan is my soul friend, you know? So I powered myself up with the strength of our friendship, came all the way here, entered through the gate...... and managed to walk about “five steps at an average human’s stride length”. But after that, I just couldn’t do it anymore, so I left things to the proxy I brought and was about to head home.]","[......Our friendship is worth five steps huh......]","[I really did try, okay......]","[I have so many complaints, but considering what Fate-san is usually like...... u- uhh......]","Alice, standing behind Kaito, instinctively threw in a retort, but when one considered that the notoriously lazy Fate had actually traveled all the way here, completed the admission procedures, entered the amusement park, and even walked a few steps...... It was sadly difficult to deny that she had, in fact, made an effort.","[So anyway, I was fully prepared to go home...... but then I remembered, oh right, Kai-chan is here too, so I came to see you!]","[I see...... I think I understand the situation now.]","[Well, now that I’ve seen Kai-chan, I’m satisfied, so I can go home...... Unn?]","[ [ ! ? ] ]","Still clinging to Kaito and wearing a relaxed smile, Fate suddenly noticed Eris and Cornelia. She turned toward them and narrowed her eyes suspiciously.","Needless to say, the moment the Supreme God’s gaze fell upon them, both women instinctively straightened their backs.","[......Errr...... I’ve seen you before. W- Wait a second, I’m trying to remember...... I’ve gotten pretty good at remembering things related to Kai-chan without even trying...... Errr, right, at the Archlesia Empire’s Founding Festival, and also at Kai-chan’s birthday party...... Ah! I remember now, it’s Eririn!!!]","[E- Eririn!?]","[Yeah, yeah. You were a noble of the Archlesia Empire...... right?]","At Fate’s words as she looked at Eris, Eris’s mind began racing at the speed of light. Since Fate herself had asked whether she was a noble in this case, Eris judged that it would be acceptable to introduce herself with her family name included, and she gave a respectful bow.","[Y- Yes. I am Eris Dia Hamilton, heir to Hamilton Marquisdom.]","[Alright! I got it right! Kai-chaaan, I’m amazing, aren’t I? Praise me, praise me~~!]","[You certainly are. Compared to before, it’s impressive that you can naturally remember people you’ve never even properly introduced yourself to.]","[Right? Ehehe~~]","Compared to how she used to have virtually no interest in most people, Fate’s growth was evident. Even if it only applied to people connected to Kaito, she could now remember names and faces relatively well, including people she had never directly spoken to or formally introduced herself to.","[......Ah, but I don’t know this one.]","As she said that and turned her gaze toward Cornelia, Cornelia’s back straightened once more. Given that the Supreme God’s attention had suddenly focused on her, it was only natural that sweat began trickling down her forehead from nervousness.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Just as she said, it’s not that she lacks memory, she just doesn’t bother trying to remember. It seems she clearly remembered meeting Eris at the Founding Festival too......]","? ? ? : [Fate-san seriously has an incredible memory. She just doesn’t recall things because she has no interest in them. Her memory’s good enough that she basically never forgets anything she’s seen once.]","Serious-senpai : [That aside, there was a phrase that caught my attention: “the proxy I brought”...... Could this mean there’s another round of trouble coming?]"]},{"number":2592,"title":"Chapter 2592 - Demon Realm Amusement Park 23","paragraphs":["Compared to the past, Fate had become capable of taking some interest in other people as well, at least towards those connected with Kaito, and she remembered them reasonably well.","However, naturally, people she had never met or even seen before were another matter entirely.","[......Hmm, yeah, I really don’t recognize you.]","[.................]","As Fate peered closely at Cornelia’s face, Cornelia stood perfectly upright, cold sweat pouring down her forehead, unable to decide how she should react.","Her counterpart was the Supreme God. Without even obtaining permission, there was no way Cornelia could carelessly address her first, much less introduce herself.","Moreover, Fate’s words just now were little more than muttering to herself, not directed at Cornelia in particular. Under those circumstances...... Cornelia had no way of making a move herself.","Naturally, Eris couldn’t intervene either. Although Eris had met Fate before, she had only just introduced herself, and they weren’t close enough to justify stepping in.","Which meant that, of course, the only one who could save Cornelia in this situation was Kaito. But even so, another major problem that Eris and Cornelia had experienced many times in the past stood in the way.","That was, Kaito tended to introduce Eris and Cornelia, both noble daughters, to even highly ranked individuals with remarkable casualness. It was a sign of the trust he had in them, but for nobles, for whom connections and relationships were of utmost importance, such things carried tremendous significance.","[Ahhh, this is Cornelia-san, one of my friends. We met after the birthday party, so it’s only natural that Fate-san wouldn’t know her.]","[Ahh, I see, that’s how it is. Since she’s with Eririn, is she a noble?]","[Yes, she’s from the Sharon County. She’s been helping me out a lot lately, and she’s even accommodated some rather sudden requests.]","[Heh~~ If Kai-chan says that...... she must be a very capable girl.]","Cornelia felt as though her breathing was about to stop. There was nothing wrong with Kaito’s words themselves. It was true that she had helped him with things like arranging the special brush and that she had indeed been assisting him.","However, the way he put it was catastrophically bad. What Kaito had just said made it sound as though he relied on Cornelia immensely, and, in fact, Fate now looked quite impressed.","(Kaito-sama! Kaito-sama!? Those words are going to create a terrible, terrible misunderstanding! P- Please, have mercy......)","Her stomach hurt, but she still couldn’t open her mouth. Interrupting Kaito and Fate’s conversation was absolutely out of the question.","After hearing Kaito’s explanation about Cornelia, Fate turned toward her once more.","[If you’re a friend Kai-chan relies on, then I should make sure to remember you properly. I’m Fate, you probably already know that, but nice to meet you~~]","[Y- Yes. My name is Cornelia Sharon. I- It’s a pleasure to make your acquaintance as well.]","[Konekone huh? Nice to meet you~~]","[Konekone!?]","It was a relief that Fate speaking to her had finally given her a chance to respond, but all Cornelia managed was the bare minimum of a self-introduction, and the misunderstanding remained completely unresolved.","[So Konekone and Eririn are nobles that Kai-chan gets along with?]","[Yes. As is the case with Cornelia-san, among the nobles of the Archlesia Empire, Eris-san is probably the person I talk to the most besides Chris-san. I think Fate-san saw it at the birthday party too, but she’s amazing, so I rely on her a lot, especially when it comes to noble-related matters.]","[......Ahh~~ come to think of it, she ranked near the top in the quiz contest and even made it to the finals of the game tournament...... Eririn’s amazing huh.]","At those casually spoken words, Eris’s eyes lost all life. She had always been aware that Kaito’s opinion of her was unusually high, but hearing him praise her to a Supreme God herself would only raise her reputation even further.","She was already struggling with the balance of power among the nobility, and this unexpected follow-up attack sent a dull pain through her stomach. Meanwhile, Lilia looked at Eris and Cornelia with genuine sympathy.","[......Ahh, that reminds me. Eririn has a strong blessing...... hmm, probably from God of Life? So you know God of Life too?]","[Y- Yes. I am honored beyond measure to have received Her favor.]","[Hehh~~ As for Konekone...... I’m not really sure because it’s weaker, but is that the blessing of the God of Commerce? Did you receive it in the Hydra Kingdom instead of the Archlesia Empire?]","[It’s as you had inferred. At the beginning of the year, I received a blessing from the God of Commerce. The Sharon County places great emphasis on our trading company, so......]","Just as Fate had said, Cornelia traveled every year to the temple of the God of Commerce in the Hydra Kingdom to receive the Provisional Blessing for the new year.","[Cornelia-san’s family owns the Sharon Trading Company, a fairly large magic tool dealer, and through that connection she introduced me to the Victor Trading Company before. Their family is really focused on commerce, so I guess that’s why they receive the God of Commerce’s Blessing.]","[I see. But a Provisional Blessing from a Low-ranking God has rather weak effects, doesn’t it? Ahh, right. I happened to have brought “God of Fortune” with me, so you should have her give you a Provisional Blessing.]","[ ! ? ! ? ! ? ]","The words had been delivered so casually, like ordinary small talk, that the shock nearly made Cornelia’s eyes roll back into her head. It seemed that peace would not be coming to the stomachs of the two girls anytime soon.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Well, she really has grown a lot. Even if it’s only with people connected to Kaito, she’s talking in a very friendly and approachable way, and she’s being considerate and giving them high praise...... but the result of all that consideration is just punching their stomachs into oblivion......]","? ? ? : [Fate-san is actually pretty lax when it comes to Provisional Blessings, her mindset more like the Provisional Blessings were things that can be carefreely handed out. Someone like Chronois-san, on the other hand, considers even those who receive a Provisional Blessing to be under her protection, so she’s extremely selective about whom she grants them to......]"]},{"number":2593,"title":"Chapter 2593 - Demon Realm Amusement Park 24","paragraphs":["I was a little surprised by the words Fate-san stated so casually, but I decided to ask about the God of Fortune-san she had mentioned.","[Fate-san, you said you brought God of Fortune-san with you...... did you come together?]","[Unn. I brought her along so I could have her handle things in my place. God of Fortune is more than enough to attract attention, and she said she was interested in the amusement park too.]","[I see. You didn’t bring Shia-san?]","[Hm~~ It’s not exactly work after all. Heck, God of Calamity came here herself, invited separately from me...... Even before the Gods changed the way they viewed things, God of Calamity used to visit the Demon Realm and Human Realm often, so she’s got her own connections. And since she loves new things, I’m sure she came.]","Now that she mentioned it, that made sense. Shia-san was very sensitive to trends, or rather, the type who wanted to try anything new at least once. She had even obtained information on Kuro’s instant products before they became popular and bought every variety. Apparently, she’d also purchased all of Nifty’s products.","And from what she’d told me when we met before, she’d made reservations and already visited all three of Nifty’s cafés. She intended to keep going until she’d conquered the entire menu. She had complained that they should add more items with less sweetness, but despite saying she wasn’t good with sweets, she still tried every dessert item at least once.","Anyhow, she’s always quick to hear about new products, so I really do think she has her own information network. Shia-san also performs things like warding off misfortune and is very friendly toward Humans and Demons alike, so she probably has quite a wide circle of acquaintances.","Well, putting Shia-san aside, what mattered right now was God of Fortune-san.","[......So, where is this God of Fortune-san?]","[No, she’s right there. I don’t know why she won’t come over...... Oiiii~~ God of Fortune, come over here and say hello to Kai-chan~~]","Looking in the direction Fate-san called toward, a God-ish woman stepped quietly out from behind a building. She had long, shimmering platinum-blonde hair and yellow eyes rather than golden ones. She was around 160 cm tall and had a calm demeanor. Her white, God-ish clothes were adorned with golden embroidery here and there. They weren’t excessively flashy, but they gave off a sense of luxury...... or rather, being told she was the God of Fortune, she possessed a solemnity that made it feel as though my luck would improve just by looking at her.","And yet, for some reason...... She had eyes that looked as though “they were filled with despair, grief, and resignation all at once”...... Why?","[......God of Fortune? Why are you making that face? It’s Kai-chan, you know?]","[......I didn’t want to meet him.]","[Why? Do you hate Kai-chan?]","[No. He is a revered individual blessed by Shallow Vernal-sama, and I am sincerely grateful that he caused the God of Fate to actually do her work, so I have an extremely favorable impression of him as a person...... but I didn’t want to meet him.]","What was with this reaction......? She didn’t dislike me at all, in fact, she seemed to think highly of me, but with God of Fortune-san looking like a dead fish and saying from the bottom of her heart that she hadn’t wanted to meet me, I had no idea what kind of response I was supposed to give.","[I don’t really get it, but introduce yourself to Kai-chan first.]","[......I see...... So this is where I am to be publicly executed.]","[......Why?]","[......Because this is an introduction. Which means I am about to call myself the “God of Fortune” in front of “someone far luckier than I am”...... Doesn’t that make me a complete clown......?]","[Ahhh, so that’s what you meant by not wanting to meet him......]","Fate-san wore an understanding expression, and only then did I finally understand what the God of Fortune-san had meant when “she said she hadn’t wanted to meet me”.","God of Fortune-san let out a resigned sigh, composed herself, and turned to face me.","[Nice to meet you. I serve directly under the God of Fate. I am Fortune, the God of Fortune...... Ah, though my luck is inferior to yours...... I do preside over fortune...... technically...... yes.]","[Ah, errr, I’m Miyama Kaito. Nice to meet you, Fortune-san.]","[Ahhh, it’s blinding...... You truly are a monster of luck. It feels like my eyes are going to melt. At this point, shouldn’t you be the God of Fortune instead......?]","She had an expression like her very identity had been shattered to pieces. Even though I hadn’t done anything, somehow it felt like I was bullying her......","[Errr...... Fate-san?]","[The God of Fortune can actually see other people’s luck, you know~~? The stronger someone’s luck is, the brighter they appear to her. So is Kai-chan really that amazing?]","[......It’s like having the sun right in front of me. If I actually looked him in the eyes for too long, I feel like the brightness would blind me.]","......So that’s why she’d been avoiding eye contact and keeping her gaze lowered diagonally the whole time......","[Geez, can we have enough of this...... Compared to this person, my luck might as well belong to an ordinary person...... It’s like comparing a single drop of water to the ocean. I feel like I’m being crushed under the weight of his luck.]","Well, how should I say this...... it wasn’t as though I had intended any of this, but apparently...... due to the countless blessings of various Gods piled on top of each other, I possessed enough luck to drive even the God of Fortune into despair.","Unn, how should I say this...... what kind of reaction was I supposed to have in a situation like this...... That was a difficult question indeed.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [It’s not exactly stomachache...... but it looks like her identity’s been shattered into tiny pieces.]"]},{"number":2594,"title":"Chapter 2594 - Demon Realm Amusement Park 25","paragraphs":["It seemed that, without meaning to, I’d ended up shattering Fortune-san’s very identity...... Anyhow, after introducing herself once, perhaps she’d managed to put it behind her. She lightly shook her head as if to compose herself before speaking to Fate-san.","[So then, God of Fate-sama. Did you need something from me?]","[Ah, right. Go ahead and give Konekone over here a Provisional Blessing.]","[ ! ? ]","At Fate-san’s usual offhand remark, Fortune-san turned toward Cornelia-san. Perhaps because a high-ranking God had suddenly directed her gaze at her, Cornelia-san stiffened with a start.","Still, hmmm. What should I think about this? Cornelia-san looked rather overwhelmed, but...... I think receiving a Provisional Blessing itself was a good thing. Fortune-san’s Blessing undoubtedly had the effect of increasing one’s luck, so it would surely be beneficial for the Sharon County, which managed a trading company.","[She’s one of Kai-chan’s friends, but she’s currently under the God of Commerce’s Provisional Blessing. A Provisional Blessing from the God of Fortune would be more effective, right?]","[I see...... Wouldn’t a blessing from God of Fate-sama herself be even more effective?]","[I mean, I could do it myself, but a Provisional Blessing from a Supreme God would make things rather troublesome for Konekone’s position, wouldn’t it? Especially since she’s a noble of Archlesia Empire. If I were the one to do it, I’d have to clear it with the God of Life first. Besides, don’t high-ranking Gods already give Provisional Blessings every year to royalty and some high-ranking nobles?]","Apparently, Fate-san had actually thought this through quite a bit. Since Life-san was the Supreme God responsible for the Archlesia Empire, if Fate-san personally bestowed a Provisional Blessing upon an Archlesian noble, it would inevitably bring Life-san’s authority and reputation into question.","......Well, there was probably also the simple fact that she couldn’t be bothered going through the trouble of informing Life-san......","On the other hand, high-ranking Gods, though few in number, bestowed Provisional Blessings every year. In Symphonia Kingdom, they were generally reserved for the royal family, but in Archlesia Empire, where the nobility held greater power, some high-ranking nobles also received Provisional Blessings from high-ranking Gods, so it seemed there would be no issue with Cornelia-san receiving one as well.","[I understand. Then, if you’ll come over here...... Hmm?]","After nodding in agreement with Fate-san’s explanation, Fortune-san approached Cornelia-san...... but then a puzzled expression appeared on her face.","She looked at Cornelia-san’s face...... then, for some reason, lowered her gaze to her stomach...... or perhaps her torso...... somewhere around there, before looking back at her face and tilting her head.","Nor did she stop there. She shifted her gaze to Eris-san, who was standing nearby, and similarly alternated between looking at her face and her stomach, tilting her head in confusion.","[......Why is it that you’re fortunate overall, yet only one particular body part of you is so extraordinarily unlucky? Is that just how humans are? Ah, pardon me. This is our first meeting. I am Fortune, the God of Fortune.]","[It is an honor to greet the radiant Goddess of Fortune. I am Cornelia Sharon, eldest daughter of the Sharon County, a noble of the Archlesia Empire.]","[It’s a pleasure to meet you. Then, with God of Fate-sama’s kindness, I’ll proceed with the Provisional Blessing.]","[Y- Yes! It is the greatest honor.]","What was that strange reaction from Fortune-san...... She seemed to be saying that only Cornelia-san’s stomach had exceptionally bad luck...... Could it be that having a weak stomach appeared that way to her? Hmmm, I really didn’t understand.","In any case, since this had been Fate-san’s decision, it seems like things are already settled here. It wasn’t a question of whether she would perform the Provisional Blessing, it was simply a declaration that it was about to begin, and Cornelia-san responded by bowing her head deeply.","[Now then, I bestow upon you the Blessing of Fortune...... Done.]","[From the bottom of my heart, I offer my deepest gratitude for the boundless mercy of the Goddess of Fortune and the Goddess of Fate.]","[I accept your words of thanks. God of Fate-sama, is this the only person receiving a Provisional Blessing...... Huh?]","After finishing Cornelia-san’s blessing, Fortune-san turned back toward Fate-san, only for her eyes to widen in utter shock.","Her gaze wasn’t fixed on Fate-san...... It was on Lilia-san.","[Whoa......]","[Unn? Is something wrong with Lili-tan?]","[......Was she born under some incredibly powerful curse affecting her stomach? Or perhaps there’s an Evil God sealed inside it? I never imagined it was possible for such tremendous good fortune and such overwhelming misfortune to coexist within the same body, separated by specific body parts. This is the first time I’ve ever seen anything like it.]","[......Ah, well, that’s just Lili-tan...... Don’t worry about it. Just think of her as being that kind of person.]","[......U- Umm...... Fate-sama? I believe I just overheard something extremely unsettling......]","[Just give up. Even my Authority can’t do anything about Lili-tan......]","[Fate-sama!?]","Hearing that Lilia-san simultaneously possessed extraordinary good fortune and extraordinary misfortune...... To be honest, all I could think was “Ah, yeah, that tracks”.","She was probably fortunate overall, but at the same time, she also attracted trouble like a black hole, so I couldn’t help finding the explanation convincing...... Though, of course, there was no way I could ever say that out loud.","After all, I was the cause of most of those troubles. If I so much as voiced that thought, I’d undoubtedly end up sitting in seiza while getting a lengthy lecture.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [So the unlucky part of the Stomachache Warriors were their stomachs...... Though the main cause is that guy Miyama Kaito......]"]},{"number":2595,"title":"Chapter 2595 - Demon Realm Amusement Park 26","paragraphs":["As the conversation about Lilia unfolded before her, the voices seemed strangely distant. Struggling to catch up with reality, Cornelia desperately forced her mind to process the situation.","(I was invited to the amusement park through Sharon Trading Company’s connections, and since Eris-sama had been invited as well, we decided to go together. I had already prepared myself for the possibility of running into Kaito-sama. I even tried to ease my nerves by having an optimistic conversation with Eris-sama, but considering my past experiences, I was convinced we’d meet eventually...... But how in the world did that lead to receiving a Provisional Blessing from the Goddess of Fortune?)","She had been prepared to encounter Kaito. What she had never expected was that Fate would happen to appear there as well. Then, after seeing the blessings Eris and Cornelia possessed, Fate would instruct Fortune, who just happened to be accompanying her, to bestow Provisional Blessings upon her...... There was no way anyone could have predicted that chain of events.","(Both the Goddess of Fate and Kaito-sama probably judged that it wouldn’t be a problem because some members of the royal family and high-ranking nobility do receive Provisional Blessings from High-ranking Gods...... But there is a problem...... A huge one...... After all, even among high-ranking nobles, the only people who receive Provisional Blessings from High-ranking Gods are heads of the most influential houses, like Marquis Hamilton......)","Indeed, it wasn’t unheard of for high-ranking nobles to receive Provisional Blessings from High-ranking Gods...... However, those recipients were only a tiny handful of the greatest noble houses, and even then, they were typically the family heads themselves.","Cornelia was the daughter of a count. Certainly, when viewed within noble society as a whole, she qualified as a high-ranking noble. But compared to dukes and marquises, her family’s standing was clearly lower. On top of that, she wasn’t even the heir to the family.","(Eris-sama has already been announced as the future head of Hamilton Marquisdom, so she has the standing to receive even the Blessing of a Supreme God without issue. But I’m only the eldest daughter, not the heir...... And after everything involving Victor Trading Company, it’s becoming increasingly likely that I’ll eventually become independent. Marquis Hamilton, Eris-sama, and Her Majesty Chris are backing me, but...... this is still bound to cause quite a commotion. As soon as I return, I’ll have to consult Father and my brother...... And if possible...... all I can do is pray that nothing else happens to further strengthen my position......)","Through her association with Kaito, Cornelia’s value had skyrocketed. From the perspective of other noble families, she was an extraordinarily attractive prospect, someone that isn’t the heir to her house and had no fiancé.","For now, Marquis Hamilton and Chris had managed to keep things under control, but she was constantly dealing with nobles who, while carefully avoiding saying it outright, would indirectly press for an engagement.","Fortune’s Provisional Blessing would only increase her value even further. Moreover, it had happened at an amusement park filled with other invited guests, and the people accompanying them were numerous as well. Keeping it a secret was simply impossible.","Of course, the blessing itself was an incredible honor, and calling it a privilege was no exaggeration. Still, if good fortune truly was about to smile upon her, wishing that it would somehow resolve this troublesome predicament first was only natural.","[......Cornelia-san? You don’t look so well. Was it a bad idea to suddenly give you a blessing?]","[Eh? Ah, no, not at all. It is a tremendous honor, and I am sincerely grateful for such thoughtful consideration. It’s just...... embarrassing it may be to say this, but this creates certain issues in noble society. With this, even more nobles will likely try to establish ties with me, so it seems I’m about to become quite busy......]","[Ah, I see...... Getting flooded with letters would definitely be a nightmare.]","Unlike Eris, Cornelia wasn’t particularly skilled at masking her emotions or instantly composing herself. Ironically, that worked in her favor, as Kaito, having read her feelings through Sympathy Magic, spoke to her with genuine concern.","Naturally, she couldn’t bring herself to admit that what truly worried her was dealing with marriage proposals and political matchmaking, so she deliberately phrased it vaguely...... Listening to her, Kaito recalled what Lilia had gone through before.","He remembered how, immediately after receiving Chronois’ Blessing, Lilia had been inundated with countless letters and worked to exhaustion. He concluded that Cornelia was anxious about ending up in a similar situation...... While not exactly correct, it wasn’t far from the truth either.","(Lilia-san really had it rough back then...... It’s no wonder Cornelia-san is worried. I’d like to help somehow, but there are probably noble obligations involved, so simply asking everyone not to send her letters wouldn’t solve anything...... Unless there were some convenient way to block only the letters from people Cornelia-san doesn’t actually want to associate with......)","Kaito sincerely wished he could help Cornelia. There wasn’t a trace of ulterior motive in that wish. It was born entirely from pure, wholehearted kindness.","And that wish......","(......Fufu, my beloved child really is so kind. Very well then. For my beloved child, it’s time for Mother to step in and lend a hand!)","......summoned an outrageously dangerous being.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Of all the people, why is the most dangerous guy showing up!? Cornelia isn’t even one of her children, and it’s not like they have any kind of relationship, so there shouldn’t be any reason for her to get involved...... Why the hell is someone this absurd suddenly popping up......]","Makina : [......Well, I haven’t had much screen time lately, so I was bored......]","Serious-senpai : [That’s your reason!?]"]},{"number":2596,"title":"Chapter 2596 - Demon Realm Amusement Park 27","paragraphs":["Fortune-san’s Provisional Blessing for Cornelia-san had come to an end. Even though it was only temporary, receiving the Blessing of a High-ranking God was apparently a very significant matter among the nobility. While Cornelia-san expressed her gratitude, there was also an unmistakable hint of anxiety on her face.","When Lilia-san had previously received Chronois-san’s Provisional Blessing, she had been buried under a mountain of letters, so I figured Cornelia-san was worried about ending up in the same situation.","Still, this wasn’t an easy problem to solve. For example, if I asked Alice to warn the other nobles not to send letters to Cornelia-san, we might also end up preventing the normal correspondence that’s necessary for noble society.","Then again, could we simply filter out only the letters related to Fortune-san’s Blessing? That wasn’t so simple either. Just like with Lilia-san, while there would certainly be people trying to take advantage of the situation, connections and relationships were vital among the nobility. Regardless of how an acquaintance began, expanding one’s social circle could often prove beneficial.","If we interfered too carelessly, we might also end up cutting off relationships that could become valuable to Cornelia-san in the future.","There were plenty of cases where someone approached another out of self-interest at first, only for that relationship to grow into a dependable alliance over time. I didn’t really understand the intricacies of noble socializing well enough to judge.","Well, if someone possessed an absurd power like “omniscience”, they might be able to pinpoint only the troublesome individuals and discreetly warn them...... but having someone like an Omniscient and Omnipotent God step in just to deal with the aftermath of a High-ranking God’s Provisional Blessing would completely defeat the purpose.","Given that, the best thing I could do was probably wait and see for now, and lend Cornelia-san a hand if she ended up in over her head.","[......Cornelia-san, if anything troublesome comes up because of the Blessing, please let me know. I can’t promise I’ll be able to solve it, but I should at least be able to help.]","[Thank you very much. Frankly, what’s truly frightening is that it feels less like there’s nothing you could do, and more like there’s nothing you couldn’t do...... If things go beyond what I can handle, I may ask for your advice.]","[Of course. When that happens, don’t hesitate to ask. Eris-san, the same goes for you. If anything comes up concerning Life-san, feel free to let me know.]","[Thank you for your concern...... The Hamilton Marquisdom is quite influential, so matters involving interactions between nobles are not a problem. However, when it comes to dealings with the God Realm or the Gods, there may be occasions when I must seek your guidance, Kaito-sama.]","Just as I had with Cornelia-san, I also told Eris-san, who had received Life-san’s Blessing, to let me know if anything came up.","As she’d said herself, the power of the Hamilton Marquisdom seemed to give her much more confidence than Cornelia-san. More than that, Eris-san simply gave off the impression that she could handle most situations on her own. Even when she met someone truly extraordinary, she would be surprised at first...... but she always regained her composure almost immediately. In that regard, she really was impressive.","[......By the way, Alice. Why are you taking out a wine bottle and staring at it with such a puzzled look?]","[Well, hmmm...... I mean, this should be the perfect opportunity for some premium schadenfreude...... but instead, I just feel this strange sense of pity. I don’t even feel like enjoying it...... Since Kaito-san stepped in, nothing weird should happen...... Hmm...... Am I overlooking something?]","Alice suddenly appeared, gave the wine bottle in her hand a puzzled look, then tilted her head before disappearing again. The way she’d said it was a little concerning, but it seemed even she didn’t really understand what she was sensing.","If Alice herself couldn’t figure it out, there was no way I could. Besides, she seemed more puzzled than alarmed, so well, I guess it probably wasn’t anything serious?","[W- Well then, changing the subject...... Fortune-san, does your Blessing really increase someone’s fortune?]","[Hyihh, I’m getting burned by fortune...... Ah, y- yes. Since it’s only a Provisional Blessing, the effect isn’t all that powerful but...... your fortune should have increased enough that you’d be guaranteed to win any lottery with about a one-in-ten chance. S- Sorry it’s so underwhelming......]","[No, no, I think that’s incredible. Being guaranteed to succeed at something with around a ten percent chance sounds amazingly powerful......]","......She’s really avoiding eye contact there. Her appearance gave off this dazzling, radiant impression, the sort that looked like it would naturally bring good fortune, but whenever she talked to me, she kept her gaze fixed diagonally downward, trembling the whole time. It wasn’t the nicest way to put it, but she gave off the aura of an introvert.","......Well, if I took Fortune-san’s words at face value, then my fortune must have been as dazzling as the sun, making it impossible for her to look directly at me.","[God of Fortune, do you not like Kai-chan?]","[No, it’s not that I dislike him...... It’s difficult to explain, but when I’m standing in front of him, it feels like I’m being overwhelmed by an aura screaming “This person is on an entirely different level”. It’s like...... being assaulted by fortune itself? So when he suddenly appears right in front of me, I can’t help but shrink back.]","Assaulted by fortune...... Well, at least it was a relief to know she didn’t actually dislike me. If I had to interpret it, my fortune was simply so overwhelming that Fortune-san, who could actually perceive it, gets jittery whenever I suddenly come close.","It was probably something she’d gradually get used to over time, so if we continued interacting, we’d likely be able to talk much more casually in the future.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Translation: He’s going to keep beating people over the head with his luck...... More importantly, did Kaito not hear that crazy god’s words last chapter!?]","Makina : [Unn? Unlike Shallow Vernal, I don’t use telepathy to interrupt my beloved child while he’s talking to someone. That would just get in the way of the conversation, wouldn’t it? Besides, this kind of thing is cooler when Mother quietly helps my beloved child behind the scenes without him ever noticing!]","Serious-senpai : [......No, but that just guarantees the worst-case scenario where nobody knows who’s going to stop it! Even Alice doesn’t seem to have considered that you’d make a move over something involving Cornelia!]","Makina : [It’s fine, it’s fine! I won’t make a big deal out of it. I’ll just use my omniscience to look into it and as Paradise Eden, I’ll head over to give them a peaceful little warning!]","Serious-senpai : [......You’re saying an Otherworld God launching an incursion isn’t considered “making a big deal out of it”?]"]},{"number":2597,"title":"Chapter 2597 - Demon Realm Amusement Park 28","paragraphs":["For the time being, the whole exchange had come to an end, but once I finally took a moment to breathe, I realized the situation had become rather chaotic. Our group of Lilia-san and the others had now been joined by Eris-san, Cornelia-san, their escorts, Fate-san, and Fortune-san. It had become quite a large crowd, and standing around in the middle of the path would probably just get in everyone’s way.","That said, with Fate-san here, the only one who could really take charge and get things moving was...... probably me? I glanced over at Lilia-san just in case, and perhaps she understood exactly what I was thinking, because she shook her head with all her might...... Looks like I’m the one who has to handle this.","[......By the way, Fate-san, what are you planning to do now?]","[Hmmm, I’ve already met Kai-chan, so I could head home now...... but Shall-tan asked me to at least go on one attraction. Which attraction are you heading to next, Kai-chan? Is it somewhere nearby?]","Asking whether it was nearby, that was so like Fate-san. If we had been heading to another area, I honestly got the feeling she’d ignore her promise to Alice out of sheer laziness and just go home.","Fortunately, or perhaps unfortunately, the attraction we were aiming for wasn’t in another area at all. It was right nearby.","[We’re planning to go to the attraction called Forest Castle, just over there.]","[ [ ! ? ! ? ] ]","For some reason, Eris-san and Cornelia-san both looked visibly startled by what I’d said...... Wait, don’t tell me we’re all heading to the same place?","[Hehh~~ I see. Eririn and Konekone too?]","[Eh? Y- Yes. By coincidence, we were also planning to head to the attraction called Forest Castle.]","Fate-san had apparently noticed their reactions as well. When she asked, Eris-san nodded.","[......Hmm, then the God of Fortune and I will come along too!]","[Fate-san too?]","[Unn. It’ll be more fun with Kai-chan here, and by going to this one attraction, I’ll have kept my promise to Shall-tan. After we’re done, I’ll head home.]","I’d more or less expected this the moment she’d asked where we were going, but it seemed Fate-san would be coming to Forest Castle with us after all.","I still had no idea what kind of attraction it was, but if that was the case, then I could probably just keep Fate-san occupied myself.","There was no way it was a single-person attraction after all...... Though, putting that aside, Fortune-san had an expression that practically screamed “Eh? I’m coming too!?”...... Ah, but as expected, Fate-san’s wishes took priority. Her surprised expression quickly turned into one of resignation.","[......Help me, God of Calamity...... I’m going to have the difference between myself and this monster of good fortune shoved in my face...... B- But, it’s still much better than trying to persuade Fate-sama after she stopped moving just a few steps past the entrance......]","Fortune-san muttered under her breath, wearing an unmistakably forlorn expression....... It sounded like she’d come here because she’d been asked to make sure Fate-san experienced at least one attraction, only for Fate-san to stop dead just a few steps inside the entrance, leaving Fortune-san to somehow coax her into moving. She really had been through quite a bit.","For the moment, I simply nodded in agreement with Fate-san’s request before stepping a little away from her and approaching Eris-san and Cornelia-san to apologize for the change in plans.","[I’m sorry, Eris-san, Cornelia-san...... Things ended up turning out like this.]","[Oh, no, not at all. Being able to accompany the Goddess of Fate and the Goddess of Fortune is an honor for us as well.]","[......If anything, are we truly allowed to come along?]","Eris-san and Cornelia-san were clearly nervous, but Fate-san had always been rather easygoing around Humans...... In the past, that had simply been because she was indifferent from a lack of interest, but now it was more that she interacted with people casually because of her naturally laid-back personality. If anything, when it came to conversations like this, she was probably the most approachable of all the Supreme Gods.","At the very least, she would never get angry over something being disrespectful, so in that sense, she was the safest one to be around. I figured Eris-san and Cornelia-san would calm down once they got used to her.","[......Unn? Shall-tan? Why are you drinking wine?]","[Earlier, I was too caught up feeling inexplicably sorry for someone to feel like drinking, but this time I can enjoy it normally...... Ah, let me scooch into your cushion.]","[Sure~~ Pour me some wine too...... So, that thing Shall-tan mentioned...... does it have something to do with “the people heading towards the attraction up ahead”?]","[Well, Kaito-san really is something else. If he hadn’t stopped because he ran into Fate-san, you guys never would’ve crossed paths.]","[Even though this amusement park is huge~~ Kai-chan really is amazing.]","Before I knew it, Alice had appeared, climbed onto Fate-san’s cushion, and was drinking wine with her. The two of them looked like they were getting along quite well, but although I couldn’t make out what they were quietly discussing, what stood out to me was the way they looked over at us afterward with warm, amused smiles.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Their stomachs are still going to take even more attacks huh...... What else could possibly happen......?]","Makina : [......It’s called “Forest” Castle after all.]","Serious-senpai : [Right...... There’s still one of the Six Kings they haven’t met yet......]"]},{"number":2598,"title":"Chapter 2598 - Demon Realm Amusement Park 29","paragraphs":["Although it was an unexpected turn of events, there was naturally no such thing as the right to refuse, and so Eris and Cornelia found themselves traveling with Kaito’s group toward Forest Castle.","Since bringing along all of the guards accompanying Eris and Cornelia would have made the group far too large, those guards kept their distance and followed from behind instead.","To begin with, this group already included Lilia, one of the strongest individuals in the Human Realm; Anima and Caraway, both Count-rank Demons; Eta and Theta, Baron-rank Demons; Lunamaria and Sieglinde, who, while not possessing the strength of a Peerage Holder, were still exceptionally powerful; not to mention Fate, a Supreme God herself, and Fortune, one of the elite among the High-ranking Gods. Guards on the level of those accompanying Eris and Cornelia wouldn’t be able to accomplish anything in a situation like this, making it meaningless for them to stay nearby in the first place.","Thus, there was no issue with Eris and Cornelia each accompanying Kaito’s party on their own. The real problem lay in what would happen afterward. The Archlesia Empire was currently viewed as a nation with exceptionally strong ties to the God Realm. It was a country that received the Divine Protection from Fate herself; all of the Supreme Gods had attended its Founding Festival; and a Ripple Tree had even been bestowed upon the Ritch Baron directly from the God Realm...... As a result, connections with the God Realm had become a powerful source of prestige for the empire’s nobility.","Naturally, many noble houses longed to establish such connections. Combined with the empire’s recent political climate, numerous families had begun donating large sums to temples and desperately seeking opportunities to associate with the Gods.","In other words, anyone with genuine ties to the God Realm would clearly stand above those noble houses still struggling to obtain them. That made the Provisional Blessing Cornelia had received from the God of Fortune an enormously significant advantage.","(To be honest, Cornelia-sama’s situation isn’t very favorable. Depending on how things develop, I may have to consider having the Hamilton Marquisdom intervene more directly. Still, even if we’re part of the same faction, interfering too deeply in another household’s affairs could create problems. Especially when it comes to Cornelia-sama’s personal relationships...... I can’t exactly be too forceful there......)","Even as they walked, Eris never stopped thinking. The impact of the God of Fortune’s Provisional Blessing on Cornelia was tremendous...... but perhaps, it was too tremendous. There was a genuine risk that Cornelia would end up like a goose that laid golden eggs.","Even though it had not yet been officially announced, any perceptive noble had likely already guessed that Cornelia would inherit the Victor Trading Company and eventually separate from Sharon County as an independent entity.","If only obvious opportunists came rushing in the moment she became independent from Sharon County, dealing with them would be simple enough, but if rival houses began infiltrating the Victor Trading Company itself, that would be far more difficult. As someone from another household, there would be limits to what Eris could do.","As she pondered this, her eyes met Cornelia’s...... and for a fleeting instant, it almost felt as though sparks flashed between them.","The technique known as telepathy, magical communication using mana wavelengths, was an advanced skill. Even among the Gods, many were incapable of using it. Naturally, neither Eris nor Cornelia possessed the magical proficiency necessary for such techniques.","However, Eris and Cornelia shared something else...... They were both veterans acquainted with stomachache. The countless stomachaches they had endured, the mountain of stomach medicine they had consumed, those experiences had forged an unshakable bond between them, one that allowed them to communicate through nothing more than eye contact.","It was much like teammates in sports...... or comrades-in-arms who had weathered countless hardships together. With only a glance, the two carried on an entire conversation.","(......As I feared, the situation really is that bad?)","(Yes. That said, it’s not that something will happen immediately. I simply mean that we’ll need to remain vigilant from this point onward......)","(Eris-sama...... Hamilton Marquisdom...... I truly am sorry for causing you trouble time and time again.)","(Not at all. If anything, I’m glad it happened where I was able to witness it. Thanks to that, I’m able to think through the situation now......)","As the two exchanged these silent messages through eye contact and the slightest of gestures, both Eris and Cornelia suddenly felt their attention drawn elsewhere and turned their gazes.","There stood Lilia...... and the moment Lilia quietly looked at them, her intent was conveyed as clearly as if she had spoken aloud.","(......Please don’t let your guard down, either of you...... Not yet.)","(Not yet? D- Don’t tell me...... after coincidentally running into the God of Fate...... there’s still more to come?)","The hearts of those who knew stomachache brought about by Kaito resonated with one another, and Lilia’s warning reached Eris and Cornelia at the very core of their souls.","(We’re not in a good location yet. We still haven’t reached Forest Castle...... Considering Kaito-san’s absurd ability to attract fateful encounters...... there’s every possibility that someone else is already waiting at Forest Castle.)","It was a warning born from the experience of the person here who had endured more Kaito-induced stomachaches than anyone else. The sheer weight behind Lilia’s gaze made Eris and Cornelia involuntarily catch their breath.","This was no time to worry about what might happen in the distant future. They first needed to survive whatever was about to happen right now.","......That said, even after steeling themselves, neither they nor even Lilia herself could have possibly predicted that waiting for them inside Forest Castle would be...... the “World King and all of the Seven Princesses”......","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [Even all the Executives are there!?]","? ? ? : [Well, Lillywood-san normally hardly ever attends events like this. She values living simply and modestly after all...... But recently, it seems she’s gone through a change of heart and decided she’d like to experience new things, so she adjusted her schedule and brought all of the Seven Princesses with her.]","Serious-senpai : [......In other words?]","? ? ? : [......Well, as usual...... it’s basically Kaito-san’s fault.]"]},{"number":2599,"title":"Chapter 2599 - Demon Realm Amusement Park 30","paragraphs":["The enormous amusement park in the Demon Realm, created by Kuromueina and Alice, within its Forest Area, there stood one of the Six Kings for whom a forest was perhaps the most fitting place imaginable...... Lillywood Yggdrasil.","Naturally, she had come after receiving an invitation from Kuromueina and Alice to experience the amusement park. And she was not alone, accompanying her were all seven of the Seven Princesses, the World King’s Executives.","[Incredible! Everywhere you look, there’s something I’ve never seen before!]","[I agree...... In other words, it’s truly amazing and feels wonderfully fresh. You can sense the ingenuity behind everything...... In other words, every attraction is built on such creative ideas that it’s genuinely exciting.]","Tirtania exclaimed with unmistakable excitement, and Ariel, walking beside her, nodded in agreement. They had only just entered the park and experienced one or two attractions, but everything was unfamiliar to them, making the entire experience feel refreshingly new.","[I considered myself quite knowledgeable about the otherworld...... but I was still far too naïve! So facilities like this actually exist in the otherworld!]","[U- Unn...... Umm, Blossom? Could you lower your voice a little? When you suddenly shout like that...... it’s kind of scary......]","[Oh, my apologies.]","Blossom, who adored all things related to the otherworld, was just as excited as Tirtania, positively thrilled to be experiencing an amusement park for the first time.","However, since Blossom was already loud normally, her excitement only made her voice even louder. Startled, Rosemary’s shoulders jumped before she timidly asked Blossom to keep her voice down.","[The concept of this area being a forest is easy enough to understand, but knowing it’s divided into upper and lower sections, with even more attractions above us...... the sheer scale is overwhelming.]","[Yeah, yeah. It seems that, especially when it comes to architectural technology, the otherworld is more advanced than ours. They must have tons of huge buildings and facilities like this. Seriously, seriously...... everything I see is so fascinating that I never get tired of looking around.]","There were countless massive structures on a scale rarely seen anywhere in Trinia, and Camellia couldn’t help murmuring in admiration as she took in the breathtaking sight.","Smiling in agreement, Jutia also looked around with keen interest, her gaze wandering over the various attractions and shops.","Walking a short distance behind the cheerfully chatting Seven Princesses, Lillywood wore a gentle smile as she strolled along. It was then that Lillie, her Head Subordinate, addressed her.","[......Still, it’s rather unusual for you to visit a place like this, Lady Lillywood.]","Lillywood was, by nature, someone who almost never indulged in entertainment. In a sense, she was remarkably disciplined. While she acknowledged the value of entertainment and luxuries, she regarded them as things she personally had no need for. To an outside observer, her lifestyle could only be described as modest and simple.","She drank nothing but water, never taking pleasure in food as a preference. She acquired whatever knowledge she needed, but never read books or watched plays simply for entertainment.","It wasn’t that she was forcing herself to practice self-control, nor that she possessed the mindset of an ascetic seeking enlightenment. She simply didn’t consider such things necessary for herself. To Lillywood, that was only natural.","Even when she was invited to festivals and public celebrations as an honored guest, she would merely inspect the event rather than enjoy it herself. The same should have applied to amusement parks like this one. She might attend a ceremony if invited, but she ordinarily would never ride the attractions or experience them firsthand...... Or at least, that should have been the case.","This time, however, things were different. When Kuromueina invited her, Lillywood accepted without a moment’s hesitation and came here of her own accord. Though she had only experienced a handful of attractions so far, she had actually participated in them herself.","Even to Lillie, who had known Lillywood for a very long time, it was an extraordinarily rare sight.","“Indeed. Had it been the old me, I would have simply decided it was unnecessary for myself and, out of courtesy to Kuromueina and the others, encouraged all of you to attend in my place, or perhaps written a letter of congratulations and considered the matter settled. But...... I suppose you could say my state of mind has changed recently. I’ve had more and more opportunities to realize just how narrow my perspective truly was. That may be what caused this change.”","[Your perspective is narrow?]","Unable to read the surface thoughts of someone as overwhelmingly superior as Lillywood, Lillie couldn’t grasp the meaning behind her words and tilted her head in confusion.","Lillywood merely smiled gently before speaking again, her voice carrying a hint of nostalgia.","“Even if someone had told the me of just 10 years ago what the world is like today, I doubt I would have believed it. So many things I once thought would never change have changed beyond recognition, and the world itself has undergone tremendous transformation. Kuromueina, Isis, Megiddo, Magnawell, Shalltear...... every one of them has, to varying extent, changed because of Kaito-san’s influence. And I myself......”","[..................]","“Perhaps...... I envy Isis and the others. Perhaps I wish more of myself would change. Or perhaps, I’m simply enjoying the process of changing. I’ve begun to think, quite naturally, that it might be worthwhile to experience the things I once dismissed as unnecessary...... and I owe even that change in perspective to Kaito-san.”","[He truly...... is an extraordinary person.]","Watching Lillywood speak as though she genuinely enjoyed broadening her horizons by experiencing the very things she had once dismissed, things she had rejected simply because of her own limited perspective, Lillie smiled softly and gave a quiet nod.","“That said, I’m hardly the only one influenced by Kaito-san.”","[Kaitokun-san? Are we talking about Kaitokun-san?]","[Come to think of it, Kaito-kun was obviously invited too, right? There’s no way we’d receive invitations while Kaito-kun didn’t......]","[There’s no doubting that...... In other words, he was definitely invited, and he’s almost certainly here.]","[Yeah, yeah. Since we’re already here, it’d be nice if we could run into him.]","[......If it’s Kaito-san, I honestly wouldn’t be surprised if we just happened to bump into him while walking around...... Though, normally speaking, the odds of meeting someone by chance in a place this huge should be incredibly low, but when the other person is Kaito-san......]","[Master’s ability to weave connections is second to none in the world after all!]","As the Seven Princesses eagerly began chatting about Kaito in response to Lillywood’s remark, Lillie let out an amused, wry smile.","[......Just hearing his name is enough to get everyone this excited. Indeed, he really has had an enormous influence on all of us.]","“And you...... are no exception, right?”","[I can’t hide anything from you, Lillywood-sama. You’re right. I instinctively found myself thinking about using Sympathy Magic to search for him...... though it seems there won’t be any need for that.]","“So it would seem. Even so, that’s quite a large group they’ve got there.”","As Lillywood murmured those words and turned her gaze ahead, she spotted Kaito walking toward them, accompanied by a group of well over 10 people.","<Afterword>","Serious-senpai : [I see, so because her affection for Kaito has gone through the roof, she’s even come to an amusement park she never would’ve visited before because of his influence...... Then it really is Kaito’s fault after all!?]"]},{"number":2600,"title":"Chapter 2600 - Demon Realm Amusement Park 31","paragraphs":["Among Kaito’s group as they headed toward the Forest Castle, the first to perceive them were, naturally, Alice and Fate. More accurately, they had perceived them even before the group started moving. Alice simply found it amusing, while Fate wasn’t interested enough to bother mentioning it, so neither of them brought it up.","As for who noticed next, it was Lilia, whose abilities ranked just below Alice and Fate’s...... The instant she perceived them, her face turned pale, and Eris and Cornelia were the first to react to her expression.","(Duchess Lilia!?)","(......Both of you, steel yourselves. They’re ahead of us.)","Using nothing more than eye contact, a mysterious exchange made possible by the fact that they all understood the same kind of suffering, Lilia silently warned Eris and Cornelia to stay on guard.","Of course, it was only eye contact, so there was no way to convey detailed information. Even so, from Lilia’s demeanor, the direction of her gaze, and the color draining from her face, it didn’t take Eris and Cornelia long to realize that a world-renowned figure was somewhere ahead along their path.","(U- Up ahead!? W- Who could it possibly be......? I’m not very skilled in Detection Magic, so I can’t tell...... But for Duchess Lilia to make that face...... Awawa......)","(Considering Duchess Lilia’s expression, the current situation, and the people likely invited to this amusement park...... the most probable candidates are either the Death King, the World King, the War King, or the Dragon King. The World King normally doesn’t attend events like these though. I’ve heard the Death King has recently gained new subordinates and expanded her activities, so she’s certainly a possibility. The War King and the Dragon King are also entirely possible...... Or perhaps more than one of them......)","Realizing that someone capable of making Lilia go pale was waiting ahead, Cornelia began panicking internally...... Meanwhile, Eris quickly sorted through the possibilities and concluded that whoever was ahead was most likely one of the Six Kings.","Her deduction was correct, but in a sense, her own knowledge worked against her. She had always assumed Lillywood never attended events like this, so she had eliminated Lillywood from consideration almost immediately.","She realized that assumption had been wrong only after a bright, cheerful voice called out.","[Kaitokun-san! It’s Kaitokun-san!!! Waaah~~ I can’t believe I get to see you here! Tir is sooo happy!]","[Tir-san? Well, what a coincidence.]","The one who came flying toward them at full speed with a delighted smile was the Fairy Princess, Tirtania. She had apparently spotted Kaito and rushed over to greet him.","However, Lilia, Eris, and Cornelia’s eyes were fixed not on Tirtania...... but on the place she had flown from.","There stood not only the World King, Lillywood...... but all Seven Princesses, Lillywood’s Executives, gathered together in one place. The three of them instinctively stopped breathing for a moment.","(......Huh? The World King and the Seven Princesses...... all of them? Eh? All of them?)","The sight was shocking enough that even Eris’s thoughts came to a complete standstill. Every one of them was an unimaginably famous figure...... and what was worse was that “they were already acquainted with more than half of them”.","Naturally, if they were acquaintances, greetings would be in order. And given the circumstances, it seemed almost inevitable that Lillywood would be introduced to them.","(Abababa...... T- T- The World King and the Seven Princesses......)","Ironically, Cornelia, who looked as though she was about to faint, was still in the safer position. After all, she had never met either Lillywood or the Seven Princesses before. It was possible that Kaito would introduce her to them, but with so many people present and everyone in the middle of heading toward an attraction, there was still a good chance that there simply wouldn’t be enough time for introductions.","(See? I knew this would happen...... My stomach really hurts. I know he’s not doing it on purpose, but why is Kaito-san always like this!?)","And of course, Lilia had already met not only Lillywood, but all Seven Princesses as well during the White God Festival, the cruise party, and other occasions. It was all but certain that she’d be the next one addressed after Kaito, and she stared off into the distance with an expression that was almost one of resignation.","[So Lillywood-san and the others are here too.]","[Yep! We all came together! Everyone~~ it’s Kaitokun-san!]","At Tirtania’s excited wave, Lillywood and the Seven Princesses approached with wry smiles on their faces.","“Good afternoon, Kaito-san, everyone. What a coincidence meeting you here.”","[Good afternoon. Were you all invited by Kuro and Alice too, Lillywood-san?]","“Yes. Since this is said to be the largest amusement facility ever built in the Demon Realm, I felt it was something I ought to be familiar with given my position...... Well, that’s only the official reason. The truth is, I was simply curious, so I decided to come and see it for myself.”","After exchanging brief greetings and bows, Kaito and Lillywood began chatting. Naturally, none of the Seven Princesses would interrupt a conversation involving their king.","However, that conversation would soon come to an end, and the greetings would move on to everyone else. Lilia would almost certainly be first, but Eris had to quietly steel herself for what was coming next...... while Cornelia silently prayed that the conversation would never be directed toward her.","<Afterword>","Lilia...... Avoiding it is simply not an option. The title of the Strongest Stomachache Warrior isn’t just for show, everyone around her, and even Lilia herself, considers it almost a certainty that she’ll be the one addressed first.","Eris...... Since she’s already acquainted with Tirtania, Jutia, Camellia, Rosemary, and Ariel, there’s an extremely high chance the conversation will naturally lead to her greeting Lillywood, putting her in a very dangerous situation. That said, having already steeled herself for it, she’ll probably manage to navigate it somehow.","Cornelia...... She’s praying with all her might. In truth, given the circumstances, she’s actually in a fairly safe position. There’s also the exchange with Fate and Fortune in between, making it unlikely that everyone will take the time to introduce themselves one by one here. She’ll probably escape this situation...... at least, this one particular situation, that is......"]}]);
